#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:52
msgid ""
"Once a :doc:`transaction <transactions>` is reconciled, the suggested action "
"button(s) is replaced with the counterpart entry/entries it was matched with "
"or the account(s) it was written off to."
msgstr ""
"När en :doc:`transaktion <transactions>` har avstämts ersätts den föreslagna "
"åtgärdsknappen/knapparna med motposten/motposterna den matchades med eller "
