"invoicing/peppol-registration>` in production."
msgstr ""
"För att prova Peppol utan att skicka verklig data, aktivera demoläge genom "
"att välja :guilabel:`Odoo Demo-ID` som Peppol-destinationsidentifierare. För "
"att växla tillbaka till produktionsläge, :ref:`avregistrera dig från "
"demoläget <accounting/e-invoicing/peppol-deregister>` och :ref:`registrera "
"<accounting/e-invoicing/peppol-registration>` i produktion."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:120
msgid "Contact verification"
msgstr "Verifiering av kontakt"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:122
msgid ""
"Before sending an invoice to a contact using Peppol, make sure the contact "
"is registered as a Peppol participant. To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Innan du skickar en faktura till en kontakt med Peppol, kontrollera att "
"kontakten är registrerad som Peppol-deltagare. Gör så här:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:125
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` and access the "
"customer's form."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Kunder --> Kunder` och öppna kundens "
"formulär."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:126
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Accounting tab`, check the following information in "
"the :guilabel:`Customer invoices` section:"
msgstr ""
"I fliken :guilabel:`Bokföring`, kontrollera följande information i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Kundfakturor`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:129
msgid ":guilabel:`eInvoice format`: Select the relevant format."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Format för elektronisk faktura`: Välj relevant format."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:130
msgid ""
"Using the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(down arrow)` icon, make sure the "
"relevant country-specific Peppol endpoint identifier is selected in the "
"dropdown list, then enter the customer's endpoint identifier, usually a "
"Company Registry or VAT number."
msgstr ""
"Använd ikonen :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(nedåtpil)` och kontrollera "
"att den relevanta landsspecifika Peppol-destinationsidentifieraren är vald i "
"rullgardinsmenyn, ange sedan kundens destinationsidentifierare, vanligtvis "
"ett organisationsnummer eller momsregistreringsnummer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:134
msgid ""
"To verify the contact, enable :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` and "
"click :guilabel:`Verify`. Its :guilabel:`Peppol endpoint verification` is "
"marked as :guilabel:`Valid` if the contact is found on the Peppol network."
msgstr ""
"För att verifiera kontakten, aktivera :ref:`systemutvecklarläge <developer-"
"mode>` och klicka på :guilabel:`Verifiera`. Dess :guilabel:`Peppol-"
"destinationsverifiering` är markerad som :guilabel:`Giltig` om kontakten "
"finns på Peppol-nätverket."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:None
msgid "verify contact registration"
msgstr "verifiera kontakt registrering"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:142
msgid ""
"While Odoo prefills the endpoint number based on the information available "
"for a contact, verifying these details with the contact is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Även om Odoo fyller i destinationsnumret i förväg baserat på tillgänglig "
"information för en kontakt, rekommenderas att verifiera dessa uppgifter med "
"kontakten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:148
msgid "Send invoices"
msgstr "Skicka fakturor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:150
msgid ""
"All posted invoices that are ready to be sent via Peppol can be viewed in "
"the :guilabel:`Invoices` list view in the following ways:"
msgstr ""
"Alla bokförda fakturor som är redo att skickas via Peppol kan visas i "
"listvyn :guilabel:`Fakturor` på följande sätt:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:153
msgid ""
"Use the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` (:guilabel:`adjust settings`) button to "
"add the :guilabel:`Peppol status` column."
msgstr ""
"Använd knappen :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` (:guilabel:`justera "
"inställningar`) för att lägga till kolumnen :guilabel:`Peppol-status`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:155
msgid "Apply the :guilabel:`Peppol Ready` filter in the search bar."
msgstr "Tillämpa filtret :guilabel:`Peppol redo` i sökfältet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:157
msgid ""
"To send the invoice to the customer via Peppol, click :guilabel:`Send` on "
"the confirmed invoice form. In the :guilabel:`Send` window, enable "
"the :guilabel:`by Peppol` option and click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""
"För att skicka fakturan till kunden via Peppol, klicka på :guilabel:`Skicka` "
"på det bekräftade fakturaformuläret. I fönstret :guilabel:`Skicka`, aktivera "
"alternativet :guilabel:`via Peppol` och klicka på :guilabel:`Skicka`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:162
msgid ""
":ref:`Multiple invoices <accounting/invoice/sending-multiple-invoices>` can "
"also be sent in batches via Peppol."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Flera fakturor <accounting/invoice/sending-multiple-invoices>` kan "
"också skickas i satser via Peppol."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:164
msgid ""
"Set the preferred :ref:`Invoice sending <accounting/invoice/sending>` method "
"for a customer to :guilabel:`by Peppol` in the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` "
"section of the customer form's :guilabel:`Accounting` tab."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in önskad metod för :ref:`Fakturasändning <accounting/invoice/"
"sending>` för en kund till :guilabel:`via Peppol` i "
"avsnittet :guilabel:`Kundfakturor` på kundformulärens "
"flik :guilabel:`Bokföring`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:168
msgid ""
"The status is updated to :guilabel:`Done` once the invoices have been "
"successfully delivered to the contact's access point."
msgstr ""
"Statusen uppdateras till :guilabel:`Klar` när fakturorna har levererats till "
"kontaktens åtkomstpunkt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:174
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:459
msgid "Receive vendor bills"
msgstr "Ta emot leverantörsfakturor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:176
msgid ""
"New documents received via Peppol are checked multiple times a day. "
"Depending on the :ref:`registration settings <accounting/e-invoicing/peppol-"
"registration>`, received documents are automatically:"
msgstr ""
"Nya dokument som tas emot via Peppol kontrolleras flera gånger om dagen. "
"Beroende på :ref:`registreringsinställningarna <accounting/e-invoicing/"
"peppol-registration>` importeras mottagna dokument automatiskt:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:180
msgid ""
"either imported into the purchase journal set in the :guilabel:`PEPPOL "
"Electronic Invoicing` section, and corresponding vendor bills are created as "
"drafts;"
msgstr ""
"antingen importerade till inköpsjournalen som angivits i "
"avsnittet :guilabel:`Elektronisk fakturering med PEPPOL`, och motsvarande "
"leverantörsfakturor skapas som utkast;"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:182
msgid ""
"or received via the :ref:`Documents app <accounting/e-invoicing/receive-"
"vendor-bills-documents-app>`."
msgstr ""
"eller tas emot via :ref:`Dokumentappen <accounting/e-invoicing/receive-"
"vendor-bills-documents-app>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:186
msgid ""
"To manually trigger the scheduled action used to retrieve incoming Peppol "
"documents, enable :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, open the Settings "
"app, go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Scheduled actions`, "
"and search for :guilabel:`Peppol: retrieve new documents`. Open the "
"scheduled action, then click :guilabel:`Run Manually`."
msgstr ""
"För att manuellt utlösa den schemalagda åtgärden som används för att hämta "
"inkommande Peppol-dokument, aktivera :ref:`utvecklarläge <developer-mode>`, "
"öppna appen Inställningar, gå till :menuselection:`Inställningar --> Teknisk "
"--> Schemalagda åtgärder`, och sök efter :guilabel:`Peppol: hämta nya "
"dokument`. Öppna den schemalagda åtgärden och klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Kör "
"manuellt`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:194
msgid "Vendor bills reception in Documents"
msgstr "Mottagning av leverantörsfakturor i Dokument"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing.rst:197
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Documents - Import from Peppol` "
