"tjänstebaserade transaktioner, med implementering som varierar per kommun."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/brazil.rst:23
msgid ""
":abbr:`NFC-e (Nota Fiscal de Consumidor Eletrônica)`: Used for end consumer "
