"transaktioner, vilket säkerställer efterlevnad av :abbr:`SRI (Servicio de "
"Rentas Internas)`:s tekniska specifikationer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/ecuador.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Transmission Requirements**: E-invoices must be transmitted to the SRI "
"within 24 hours of issuance."
msgstr ""
