#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/ecuador.rst:23
msgid ""
"**Record Storage**: E-invoices, including the :abbr:`SRI (Servicio de Rentas "
"Internas)`'s acceptance messages, must be stored for a minimum of seven "
"years."
msgstr ""
"**Registerförvaring**: Elektroniska fakturor, inklusive :abbr:`SRI (Servicio "
"de Rentas Internas)`:s acceptmeddelanden, måste lagras i minst sju år."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/ecuador.rst:27
msgid "Compliance with Ecuadorian e-invoicing regulations"
msgstr "Efterlevnad av ecuadorianska regler för elektronisk fakturering"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/ecuador.rst:29
msgid ""
"Odoo Invoicing simplifies compliance with Ecuador's e-invoicing requirements "
"by offering tailored features:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo Faktura förenklar efterlevnaden av Ecuadors krav på elektronisk "
