#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/ecuador.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Supported formats**: Odoo supports the Ecuadorian e-invoice format (XML) "
"and ensures compatibility with the :abbr:`SRI (Servicio de Rentas "
"Internas)`'s system for validation and authorization, including the "
