"nödvändig digital underskrift."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/ecuador.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Secure storage and retrieval**: In compliance with Ecuador's seven-year "
"storage requirement, Odoo offers tamper-proof archiving so that invoices can "
"be easily accessed during audits or inspections."
msgstr ""
"**Säker förvaring och återhämtning**: I enlighet med Ecuadors krav på sju "
"års förvaring erbjuder Odoo manipuleringssäker arkivering så att fakturor "
"enkelt kan nås vid revisioner eller inspektioner."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/ecuador.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Automatic tax calculation and reporting**: Odoo automates tax calculations "
"for VAT (IVA) and other applicable taxes, ensuring accurate invoicing and "
"adherence to Ecuador's tax reporting standards."
msgstr ""
"**Automatisk skatteberäkning och rapportering**: Odoo automatiserar "
