#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:189
msgid ""
"When using the Continental accounting standard in combination with "
"the :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` inventory valuation, inventory "
"variations from production (for both finished products and components) are "
"recorded separately from general inventory variations recorded at closing, "
"isolating production-related changes from receipts and deliveries. However, "
"this account is not commonly used when combining the Continental accounting "
"standard with the :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` inventory valuation."
msgstr ""

