#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments.rst:80
msgid ""
"Registering a customer payment by check in Odoo does not move funds. Checks "
"must be deposited in order to make the payment. Once deposited to your bank, "
"the check should appear as a :doc:`bank transaction <bank/transactions>`, at "
"which point it can be :doc:`reconciled <bank/reconciliation>` with the "
"registered payment."
msgstr ""
"Att registrera en kundbetalning med check i Odoo flyttar inte medel. Checkar "
"måste sättas in för att genomföra betalningen. När checken satts in på ditt "
"bankkonto bör den visas som en :doc:`banktransaktion <bank/transactions>`, "
"vid vilken tidpunkt den kan :doc:`avstämmas <bank/reconciliation>` med den "
"registrerade betalningen."

