#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:107
msgid "Closing or revoking a mandate"
msgstr "Stänga eller återkalla en fullmakt"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:109
msgid ""
"To close or revoke a mandate, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers "
"--> Direct Debit Mandates`, select the relevant mandate, and "
"click :guilabel:`Close` or :guilabel:`Revoke`."
msgstr ""
"För att stänga eller återkalla en fullmakt, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Kunder --> Direktdebitfullmakter`, välj "
"relevant fullmakt och klicka på :guilabel:`Stäng` "
"eller :guilabel:`Återkalla`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:112
msgid ""
"**Closing** a mandate updates the mandate's end day to the current day. "
"Invoices issued after the present day will not be processed with an SDD "
"payment. **Revoking** a mandate immediately disables it. No SDD payment can "
"be registered anymore, regardless of the invoice's date. However, payments "
"that have already been registered are still included in the next :ref:`SDD "
"XML file <accounting/sepa_payments/XML>`."
msgstr ""
"**Stängning** av en fullmakt uppdaterar fullmaktens slutdatum till aktuellt "
"datum. Fakturor som utfärdas efter dagens datum kommer inte att behandlas "
"med en SDD-betalning. **Återkallande** av en fullmakt inaktiverar den "
"omedelbart. Ingen SDD-betalning kan registreras längre, oavsett fakturans "
"datum. Betalningar som redan har registrerats ingår dock fortfarande i "
"nästa :ref:`SDD XML-fil <accounting/sepa_payments/XML>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:119
msgid ""
"Mandates are automatically closed 36 months after the date of the last "
"collection."
msgstr ""
"Fullmakter stängs automatiskt 36 månader efter datumet för den senaste "
"inkasseringen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:120
msgid "Closed or revoked mandates cannot be reactivated."
msgstr "Stängda eller återkallade fullmakter kan inte återaktiveras."

