msgid ""
"To expand the lines of a report and view its details, click the :icon:`fa-"
"caret-right` (:guilabel:`right arrow`) on the left. Then click the :icon:`fa-"
"caret-down` (:guilabel:`down arrow`) to the right of the account, journal "
"entry, payment, invoice, etc. to :guilabel:`Annotate` and view the details."
msgstr ""
"För att expandera raderna i en rapport och visa dess detaljer, klicka "
"på :icon:`fa-caret-right` (:guilabel:`högerpil`) till vänster. Klicka sedan "
"på :icon:`fa-caret-down` (:guilabel:`down arrow`) till höger om kontot, "
"journalposten, betalningen, fakturan etc. för att :guilabel:`Annotera` och "
"visa detaljerna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:None
msgid "Annotate reports."
msgstr "Anteckna rapporter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:31
msgid ""
"To export reports in PDF or XLSX format, click :guilabel:`PDF` at the top or "
"click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` (:guilabel:`down arrow`) icon next to "
"the :guilabel:`PDF` button and select :guilabel:`XLSX`."
msgstr ""
"För att exportera rapporter i PDF- eller XLSX-format, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`PDF` längst upp eller klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
"(:guilabel:`nedåtpil`) bredvid knappen :guilabel:`PDF` och "
"välj :guilabel:`XLSX`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:35
msgid ""
"To compare values across periods, click the :guilabel:`Comparison` menu and "
"select the periods you want to compare."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill jämföra värden mellan olika perioder klickar du på "
"menyn :guilabel:`Comparison` och väljer de perioder som du vill jämföra."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:None
msgid "Comparison menu to compare time periods."
msgstr "Jämförelsemeny för att jämföra tidsperioder."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:46
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Balance Sheet` shows a snapshot of your organization's "
"assets, liabilities, and equity at a particular date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Balansräkningen` visar en ögonblicksbild av organisationens "
"tillgångar, skulder och eget kapital vid ett visst datum."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:54
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Profit and Loss` report (or **Income Statement**) shows your "
"company's net income by deducting expenses from revenue for the reporting "
"period."
msgstr ""
"Rapporten :guilabel:`Profit and Loss` (eller **Income Statement**) visar "
"ditt företags nettoresultat genom att dra av kostnader från intäkter för "
"rapporteringsperioden."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:60
msgid "Executive Summary"
msgstr "Sammanfattning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:62
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Executive Summary` provides an overview of all the important "
"figures for overseeing your company's performance."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Executive Summary` ger en översikt över alla viktiga siffror för "
"att övervaka ditt företags resultat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:65
msgid "It includes the following items:"
msgstr "Den innehåller följande delar:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:75
msgid ":guilabel:`Performance`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Prestanda`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:69
msgid ":guilabel:`Gross profit margin`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Gross vinstmarginal`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:69
msgid ""
"The contribution of all sales your business makes **minus** any direct costs "
"needed to make those sales (labor, materials, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Bidraget från all försäljning som ditt företag gör **minus** alla direkta "
"kostnader som krävs för att göra denna försäljning (arbetskraft, material "
"etc.)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:73
msgid ":guilabel:`Net profit margin`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Nettovinstmarginal`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:72
msgid ""
"The contribution of all sales made by your business **minus** any direct "
"costs needed to make those sales *and* fixed overheads your company has "
"(electricity, rent, taxes to be paid as a result of those sales, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Bidraget från all försäljning som ditt företag gör **minus** alla direkta "
"kostnader som behövs för att göra denna försäljning *och* fasta omkostnader "
"som ditt företag har (el, hyra, skatter som ska betalas till följd av denna "
"försäljning etc.)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:75
msgid ":guilabel:`Return on investment (per annum)`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Avkastning på investering (per år)`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:76
msgid ""
"The ratio of the net profit to the amount of assets the company used to make "
"those profits."
msgstr ""
"Förhållandet mellan nettovinsten och de tillgångar som företaget använt för "
"att göra denna vinst."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:91
msgid ":guilabel:`Position`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Position`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:79
msgid ":guilabel:`Average debtors days`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Gemensamma gäldenärsdagar`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:79
msgid ""
"The average number of days it takes your customers to (fully) pay you across "
"all your customer invoices."
msgstr ""
"Det genomsnittliga antalet dagar som det tar för dina kunder att betala dig "
"(fullt ut) för alla dina kundfakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:81
msgid ":guilabel:`Average creditors days`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Genomsnittliga kreditgivardagar`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:82
msgid ""
"The average number of days it takes you to (fully) pay your suppliers across "
"all your bills."
msgstr ""
"Det genomsnittliga antalet dagar det tar för dig att (fullt ut) betala dina "
"leverantörer för alla dina räkningar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:85
msgid ":guilabel:`Short-term cash forecast`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Kortfristig kassaprognos`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:84
msgid ""
"How much cash is expected in or out of your business in the next month, "
"i.e., the balance of your **Sales account** for the month **minus** the "
"balance of your **Purchases account** for the month."
msgstr ""
"Hur mycket kontanter som förväntas komma in eller ut ur ditt företag under "
"nästa månad, dvs. saldot på ditt **försäljningskonto** för månaden **minus** "
"saldot på ditt **inköpskonto** för månaden."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:91
msgid ":guilabel:`Current assets to liabilities`:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Anläggningstillgångar till skulder`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:88
msgid ""
"Also referred to as the **current ratio**, this is the ratio of current "
"assets (:dfn:`assets that could be turned into cash within a year`) to the "
"current liabilities (:dfn:`liabilities that will be due in the next year`). "
"It is typically used to measure a company's ability to service its debt."
msgstr ""
"Detta kallas även **kurantkvot** och är kvoten mellan omsättningstillgångar "
"(:dfn:`tillgångar som kan omvandlas till kontanter inom ett år`) och "
"kortfristiga skulder (:dfn:`skulder som förfaller till betalning under nästa "
"år`). Det används vanligen för att mäta ett företags förmåga att betala sina "
"skulder."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:96
msgid "General Ledger"
msgstr "Huvudbok"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:98
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`General Ledger` report shows all transactions from all "
"accounts for a selected date range. The initial summary report shows the "
"totals for each account. To expand an account and view its details, click "
"the :icon:`fa-caret-right` (:guilabel:`right arrow`) on the left. This "
"report is useful for reviewing each transaction that occurred during a "
"specific period."
msgstr ""
"Rapporten :guilabel:`General Ledger` visar alla transaktioner från alla "
"konton för ett valt datumintervall. Den första sammanfattningsrapporten "
"visar totalsummorna för varje konto. För att expandera ett konto och visa "
"dess detaljer, klicka på :icon:`fa-caret-right` (:guilabel:`högerpil`) till "
"vänster. Den här rapporten är användbar för att granska varje transaktion "
"som har skett under en viss period."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:108
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Aged Receivable` report shows the sales invoices awaiting "
"payment during a selected month and several months prior."
msgstr ""
"Rapporten :guilabel:`Aged Receivable` visar de försäljningsfakturor som "
"väntar på betalning under en vald månad och flera månader tidigare."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:116
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Aged Payable` report displays information on individual "
"bills, credit notes, and overpayments you owe and how long these have gone "
"unpaid."
msgstr ""
"Rapporten :guilabel:`Aged Payable` visar information om enskilda räkningar, "
"kreditfakturor och överbetalningar som du är skyldig och hur länge dessa har "
"varit obetalda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:122
msgid "Cash Flow Statement"
msgstr "Kassaflödesanalys"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:124
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Cash Flow Statement` shows how changes in balance sheet "
"accounts and income affect cash and cash equivalents and breaks the analysis "
"down to operating, investing, and financing activities."
msgstr ""
"Kassaflödesanalysen visar hur förändringar i balansräkningens konton och "
"resultat påverkar likvida medel och delar upp analysen i löpande verksamhet, "
"investeringsverksamhet och finansieringsverksamhet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:131
msgid "Tax Report"
msgstr "Skattedeklaration"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:133
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tax Report` shows the :guilabel:`NET` and :guilabel:`TAX` "
"amounts for all the taxes grouped by type "
"(:guilabel:`Sales`/:guilabel:`Purchases`)."
msgstr ""
"I :guilabel:`Tax Report` visas :guilabel:`NET`- och :guilabel:`TAX`-beloppen "
"för alla skatter grupperade efter typ "
"(:guilabel:`Sales`/:guilabel:`Purchases`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:153
msgid "Audit Trail"
msgstr "Spårningskedja"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:155
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Audit Trail` report tracks changes made to fields that have "
"an impact on accounting and includes the date and time of the changes, the "
"user who made the changes, the type of change, the previous value, and the "
"updated value."
msgstr ""
"Rapporten :guilabel:`Verifieringskedja` spårar ändringar som gjorts i fält "
"som påverkar bokföringen och inkluderar datum och tid för ändringarna, "
"användaren som gjorde ändringarna, typ av ändring, tidigare värde och "
"uppdaterat värde."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:159
msgid ""
"In addition to being recorded in the :doc:`chatter </applications/"
"productivity/discuss/chatter>`, changes to records are also tracked in the "
"audit trail, providing users a dedicated and detailed audit trail report. "
"The audit trail report is available for audit checks, satisfying the "
"requirements of the financial authorities and auditors of various countries."
msgstr ""
"Förutom att registreras i :doc:`händelseflödet </applications/productivity/"
"discuss/chatter>`, spåras ändringar av handlingar också i "
"verifieringskedjan, vilket ger användarna en dedikerad och detaljerad "
"verifieringskedjerapport. Verifieringskedjorapporten är tillgänglig för "
"revisionskontroller och uppfyller kraven från finansiella myndigheter och "
"revisorer i olika länder."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:164
msgid ""
"To access the audit trail, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review "
"--> Audit Trail`."
msgstr ""
"För att komma åt verifieringskedjan, navigera till :menuselection:`Bokföring "
"--> Granska --> Verifieringskedja`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:166
msgid ""
"An optional restrictive mode prevents tracked records from being deleted for "
"more controlled immutability. Instead of being deleted, these records can "
"only be cancelled or archived. To enable this restrictive mode, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Settings --> Configuration`, scroll down "
"to the :guilabel:`Reporting` section, and tick the checkbox "
"beside :guilabel:`Restrictive Audit Trail`."
msgstr ""
"Ett valfritt restriktivt läge förhindrar att spårade handlingar raderas för "
"mer kontrollerad oföränderlighet. Istället för att raderas kan dessa "
"handlingar endast annulleras eller arkiveras. För att aktivera detta "
"restriktiva läge, navigera till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Inställningar "
"--> Konfiguration`, skrolla ner till sektionen :guilabel:`Rapportering` och "
"kryssa för rutan bredvid :guilabel:`Restriktiv verifieringskedja`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:175
msgid "Bank Reconciliation Summary"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:177
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Bank Reconciliation Summary` report provides a detailed "
"overview of reconciled and unreconciled transactions, including transaction "
"details and the calculations behind each reported balance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:181
msgid ""
"Designed for review and audit purposes, the report provides a complete "
"reconciliation trail as of a selected end date. It reflects balances and "
"reconciliation statuses as they existed at that point in time, rather than "
"their current live status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:185
msgid ""
"To access the report, open the **Accounting** dashboard, click the :icon:`oi-"
"ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` on the :guilabel:`Bank` journal, "
"and then :guilabel:`Report`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:191
msgid "Report filters and options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:193
msgid ""
"Reporting filters and options vary on a per-report basis. The following "
"buttons and options are common to most reports and are located in the top "
"bar of the report:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:196
msgid ""
"A *date* filter, indicated by the :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`(calendar)` "
"icon that precedes a date in the local format. Use this filter to select a "
"specific date or date range for the report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:198
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`% Comparison` filter, to compare reporting periods against each "
"other."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:199
msgid ""
"A *journal* filter, indicated by the :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`(book)` icon "
"and a default setting, such as :guilabel:`All Journals`. Use this filter to "
"specify which journals should be included in the report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:202
msgid ""
"An *analytic* filter, indicated by the :icon:`oi-group` :guilabel:`(group)` "
"icon. Use this filter to only include analytic accounts and plans in the "
"report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:204
msgid ""
"An *entries type* filter, indicated by the :icon:`fa-"
"sliders` :guilabel:`(filter)` icon and a default setting, such "
"as :guilabel:`Posted Entries Only, Accrual Basis`. Use this filter to "
"determine which type of journal entries should be included in the report "
"(e.g. posted or draft), along with the type of accounting method (e.g., "
"accrual or :ref:`cash basis <accounting/cash-basis/report-filter>`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:210
msgid ""
"This filter also includes display options, such as :guilabel:`Hide lines at "
"0`, which removes zero-value lines from the report, or :guilabel:`Split "
"Horizontally`, which keeps the report within the screen's fold and "
"eliminates the need to scroll."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:214
msgid ""
"A *decimal* option, which includes figures with cents by default, as "
"indicated by your local currency icon (e.g., :guilabel:`In .$`). Use the "
"other options in the drop-down menu to format figures in the report as whole "
"numbers (e.g., :guilabel:`In $`), thousands (e.g., :guilabel:`In K$`), or "
"millions (e.g., :guilabel:`In M$`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:None
msgid "Reporting filters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting.rst:223
msgid ""
"With :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` enabled, a :doc:`report "
"customization <reporting/customize>` option, indicated by the :icon:`fa-"
"cogs` :guilabel:`(cogs)` icon is available in the top bar. It allows, for "
"example, to add the :ref:`Cash Basis Method filter <accounting/cash-basis/"
"report-filter>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:3
msgid "Analytic accounting"
msgstr "Objektredovisning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:5
msgid ""
"Analytic accounting helps track costs and revenues and analyze a project's "
"or service's profitability. When creating journal entries, costs can "
"be :ref:`distributed <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic-distribution>` "
"across one or more analytic accounts."
msgstr ""
"Analytisk redovisning hjälper till att spåra kostnader och intäkter samt "
"analysera ett projekts eller en tjänsts lönsamhet. När verifikationer skapas "
"kan kostnader :ref:`fördelas <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic-"
"distribution>` över ett eller flera analytiska konton."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:9
msgid ""
"To activate this feature, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration "
"--> Settings` and enable :guilabel:`Analytic Accounting` in "
"the :guilabel:`Analytics` section."
msgstr ""
"För att aktivera den här funktionen, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> "
"Konfiguration --> Inställningar` och aktivera :guilabel:`Analytisk "
"redovisning` i sektionen :guilabel:`Analys`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:13
msgid ":doc:`Analytic budget <budget>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Analytisk budget <budget>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:18
msgid "Analytic accounts"
msgstr "Objekta konton"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:20
msgid "Analytic accounts give an overview of costs and revenue."
msgstr "Analytiska konton ger en översikt över kostnader och intäkter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:22
msgid ""
"To access analytic accounts, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Analytic Accounts`. To create a new analytic account, "
"click :guilabel:`New` and fill in the following information:"
msgstr ""
"För att komma åt analytiska konton, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> "
"Konfiguration --> Analytiska konton`. För att skapa ett nytt analytiskt "
"konto, klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa` och fyll i följande information:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:26
msgid ":guilabel:`Analytic Account`: Assign the name of the analytic account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Analytiskt konto`: Tilldela namnet på det analytiska kontot."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:27
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: Select the customer linked to the project, if "
"applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kund`: Välj kunden som är kopplad till projektet, om tillämpligt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reference`: Include a reference to make the account easier to "
"find if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Referens`: Inkludera en referens för att göra kontot lättare att "
"hitta vid behov."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:29
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Plan`: Link the :guilabel:`Analytic Account` to an :ref:`analytic "
"plan <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Plan`: Länka :guilabel:`Analytiskt konto` till en :ref:`analytisk "
"plan <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:31
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: In a :doc:`multi-company </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>` environment, select the company using the analytic "
"account. To make the analytic account accessible to all companies, leave the "
"field empty."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Företag`: I en :doc:`multi-företagsmiljö </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>`, välj det företag som använder det analytiska "
"kontot. För att göra det analytiska kontot tillgängligt för alla företag, "
"lämna fältet tomt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: Update the currency of the analytic account if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Valuta`: Uppgradera valutan för det analytiska kontot vid behov."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:36
msgid "Then, the :doc:`budget <budget>` information can be filled in."
msgstr "Sedan kan :doc:`budget <budget>`information fyllas i."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:41
msgid "Analytic plans"
msgstr "Objektscheman"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:43
msgid ""
"Analytic plans group :ref:`analytic accounts <accounting/analytic_accounting/"
"analytic_accounts>`, allowing the company to analyze its accounting, such as "
"tracking costs and revenues by project or department."
msgstr ""
"Analytiska planer grupperar :ref:`analytiska konton <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>`, vilket gör det möjligt för "
"företaget att analysera sin bokföring, exempelvis genom att spåra kostnader "
"och intäkter per projekt eller avdelning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:47
msgid ""
"To access analytic plans, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration "
"--> Analytic Plans`. Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new plan, add a name, "
"and fill in the following information:"
msgstr ""
"För att komma åt analytiska planer, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> "
"Konfiguration --> Analytiska planer`. Klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa` för att "
"skapa en ny plan, lägg till ett namn och fyll i följande information:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Parent`: Link the plan to another analytic plan if a hierarchy "
"between plans must be built."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Överordnad`: Länka planen till en annan analytisk plan om en "
"hierarki mellan planer måste byggas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:52
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default Applicability`: Define how the plan is applied when "
"creating a new journal entry:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Standardtillämpbarhet`: Definiera hur planen tillämpas när en ny "
"verifikation skapas:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:55
msgid ":guilabel:`Optional`: Adding the analytic plan is not mandatory."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Valfri`: Det är inte obligatoriskt att lägga till den analytiska "
"planen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:56
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mandatory`: The entry cannot be confirmed if no analytic account "
"is selected."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Obligatorisk`: Inlägget kan inte bekräftas om inget analytiskt "
"konto är valt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:57
msgid ":guilabel:`Unavailable`: The plan is not available."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Ej tillgänglig`: Planen är inte tillgänglig."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Color`: Set a color for the tag related to this specific plan."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Färg`: Ange en färg för taggen relaterad till denna specifika "
"plan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:61
msgid ""
"To fine-tune a plan's applicability, create a new line in "
"the :guilabel:`Applicability` tab and set the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"För att finjustera en plans tillämplighet, skapa en ny rad i "
"fliken :guilabel:`Tillämplighet` och ställ in följande fält:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Domain`: Choose the accounting documents to which the plan "
"applies."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Domän`: Välj de bokföringsdokument som planen gäller för."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:65
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Financial Accounts Prefixes`: Enter the prefix(es) of the "
"account(s) to which the plan applies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Prefix för finansiella konton`: Ange prefix(en) för de konto(n) "
"som planen gäller för."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:67
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Category`: Choose the product category to which the plan "
"applies."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Produktkategori`: Välj den produktkategori som planen gäller för."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:68
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Applicability`: Define how the plan is applied when creating a "
"new journal entry. The applicability set here always overrides the default "
"applicability."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tillämplighet`: Definiera hur planen tillämpas när en ny "
"verifikation skapas. Tillämpligheten som anges här åsidosätter alltid "
"standardtillämpligheten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:70
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: In a :doc:`multi-company </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>` environment, select the company using the plan. To "
"make the analytic plan accessible to all companies, leave the field empty."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Företag`: I en :doc:`fleraföretagsmiljö </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>`, välj det företag som använder planen. För att "
"göra den analytiska planen tillgänglig för alla företag, lämna fältet tomt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:74
msgid "Two smart buttons are available:"
msgstr "Två smarta knappar är tillgängliga:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Subplans`: To have a more complex analytic structure. Click the "
"smart button, then click :guilabel:`New` to add a subplan. This creates a "
"parent-child relationship between the two plans, and the :guilabel:`Parent` "
"field of the subplan is automatically populated with the original plan."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Underplaner`: För att ha en mer komplex analytisk struktur. "
"Klicka på den smarta knappen och klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Ny` för att "
"lägga till en underplan. Detta skapar en överordnad-underordnad relation "
"mellan de två planerna, och fältet :guilabel:`Överordnad` för underplanen "
"fylls automatiskt i med den ursprungliga planen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Analytic Accounts`: To access the :ref:`analytic accounts "
"<accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>` linked to the plan."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Analytiska konton`: För att komma åt de :ref:`analytiska konton "
"<accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>` som är länkade till "
"planen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:84
msgid "Each analytic plan must have at least one analytic account."
msgstr "Varje analytisk plan måste ha minst ett objektkonto."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:89
msgid "Analytic distribution"
msgstr "Objekt distribution"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:91
msgid ""
"The distribution of costs in one or more analytic accounts can be set in "
"each :ref:`invoice/bill <accounting/analytic_accounting/distribution-"
"invoices-bills>` or :ref:`en masse <accounting/analytic_accounting/"
"distribution-mass>`."
msgstr ""
"Fördelningen av kostnader i ett eller flera analytiska konton kan ställas in "
"i varje :ref:`faktura <accounting/analytic_accounting/distribution-invoices-"
"bills>` eller :ref:`i massor <accounting/analytic_accounting/distribution-"
"mass>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:96
msgid ""
"The analytic distribution is prefilled based on the applicability and "
"the :ref:`analytic distribution models <accounting/"
"analytic_distribution_models>`."
msgstr ""
"Den analytiska fördelningen är förfylld baserat på tillämpligheten "
"och :ref:`modellerna för analytisk fördelning <accounting/"
"analytic_distribution_models>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:102
msgid "Analytic distribution on invoices or bills"
msgstr "Analytisk fördelning på fakturor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:104
msgid ""
"To add analytic distribution, click the :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` "
"column when creating an :ref:`invoice <accounting/invoice/creation>` "
"or :ref:`bill <accounting/vendor_bills/creation>`."
msgstr ""
"För att lägga till analytisk fördelning, klicka på "
"kolumnen :guilabel:`Analytisk fördelning` när du skapar en :ref:`faktura "
"<accounting/invoice/creation>` eller :ref:`faktura <accounting/vendor_bills/"
"creation>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:108
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` field is mandatory only if "
"the :ref:`analytic plan <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>` has "
"been set as :guilabel:`Mandatory` in either the :guilabel:`Default "
"Applicability` field on an analytic plan or the :guilabel:`Applicability` "
"field on an analytic plan line."
msgstr ""
"Fältet :guilabel:`Analytisk fördelning` är obligatoriskt endast om "
"den :ref:`analytiska planen <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>` "
"har angetts som :guilabel:`Obligatorisk` antingen i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Standardtillämpbarhet` på en analytisk plan eller i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Tillämplighet` på en analytisk planrad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:113
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Analytic` window, select the desired :guilabel:`Analytic "
"Accounts` in the different :guilabel:`Analytic Plans` displayed in columns. "
"Then, split the costs between the accounts by modifying the percentage."
msgstr ""
"I fönstret :guilabel:`Analytisk` väljer du önskade :guilabel:`Analytiska "
"konton` i de olika :guilabel:`Analytiska planerna` som visas i kolumner. "
"Fördela sedan kostnaderna mellan kontona genom att ändra procentsatsen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:None
msgid "create a distribution template"
msgstr "skapa en distributionsmall"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:123
msgid "Analytic distribution en masse"
msgstr "Analytisk fördelning i bulk"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:125
msgid ""
"To mass-edit analytic accounts in several entries simultaneously, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> Journal items`, and select the "
"ones that need to be updated. Click the :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` "
"column and add the required distribution in the :guilabel:`Analytic` column, "
"then click the :icon:`oi-close` :guilabel:`(cross)` and :guilabel:`Update`. "
"The analytic distribution is then added to the selected journal items."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:132
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution` column is not displayed, use "
"the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`(settings adjust)` icon, and "
"tick :guilabel:`Analytic Distribution`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:139
msgid "Analytic distribution models"
msgstr "Objekta distributionsmodeller"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:141
msgid ""
"Analytic distribution models automatically apply a specific distribution "
"based on defined criteria."
msgstr ""
"Analytiska fördelningsmodeller tillämpar automatiskt en specifik fördelning "
"baserat på definierade kriterier."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:143
msgid ""
"To create a new analytic distribution model, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Analytic Distribution "
"Models`, click :guilabel:`New`, and set the conditions the model has to meet "
"to apply automatically:"
msgstr ""
"För att skapa en ny analytisk fördelningsmodell, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Analytiska "
"fördelningsmodeller`, klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa` och ange villkoren som "
"modellen måste uppfylla för att tillämpas automatiskt:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:148
msgid ""
"All specified conditions of an analytic distribution model must be met for "
"the model to be applied. To apply an analytic distribution model based on "
"individual conditions, create separate analytic distribution models for each "
"condition."
msgstr ""
"Alla angivna villkor för en analytisk fördelningsmodell måste vara uppfyllda "
"för att modellen ska tillämpas. För att tillämpa en analytisk "
"fördelningsmodell baserat på individuella villkor, skapa separata analytiska "
"fördelningsmodeller för varje villkor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:151
msgid ""
"Analytic distribution models can be combined and sequenced, allowing "
"distribution across multiple models if linked to different :ref:`analytic "
"plans <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>`. To adjust the order, "
"drag and drop the models using the :icon:`oi-"
"draggable` :guilabel:`(draggable)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Analytiska fördelningsmodeller kan kombineras och ordnas i sekvens, vilket "
"möjliggör fördelning över flera modeller om de är kopplade till "
"olika :ref:`analytiska planer <accounting/analytic_accounting/"
"analytic_plans>`. För att justera ordningen, dra och släpp modellerna med "
"ikonen :icon:`oi-draggable` :guilabel:`(dragbar)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:156
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Accounts Prefixes`: Apply the distribution model only to journal "
"items involving accounts that begin with specific prefixes."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kontoprefix`: Tillämpa fördelningsmodellen endast på "
"affärshändelser som involverar konton som börjar med specifika prefix."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:158
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Partner`: Apply the distribution model only to journal items "
"involving a specific partner."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Partner`: Tillämpa fördelningsmodellen endast på affärshändelser "
"som involverar en specifik partner."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:160
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product`: Apply the distribution model only to journal items "
"involving a specific product."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Produkt`: Tillämpa fördelningsmodellen endast på affärshändelser "
"som involverar en specifik produkt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:162
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: In a :doc:`multi-company </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>` environment, apply the distribution model only to "
"journal items involving a specific company. To apply it across all "
"companies, leave the field empty."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Företag`: I en :doc:`multi-företagsmiljö </applications/general/"
"companies/multi_company>`, tillämpa fördelningsmodellen endast på "
"affärshändelser som involverar ett specifikt företag. För att tillämpa den "
"på alla företag, lämna fältet tomt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:165
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Analytic Distribution`: :ref:`Analytic distribution <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic-distribution>` that will be applied when the "
"above conditions are met."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Analytisk fördelning`: :ref:`Analytisk fördelning <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic-distribution>` som kommer att tillämpas när "
"ovanstående villkor är uppfyllda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:170
msgid ""
"Any time a journal item is posted to the :guilabel:`Utilities (601000)` "
"account, it should be automatically distributed in "
"the :guilabel:`Departments` analytic plan as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Varje gång en affärshändelse bokförs på kontot :guilabel:`Verktyg (601000)`, "
"ska den automatiskt fördelas i den analytiska planen :guilabel:`Avdelningar` "
"enligt följande:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:173
msgid "60% to the :guilabel:`Manufacturing` analytic account"
msgstr "60% till det analytiska kontot :guilabel:`Tillverkning`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:174
msgid "30% to the :guilabel:`Marketing` analytic account"
msgstr "30% till det analytiska kontot :guilabel:`Marknadsföring`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:175
msgid "10% to the :guilabel:`Admin` analytic account"
msgstr "10% till det analytiska kontot :guilabel:`Administration`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:177
msgid ""
"To automate this distribution, the :guilabel:`Accounts Prefix` can be set to "
"`601`, as :guilabel:`Utilities (601000)` is the only account in the chart of "
"accounts that begins with `601`."
msgstr ""
"För att automatisera denna fördelning kan :guilabel:`Kontoprefix` ställas in "
"på `601`, eftersom :guilabel:`Verktyg (601000)` är det enda kontot i "
"kontoplanen som börjar med `601`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:181
msgid ""
"If additional accounts such as :guilabel:`Electricity (601100)` "
"or :guilabel:`Gas (601200)` are available in the chart of accounts, the "
"distribution will also apply to both since they share the same prefix."
msgstr ""
"Om ytterligare konton som :guilabel:`El (601100)` eller :guilabel:`Gas "
"(601200)` finns tillgängliga i kontoplanen, kommer fördelningen även att "
"gälla för båda eftersom de delar samma prefix."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:185
msgid ""
"To define more criteria, use the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(adjust settings)` icon to reveal more columns or "
"click :guilabel:`View` on an individual analytic distribution model."
msgstr ""
"För att definiera fler kriterier, använd ikonen :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`(justera inställningar)` för att visa fler kolumner eller "
"klicka på :guilabel:`Visa` på en enskild analytisk fördelningsmodell."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:188
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Partner Category`: Apply this distribution model only to journal "
"items involving a partner in a specific category."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Partnerkategori`: Tillämpa denna fördelningsmodell endast på "
"affärshändelser som involverar en partner i en specifik kategori."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:190
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Category`: Apply this distribution model to journal items "
"involving a product in a specific category."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Produktkategori`: Tillämpa denna fördelningsmodell på "
"affärshändelser som involverar en produkt i en specifik kategori."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:194
msgid ""
"Alternatively, it is possible to create an analytic distribution model from "
"the :guilabel:`Analytic` window by clicking :guilabel:`New Model`:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativt är det möjligt att skapa en analytisk fördelningsmodell från "
"fönstret :guilabel:`Analytisk` genom att klicka på :guilabel:`Ny modell`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:197
msgid ""
"either when creating an invoice/bill and filling in the :ref:`analytic "
"distribution <accounting/analytic_accounting/distribution-invoices-bills>`;"
msgstr ""
"antingen när du skapar en faktura och fyller i den :ref:`analytiska "
"fördelningen <accounting/analytic_accounting/distribution-invoices-bills>`,"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/analytic_accounting.rst:199
msgid ""
"or when :ref:`mass-editing analytic accounts <accounting/analytic_accounting/"
"distribution-mass>` in several entries simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"eller när du :ref:`massredigerar analytiska konton <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/distribution-mass>` i flera poster samtidigt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:3
msgid "Annual/Audit report"
msgstr "Årsrapport/Revisionsrapport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:5
msgid ""
"Annual reports document annual financial performance, operational "
"challenges, and organizational achievements for stakeholder review."
msgstr ""
"Årsrapporter dokumenterar årlig finansiell prestation, operativa utmaningar "
"och organisatoriska prestationer för intressentgranskning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:8
msgid ""
"Odoo :ref:`generates annual reports <accounting/annual-report/creation>` "
"from pre-configured templates. Users can :ref:`edit and customize "
"<accounting/annual-report/edit>` content, :ref:`add more content or upload "
"PDF files <accounting/annual-report/additional-content>`, and :ref:`export "
"the report as a PDF <accounting/annual-report/export>` for distribution."
msgstr ""
"Odoo :ref:`genererar årsrapporter <accounting/annual-report/creation>` från "
"förkonfigurerade mallar. Användare kan :ref:`redigera och anpassa "
"<accounting/annual-report/edit>` innehåll, :ref:`lägga till mer innehåll "
"eller ladda upp PDF-filer <accounting/annual-report/additional-content>`, "
"och :ref:`exportera rapporten som en PDF <accounting/annual-report/export>` "
"för distribution."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:14
msgid ""
"The annual report is edited using the :doc:`Knowledge app <../../../"
"productivity/knowledge>` interface from within the Accounting app."
msgstr ""
"Årsrapporten redigeras med hjälp av :doc:`Kunskap-appens <../../../"
"productivity/knowledge>` gränssnitt från Bokförings-appen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:20
msgid "Create an annual report"
msgstr "Skapa en årsrapport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:22
msgid "To create an annual report, follow these steps:"
msgstr "För att skapa en årsrapport, följ dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:24
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> Annual Report` and "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Granska --> Årsrapport` och klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Ny`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:25
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create an Annual Report` window, enter a :guilabel:`Title` "
"and, if necessary, update the start and end :guilabel:`Dates` of the period "
"covered by the report."
msgstr ""
"I fönstret :guilabel:`Skapa en Årsrapport`, ange en :guilabel:`Rubrik` och, "
"om nödvändigt, uppdatera start- och slutdatum för den period som täcks av "
"rapporten under :guilabel:`Datum`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:27
msgid ""
"Update the :guilabel:`Responsibles` field to let other users access and edit "
"the report, if needed."
msgstr ""
"Uppdatera fältet :guilabel:`Ansvariga` för att låta andra användare få "
"tillgång till och redigera rapporten, om det behövs."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:31
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Draft` annual report card is then created in "
"the :guilabel:`Annual Reports` Kanban view."
msgstr ""
"Ett årsrapportkort med statusen :guilabel:`Utkast` skapas då i Kanban-"
"vyn :guilabel:`Årsrapporter`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:35
msgid ""
"Clicking the card opens the annual report in the :ref:`editable view "
"<accounting/annual-report/edit>`."
msgstr ""
"Genom att klicka på kortet öppnas årsrapporten i :ref:`redigeringsvy "
"<accounting/annual-report/edit>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:37
msgid ""
"The annual report is stored in the :doc:`Knowledge app <../../../"
"productivity/knowledge>`, under the :guilabel:`Private` category in the "
"sidebar tree, making the editable report visible only to its creator. If "
"additional users are added to the :guilabel:`Responsibles` field, the annual "
"report is then moved to the :guilabel:`Shared` category, allowing those "
"users to access it as well."
msgstr ""
"Årsrapporten lagras i :doc:`Kunskap-appen <../../../productivity/"
"knowledge>`, under kategorin :guilabel:`Privat` i sidofältets träd, vilket "
"gör den redigerbara rapporten synlig endast för dess skapare. Om ytterligare "
"användare läggs till i fältet :guilabel:`Ansvariga`, flyttas årsrapporten "
"till kategorin :guilabel:`Delad`, vilket gör att dessa användare också kan "
"komma åt den."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:46
msgid "Edit an annual report"
msgstr "Redigera en årsrapport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:49
msgid ""
"To modify the annual report's :guilabel:`Title`, :guilabel:`Dates`, "
"or :guilabel:`Responsibles`, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> "
"Annual Report`, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical "
"ellipsis)` icon of the annual report card, and select :guilabel:`Configure`."
msgstr ""
"För att ändra årsrapportens :guilabel:`Rubrik`, :guilabel:`Datum`, "
"eller :guilabel:`Ansvariga`, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Granska --"
"> Årsrapport`, klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertikala "
"ellipser)` på årsrapportkortet, och välj :guilabel:`Konfigurera`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:53
msgid ""
"To edit the content of the annual report, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --"
"> Review --> Annual Report`, then click on the annual report card to open it."
msgstr ""
"För att redigera innehållet i årsrapporten, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Granska --> Årsrapport`, och klicka sedan "
"på årsrapportkortet för att öppna det."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:56
msgid ""
"In the sidebar tree, hover over the new annual report and click "
"the :icon:`fa-caret-right` :guilabel:`(right arrow)` icon to the left of the "
"title to display the different sections. The detailed view appears in the "
"main editing area. Click any item in the sidebar or main view to open it for "
"editing:"
msgstr ""
"I sidofältets träd, håll muspekaren över den nya årsrapporten och klicka på "
"ikonen :icon:`fa-caret-right` :guilabel:`(högerpil)` till vänster om titeln "
"för att visa de olika avsnitten. Den detaljerade vyn visas i "
"huvudredigeringsområdet. Klicka på vilket objekt som helst i sidofältet "
"eller huvudvyn för att öppna det för redigering:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:61
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Attestation`: Use the :icon:`fa-toggle-on` :guilabel:`(toggle-"
"on)` or :icon:`fa-toggle-off` :guilabel:`(toggle-off)` icons to show or hide "
"attestations, which contain dynamic text. Dates and company values are "
"automatically updated when the final PDF report is generated, which includes "
"only attestations with the toggle enabled."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Intyg`: Använd ikonerna :icon:`fa-toggle-on` :guilabel:`(toggle-"
"on)` eller :icon:`fa-toggle-off` :guilabel:`(toggle-off)` för att visa eller "
"dölja intyg, som innehåller dynamisk text. Datum och företagsvärden "
"uppdateras automatiskt när den slutliga PDF-rapporten genereras, som endast "
"inkluderar intyg med aktiverad växling."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:67
msgid ""
"Attestations can be signed electronically by clicking :guilabel:`SIGNATURE`. "
"For users who have previously signed documents in Odoo, "
"click :guilabel:`Sign`. For first-time signers, :ref:`define a signature "
"<sign/sign-document/initials-signature>`, then click :guilabel:`Adopt & "
"Sign`."
msgstr ""
"Intyg kan signeras elektroniskt genom att klicka på :guilabel:`SIGNATURE`. "
"För användare som tidigare har signerat dokument i Odoo, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Sign`. För förstagångssignerare, :ref:`definiera en signatur "
"<sign/sign-document/initials-signature>`, och klicka sedan "
"på :guilabel:`Adopt & Sign`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:72
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Balance Sheet`: Click :guilabel:`Customize` to open "
"the :guilabel:`Balance Sheet` and customize it using filters and options. "
"Any configurations performed are reflected in the :ref:`exported PDF report "
"<accounting/annual-report/export>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Balansräkning`: Klicka på :guilabel:`Customize` för att "
"öppna :guilabel:`Balansräkningen` och anpassa den med hjälp av filter och "
"alternativ. Eventuella konfigurationer som utförs återspeglas i "
"den :ref:`exporterade PDF-rapporten <accounting/annual-report/export>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:75
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Profit and Loss`: Click :guilabel:`Customize` to open "
"the :guilabel:`Profit and Loss` statement and customize it using filters and "
"options. Any configurations performed are reflected in the :ref:`exported "
"PDF report <accounting/annual-report/export>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Resultaträkning`: Klicka på :guilabel:`Customize` för att "
"öppna :guilabel:`Resultaträkningen` och anpassa den med hjälp av filter och "
"alternativ. Eventuella konfigurationer som utförs återspeglas i "
"den :ref:`exporterade PDF-rapporten <accounting/annual-report/export>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Annexes`: Displays :ref:`additional items <accounting/annual-"
"report/additional-content>` included in the report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Annexes`: Visar :ref:`ytterligare objekt <accounting/annual-"
"report/additional-content>` som ingår i rapporten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Supporting Documents`: Allows :ref:`uploaded PDF files "
"<accounting/annual-report/additional-content>` to be included in the report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Supporting Documents`: Tillåter att :ref:`uppladdade PDF-filer "
"<accounting/annual-report/additional-content>` inkluderas i rapporten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:83
msgid "To remove items from the annual report:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:85
msgid ""
"In the sidebar, hover over the item, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon, and select :guilabel:`Send to "
"Trash`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:87
msgid ""
"In the main view, hover over the item and click the :icon:`fa-"
"trash` :guilabel:`(trash)` icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:90
msgid "Drag and drop items in the sidebar or main view to reorder them."
msgstr ""
"Dra och släpp objekt i sidofältet eller huvudvyn för att sortera om dem."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:91
msgid ""
"To create a new article, hover over a section in the sidebar and click "
"the :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` icon that appears next to it. The "
"article is then nested under the relevant section."
msgstr ""
"För att skapa en ny artikel, hovra över en sektion i sidofältet och klicka "
"på ikonen :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`(plus)` som visas bredvid den. Artikeln "
"kapslas sedan under relevant sektion."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:94
msgid ""
"To show or hide sub-articles, click :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Show sub-"
"articles` or :icon:`fa-sitemap` :guilabel:`Hide sub-articles` in the main "
"view."
msgstr ""
"För att visa eller dölja underartiklar, klicka på :icon:`fa-"
"sitemap` :guilabel:`Show sub-articles` eller :icon:`fa-"
"sitemap` :guilabel:`Hide sub-articles` i huvudvyn."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:100
msgid "Additional content"
msgstr "Ytterligare innehåll"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:102
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Annexes` section contains additional items, such as "
"customizable accounting reports, and articles with sections or tables to "
"complete. Review and delete any items that should not be included in the "
"final report."
msgstr ""
"Sektionen :guilabel:`Annexes` innehåller ytterligare objekt, såsom "
"anpassningsbara bokföringsrapporter, och artiklar med sektioner eller "
"tabeller att fylla i. Granska och radera eventuella objekt som inte ska "
"inkluderas i den slutliga rapporten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:106
msgid ""
"To add additional annexes, click :guilabel:`Annexes` in the sidebar, then, "
"in the main view, choose one of the following options:"
msgstr ""
"För att lägga till ytterligare bilagor, klicka på :guilabel:`Annexes` i "
"sidofältet, och välj sedan något av följande alternativ i huvudvyn:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Load a Template`: Click to select extra items not included by "
"default. Complete the sections, disable the :icon:`fa-toggle-"
"on` :guilabel:`(toggle-on)` icons to hide unnecessary parts, and "
"click :guilabel:`Load Template`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Load a Template`: Klicka för att välja extra objekt som inte "
"ingår som standard. Fyll i sektionerna, avaktivera ikonerna :icon:`fa-toggle-"
"on` :guilabel:`(toggle-on)` för att dölja onödiga delar, och klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Load Template`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:112
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Add an Article`: Click to create a blank article to complete "
"manually."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Add an Article`: Klicka för att skapa en tom artikel att fylla i "
"manuellt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:114
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Supporting Documents` section, click :guilabel:`Upload "
"files` to include additional PDF files in the annual report."
msgstr ""
"I sektionen :guilabel:`Supporting Documents`, klicka på :guilabel:`Upload "
"files` för att inkludera ytterligare PDF-filer i årsrapporten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:120
msgid "Export an annual report"
msgstr "Exportera en årsrapport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:122
msgid "To export the annual report as a PDF, follow these steps:"
msgstr "För att exportera årsrapporten som en PDF, följ dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:124
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> Annual Report`, then click "
"on the annual report card to open it in the editable view."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Review --> Annual Report`, och klicka "
"sedan på årsrapportskortet för att öppna det i redigerbar vy."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:126
msgid "Click on the upper-most level of the annual report in the sidebar tree."
msgstr "Klicka på den översta nivån av årsrapporten i sidofältets träd."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:127
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon in the "
"top-right corner and select :icon:`fa-file-pdf-o` :guilabel:`Download Annual "
"Report`."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` i det "
"övre högra hörnet och välj :icon:`fa-file-pdf-o` :guilabel:`Download Annual "
"Report`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:129
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Download Annual Report` window, disable the :icon:`fa-"
"toggle-on` :guilabel:`(toggle-on)` icons to exclude sub-articles and PDF "
"files, if needed."
msgstr ""
"I fönstret :guilabel:`Ladda ner årsredovisning` avaktivera "
"ikonerna :icon:`fa-toggle-on` :guilabel:`(toggle-on)` för att utesluta "
"underartiklar och PDF-filer, om det behövs."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:131
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Download PDF`."
msgstr "Klicka på :guilabel:`Ladda ner PDF`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:133
msgid ""
"Alternatively, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> Annual "
"Report` and click :guilabel:`Print` on the annual report card. This option "
"includes sub-articles and uploaded PDF files by default."
msgstr ""
"Alternativt, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Granska --> "
"Årsredovisning` och klicka på :guilabel:`Skriv ut` på årsredovisningskortet. "
"Detta alternativ inkluderar underartiklar och uppladdade PDF-filer som "
"standard."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:138
msgid ""
"The logo configured in the :ref:`company form <general/companies/company>` "
"is displayed on the cover page of the annual report."
msgstr ""
"Loggan som konfigurerats i :ref:`företagsformuläret <general/companies/"
"company>` visas på omslagssidan för årsredovisningen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/annual-report.rst:141
msgid ""
"To mark an annual report as :guilabel:`Done` or to delete it, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> Annual Report`, click "
"the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon on the report "
"card, then select :guilabel:`Set to Done` or :guilabel:`Delete`, as "
"appropriate."
msgstr ""
"För att markera en årsredovisning som :guilabel:`Klar` eller för att radera "
"den, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Granska --> Årsredovisning`, "
"klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertikal ellips)` på "
"rapportkortet och välj sedan :guilabel:`Ställ in som klar` "
"eller :guilabel:`Radera`, beroende på vad som är lämpligt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:3
msgid "Budgets"
msgstr "Budgetar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:5
msgid ""
":ref:`Analytic budgets <accounting/budgets/analytic-budgets>` track specific "
"activities and projects using analytic accounts, helping businesses make "
"informed decisions about specific departments, projects, or other groups of "
"transactions. In contrast, :ref:`financial budgets <accounting/budgets/"
"financial>` are tied to the general ledger accounts that appear on the "
"profit and loss and focus on the company's overall economic position."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Analytiska budgetar <accounting/budgets/analytic-budgets>` spårar "
"specifika aktiviteter och projekt med hjälp av analytiska konton, vilket "
"hjälper företag att fatta välgrundade beslut om specifika avdelningar, "
"projekt eller andra grupper av transaktioner. Däremot är :ref:`finansiella "
"budgetar <accounting/budgets/financial>` kopplade till huvudbokskontona som "
"visas i resultaträkningen och fokuserar på företagets övergripande "
"ekonomiska ställning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:14
msgid "Analytic budgets"
msgstr "Objekta budgetar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:16
msgid ""
"Analytic budgets allow for allocating and tracking income and expenses in "
"detail, breaking down costs and revenues by specific projects, departments, "
"or groups of transactions. Analytic budgets can be applied across various "
"departments or projects to measure profitability and performance. Odoo "
"manages analytic budgets using :doc:`analytic accounting "
"<analytic_accounting>`."
msgstr ""
"Analytiska budgetar möjliggör allokering och spårning av intäkter och utlägg "
"i detalj, genom att bryta ner kostnader och intäkter efter specifika "
"projekt, avdelningar eller grupper av transaktioner. Analytiska budgetar kan "
"tillämpas över olika avdelningar eller projekt för att mäta lönsamhet och "
"prestanda. Odoo hanterar analytiska budgetar med hjälp av :doc:`analytisk "
"redovisning <analytic_accounting>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:21
msgid ""
"To activate the option for creating analytic budgets, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, and "
"enable :guilabel:`Budget Management` in the :guilabel:`Analytics` section."
msgstr ""
"För att aktivera alternativet för att skapa analytiska budgetar, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar` och "
"aktivera :guilabel:`Budgethantering` i sektionen :guilabel:`Analytik`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:26
msgid ""
"Odoo structures budgets using :ref:`plans <accounting/analytic_accounting/"
"analytic_plans>` and :ref:`accounts <accounting/analytic_accounting/"
"analytic_accounts>`, which must be configured *before* creating a budget."
msgstr ""
"Odoo strukturerar budgetar med hjälp av :ref:`planer <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>` och :ref:`konton <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>`, som måste konfigureras *innan* en "
"budget skapas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:33
msgid "Set an analytic budget"
msgstr "Ställ in en analytisk budget"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:35
msgid ""
"To create a new budget, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Accounting --> "
"Analytic Budgets` and click :guilabel:`New`. Make sure the following fields "
"are appropriately completed: :guilabel:`Budget Name`, :guilabel:`Period`, "
"and :guilabel:`Budget Type`."
msgstr ""
"För att skapa en ny budget, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Bokföring "
"--> Analytiska budgetar` och klicka på :guilabel:`Ny`. Se till att följande "
"fält är korrekt ifyllda: :guilabel:`Budgetnamn`, :guilabel:`Period` "
"och :guilabel:`Budgettyp`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:39
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` in the :guilabel:`Budget Lines` tab to "
"structure the budget with the :ref:`analytic plans <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>` and :ref:`accounts <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>` previously created. While "
"the :ref:`analytic plans <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>` "
"correspond to the column names, select the :ref:`analytic accounts "
"<accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>` to define the budget "
"lines and set the amounts for each in the :guilabel:`Budgeted` column. Once "
"all the budget lines are settled, click :guilabel:`Open`. If changes need to "
"be made once the budget's status is :guilabel:`Open`, there are two options:"
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Lägg till en rad` i fliken :guilabel:`Budgetrader` för "
"att strukturera budgeten med de :ref:`analytiska planerna <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic_plans>` och :ref:`kontona <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>` som tidigare skapats. Medan "
"de :ref:`analytiska planerna <accounting/analytic_accounting/"
"analytic_plans>` motsvarar kolumnnamnen, välj de :ref:`analytiska kontona "
"<accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>` för att definiera "
"budgetraderna och ange beloppen för varje i kolumnen :guilabel:`Budgeterad`. "
"När alla budgetrader är fastställda, klicka på :guilabel:`Öppna`. Om "
"ändringar behöver göras när budgetens status är :guilabel:`Öppna`, finns det "
"två alternativ:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reset to Draft`: To overwrite the data, then reopen the budget."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Återställ till utkast`: För att skriva över data och sedan öppna "
"budgeten igen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:49
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Revise`: A new budget will be created. Once it "
"is :guilabel:`Open`, a :guilabel:`Rev` reference is added to "
"the :guilabel:`Budget Name`. The original budget is then :guilabel:`Revised`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Revidera`: En ny budget kommer att skapas. När den "
"är :guilabel:`Öppna`, läggs en :guilabel:`Rev`-referens till "
"i :guilabel:`Budgetnamn`. Den ursprungliga budgeten är "
"då :guilabel:`Reviderad`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:56
msgid "Check an analytic budget"
msgstr "Kontrollera en analytisk budget"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:58
msgid ""
"Once the budget is :guilabel:`Open`, two additional columns are "
"available: :guilabel:`Committed` and :guilabel:`Achieved`. These columns' "
"amounts are automatically calculated based on the related :ref:`analytic "
"distribution <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic-distribution>` of "
"journal items. When the :ref:`analytic distribution <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic-distribution>` of a journal item within the "
"budget's period is updated, the budget's columns for the analytic account(s) "
"selected in the distribution are automatically updated. "
"The :guilabel:`Achieved` amount reflects the current result according to the "
"items of confirmed journal entries for the associated :ref:`analytic account "
"<accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>`. In contrast, "
"the :guilabel:`Committed` amount displays the full value of "
"the :guilabel:`Achieved` amount, plus any confirmed purchase orders that "
"have not yet been billed."
msgstr ""
"När budgeten är :guilabel:`Öppna` finns två ytterligare kolumner "
"tillgängliga: :guilabel:`Åtagande` och :guilabel:`Uppnått`. Dessa kolumners "
"belopp beräknas automatiskt baserat på den relaterade :ref:`analytiska "
"fördelningen <accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic-distribution>` för "
"affärshändelser. När den :ref:`analytiska fördelningen <accounting/"
"analytic_accounting/analytic-distribution>` för en affärshändelse inom "
"budgetperioden uppdateras, uppdateras budgetens kolumner för de analytiska "
"konton som valts i fördelningen automatiskt. Beloppet "
"för :guilabel:`Uppnått` återspeglar det aktuella resultatet enligt posterna "
"i bekräftade verifikationer för det associerade :ref:`analytiska kontot "
"<accounting/analytic_accounting/analytic_accounts>`. Däremot visar beloppet "
"för :guilabel:`Åtagande` det fullständiga värdet av beloppet "
"för :guilabel:`Uppnått`, plus eventuella bekräftade inköpsordrar som ännu "
"inte fakturerats."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:70
msgid ""
"When a line in a request for quotation or purchase order includes an "
"analytic distribution, a :guilabel:`Budget` smart button appears, providing "
"a link to the :ref:`budget report <accounting/budgets/analytic-budget-"
"reporting>` for more details."
msgstr ""
"När en rad i en offertförfrågan eller inköpsorder inkluderar en analytisk "
"fördelning visas en smart knapp för :guilabel:`Budget`, som ger en länk "
"till :ref:`budgetrapporten <accounting/budgets/analytic-budget-reporting>` "
"för mer detaljer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:73
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Open` budgets, if a request for quotation or a purchase order "
"is created using the associated analytic distribution and exceeds the "
"allocated budget amount, the corresponding purchase order line is "
"highlighted in red."
msgstr ""
"För :guilabel:`Öppna` budgetar, om en offertförfrågan eller en inköpsorder "
"skapas med den associerade analytiska fördelningen och överskrider det "
"tilldelade budgetbeloppet, markeras motsvarande inköpsorderrad i rött."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:77
msgid ""
"To reveal the :guilabel:`Theoretical` amount or percentage, use "
"the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` (:guilabel:`adjust settings`) icon in "
"the :guilabel:`Budget Lines`' header. The :guilabel:`Theoretical` amount "
"represents the amount of money that could theoretically have been spent or "
"should have been received based on the current date relative to the start/"
"end dates. Click :guilabel:`Details` to open a filtered view of "
"the :ref:`budget report <accounting/budgets/analytic-budget-reporting>` "
"related to that specific budget line."
msgstr ""
"För att visa det :guilabel:`Teoretiska` beloppet eller procentsatsen, använd "
"ikonen :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` (:guilabel:`justera inställningar`) i "
"rubriken för :guilabel:`Budgetrader`. Det :guilabel:`Teoretiska` beloppet "
"representerar den summa pengar som teoretiskt kunde ha spenderats eller "
"borde ha mottagits baserat på det aktuella datumet i förhållande till start-/"
"slutdatumen. Klicka på :guilabel:`Detaljer` för att öppna en filtrerad vy "
"av :ref:`budgetrapporten <accounting/budgets/analytic-budget-reporting>` "
"relaterad till den specifika budgetraden."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:None
msgid "open budget with committed, achieved, and theoretical amounts"
msgstr "öppen budget med åtagande, uppnådda och teoretiska belopp"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:88
msgid ""
"Deleting a budget is only allowed in the :guilabel:`Draft` "
"and :guilabel:`Cancelled` stages."
msgstr ""
"Att radera en budget är endast tillåtet i stadierna :guilabel:`Utkast` "
"och :guilabel:`Annullerad`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:90
msgid ""
"To view the budget lines of one or multiple budgets directly from "
"the :guilabel:`Budgets` list view, select the budget(s) and "
"click :guilabel:`Budget Lines`."
msgstr ""
"För att visa budgetrader för en eller flera budgetar direkt från "
"listvyn :guilabel:`Budgetar` väljer du budget(arna) och klickar "
"på :guilabel:`Budgetrader`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:96
msgid "Generate periodic budgets"
msgstr "Skapa periodiska budgetar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:98
msgid ""
"To create periodic budgets (monthly, quarterly, and yearly) for the "
"selected :guilabel:`Analytic Plans`, click :guilabel:`Generate`. A new "
"budget is created for each :guilabel:`Period` between the start and end "
"dates:"
msgstr ""
"För att skapa periodiska budgetar (månatliga, kvartalsvisa och årliga) för "
"de valda :guilabel:`Analytiska planerna` klickar du på :guilabel:`Skapa`. En "
"ny budget skapas för varje :guilabel:`Period` mellan start- och slutdatum:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:102
msgid ""
"If a single analytic plan is selected, each budget includes a line for each "
"account in that analytic plan."
msgstr ""
"Om en enstaka analytisk plan väljs innehåller varje budget en rad för varje "
"konto i den analytiska planen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:104
msgid ""
"If multiple analytic plans are selected, each budget includes a line for "
"each account/analytic plan combination."
msgstr ""
"Om flera analytiska planer väljs innehåller varje budget en rad för varje "
"kombination av konto/analytisk plan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:107
msgid "To generate periodic budgets, follow these steps:"
msgstr "För att skapa periodiska budgetar följer du dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:109
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Budgets` list view, click :guilabel:`Generate`."
msgstr "I listvyn :guilabel:`Budgetar` klickar du på :guilabel:`Skapa`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:110
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Generate Budget` window, set the dates and select "
"the :guilabel:`Period` and the :guilabel:`Analytic Plans`."
msgstr ""
"I fönstret :guilabel:`Skapa budget` anger du datum och "
"väljer :guilabel:`Period` samt :guilabel:`Analytiska planer`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:0
msgid "all the options to generate periodical budgets"
msgstr "alla alternativ för att skapa periodiska budgetar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:116
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Split` to create the periodic budgets."
msgstr "Klicka på :guilabel:`Dela upp` för att skapa de periodiska budgetarna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:117
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Budgets` in the top-left corner to return to "
"the :guilabel:`Budgets` list view."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Budgetar` i det övre vänstra hörnet för att återgå till "
"listvyn :guilabel:`Budgetar`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:118
msgid ""
"One by one, click on the different periodic budgets with "
"the :guilabel:`Draft` status to open them and set the amounts in "
"the :guilabel:`Budgeted` column for each analytic account linked to the "
"chosen analytic plans."
msgstr ""
"En efter en klickar du på de olika periodiska budgetarna med "
"statusen :guilabel:`Utkast` för att öppna dem och ange beloppen i "
"kolumnen :guilabel:`Budgeterat` för varje analytiskt konto som är kopplat "
"till de valda analytiska planerna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:121
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Open` for each periodic budget."
msgstr "Klicka på :guilabel:`Öppna` för varje periodisk budget."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:128
msgid ""
"To perform various reporting actions, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Reporting --> Budget Report`, then:"
msgstr ""
"För att utföra olika rapporteringsåtgärder går du "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Rapportering --> Rapport om budget` och:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:131
msgid "Track, analyze, and compare budget data."
msgstr "Spåra, analysera och jämför budgetdata."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:132
msgid ""
"Filter and group data using the :icon:`fa-plus-square` (:guilabel:`plus-"
"square`) or :icon:`fa-minus-square` :guilabel:`(minus-square)` icon."
msgstr ""
"Filtrera och gruppera data med hjälp av ikonen :icon:`fa-plus-square` "
"(:guilabel:`plus-kvadrat`) eller :icon:`fa-minus-square` :guilabel:`(minus-"
"kvadrat)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:134
msgid ""
"Drill down into the report to see more details on the actual amounts and "
"transactions."
msgstr ""
"Gå djupare in i rapporten för att se fler detaljer om de faktiska beloppen "
"och transaktionerna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:135
msgid "Export the data for further analysis or reporting needs."
msgstr "Exportera data för vidare analys eller rapporteringsbehov."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:140
msgid "Financial budgets"
msgstr "Finansiella budgetar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:142
msgid ""
"Financial budgets are structured around specific income and expense accounts "
"and transactions for official financial reporting and compliance purposes."
msgstr ""
"Finansiella budgetar är strukturerade kring specifika intäkts- och "
"utgiftskonton samt transaktioner för officiell finansiell rapportering och "
"efterlevnadsändamål."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:146
msgid ""
"Financial budgets are available on the :ref:`Profit and Loss <accounting/"
"reporting/profit-and-loss>` report."
msgstr ""
"Finansiella budgetar är tillgängliga i rapporten :ref:`Resultaträkning "
"<accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:152
msgid "Set a financial budget"
msgstr "Ange en finansiell budget"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:154
msgid "To create a new financial budget, follow these steps:"
msgstr "För att skapa en ny finansiell budget, följ dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:156
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Profit and Loss` to open "
"the :ref:`Profit and Loss <accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>` report."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Rapporter --> Resultaträkning` för att "
"öppna rapporten :ref:`Resultaträkning <accounting/reporting/profit-and-"
"loss>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:158
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`(calendar)` button to use the date "
"selector and choose a period."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`(kalender)` för att använda "
"datumväljaren och välja en period."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:160
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`Budget` button and name the "
"budget. A new column labeled with the budget name will appear next to "
"the :guilabel:`Balance` column."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`Budget` och namnge "
"budgeten. En ny kolumn märkt med budgetnamnet kommer att visas bredvid "
"kolumnen :guilabel:`Saldo`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:162
msgid "Assign amounts to each account requiring analysis."
msgstr "Tilldela belopp till varje konto som kräver analys."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:163
msgid ""
"A new :guilabel:`%` column will appear to the right of the new budget "
"column, indicating the current status."
msgstr ""
"En ny :guilabel:`%`-kolumn kommer att visas till höger om den nya "
"budgetkolumnen, vilket indikerar den aktuella statusen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:166
msgid ""
"Different financial budgets can be created using these steps for comparison "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"Olika finansiella budgetar kan skapas med hjälp av dessa steg för "
"jämförelseändamål."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:169
msgid ""
"The date selector enables the division of periods and navigation between "
"periods, automatically updating the amounts accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Datumväljaren möjliggör uppdelning av perioder och navigering mellan "
"perioder, vilket automatiskt uppdaterar beloppen i enlighet därmed."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:3
msgid "Custom reports"
msgstr "Anpassade rapporter"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo comes with a powerful and easy-to-use reporting framework. The engine "
"allows you to create new reports, such as **tax reports**, or **balance "
"sheets** and **income statements** with **specific groupings** and "
"**layouts**."
msgstr ""
"Odoo levereras med ett kraftfullt och lättanvänt rapportramverk. Motorn "
"låter dig skapa nya rapporter, såsom **skatterapporter**, eller "
"**balansräkningar** och **resultaträkningar** med **specifika grupperingar** "
"och **layouter**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:10
msgid ""
"Activate the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` to access the accounting "
"report creation interface."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera :ref:`systemutvecklarläget <developer-mode>` för att få tillgång "
"till gränssnittet för att skapa bokföringsrapporter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:13
msgid ""
"To create a new report, open the :guilabel:`Accounting` app and navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Accounting Reports`. From here, you can "
"either create a :ref:`root report <customize-reports/root>` or "
"a :ref:`variant <customize-reports/variants>`."
msgstr ""
"För att skapa en ny rapport, öppna appen :guilabel:`Bokföring` och navigera "
"till :menuselection:`Konfiguration --> Bokföringsrapporter`. Härifrån kan du "
"antingen skapa en :ref:`grundrapport <customize-reports/root>` eller "
"en :ref:`variant <customize-reports/variants>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:20
msgid "Root reports"
msgstr "Rotrapporter"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:22
msgid ""
"Root reports can be regarded as generic, neutral accounting reports. They "
"serve as models on which local accounting versions are built. If a report "
"has no root report, it is considered to be a root report itself."
msgstr ""
"Rotrapporter kan betraktas som generiska, neutrala redovisningsrapporter. De "
"fungerar som modeller på vilka lokala bokföringsversioner byggs upp. Om en "
"rapport inte har någon rotrapport, anses den själv vara en rotrapport."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:27
msgid ""
"A tax report for Belgium and the US would both use the same generic version "
"as a base and adapt it for their domestic regulations."
msgstr ""
"En skatterapport för Belgien och USA skulle båda använda samma generiska "
"version som bas och anpassa den till sina nationella bestämmelser."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:30
msgid ""
"When creating a new root report, you need to create a **menu item** for it. "
"To do so, open the report and, on that same report, click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then select :guilabel:`Create Menu Item`. "
"Refresh the page; the report is now available "
"under :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting`."
msgstr ""
"När du skapar en ny grundrapport måste du skapa ett **menyobjekt** för den. "
"För att göra detta, öppna rapporten och klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(Åtgärder)`, välj sedan :guilabel:`Skapa menyobjekt`. "
"Uppdatera sidan; rapporten är nu tillgänglig under :menuselection:`Bokföring "
"--> Rapporter`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:36
msgid ""
"Cases that require creating a new root report are rare, such as when a "
"country's tax authorities require a new and specific type of report."
msgstr ""
"Fall som kräver att en ny rotrapport skapas är sällsynta, till exempel när "
"ett lands skattemyndigheter kräver en ny och specifik typ av rapport."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:42
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:138
msgid "Variants"
msgstr "Varianter"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:44
msgid ""
"Variants are country-specific versions of root reports and, therefore, "
"always refer to a root report. To create a variant, select a generic (root) "
"report in the :guilabel:`Root Report` field when creating a new report."
msgstr ""
"Varianter är landsspecifika versioner av rotrapporter och hänvisar därför "
"alltid till en rotrapport. Om du vill skapa en variant väljer du en generisk "
"rapport (rotrapport) i fältet :guilabel:`Root Report` när du skapar en ny "
"rapport."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:48
msgid ""
"When a root report is opened from one of the accounting app's main menus, "
"all its variants are displayed in the variant selector in the top right "
"corner of the view."
msgstr ""
"När en grundrapport öppnas från en av bokföringsappens huvudmenyer, visas "
"alla dess varianter i variantväljaren i det övre högra hörnet av vyn."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:52
msgid ""
"In the following image, :guilabel:`VAT Report (BE)` is the variant of the "
"root :guilabel:`Generic Tax report`."
msgstr ""
"I följande bild är :guilabel:`Momsrapport (BE)` varianten av "
"grundrapporten :guilabel:`Generisk skatterapport`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:58
msgid "Report lines"
msgstr "Rapportrader"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:60
msgid ""
"After having created a report (either root or variant), you need to fill it "
"with report lines. You can either create a new one by clicking "
"on :guilabel:`Add a line`, or modify an existing report line by clicking on "
"it. All report lines *require* a :guilabel:`Name`, and can have an optional "
"additional :guilabel:`Code` (of your choice) if you wish to use their value "
"in formulas."
msgstr ""
"Efter att ha skapat en rapport (antingen rot eller variant) behöver du fylla "
"den med rapportrader. Du kan antingen skapa en ny genom att klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Skapa en rad` eller ändra en befintlig rapportrad genom att "
"klicka på den. Alla rapportrader *kräver* ett :guilabel:`Namn` och kan ha en "
"valfri ytterligare :guilabel:`Kod` (efter eget val) om du vill använda deras "
"värde i formler."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:None
msgid "Engine lines options."
msgstr "Alternativ för motorledningar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:71
msgid "Expressions"
msgstr "Uttryck"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:73
msgid ""
"Each report line can contain one or multiple **expressions**. Expressions "
"can be seen as **sub-variables** needed by a report line. To create an "
"expression, click on :guilabel:`Add a line` *within* a report line."
msgstr ""
"Varje rapportrad kan innehålla ett eller flera **uttryck**. Uttryck kan ses "
"som **undervariabler** som behövs av en rapportrad. För att skapa ett "
"uttryck, klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa en rad` *inom* en rapportrad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:77
msgid ""
"When creating an expression, you must attribute a :guilabel:`Label` used to "
"refer to that expression. Therefore, it has to be **unique** among the "
"expressions of each line. Both a :guilabel:`Computation Engine` and "
"a :guilabel:`Formula` must also be indicated. The **engine** defines how "
"your **formula(s)** and **subformula(s)** are interpreted. It is possible to "
"mix expressions using different computation engines under the same line if "
"you need to."
msgstr ""
"När du skapar ett uttryck måste du tilldela en :guilabel:`Etikett` som "
"används för att referera till uttrycket. Därför måste den vara **unik** "
"bland uttrycken för varje rad. Både en :guilabel:`Beräkningsmotor` och "
"en :guilabel:`Formel` måste också anges. **Motorn** definierar hur dina "
"**formler** och **underformler** tolkas. Det är möjligt att blanda uttryck "
"som använder olika beräkningsmotorer under samma rad om du behöver det."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:84
msgid "Depending on the engine, :guilabel:`subformulas` may also be required."
msgstr "Beroende på motorn kan :guilabel:`subformulas` också krävas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:89
msgid "'Odoo Domain' engine"
msgstr "Motor 'Odoo-domän'"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:91
msgid ""
"With this engine, a formula is interpreted as an :ref:`Odoo domain "
"<reference/orm/domains>` targeting `account.move.line` objects."
msgstr ""
"Med denna motor tolkas en formel som en :ref:`Odoo-domän <reference/orm/"
"domains>` som riktar sig mot `account.move.line`-objekt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:94
msgid ""
"The subformula allows you to define how the move lines matching the domain "
"are used to compute the value of the expression:"
msgstr ""
"Med hjälp av underformeln kan du definiera hur de flyttlinjer som matchar "
"domänen används för att beräkna värdet på uttrycket:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:98
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:273
msgid "`sum`"
msgstr "`summa`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:98
msgid "The result is the sum of all the balances of the matched move lines."
msgstr "Resultatet är summan av alla saldon för de matchade flyttraderna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:102
msgid "`sum_if_pos`"
msgstr "`summa_if_pos`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:101
msgid ""
"The result is the sum of all the balances of the matched move lines if this "
"amount is positive. Otherwise, it is `0`."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet är summan av alla saldon för de matchade flyttraderna om detta "
"belopp är positivt. I annat fall är det \"0\"."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:106
msgid "`sum_if_neg`"
msgstr "`summa_om_neg`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:105
msgid ""
"The result is the sum of all the balances of the matched move lines if this "
"amount is negative. Otherwise, it is `0`."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet är summan av alla saldon för de matchade flyttraderna om detta "
"belopp är negativt. I annat fall är det \"0\"."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:111
msgid "`count_rows`"
msgstr "`räkna_rader`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:109
msgid ""
"The result is the number of sub-lines of this expression. If the report line "
"has a group-by value, this will correspond to the number of distinct "
"grouping keys in the matched move lines. Otherwise, it will be the number of "
"matched move lines."
msgstr ""
"Resultatet är antalet underrader för detta uttryck. Om rapportraden har ett "
"gruppera-efter-värde kommer detta att motsvara antalet distinkta "
"grupperingsnycklar i de matchade transportraderna. Annars blir det antalet "
"matchade transportrader."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:113
msgid ""
"You can also put a `-` sign at the beginning of the subformula to "
"**reverse** the sign of the result."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också sätta ett `-`-tecken i början av underformeln för att "
"**återkalla** resultatet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:None
msgid "Expression line within a line report"
msgstr "Expressionsrad inom en radrapport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:122
msgid "'Tax Tags' engine"
msgstr "Motor 'Skatterelaterade taggar'"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:124
msgid ""
"A formula made for this engine consists of a name used to match tax tags. If "
"such tags do not exist when creating the expression, they will be created."
msgstr ""
"En formel skapad för denna motor består av ett namn som används för att "
"matcha skatterelaterade taggar. Om sådana taggar inte finns när uttrycket "
"skapas kommer de att skapas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:127
msgid ""
"When evaluating the expression, the expression computation can roughly be "
"expressed as: **(amount of the move lines with** `+` **tag)** `-` **(amount "
"of the move lines with** `-` **tag)**."
msgstr ""
"Vid utvärdering av uttrycket kan uttrycksberäkningen grovt sett uttryckas "
"som: **(antal flyttrader med** `+` **tag)** `-` **(antal flyttrader med** `-"
"` **tag)**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:131
msgid ""
"If the formula is `tag_name`, the engine matches tax tags `+tag_name` and `-"
"tag_name`, creating them if necessary. To exemplify further: two tags are "
"matched by the formula. If the formula is `A`, it will require (and create, "
"if needed) tags `+A` and `-A`."
msgstr ""
"Om formeln är `tag_name` matchar motorn skatterelaterade taggar `+tag_name` "
"och `-tag_name` och skapar dem om nödvändigt. För att exemplifiera "
"ytterligare: två taggar matchas av formeln. Om formeln är `A` kommer den att "
"kräva (och skapa, om nödvändigt) taggarna `+A` och `-A`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:138
msgid "'Aggregate Other Formulas' engine"
msgstr "Motor 'Aggregera andra formler'"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:140
msgid ""
"Use this engine when you need to perform arithmetic operations on the "
"amounts obtained for other expressions. Formulas here are composed of "
"references to expressions separated by one of the four basic arithmetic "
"operators (addition `+`, subtraction `-`, division `/`, and multiplication "
"`*`). To refer to an expression, type in its report line's **code** followed "
"by a period `.` and the expression's **label** (ex. **code.label**)."
msgstr ""
"Använd denna motor när du behöver utföra aritmetiska operationer på beloppen "
"som erhållits för andra uttryck. Formler här består av referenser till "
"uttryck separerade med en av de fyra grundläggande aritmetiska operatorerna "
"(addition `+`, subtraktion `-`, division `/` och multiplikation `*`). För "
"att referera till ett uttryck, skriv in rapportradernas **kod** följt av en "
"punkt `.` och uttryckets **etikett** (ex. **kod.etikett**)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:146
msgid "**Subformulas** can be one of the following:"
msgstr "**Subformler** kan vara något av följande:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:150
msgid "`if_above(CUR(amount))`"
msgstr "`if_above(CUR(belopp))`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:149
msgid ""
"The value of the arithmetic expression will be returned only if it is "
"greater than the provided bound. Otherwise, the result will be `0`."
msgstr ""
"Värdet på det aritmetiska uttrycket returneras endast om det är större än "
"den angivna gränsen. I annat fall blir resultatet `0`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:154
msgid "`if_below(CUR(amount))`"
msgstr "`if_below(CUR(belopp))`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:153
msgid ""
"The value of the arithmetic expression will be returned only if it is lower "
"than the provided bound. Otherwise, the result will be `0`."
msgstr ""
"Värdet på det aritmetiska uttrycket returneras endast om det är lägre än den "
"angivna gränsen. I annat fall blir resultatet `0`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:158
msgid "`if_between(CUR1(amount1), CUR2(amount2))`"
msgstr "`if_between(CUR1(belopp1), CUR2(belopp2))`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:157
msgid ""
"The value of the arithmetic expression will be returned only if it is "
"strictly between the provided bounds. Otherwise, it will be brought back to "
"the closest bound."
msgstr ""
"Värdet på det aritmetiska uttrycket returneras endast om det ligger strikt "
"mellan de angivna gränserna. Annars kommer det att återföras till den "
"närmaste gränsen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:163
msgid "`if_other_expr_above(LINE_CODE.EXPRESSION_LABEL, CUR(amount))`"
msgstr "`if_other_expr_above(LINE_CODE.EXPRESSION_LABEL, CUR(amount))`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:161
msgid ""
"The value of the arithmetic expression will be returned only if the value of "
"the expression denoted by the provided line code and expression label is "
"greater than the provided bound. Otherwise, the result will be `0`."
msgstr ""
"Värdet på det aritmetiska uttrycket returneras endast om värdet på det "
"uttryck som anges med den angivna radkoden och uttrycketiketten är större än "
"den angivna gränsen. I annat fall blir resultatet `0`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:168
msgid "`if_other_expr_below(LINE_CODE.EXPRESSION_LABEL, CUR(amount))`"
msgstr "`if_other_expr_below(LINE_CODE.EXPRESSION_LABEL, CUR(amount))`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:166
msgid ""
"The value of the arithmetic expression will be returned only if the value of "
"the expression denoted by the provided line code and expression label is "
"lower than the provided bound. Otherwise, the result will be `0`."
msgstr ""
"Värdet på det aritmetiska uttrycket returneras endast om värdet på det "
"uttryck som anges med den angivna radkoden och uttrycketiketten är lägre än "
"den angivna gränsen. I annat fall blir resultatet `0`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:170
msgid ""
"`CUR` is the currency code in capital letters, and `amount` is the amount of "
"the bound expressed in that currency."
msgstr ""
"`CUR` är valutakoden i versaler och `belopp` är beloppet för den bundna "
"betalningen uttryckt i den valutan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:176
msgid "`cross_report(xml_id | report_id[, force_date_scope])`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:174
msgid ""
"Match an expression from another report targeted by the xml_id or the report "
"ID itself. If `force_date_scope` is added, the :guilabel:`Date Scope` "
"defined on the expression will be used to compute all the expressions used "
"by the formula."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:181
msgid "'Prefix of Account Codes' engine"
msgstr "Motor 'Prefix av kontokoder'"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:183
msgid ""
"This engine is used to match amounts made on accounts using the prefixes of "
"these accounts' codes as variables in an arithmetic expression."
msgstr ""
"Denna motor används för att matcha belopp gjorda på konton med hjälp av "
"prefix för dessa kontons koder som variabler i ett aritmetiskt uttryck."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`21`"
msgstr "`21`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "Arithmetic expressions can also be a single prefix, such as here."
msgstr "Aritmetiska uttryck kan också bestå av ett enda prefix, t.ex. här."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`21 + 10 - 5`"
msgstr "`21 + 10 - 5`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula adds the balances of the move lines made on accounts whose "
"codes start with `21` and `10`, and subtracts the balance of the ones on "
"accounts with the prefix `5`."
msgstr ""
"Denna formel adderar saldona för de flyttrader som gjorts på konton vars "
"koder börjar med `21` och `10` och subtraherar saldot för dem på konton med "
"prefixet `5`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:195
msgid "It is also possible to ignore a selection of sub-prefixes."
msgstr "Det är också möjligt att ignorera ett urval av subrefix."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`21 + 10\\\\(101, 102) - 5\\\\(57)`"
msgstr "`21 + 10\\\\(101, 102) - 5\\\\(57)`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula works the same way as the previous example but ignores the "
"prefixes `101`, `102`, and `57`."
msgstr ""
"Formeln fungerar på samma sätt som i föregående exempel, men ignorerar "
"prefixen `101`, `102` och `57`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:202
msgid ""
"You can apply 'sub-filtering' on **credits and debits** using the `C` and "
"`D` suffixes. In this case, an account will only be considered if its prefix "
"matches, *and* if the total balance of the move lines made on this account "
"is **credit/debit**."
msgstr ""
"Du kan tillämpa \"underfiltrering\" på **krediter och debiteringar** med "
"hjälp av suffixen `C` och `D`. I detta fall kommer ett konto endast att "
"beaktas om dess prefix matchar, *och* om det totala saldot för de flyttrader "
"som gjorts på detta konto är **kredit/debit**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:207
msgid ""
"Account `210001` has a balance of -42 and account `210002` has a balance of "
"25. The formula `21D` only matches the account `210002`, and hence returns "
"25. `210001` is not matched, as its balance is *credit*."
msgstr ""
"Konto `210001` har ett saldo på -42 och konto `210002` har ett saldo på 25. "
"Formeln `21D` matchar endast kontot `210002` och returnerar därför 25. "
"`210001` matchas inte, eftersom dess saldo är *kredit*."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:211
msgid "Prefix exclusions can be mixed with the `C` and `D` suffixes."
msgstr "Prefixuteslutningar kan kombineras med suffixen `C` och `D`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`21D + 10\\\\(101, 102)C - 5\\\\(57)`"
msgstr "21D + 10(101, 102)C - 5(57)`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula adds the balances of the move lines made on accounts whose code "
"starts with `21` *if* it is debit (`D`) and `10` *if* it is credit (`C`), "
"but ignores prefixes `101`, `102`, and subtracts the balance of the ones on "
"accounts with the prefix `5`, ignoring the prefix `57`."
msgstr ""
"Denna formel adderar saldona för de flyttrader som gjorts på konton vars kod "
"börjar med `21` *om* det är debet (`D`) och `10` *om* det är kredit (`C`), "
"men ignorerar prefixen `101`, `102`, och subtraherar saldot för dem på "
"konton med prefixet `5`, ignorerar prefixet `57`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:219
msgid ""
"To match the letter `C` or `D` in a prefix and not use it as a suffix, use "
"an empty exclusion `()`."
msgstr ""
"För att matcha bokstaven `C` eller `D` i ett prefix och inte använda den som "
"suffix, använd en tom uteslutning `()`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`21D\\\\()`"
msgstr "`21D\\\\()`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula matches accounts whose code starts with `21D`, regardless of "
"their balance sign."
msgstr ""
"Denna formel matchar konton vars kod börjar med \"21D\", oavsett deras "
"saldotecken."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:225
msgid ""
"In addition to using code prefixes to include accounts, you can also match "
"them with **account tags**. This is especially useful, for example, if your "
"country lacks a standardized chart of accounts, where the same prefix might "
"be used for different purposes across companies."
msgstr ""
"Förutom att använda kodprefix för att inkludera konton kan du också matcha "
"dem med **kontotaggar**. Detta är särskilt användbart om ditt land till "
"exempel saknar en standardiserad kontoplan, där samma prefix kan användas "
"för olika ändamål i olika företag."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`tag(25)`"
msgstr "`tag(25)`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula matches accounts whose associated tags contain the one with id "
"*25*."
msgstr ""
"Denna formel matchar konton vars associerade taggar innehåller den med id "
"*25*."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:233
msgid ""
"If the tag you reference is defined in a data file, an xmlid can be used "
"instead of the id."
msgstr ""
"Om taggen du refererar till är definierad i en datafil kan ett xmlid "
"användas istället för id."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`tag(my_module.my_tag)`"
msgstr "`tag(min_modul.min_tag)`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula matches accounts whose associated tags include the tag denoted "
"by *my_module.my_tag*."
msgstr ""
"Denna formel matchar konton vars associerade taggar innehåller den tagg som "
"anges av *min_modul.min_tagg*."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:240
msgid ""
"You can also use arithmetic expressions with tags, possibly combining them "
"with prefix selections."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också använda aritmetiska uttryck med taggar och eventuellt kombinera "
"dem med prefixval."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`tag(my_module.my_tag) + tag(42) + 10`"
msgstr "`tag(min_modul.min_tag) + tag(42) + 10`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"The balances of accounts tagged as *my_module.my_tag* will be summed with "
"those of accounts linked to the tag with ID *42* and accounts with the code "
"prefix `10`"
msgstr ""
"Saldona för konton som märkts med *my_module.my_tag* kommer att summeras med "
"saldona för konton som är kopplade till taggen med ID *42* och konton med "
"kodprefixet `10`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:247
msgid "`C` and `D` suffixes can be used in the same way with tags."
msgstr "Suffixen `C` och `D` kan användas på samma sätt som taggar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`tag(my_module.my_tag)C`"
msgstr "`tag(min_modul.min_tag)C`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula matches accounts with the tag *my_module.my_tag* and a credit "
"balance."
msgstr ""
"Denna formel matchar konton med taggen *min_modul.min_tagg* och ett "
"kreditsaldo."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:253
msgid "Prefix exclusion also works with tags."
msgstr "Prefixuteslutning fungerar också med taggar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`tag(my_module.my_tag)\\\\(10)`"
msgstr "`tag(min_modul.min_tag)\\\\(10)`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula matches accounts with the tag *my_module.my_tag* and a code not "
"starting with `10`."
msgstr ""
"Denna formel matchar konton med taggen *my_module.my_tag* och en kod som "
"inte börjar med `10`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:263
msgid "'External Value' engine"
msgstr "Motor 'Externt värde'"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:265
msgid ""
"The 'external value' engine is used to refer to **manual** and **carryover "
"values**. Those values are not stored using `account.move.line`, but with "
"`account.report.external.value`. Each of these objects directly points to "
"the expression it impacts, so very little needs to be done about their "
"selection here."
msgstr ""
"Motorn 'externt värde' används för att referera till **manuella** och "
"**överföringsvärden**. Dessa värden lagras inte med `account.move.line`, "
"utan med `account.report.external.value`. Vart och ett av dessa objekt pekar "
"direkt på det uttryck det påverkar, så väldigt lite behöver göras för deras "
"val här."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:270
msgid "**Formulas** can be one of the following:"
msgstr "**Formler** kan vara en av följande:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:273
msgid "If the result must be the sum of all the external values in the period."
msgstr "Om resultatet ska vara summan av alla externa värden under perioden."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:276
msgid "`most_recent`"
msgstr "`most_recent`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:276
msgid ""
"If the result must be the value of the latest external value in the period."
msgstr ""
"Om resultatet ska vara värdet av det senaste externa värdet under perioden."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:278
msgid "In addition, **subformulas** can be used in two ways:"
msgstr "Dessutom kan **subformler** användas på två sätt:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:281
msgid "`rounding=X`"
msgstr "avrundning=X"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:281
msgid ""
"Replacing `X` with a number instructs to round the amount to X decimals."
msgstr "Om du ersätter \"X\" med ett tal avrundas beloppet till X decimaler."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:285
msgid "`editable`"
msgstr "\"redigerbar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:284
msgid ""
"Indicates this expression can be edited manually, triggering the display of "
"an icon in the report, allowing the user to perform this action."
msgstr ""
"Indikerar att detta uttryck kan redigeras manuellt, vilket utlöser visning "
"av en ikon i rapporten som gör det möjligt för användaren att utföra denna "
"åtgärd."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:288
msgid ""
"Manual values are created at the `date_to` currently selected in the report."
msgstr ""
"Manuella värden skapas vid det \"date_to\" som för närvarande är valt i "
"rapporten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:290
msgid "Both subformulas can be mixed by separating them with a `;`."
msgstr "Båda delformlerna kan blandas genom att separera dem med ett `;`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`editable;rounding=2`"
msgstr "redigerbar;avrundning=2"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "is a correct subformula mixing both behaviors."
msgstr "är en korrekt underformel som blandar båda beteendena."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:299
msgid "'Custom Python Function' engine"
msgstr "Motor 'anpassad Python-funktion'"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:301
msgid ""
"This engine is a means for developers to introduce custom computation of "
"expressions on a case-by-case basis. The formula is the name of a **python "
"function** to call, and the subformula is a **key** to fetch in the "
"**dictionary** returned by this function. Use it only if you are making a "
"custom module of your own."
msgstr ""
"Denna motor är ett sätt för utvecklare att introducera anpassad beräkning av "
"uttryck från fall till fall. Formeln är namnet på en **python-funktion** som "
"ska anropas, och delformeln är en **nyckel** som ska hämtas i den **ordbok** "
"som returneras av denna funktion. Använd den endast om du skapar en egen "
"anpassad modul."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:309
msgid "Date filtering"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:311
msgid ""
"By default, the values computed for each expression will restrict the move "
"lines they consider to the ones strictly within the interval selected on the "
"report. To change that behavior, modify the :guilabel:`Date Scope` field of "
"the expression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:316
msgid "Columns"
msgstr "Kolumner"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:318
msgid ""
"Reports can have an **indefinite number** of columns to display. Each column "
"gets its values from the **expressions** declared on the **lines**. The "
"field :guilabel:`expression_label` of the column gives the label of the "
"expressions whose value is displayed. If a line has no **expression** in "
"that field, then nothing is displayed for it in this column. If multiple "
"columns are required, you must use different **expression** labels."
msgstr ""
"Rapporter kan ha ett **obegränsat antal** kolumner att visa. Varje kolumn "
"får sina värden från de **uttryck** som deklareras på **raderna**. "
"Fältet :guilabel:`expression_label` i kolumnen anger etiketten för de "
"uttryck vars värde visas. Om en rad inte har något **uttryck** i det fältet "
"visas ingenting för den i den här kolumnen. Om flera kolumner krävs måste du "
"använda olika **expression**-etiketter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:None
msgid "Columns of report."
msgstr "Kolumner i rapporten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:327
msgid ""
"When using the **period comparison** feature found under "
"the :guilabel:`Options` tab of an accounting report, all columns are "
"repeated in and for each period."
msgstr ""
"När du använder funktionen **periodjämförelse** som finns under "
"fliken :guilabel:`Options` i en redovisningsrapport, upprepas alla kolumner "
"i och för varje period."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:333
msgid "Line grouping"
msgstr "Radgruppering"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:335
msgid ""
"Non-standard grouping is possible by adding or using existing fields on the "
"*Journal Item* model, provided that the fields are related and non-stored."
msgstr ""
"Icke-standardgruppering är möjlig genom att lägga till eller använda "
"befintliga fält i modellen *Affärshändelse*, förutsatt att fälten är "
"relaterade och icke-lagrade."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:339
msgid ""
"Grouping lines requires the report to have explicit report lines that can be "
"edited. The deferred reports, for example, do not support grouping lines as "
"they use dynamic lines that are generated."
msgstr ""
"Gruppering av rader kräver att rapporten har explicita rapportrader som kan "
"redigeras. De uppskjutna rapporterna stöder till exempel inte gruppering av "
"rader eftersom de använder dynamiska rader som genereras."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:343
msgid "Create a new field on journal item"
msgstr "Skapa ett nytt fält för affärshändelse"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:345
msgid ""
"To create a non-stored, related field in the *Journal Item* model, first go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Journal Items`, and click the :icon:`fa-"
"bug` :guilabel:`(bug)` icon, then click :guilabel:`Fields`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new field, and complete the following "
"fields:"
msgstr ""
"För att skapa ett icke-lagrat, relaterat fält i modellen *Affärshändelse*, "
"gå först till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Affärshändelser` och klicka på "
"ikonen :icon:`fa-bug` :guilabel:`(bug)`, klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Fält`. "
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa` för att skapa ett nytt fält och fyll i följande "
"fält:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:350
msgid ":guilabel:`Field Name`: a technical name for the field"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fältnamn`: ett tekniskt namn för fältet"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:351
msgid ":guilabel:`Field Label`: the label to be displayed for the field"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fältetikett`: etiketten som ska visas för fältet"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:352
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Field Type`: the type of field that this related field should "
"point to"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fälttyp`: typen av fält som detta relaterade fält ska peka på"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:353
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stored`: Leave this field unchecked as only non-stored fields can "
"be used to group lines."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lagrat`: Lämna detta fält omarkerat eftersom endast icke-lagrade "
"fält kan användas för att gruppera rader."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:355
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Related Model`: If the field type "
"is :guilabel:`one2many`, :guilabel:`many2many`, or :guilabel:`many2one`, "
"select the model of the original field to group by."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Relaterad modell`: Om fälttypen är :guilabel:`en till "
"många`, :guilabel:`många till många` eller :guilabel:`många till en`, välj "
"modellen för det ursprungliga fältet att gruppera efter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:357
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Related Field Definition`: the technical path to the field you "
"want to group by"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Relaterad fältdefinition`: den tekniska sökvägen till fältet du "
"vill gruppera efter"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:360
msgid ""
"To group by the sales team of the commercial partner, set the related field "
"definition to `move_id.team_id`."
msgstr ""
"För att gruppera efter säljteamet för den kommersiella partnern, ställ in "
"den relaterade fältdefinitionen till `move_id.team_id`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:364
msgid "Group lines"
msgstr "Gruppera rader"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:366
msgid ""
"To group lines, go to the :ref:`Lines <customize-reports/lines>` tab of the "
"desired report, click on the line you want to group, and edit "
"the :guilabel:`Group by` field. Enter the technical name (:guilabel:`Field "
"Name`) of the field to use as the grouping key."
msgstr ""
"För att gruppera rader, gå till fliken :ref:`Rader <customize-reports/"
"lines>` för önskad rapport, klicka på raden du vill gruppera och redigera "
"fältet :guilabel:`Gruppera efter`. Ange det tekniska namnet "
"(:guilabel:`Fältnamn`) för fältet som ska användas som grupperingsnyckel."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:371
msgid ""
"To find a list of all the model's fields and their technical names, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Journal Items`, and click the :icon:`fa-"
"bug` :guilabel:`(bug)` icon, then click :guilabel:`Fields`. The technical "
"name of each field is listed in the :guilabel:`Field Name` column."
msgstr ""
"För att hitta en lista över alla modellens fält och deras tekniska namn, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Affärshändelser` och klicka på "
"ikonen :icon:`fa-bug` :guilabel:`(bug)`, klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Fält`. "
"Det tekniska namnet för varje fält visas i kolumnen :guilabel:`Fältnamn`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:377
msgid ""
":ref:`Consolidation via grouping by account code "
"<consolidation_account_mapping>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Konsolidering via gruppering efter kontokod "
"<consolidation_account_mapping>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:382
msgid "Custom tax report setup"
msgstr "Installation av anpassad skatterapport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:385
msgid "Report configuration"
msgstr "Rapportkonfiguration"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:388
msgid ""
"All technical terms and functions of Odoo's reports engine are explained in "
"the previous sections of this page. We strongly recommend reading these "
"sections before setting up a custom tax report."
msgstr ""
"Alla tekniska termer och funktioner i Odoos rapportmotor förklaras i "
"föregående avsnitt på denna sida. Vi rekommenderar starkt att du läser dessa "
"avsnitt innan du konfigurerar en anpassad skatterapport."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:391
msgid ""
"To create a custom **tax report**, open the :guilabel:`Accounting` app, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Accounting Reports`, then "
"click :guilabel:`New`:"
msgstr ""
"För att skapa en anpassad **skatterapport**, öppna "
"appen :guilabel:`Bokföring`, navigera till :menuselection:`Konfiguration --> "
"Bokföringsrapporter` och klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Skapa`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:394
msgid "Enter a **name** for your report."
msgstr "Ange ett **namn** för din rapport."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:395
msgid "Select a :ref:`Root Report <customize-reports/root>`."
msgstr "Välj en :ref:`Grundrapport <customize-reports/root>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:396
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Availability` field, select :guilabel:`Country "
"Matches`, then select the :guilabel:`Country` matching your company."
msgstr ""
"Under fältet :guilabel:`Tillgänglighet`, välj :guilabel:`Land matchar` och "
"välj sedan det :guilabel:`Land` som matchar ditt företag."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:399
msgid ""
"Next, create a report line by clicking the :guilabel:`Add a line`. Once "
"created, click that report line to configure it:"
msgstr ""
"Skapa sedan en rapportrad genom att klicka på :guilabel:`Lägg till en rad`. "
"När den har skapats klickar du på rapportraden för att konfigurera den:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:402
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Add a line` again to create an :ref:`Expression <customize-"
"reports/expressions>` and name it."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Lägg till en rad` igen för att skapa ett :ref:`Uttryck "
"<customize-reports/expressions>` och namnge det."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:404
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Definition` tab, select a :guilabel:`Computation Engine` "
"for that expression depending on the following scenarios:"
msgstr ""
"I fliken :guilabel:`Definition`, välj en :guilabel:`Beräkningsmotor` för det "
"uttrycket beroende på följande scenarier:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:409
msgid "Scenario A (Tax grids)"
msgstr "Scenario A (Skattetabeller)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:411
msgid "In this scenario, your company *uses* tax grids:"
msgstr "I detta scenario *använder* ditt företag skattetabeller:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:413
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Tax Tags` as the computation engine. Odoo uses this field "
"to link the report line to your taxes."
msgstr ""
"Välj :guilabel:`Skatterelaterade taggar` som beräkningsmotor. Odoo använder "
"detta fält för att koppla rapportraden till dina skatter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:415
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Formula` field, type your short grid identifier (e.g., "
"`vat_sales_base`). Odoo automatically generates the `+` and `-` variants of "
"this tag for you to map inside :menuselection:`Configuration --> Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"I fältet :guilabel:`Formel`, skriv din korta rutnätsidentifierare (t.ex. "
"`vat_sales_base`). Odoo genererar automatiskt `+`- och `-`-varianterna av "
"denna tagg som du kan mappa i :menuselection:`Konfiguration --> Skatter`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:418
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Subformula` field, enter either `base` to report the "
"untaxed amount, or `tax` to report the actual tax amount collected/paid."
msgstr ""
"I fältet :guilabel:`Delformel`, ange antingen `base` för att rapportera det "
"skattefria beloppet, eller `tax` för att rapportera det faktiska "
"skattebeloppet som uppburits/betalats."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:421
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:431
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:445
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:455
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:486
msgid "Repeat this process as necessary. Then, :guilabel:`Save & Close`."
msgstr ""
"Upprepa denna process efter behov. Klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Spara och "
"stäng`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:423
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:447
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:468
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:478
msgid "Alternatively, you can:"
msgstr "Alternativt kan du:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:425
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Aggregate Other Formulas` as the computation engine. Odoo "
"uses this field to perform math on lines *already present* in the report "
"rather than scanning raw transactions."
msgstr ""
"Välj :guilabel:`Aggregate Other Formulas` som beräkningsmotor. Odoo använder "
"detta fält för att utföra matematiska beräkningar på rader *som redan finns* "
"i rapporten snarare än att skanna råa transaktioner."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:428
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:452
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Formula` field, use basic algebra referencing your line "
"codes (e.g., `LINE_10 - LINE_20`)."
msgstr ""
"I fältet :guilabel:`Formula` använd grundläggande algebra med hänvisning "
"till dina radkoder (t.ex. `LINE_10 - LINE_20`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:433
msgid "Scenario B (No tax grids)"
msgstr "Scenario B (Inga skattetabeller)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:435
msgid ""
"In this scenario, your company *does not* use tax grids. Instead, it tracks "
"everything strictly via General Ledger accounts:"
msgstr ""
"I detta scenario använder ditt företag *inte* skattetabeller. Istället "
"spårar det allt strikt via huvudbokskonton:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:438
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Prefix of Account Codes` as the computation engine: Odoo "
"uses this for lines that need to pull financial totals. Instead of looking "
"for transaction tags, Odoo pulls live balances directly from your chart of "
"accounts."
msgstr ""
"Välj :guilabel:`Prefix of Account Codes` som beräkningsmotor: Odoo använder "
"detta för rader som behöver hämta finansiella summor. Istället för att leta "
"efter transaktionstaggar hämtar Odoo saldon direkt från din kontoplan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:441
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Formula` field, type the starting digits of the accounts "
"you want to track, (e.g., `40` will pull the combined total of all revenue "
"accounts starting with `400000`, `401000`, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"I fältet :guilabel:`Formula` skriv de inledande siffrorna för de konton du "
"vill spåra (t.ex. `40` kommer att hämta den kombinerade summan av alla "
"intäktskonton som börjar med `400000`, `401000`, osv.)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:449
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Aggregate Other Formulas` as the computation engine. Odoo "
"uses this to calculate subtotals, net tax, or grand totals by adding or "
"subtracting your other report lines."
msgstr ""
"Välj :guilabel:`Aggregate Other Formulas` som beräkningsmotor. Odoo använder "
"detta för att beräkna delsummor, nettoskatt eller totalsummor genom att "
"addera eller subtrahera dina andra rapportrader."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:457
msgid "Scenario C (Advanced Engines)"
msgstr "Scenario C (Avancerade motorer)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:459
msgid ""
"In this scenario, your company requires advanced filtering, manual user "
"overrides, or complex algorithmic logic that standard tags and account "
"prefixes cannot handle:"
msgstr ""
"I detta scenario kräver ditt företag avancerad filtrering, manuella "
"användaråsidosättningar eller komplex algoritmisk logik som standardtaggar "
"och kontoprefix inte kan hantera:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:462
msgid ""
"Select :ref:`Odoo Domain <customize-reports/domain-engine>` as the "
"computation engine: Odoo uses this to bypass tax tags entirely and filter "
"raw journal items (`account.move.line`) using standard Odoo search syntax."
msgstr ""
"Välj :ref:`Odoo Domain <customize-reports/domain-engine>` som "
"beräkningsmotor: Odoo använder detta för att kringgå skatterelaterade taggar "
"helt och hållet och filtrera råa verifikationsrader (`account.move.line`) "
"med standardsyntax för Odoo-sökning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:465
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Formula` field, enter a valid domain starting with "
"brackets to isolate tax-exempt transactions for specific partner categories."
msgstr ""
"I fältet :guilabel:`Formula` ange en giltig domän som börjar med "
"hakparenteser för att isolera skattebefriade transaktioner för specifika "
"partnerkategorier."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:470
msgid ""
"Select :ref:`External Value <customize-reports/external-engine>` as the "
"computation engine. Odoo uses this to log manual overrides or historical "
"carryover values."
msgstr ""
"Välj :ref:`External Value <customize-reports/external-engine>` som "
"beräkningsmotor. Odoo använder detta för att logga manuella åsidosättningar "
"eller historiska överföringsvärden."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:472
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Formula` field, type either `sum` (to add all manual "
"values together over multi-period reports) or `most_recent` (to display only "
"the latest value)."
msgstr ""
"I fältet :guilabel:`Formula` skriv antingen `sum` (för att addera alla "
"manuella värden tillsammans över fleraperiodrapporter) eller `most_recent` "
"(för att visa endast det senaste värdet)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:474
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Subformula` field, type `editable` to display an edit icon "
"on the live report, allowing users to modify the value manually. "
"Additionally, you can round numbers by typing `rounding=x`."
msgstr ""
"I fältet :guilabel:`Subformula` skriv `editable` för att visa en "
"redigeringsikon på den aktiva rapporten, vilket tillåter användare att ändra "
"värdet manuellt. Dessutom kan du avrunda tal genom att skriva `rounding=x`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:480
msgid ""
"Select :ref:`Custom Python Function <customize-reports/python-engine>` as "
"the computation engine. Odoo uses this as an execution engine to run "
"specific calculations through backend coding when rules involve progressive "
"brackets, loops, or multi-tier thresholds."
msgstr ""
"Välj :ref:`Custom Python Function <customize-reports/python-engine>` som "
"beräkningsmotor. Odoo använder detta som en exekveringsmotor för att köra "
"specifika beräkningar genom backend-kodning när regler involverar "
"progressiva intervaller, loopar eller flernivåtrösklar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:483
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Formula` field, enter the exact technical name of the "
"Python method defined in your custom localization module."
msgstr ""
"I fältet :guilabel:`Formula` ange det exakta tekniska namnet på den Python-"
"metod som definierats i din anpassade lokaliseringsmodul."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:488
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Options` tab of an **Expression**, populate "
"the :guilabel:`Carry Over To` field with a formula to always carry over "
"balances or only carry them over when the amount is negative. Leave this "
"field blank if you do not want to use this feature."
msgstr ""
"I fliken :guilabel:`Options` för ett **Expression** fyll i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Carry Over To` med en formel för att alltid överföra "
"saldon eller endast överföra dem när beloppet är negativt. Lämna detta fält "
"tomt om du inte vill använda denna funktion."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`if_below(EUR(0))`"
msgstr "`if_below(EUR(0))`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "This formula will only carry over amounts below 0.00 EUR."
msgstr "Denna formel kommer endast att överföra belopp under 0,00 EUR."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:497
msgid "Tax configuration"
msgstr "Skattkonfiguration"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:499
msgid ""
"Next, go to :menuselection:`Configuration --> Taxes` and "
"click :guilabel:`New` to create and :ref:`configure new taxes <taxes/"
"configuration>` for your custom tax report. Create your **Sales** and "
"**Purchases** taxes, and populate the :guilabel:`Tax Grids` for all taxes "
"using the matching tax grids you created earlier. Finally, make sure "
"to :ref:`specify both a tax payable and tax receivable account <customize-"
"reports/tax-reports/closing-entry>` for each tax."
msgstr ""
"Gå sedan till :menuselection:`Konfiguration --> Taxes` och klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Skapa` för att skapa och :ref:`konfigurera nya skatter <taxes/"
"configuration>` för din anpassade skatterapport. Skapa dina skatter för "
"**Försäljning** och **Inköp** och fyll i :guilabel:`Skattetabeller` för alla "
"skatter med hjälp av de matchande skattetabeller du skapade tidigare. Se "
