msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:78
msgid ""
"Avalara Included: An affordable :doc:`In-App purchase service <../../../"
"essentials/in_app_purchase>` designed for SMBs with essential tax "
