#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:110
msgid ""
"This tax computation is rarely used and only useful in countries (e.g., "
"Brazil, Bolivia) that quote tax rates as a percentage of the tax-included "
"total. For the more common need to compute tax amounts from a tax-included "
"price, use the :ref:`Percentage of Price <taxes/computation/percentage-of-"
"price>` tax computation with :ref:`Included in Price <taxes/included-in-"
"price>` set to :guilabel:`Tax Included`."
msgstr ""
"Denna skatteberäkning används sällan och är endast användbar i länder (t.ex. "
"Brasilien, Bolivia) som anger skattesatser som en procentandel av den "
"skatteinkluderade totalsumman. För det vanligare behovet att beräkna "
"skattebelopp från ett pris inklusive skatt, använd "
"skatteberäkningen :ref:`Percentage of Price <taxes/computation/percentage-of-"
"price>` med :ref:`Included in Price <taxes/included-in-price>` inställd "
"på :guilabel:`Tax Included`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:116
msgid "The tax rate is a percentage of the **tax-included** total."
msgstr "Skattesatsen är en procentandel av totalsumman **inklusive skatt**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:123
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Included in Price` is set to :guilabel:`Tax Excluded`, the "
"computation is :math:`\\text{tax amount} = \\text{sales price} \\times "
"\\frac{\\text{tax rate}}{1 - \\text{tax rate}}`."
msgstr ""
"Om :guilabel:`Included in Price` är inställd på :guilabel:`Tax Excluded`, är "
"beräkningen :math:`\\text{tax amount} = \\text{sales price} \\times "
"\\frac{\\text{tax rate}}{1 - \\text{tax rate}}`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:128
msgid ""
"A product has a sales price of $1000, and we apply a "
"10% :guilabel:`Percentage of Price Tax Included` tax that is :guilabel:`Tax "
"Excluded`. We then have:"
msgstr ""
"En produkt har ett försäljningspris på $1000, och vi tillämpar en "
"10% :guilabel:`Percentage of Price Tax Included` skatt som är :guilabel:`Tax "
"Excluded`. Vi har då:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:135
msgid "111.11"
msgstr "111.11"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:135
msgid "1,111.11"
msgstr "1,111.11"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:138
msgid ""
"Note that the real tax rate in terms of the tax-excluded price "
"is :math:`\\frac{111.11}{1000} = 11.111\\%`."
msgstr ""
"Observera att den verkliga skattesatsen i termer av priset exklusive skatt "
"är :math:`\\frac{111.11}{1000} = 11.111\\%`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:143
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Included in Price` is set to :guilabel:`Tax Included`, the "
"computation is :math:`\\text{tax amount} = \\text{sales price} \\times "
"\\text{tax rate}`."
msgstr ""
"Om :guilabel:`Included in Price` är inställd på :guilabel:`Tax Included`, är "
"beräkningen :math:`\\text{tax amount} = \\text{sales price} \\times "
"\\text{tax rate}`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:147
msgid ""
"A product has a sales price of $1000, and we apply a "
"10% :guilabel:`Percentage of Price Tax Included` tax that is :guilabel:`Tax "
"Included`. We then have:"
msgstr ""
"En produkt har ett försäljningspris på $1000, och vi tillämpar en "
"10% :guilabel:`Procentandel av pris inklusive skatt`-skatt som "
"är :guilabel:`Skatt inkluderad`. Vi får då:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:155
msgid "900"
msgstr "900"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:158
msgid ""
"Note that the real tax rate in terms of the tax-excluded price "
"is :math:`\\frac{100}{900} = 11.111\\%`."
msgstr ""
"Observera att den verkliga skattesatsen i termer av skatteexkluderat pris "
"är :math:`\\frac{100}{900} = 11.111\\%`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:164
msgid "Custom formula"
msgstr "Anpassad formel"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:167
msgid ""
"If a tax can be expressed as a multiple of the quantity of the product to "
"which it applies, it can be defined as a :ref:`Fixed <taxes/computation/"
"fixed>` tax. Doing so is strongly recommended over defining "
"a :guilabel:`Custom Formula` tax."
msgstr ""
"Om en skatt kan uttryckas som en multipel av kvantiteten av produkten som "
"den tillämpas på, kan den definieras som en :ref:`Fast <taxes/computation/"
"fixed>`-skatt. Att göra så rekommenderas starkt framför att definiera "
"en :guilabel:`Anpassad formel`-skatt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:172
msgid ""
"To use :guilabel:`Custom Formula` taxes, :ref:`install <general/install>` "
"the :guilabel:`Define Taxes as Python Code` (`account_python_tax`) module."
msgstr ""
"För att använda :guilabel:`Anpassad formel`-skatter, :ref:`installera "
"<general/install>` modulen :guilabel:`Definiera skatter som Python-kod` "
"(`account_python_tax`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:175
msgid ""
"For a :guilabel:`Custom Formula` tax, the tax amount is computed according "
"to a Python expression defined in the :guilabel:`Formula` field. The Python "
"expression may contain the following tokens:"
msgstr ""
"För en :guilabel:`Anpassad formel`-skatt beräknas skattebeloppet enligt ett "
"Python-uttryck som definieras i fältet :guilabel:`Formel`. Python-uttrycket "
"kan innehålla följande element:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:178
msgid "any of the following variables:"
msgstr "någon av följande variabler:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:180
msgid "`price_unit`: the unit price of the product"
msgstr "`price_unit`: enhetspriset för produkten"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:181
msgid ""
"`base`: the taxable basis on which the tax is applied - may differ from the "
"`price_unit` if other taxes are applied first"
msgstr ""
"`base`: den beskattningsbara grunden som skatten tillämpas på - kan skilja "
"sig från `price_unit` om andra skatter tillämpas först"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:183
msgid "`quantity`: the quantity of the product"
msgstr "`quantity`: kvantiteten av produkten"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:184
msgid "`product`: the product record - product fields can also be accessed"
msgstr "`product`: produktposten - produktfält kan också nås"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:186
msgid "integers and floating-point numbers"
msgstr "heltal och flyttal"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:188
msgid ""
"the following permitted tokens: `(`, `)`, `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, `,`, `<`, `>`, "
"`<=`, `>=`, `and`, `or`, `None`, `min`, and `max`"
msgstr ""
"följande tillåtna element: `(`, `)`, `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, `,`, `<`, `>`, "
"`<=`, `>=`, `and`, `or`, `None`, `min` och `max`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:192
msgid ""
"A product has a sales price of $1000, and we apply a :guilabel:`Custom "
"Formula` tax with a :guilabel:`Formula` of `min(base, 500) * 0.10 + max(base "
"- 500, 0) * 0.20`"
msgstr ""
"En produkt har ett försäljningspris på $1000, och vi tillämpar "
"en :guilabel:`Anpassad formel`-skatt med en :guilabel:`Formel` på `min(base, "
"500) * 0.10 + max(base - 500, 0) * 0.20`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:195
msgid "We then have:"
msgstr "Vi får då:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:201
msgid "150"
msgstr "150"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:201
msgid "1,150.00"
msgstr "1,150.00"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:207
msgid "Included in price"
msgstr "Ingår i priset"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:209
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Included in Price` field determines if the price on products "
"and invoices already includes this tax or if this tax should be applied on "
"top of that value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:213
msgid ""
"To set a company-wide default for this setting, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, find "
"the :guilabel:`Taxes` section, and set the :guilabel:`Prices` setting "
"to :guilabel:`Tax Excluded` or :guilabel:`Tax Included`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default` indicates that the tax follows the company-wide default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Standard` indikerar att skatten följer den företagsövergripande "
"standarden."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:219
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Excluded` indicates that the tax amount is not included in "
"the sales price. The tax computation will therefore compute a tax amount on "
"top of the sales price."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Exklusive moms` anger att momsbeloppet inte ingår i "
"försäljningspriset. Momsberäkningen kommer därför att beräkna ett momsbelopp "
"utöver försäljningspriset."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:222
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Included` indicates that the tax amount is included in the "
"sales price. The tax computation will therefore split the sales price into a "
"tax-excluded base and the tax amount. This makes it suitable for B2C sales "
"in most countries, where prices are quoted tax-inclusive."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Inklusive moms` anger att momsbeloppet ingår i "
"försäljningspriset. Momsberäkningen kommer därför att dela upp "
"försäljningspriset i en momsfri bas och momsbeloppet. Detta gör det lämpligt "
"för B2C-försäljning i de flesta länder, där priser anges inklusive moms."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:229
msgid "Tax excluded/included toggle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:231
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tax Excl. / Tax Incl.` toggle on quotations, sales orders, "
"purchase orders, and invoices allows users to change a tax's behavior "
"regarding if it is included or excluded in the price of products. This "
"toggle allows one tax to meet the needs of multiple situations instead of "
"requiring duplicate taxes with otherwise identical configurations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:236
msgid ""
"To use the :guilabel:`Tax Excl. / Tax Incl.` toggle, add the desired "
"products first, then set the toggle to the desired option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:239
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Default` option is selected, using the :guilabel:`Tax "
"Excl. / Tax Incl.` toggle on a specific quotation, sales order, purchase "
"order, or invoice changes this tax's behavior for that record only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:243
msgid ""
"However, if a tax's :guilabel:`Included in Price` field is set to "
"either :guilabel:`Tax Excluded` or :guilabel:`Tax Included`, the tax's "
"behavior will not be changed by the :guilabel:`Tax Excl. / Tax Incl.` toggle "
"on quotations, sales orders, purchase orders, and invoices."
msgstr ""

