#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:71
msgid "Bill completion"
msgstr "Komplettering av räkning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:73
msgid ""
"Whether the bill is created manually or automatically, make sure the "
"following fields are appropriately completed:"
msgstr ""
"Oavsett om fakturan skapas manuellt eller automatiskt ska du se till att "
"följande fält är korrekt ifyllda:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:76
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vendor`: Odoo automatically fills in some information based on "
"the information on the vendor's contact record as well as previous purchase "
"orders and bills."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Leverantör`: Odoo fyller automatiskt i viss information baserat "
"på informationen i leverantörens kontaktpost samt tidigare inköpsorder och "
"fakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bill Reference`: Add the sales order reference provided by the "
"vendor. This field is used to :ref:`match <accounting/payments/payments-"
"matching>` the products when they are received."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fakturareferens`: Lägg till försäljningsorderreferensen som "
"tillhandahålls av leverantören. Detta fält används för att :ref:`matcha "
"<accounting/payments/payments-matching>` produkterna när de tas emot."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:80
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Auto-Complete`: Select a past bill/purchase order to complete the "
"document automatically. The :guilabel:`Vendor` field should be completed "
"before completing this field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Auto-Complete`: Välj en tidigare faktura/inköpsorder för att "
"slutföra dokumentet automatiskt. Fältet :guilabel:`Leverantör` bör fyllas i "
"innan detta fält fylls i."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:82
msgid ":guilabel:`Bill Date`: Select the document's issuance date."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fakturadatum`: Välj dokumentets utfärdandedatum."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:83
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Accounting Date`: Update the document's accounting registration "
"date if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bokföringsdatum`: Uppdatera dokumentets "
"bokföringsregistreringsdatum vid behov."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Reference`: The :guilabel:`Memo` field automatically "
"includes the payment reference once the payment is registered."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Betalningsreferens`: Fältet :guilabel:`Memo` inkluderar "
"automatiskt betalningsreferensen när betalningen har registrerats."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:86
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recipient Bank`: Indicates the account number to which the "
"payment will be made. This field is required when paying via batch payment "
"files (such as :ref:`NACHA <l10n_us/ach-electronic-transfers>` "
"and :doc:`SEPA Direct Debit <payments/sepa_payments>`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mottagarbank`: Anger det kontonummer som betalningen ska göras "
"till. Detta fält är obligatoriskt när du betalar via batchbetalningsfiler "
"(som :ref:`NACHA <l10n_us/ach-electronic-transfers>` och :doc:`SEPA-"
"direktdebitering <payments/sepa_payments>`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:89
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Due Date` or :guilabel:`Payment Terms` must be specified for the "
"bill payment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Förfallodatum` eller :guilabel:`Betalningsvillkor` måste anges "
"för fakturabetalningen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:90
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: Select which journal should record the bill and in "
"which :doc:`currency <get_started/multi_currency>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: Välj vilken journal som ska registrera fakturan och i "
"vilken :doc:`valuta <get_started/multi_currency>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:95
msgid ""
"To access the product catalog, click :doc:`Catalog </applications/essentials/"
"product_catalog>`."
msgstr ""
"För att komma åt produktkatalogen, klicka på :doc:`Katalog </applications/"
"essentials/product_catalog>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:96
msgid ""
"Select the products and quantities, then click :guilabel:`Back to Bill` to "
"return to the vendor bill; the selected catalog items will appear in the "
"vendor bill lines."
msgstr ""
"Välj produkterna och kvantiteterna och klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Tillbaka "
"till faktura` för att återgå till leverantörsfakturan; de valda "
"katalogartiklarna visas i leverantörsfakturans rader."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:98
msgid ""
"Update the :guilabel:`Quantity`, :guilabel:`Price`, and :doc:`Taxes <taxes>` "
"fields if needed."
msgstr ""
"Uppdatera fälten :guilabel:`Kvantitet`, :guilabel:`Pris` och :doc:`Skatter "
"<taxes>` vid behov."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:101
msgid ""
"If the bill line does not correspond to an existing product in the database, "
"click :guilabel:`Add a line` and enter a description for the bill line "
"without linking it to a product."
msgstr ""
"Om fakturaraden inte motsvarar en befintlig produkt i databasen, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Lägg till rad` och ange en beskrivning för fakturaraden utan "
"att länka den till en produkt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:105
msgid ""
"Multiple bills for the same purchase order may be issued if the vendor is on "
"back-order and sends invoices as products are shipped or if the vendor sends "
"partial bills or requests a deposit. In this case, multiple bills may have "
"the same :guilabel:`Bill Reference`."
msgstr ""
"Flera fakturor för samma inköpsorder kan utfärdas om leverantören har "
"restorder och skickar fakturor när produkterna levereras eller om "
"leverantören skickar delfakturor eller begär en deposition. I detta fall kan "
"flera fakturor ha samma :guilabel:`Fakturareferens`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:112
msgid "Bill confirmation"
msgstr "Bekräftelse av räkning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:114
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` when the document is completed. The status changes "
"to :guilabel:`Posted`, and a journal entry is generated based on the vendor "
"bill information. On confirmation, Odoo assigns each vendor bill a unique "
"number from a defined :doc:`sequence <vendor_bills/sequence>`."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Bekräfta` när dokumentet är färdigt. Statusen ändras "
"till :guilabel:`Bokförd` och en verifikation genereras baserat på "
"leverantörsfakturans information. Vid bekräftelse tilldelar Odoo varje "
"leverantörsfaktura ett unikt nummer från en definierad :doc:`nummerserie "
"<vendor_bills/sequence>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:119
msgid ""
"Once confirmed, a vendor bill can no longer be updated. "
"Click :guilabel:`Reset to draft` if changes are required."
msgstr ""
"När den väl är bekräftad kan en leverantörsfaktura inte längre uppdateras. "
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Återställ till utkast` om ändringar krävs."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:125
msgid "Self-billing"
msgstr "Egenutfärdade"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:127
msgid ""
"Self-billing is a workflow where a customer generates a vendor bill on the "
"supplier's behalf and sends a copy to the supplier for their records. It "
"removes the need for the supplier to send the customer a vendor bill and is "
"common in industries where the customer has more reliable transaction data. "
"It also reduces payment time as the customer does not have to wait for the "
"supplier to issue a vendor bill."
msgstr ""
"Egenutfärdade är ett arbetsflöde där en kund genererar en leverantörsfaktura "
"för leverantörens räkning och skickar en kopia till leverantören för deras "
"handlingar. Det tar bort behovet för leverantören att skicka kunden en "
"leverantörsfaktura och är vanligt i branscher där kunden har mer "
"tillförlitliga transaktionsdata. Det minskar också betalningstiden eftersom "
"kunden inte behöver vänta på att leverantören ska utfärda en "
"leverantörsfaktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:133
msgid ""
"Odoo supports the generation of self-billing vendor bills and self-billing "
"credit notes, both of which can be sent by email and via Peppol."
msgstr ""
"Odoo stöder generering av egenutfärdade leverantörsfakturor och "
"egenutfärdade kreditfakturor, vilka båda kan skickas via e-post och via "
"Peppol."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:141
msgid ""
"To configure self-billing in Odoo, first create a separate purchase journal "
"specifically for self-billing:"
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera egenutfärdade i Odoo, skapa först en separat "
"inköpsjournal specifikt för egenutfärdade:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:146
msgid "In the popup window, click :guilabel:`Purchases Journal`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:147
msgid "Enter a :guilabel:`Journal Name`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:148
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Advanced Settings` tab, enable :guilabel:`Self Billing`."
msgstr ""
"I fliken :guilabel:`Avancerade inställningar`, "
"aktivera :guilabel:`Egenutfärdade`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:151
msgid ":doc:`get_started/journals`"
msgstr ":doc:`get_started/journals`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:156
msgid "Create a self-bill"
msgstr "Skapa en egenutfärdad faktura"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:158
msgid ""
"Self-bills can be created both :ref:`manually <accounting/vendor_bills/"
"creation-manual>` and :ref:`automatically <accounting/vendor_bills/"
"automatic>`. When creating self-bills, be sure to either create them "
"directly from the :ref:`self-billing purchase journal <accounting/"
"vendor_bills/self-billing-config>` on the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard` "
"or manually set the :guilabel:`Journal` of the self-bill to the self-billing "
"purchase journal."
msgstr ""
"Egenutfärdade fakturor kan skapas både :ref:`manuellt <accounting/"
"vendor_bills/creation-manual>` och :ref:`automatiskt <accounting/"
"vendor_bills/automatic>`. När du skapar egenutfärdade fakturor, se till att "
"antingen skapa dem direkt från :ref:`inköpsjournalen för egenutfärdade "
"<accounting/vendor_bills/self-billing-config>` på :guilabel:`Dashboard för "
"bokföring` eller manuellt sätta :guilabel:`Journal` för den egenutfärdade "
"fakturan till inköpsjournalen för egenutfärdade."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:165
msgid ""
"The sequence of self-bills contains the :ref:`database ID "
"<export_import_data/different-ids>` (also known as the internal ID) of the "
"partner, making the sequence unique per partner."
msgstr ""
"Nummerserien för egenutfärdade fakturor innehåller :ref:`databas-ID "
"<export_import_data/different-ids>` (även känt som det interna ID:t) för "
"partnern, vilket gör nummerserien unik per partner."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:171
msgid "Send a self-bill"
msgstr "Skicka en egenutfärdad faktura"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:173
msgid ""
"To send a self-bill after :ref:`creating <accounting/vendor_bills/self-"
"billing-create>` and confirming it, click :guilabel:`Send`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Send` popup window, select the sending methods "
"(i.e., :guilabel:`by Email`, :guilabel:`by Post`, and/or :guilabel:`by "
"Peppol`), and click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""
"För att skicka en egenutfärdad faktura efter att ha :ref:`skapat <accounting/"
"vendor_bills/self-billing-create>` och bekräftat den, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Skicka`. I popup-fönstret :guilabel:`Skicka`, välj "
"sändningsmetoder (dvs. :guilabel:`via e-post`, :guilabel:`via post` och/"
"eller :guilabel:`via Peppol`) och klicka på :guilabel:`Skicka`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:179
msgid ""
"If sending self-bills via :ref:`Peppol <accounting/e-invoicing/peppol>`, "
"first :ref:`configure your Peppol registration <accounting/e-invoicing/"
"peppol-registration>`, then verify that the vendor is registered with "
"Peppol. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Vendors`, "
"then go through the :ref:`contact verification process <accounting/e-"
"invoicing/contact-verification>`."
msgstr ""
"Om du skickar egenutfärdade fakturor via :ref:`Peppol <accounting/e-"
"invoicing/peppol>`, :ref:`konfigurera först din Peppol-registrering "
"<accounting/e-invoicing/peppol-registration>`, verifiera sedan att "
"leverantören är registrerad hos Peppol. För att göra detta, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Leverantörer --> Leverantörer`, gå sedan "
"igenom :ref:`verifieringsprocessen för kontakter <accounting/e-invoicing/"
"contact-verification>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:184
msgid ""
"Not every Peppol access point supports self-billing. Check with your "
"suppliers to ensure theirs does."
msgstr ""
"Inte varje Peppol-åtkomstpunkt stöder egenutfärdade. Kontrollera med dina "
"leverantörer för att säkerställa att deras gör det."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:187
msgid ""
"To send multiple self-bills at once, select them in the journal's list view "
"and click :guilabel:`Send`. In the popup window that notes how many self-"
"bills will be sent by each method, click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:192
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Send` button only appears when accessing the list view of the "
"self-billing journal from the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard`; it does not "
"appear when accessing the general vendor bills list view from the menu."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:197
msgid ""
"When sending in bulk, the sending method is determined by the "
"vendor's :ref:`invoice sending preferences <accounting/invoice/sending>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:205
msgid ""
"To register a payment, click on :guilabel:`Pay`. In the :guilabel:`Pay` "
"window, select the :guilabel:`Journal`, the :guilabel:`Payment Method`, "
"the :guilabel:`Amount`, and the :guilabel:`Currency`."
msgstr ""
"För att registrera en betalning, klicka på :guilabel:`Betala`. I "
"fönstret :guilabel:`Betala`, "
"välj :guilabel:`Journal`, :guilabel:`Betalningsmetod`, :guilabel:`Belopp` "
"och :guilabel:`Valuta`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:209
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Amount` paid is less than the total remaining amount on "
"the vendor bill, the payment is :ref:`partial <accounting/payments/partial-"
"payment>`, and the :guilabel:`Payment Difference` field displays the "
"outstanding balance."
msgstr ""
"När det :guilabel:`Belopp` som betalas är mindre än det totala återstående "
"beloppet på leverantörsfakturan, är betalningen :ref:`partiell <accounting/"
"payments/partial-payment>`, och fältet :guilabel:`Betalningsdifferens` visar "
"det utestående saldot."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:213
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Memo` field is filled automatically if the :guilabel:`Payment "
"Reference` has been set correctly on the vendor bill. If the field is empty, "
"select the vendor invoice number as a reference."
msgstr ""
"Fältet :guilabel:`Memo` fylls i automatiskt "
"om :guilabel:`Betalningsreferens` har angetts korrekt på "
"leverantörsfakturan. Om fältet är tomt, välj leverantörens fakturanummer som "
"referens."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:217
msgid ""
"Then click :guilabel:`Create payment`. An :guilabel:`In "
"Payment`/:guilabel:`Partial` banner appears on the bill until it "
"is :doc:`reconciled <bank/reconciliation>` and its status updates "
"to :guilabel:`Paid`."
msgstr ""
"Klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Skapa betalning`. "
"En :guilabel:`Betalas`/:guilabel:`Partiell` banner visas på fakturan tills "
"den är :doc:`avstämd <bank/reconciliation>` och dess status uppdateras "
"till :guilabel:`Betald`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:228
msgid "Aged payable report"
msgstr "Föråldrad skuldrapport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:230
msgid ""
"For an overview of the open vendor bills and their due dates, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Aged payable`."
msgstr ""
"För en översikt över de öppna leverantörsfakturorna och deras förfallodatum, "
"gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Rapportering --> Leverantörsskuld`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:233
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-caret-right` :guilabel:`(right arrow)` icon next to a "
"vendor to view the details of all their outstanding bills, including the due "
"dates and amounts."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-caret-right` :guilabel:`(högerpil)` bredvid en "
"leverantör för att visa detaljer för alla deras utestående fakturor, "
"inklusive förfallodatum och belopp."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:3
msgid "Non-current assets and fixed assets"
msgstr "Långfristiga tillgångar och anläggningstillgångar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Non-current Assets**, also known as **long-term assets**, are investments "
"that are expected to be realized after one year. They are capitalized rather "
"than being expensed and appear on the company's balance sheet. Depending on "
"their nature, they may undergo **depreciation**."
msgstr ""
"**Anläggningstillgångar**, även kallade **långfristiga tillgångar**, är "
"investeringar som förväntas bli realiserade efter ett år. De aktiveras i "
"stället för att kostnadsföras och tas upp i företagets balansräkning. "
"Beroende på deras natur kan de genomgå **avskrivning**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:9
msgid ""
"**Fixed Assets** are a type of Non-current Assets and include the properties "
"bought for their productive aspects, such as buildings, vehicles, equipment, "
"land, and software."
msgstr ""
"**Anläggningstillgångar** är en typ av långfristiga tillgångar och omfattar "
"fastigheter som köps för att användas i produktionssyfte, t.ex. byggnader, "
"fordon, utrustning, mark och programvara."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:12
msgid ""
"For example, let's say we buy a car for $ 27,000. We plan to amortize it "
"over five years, and we will sell it for $ 7,000 afterward. Using the "
"linear, or straight-line, depreciation method, $ 4,000 are expensed each "
"year as **depreciation expenses**. After five years, the **Accumulated "
"Depreciation** amount reported on the balance sheet equals $ 20,000, leaving "
"us with $ 7,000 of **Not Depreciable Value**, or Salvage value."
msgstr ""
"Låt oss till exempel säga att vi köper en bil för 27 000 dollar. Vi planerar "
"att skriva av den under fem år och därefter sälja den för 7 000 USD. Med "
"hjälp av den linjära avskrivningsmetoden kostnadsförs 4 000 USD varje år som "
"**avskrivningskostnader**. Efter fem år uppgår **Avskrivningar** som "
"redovisas i balansräkningen till 20 000 USD, vilket ger oss 7 000 USD i "
"**Inte avskrivningsbart värde**, eller återvinningsvärde."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:18
msgid ""
"Odoo Accounting handles depreciation by creating all depreciation entries "
"automatically in *draft mode*. They are then posted periodically."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Accounting hanterar avskrivningar genom att skapa alla "
"avskrivningsposter automatiskt i *draft mode*. De bokförs sedan periodiskt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:21
msgid "Odoo supports the following **Depreciation Methods**:"
msgstr "Odoo stöder följande **Avskrivningsmetoder**:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:23
msgid "Straight Line"
msgstr "Rak linje"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:24
msgid "Declining"
msgstr "Minskande"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:25
msgid "Declining Then Straight Line"
msgstr "Avtagande sedan rak linje"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:28
msgid ""
"The server checks once a day if an entry must be posted. It might then take "
"up to 24 hours before you see a change from *draft* to *posted*."
msgstr ""
"Servern kontrollerar en gång om dagen om ett inlägg måste publiceras. Det "
"kan då ta upp till 24 timmar innan du ser en ändring från *draft* till "
"*posted*."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:32
