#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:176
msgid ""
"Odoo allows companies under the `Deferred Goods and Services Tax (DGST) "
"scheme <https://www.ato.gov.au/businesses-and-organisations/gst-excise-and-"
"indirect-taxes/gst/in-detail/rules-for-specific-transactions/international-"
"transactions/deferred-gst?=redirected_deferredGSTscheme>`_ to automate their "
"deferred GST flows."
msgstr ""
"Odoo tillåter företag under `Deferred Goods and Services Tax (DGST) scheme "
"<https://www.ato.gov.au/businesses-and-organisations/gst-excise-and-indirect-"
"taxes/gst/in-detail/rules-for-specific-transactions/international-"
"transactions/deferred-gst?=redirected_deferredGSTscheme>`_ att automatisera "
"sina uppskjutna GST-flöden."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:182
msgid "It is recommended to:"
msgstr "Det rekommenderas att:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:184
msgid ""
"go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and set "
"the :guilabel:`Tax Return Periodicity` to :guilabel:`monthly` (= monthly "
"BAS); and"
msgstr ""
"gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar` och "
"ställ in :guilabel:`Deklarationsperiod` till :guilabel:`månatlig` (= "
"månatlig BAS); och"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:186
msgid ""
"create a new journal to store all deferred GST entries by going "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals --> New`, and "
"selecting :guilabel:`Miscellaneous` as its :guilabel:`Type` when configuring "
"it."
msgstr ""
"skapa en ny journal för att lagra alla uppskjutna GST-poster genom att gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Journaler --> Skapa` "
"och välja :guilabel:`Diverse` som dess :guilabel:`Typ` vid konfiguration."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:190
msgid ""
"By default, a tax (*100% DGST*, inactive by default) and an account (*21340 "
"Deferred GST Liability*) are available for Australian companies. Activate "
"the tax by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`. "
"Search for the :guilabel:`Name` `100% DGST` (remove the default filter if "
"necessary), and click the :guilabel:`Activate` toggle switch."
msgstr ""
"Som standard finns en skatt (*100% DGST*, inaktiv som standard) och ett "
"konto (*21340 Deferred GST Liability*) tillgängliga för australiensiska "
"företag. Aktivera skatten genom att gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> "
"Konfiguration --> Skatter`. Sök efter :guilabel:`Namn` `100% DGST` (ta bort "
"standardfiltret om nödvändigt) och klicka på "
"växlingsknappen :guilabel:`Aktivera`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:196
msgid "Flow"
msgstr "Flöde"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:199
msgid "1. Importing goods: purchase order and vendor bill"
msgstr "1. Importera varor: inköpsorder och leverantörsfaktura"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:201
msgid ""
"When importing goods from abroad, the GST liability can now be deferred for "
"companies under the DGST scheme. On the purchase order, select "
"the :guilabel:`0% TPS` tax (tax paid separately) for the relevant order "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"När du importerar varor från utlandet kan GST-skulden nu skjutas upp för "
"företag under DGST-systemet. På inköpsordern väljer du skatten :guilabel:`0% "
"TPS` (skatt betalas separat) för de relevanta orderraderna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "Setting the 0% TPS tax on a purchase order"
msgstr "Ange 0% TPS-skatt på en inköpsorder"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:209
msgid "2. Recording the DGST balance on the BAS report"
msgstr "2. Registrering av DGST-saldot i BAS-rapporten"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:211
msgid ""
"When the Australian Taxation Office (ATO) is advised electronically of the "
"aggregated liability for the company by the Integrated Cargo System (ICS), "
"the GST balance deferred during the previous month becomes available on the "
"ATO's BAS portal."
msgstr ""
"När Australian Taxation Office (ATO) informeras elektroniskt om det "
"sammanlagda skuldbeloppet för företaget av Integrated Cargo System (ICS), "
"blir GST-saldot som skjutits upp under föregående månad tillgängligt på "
"ATO:s BAS-portal."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:216
msgid ""
"Odoo does not yet fetch the DGST balance automatically from the ATO. A "
"manual entry with the liability amount needs to be created in Odoo. We "
"recommend using a new journal for this purpose since deferrals will be "
"recurring."
msgstr ""
"Odoo hämtar ännu inte DGST-saldot automatiskt från ATO. En manuell post med "
"skuldbeloppet måste skapas i Odoo. Vi rekommenderar att använda en ny "
"journal för detta ändamål eftersom uppskov kommer att vara återkommande."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:220
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Journal Entries --> New`. On the first "
"journal item line, add the :guilabel:`Account` `21340 Deferred GST "
"Liability` and the deferred GST balance as a :guilabel:`Credit`. To resume "
"the example shown above, we credit $2,000 and save."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Verifikationer --> Ny`. På den första "
"aff ärshändelseraden lägger du till :guilabel:`Konto` `21340 Deferred GST "
"Liability` och det uppskjutna GST-saldot som en :guilabel:`Kredit`. För att "
"återuppta exemplet ovan krediterar vi $2 000 och sparar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "Creating a journal entry with the DGST account"
msgstr "Skapa en verifikation med DGST-kontot"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:227
msgid ""
"An auto-balancing line is created, along with journal items correctly "
"assigning the right values in the BAS :guilabel:`Tax Grids`. Sections *G11*, "
"*G18*, *7A*, and *ONLY* are updated correctly."
msgstr ""
"En auto-balanserande rad skapas, tillsammans med affärshändelser som korrekt "
"tilldelar rätt värden i BAS :guilabel:`Skattetabeller`. Sektionerna *G11*, "
"*G18*, *7A* och *ONLY* uppdateras korrekt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "The journal entry with the auto-balancing line and BAS tax grids"
msgstr "Verifikationen med den auto-balanserande raden och BAS-skattetabeller"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:233
msgid ""
"After posting the journal entry, the BAS report displays the correct values "
"for each section, along with the DGST offset."
msgstr ""
"Efter bokföring av verifikationen visar BAS-rapporten korrekta värden för "
"varje sektion, tillsammans med DGST-kompensationen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:242
msgid "Business Activity Statement (BAS)"
msgstr "Business Activity Statement (BAS)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:244
msgid ""
"The **BAS report** is a critical tax reporting requirement for businesses "
"registered for GST in Australia. The BAS is used to report and remit various "
"taxes to the ATO. With the Odoo BAS feature, businesses can report on the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"**BAS-rapporten** är ett kritiskt skatterapporteringskrav för företag "
"registrerade för GST i Australien. BAS används för att rapportera och betala "
"olika skatter till ATO. Med Odoo BAS-funktionen kan företag rapportera om "
"följande:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:248
msgid "GST"
msgstr "GST"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:249
msgid "PAYG tax withheld"
msgstr "Innehållen PAYG-skatt"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:250
msgid "DGST"
msgstr "DGST"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:252
msgid ""
"Access the report from the Accounting dashboard by clicking :guilabel:`BAS "
"Report (AU)` under the :guilabel:`Miscellaneous Operations` section."
msgstr ""
"Öppna rapporten från bokföringsdashboarden genom att klicka "
"på :guilabel:`BAS Report (AU)` under sektionen :guilabel:`Diverse konton`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "BAS report example"
msgstr "Exempel på BAS-rapport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:258
msgid ""
"The base and tax amounts are collected from the **tax grid**, which is pre-"
"configured in the system. The tax grid can also be manually set up for any "
"additional special use-case of GST (e.g., wine equalization tax). Once the "
"tax for each account is set up, the system automatically slots journal items "
"into the correct tax category. This ensures the BAS report is accurate and "
"reflective of the business's financial activities."
msgstr ""
"Bas- och skattebeloppen samlas in från **skattetabellen**, som är "
"förkonfigurerad i systemet. Skattetabellen kan också ställas in manuellt för "
"eventuella ytterligare speciella användningsfall av GST (t.ex. "
"vinutjämningsskatt). När skatten för varje konto är inställd placerar "
"systemet automatiskt affärshändelser i rätt skattekategori. Detta "
"säkerställer att BAS-rapporten är korrekt och återspeglar företagets "
"finansiella aktiviteter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "GST grids example"
msgstr "Exempel på GST-tabeller"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:267
msgid ""
"Besides the GST sections, the BAS report also includes the **PAYG** tax "
"withheld components (*W1* to *W5*, then *summary, section 4*). This "
"integration ensures that all payroll-related withholding taxes are "
"accurately captured and reflected within the report."
msgstr ""
"Förutom GST-sektionerna inkluderar BAS-rapporten även komponenterna för "
"**PAYG**-skatt som innehållits (*W1* till *W5*, sedan *sammanfattning, "
"sektion 4*). Denna integration säkerställer att alla lönerelaterade "
"källskatter fångas korrekt och återspeglas i rapporten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "PAYG tax withheld and summary of BAS report example"
msgstr ""
"Exempel på PAYG-skatt som innehållits och sammanfattning av BAS-rapport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:274
msgid ""
"The module incorporates built-in rules that facilitate the automatic "
"calculation of taxes for types W1 to W5. For a detailed walkthrough and more "
"information on the calculation process for these taxes, refer to "
"the :doc:`Australian Payroll localization documentation <../../hr/payroll/"
"payroll_localizations/australia>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:280
msgid "Closing"
msgstr "Avslutning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:282
msgid ""
"When it is time to file the tax return with the ATO, "
"click :guilabel:`Closing Entry`. The tax return period can be configured "
"under :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings --> Tax "
"Return Periodicity`. The start date of the tax return period can also be "
"defined on the report itself through the period button (:icon:`fa-calendar` "
"*period* *year*)."
msgstr ""
"När det är dags att lämna deklarationen till ATO, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Utgående saldo`. Perioden för deklarationen kan konfigureras "
"under :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar --> "
"Deklaration periodicitet`. Startdatumet för deklarationsperioden kan också "
"definieras i själva rapporten via periodknappen (:icon:`fa-calendar` "
"*period* *år*)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:288
msgid ":doc:`Year-end closing <../accounting/reporting/year_end>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Årsbokslut <../redovisning/rapportering/årsbokslut>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:291
msgid ""
"Odoo uses calendar quarters rather than the Australian FY quarters, which "
"means *July to September* is *Q3* in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Odoo använder kalenderkvartal snarare än de australiensiska "
"räkenskapsårskvartalarna, vilket innebär att *juli till september* är *Q3* i "
"Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:294
msgid ""
"Before closing the entry for the first time, the default **GST payable "
"account** and **GST receivable account** need to be set. A notification pops "
"up and redirects the user to the tax groups configuration."
msgstr ""
"Innan inlägget stängs för första gången måste standardkontot för **GST "
"skulder** och **GST kundfordran** ställas in. En avisering dyker upp och "
"omdirigerar användaren till konfigurationen för skattegrupper."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "BAS report tax groups"
msgstr "BAS-rapport skattegrupper"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:301
msgid ""
"Once the GST payable and GST receivable accounts are set up, the BAS report "
"generates an accurate journal closing entry automatically, which balances "
"out the GST balance with the GST clearing account."
msgstr ""
"När GST skulder- och GST kundfordrankontona är installerade genererar BAS-"
"rapporten automatiskt ett korrekt journalutgående saldo som balanserar ut "
"GST-saldot med GST-clearingkontot."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:305
msgid ""
"The balance between GST receivable and payable is set against the tax "
"clearing account defined on the tax group. The amount to be paid to or "
"received from the ATO can be reconciled against a bank statement."
msgstr ""
"Saldot mellan GST kundfordran och skulder kvittas mot clearingkontot för "
"skatt som definieras i skattegruppen. Beloppet som ska betalas till eller "
"tas emot från ATO kan kvittas mot ett bankkontoutdrag."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "BAS report tax payment"
msgstr "BAS-rapport skattebetalning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:313
msgid ""
"The BAS report is not directly submitted to the ATO. Odoo helps you "
"automatically compute the necessary values in each section, with the "
"possibility to audit them to better understand the history behind these "
"numbers. Businesses can copy these values and enter them on the `ATO portal "
"<https://www.ato.gov.au/businesses-and-organisations/preparing-lodging-and-"
"paying/business-activity-statements-bas/how-to-lodge-your-bas>`_."
msgstr ""
"BAS-rapporten skickas inte direkt till ATO. Odoo hjälper dig att automatiskt "
"beräkna de nödvändiga värdena i varje sektion, med möjlighet att granska dem "
"för att bättre förstå historiken bakom dessa siffror. Företag kan kopiera "
"dessa värden och ange dem på `ATO-portalen <https://www.ato.gov.au/"
"businesses-and-organisations/preparing-lodging-and-paying/business-activity-"
"statements-bas/how-to-lodge-your-bas>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:321
msgid "Taxable Payments Annual Report (TPAR)"
msgstr "Årlig rapport över beskattningsbara betalningar (TPAR)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:323
msgid ""
"Odoo allows businesses to report payments made to contractors or "
"subcontractors during the financial year. This is done by generating a "
"**TPAR**. If you are unsure your business needs this report, refer to the "
"`ATO's TPAR web page <https://www.ato.gov.au/businesses-and-organisations/"
"preparing-lodging-and-paying/reports-and-returns/taxable-payments-annual-"
"report>`_."
msgstr ""
"Odoo tillåter företag att rapportera betalningar som gjorts till "
"entreprenörer eller underentreprenörer under räkenskapsåret. Detta görs "
"genom att generera en **TPAR**. Om du är osäker på om ditt företag behöver "
"denna rapport, se `ATO:s webbsida för TPAR <https://www.ato.gov.au/"
"businesses-and-organisations/preparing-lodging-and-paying/reports-and-"
"returns/taxable-payments-annual-report>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:327
msgid ""
"Access the TPAR in Odoo by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting "
"--> Taxable Payments Annual Reports (TPAR)`."
msgstr ""
"Åtkomst till TPAR i Odoo genom att gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> "
"Rapporter --> Årliga rapporter över beskattningsbara betalningar (TPAR)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:333
msgid ""
"First, it is required to assign fiscal positions to your contractors before "
"billing them to update the TPAR. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Accounting "
"--> Vendors --> Vendors`, select a contractor, and set a :guilabel:`Fiscal "
"Position` under the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab."
msgstr ""
"Först krävs det att tilldela skatteområden till dina entreprenörer innan du "
"fakturerar dem för att uppdatera TPAR. Gör detta genom att gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Leverantörer --> Leverantörer`, välj en "
"entreprenör och ställ in ett :guilabel:`Skatteområde` under "
"fliken :guilabel:`Försäljning & Inköp`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "TPAR fiscal position on a vendor"
msgstr "TPAR skatteområde på en leverantör"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:340
msgid ""
"Based on the chosen fiscal position, the correct tax mapping will apply to "
"the contractor's vendor bills."
msgstr ""
"Baserat på det valda skatteområdet tillämpas korrekt skattemappning på "
"entreprenörens leverantörsfakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "TPAR vendor bill tax mapping"
msgstr "TPAR leverantörsfaktura skattemappning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:346
msgid "The TPAR includes the following information from contractors:"
msgstr "TPAR inkluderar följande information från entreprenörer:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:348
msgid ":guilabel:`ABN`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`ABN`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:349
msgid ":guilabel:`Total GST` (the total tax paid)"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Totala GST` (den totala skatten som betalats)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:350
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Gross Paid` (the amounts are displayed after a vendor bill has "
"been marked as paid)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Brutto betalt` (beloppen visas efter att en leverantörsfaktura "
"har markerats som betald)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:351
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Withheld` (displayed if the contractor is registered with a "
"fiscal position set to :guilabel:`TPAR without ABN`)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Innehallen skatt` (visas om entreprenören är registrerad med ett "
"skatteområde inställt på :guilabel:`TPAR utan ABN`)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:354
msgid "The TPAR can be exported to multiple formats: PDF, XLSX, and TPAR."
msgstr "TPAR kan exporteras till flera format: PDF, XLSX och TPAR."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:359
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:169
msgid "Remittance advice"
msgstr "Råd om penningförsändelser"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:361
msgid ""
"A remittance advice is a document used as proof of payment to a business. In "
"Odoo, it can be accessed by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors "
"--> Payments`, selecting the payment(s), and clicking :menuselection:`Print "
"--> Payment Receipt`."
msgstr ""
"Ett betalningskvitto är ett dokument som används som bevis på betalning till "
"ett företag. I Odoo kan det nås genom att gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring "
"--> Leverantörer --> Betalningar`, välja betalning(ar) och klicka "
"på :menuselection:`Skriv ut --> Betalningskvitto`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "Remittance advice example"
msgstr "Exempel på betalningskvitto"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:376
msgid ""
"Odoo is compliant with Australia's `Peppol requirements <https://peppol.org/"
"learn-more/country-profiles/australia/>`_. Set up your customers and vendors "
"by going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` "
"or :menuselection:`Vendors --> Vendors`, selecting one, clicking "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, and configuring the :guilabel:`Electronic "
"Invoicing` section as needed."
msgstr ""
"Odoo uppfyller Australiens `Peppol-krav <https://peppol.org/learn-more/"
"country-profiles/australia/>`_. Installera dina kunder och leverantörer "
"genom att gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Kunder --> Kunder` "
"eller :menuselection:`Leverantörer --> Leverantörer`, välja en, klicka på "
"fliken :guilabel:`Bokföring` och konfigurera sektionen :guilabel:`Digital "
"fakturering` efter behov."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:None
msgid "Electronic invoicing settings for a partner"
msgstr "Inställningar för digital fakturering för en partner"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:386
msgid ""
"Validating an invoice or credit note for a partner on the Peppol network "
"will download a compliant XML file that can be manually uploaded to your "
"Peppol network. Odoo is currently in the process of becoming an access point "
"for the ANZ region."
msgstr ""
"Att validera en faktura eller kreditfaktura för en partner på Peppol-"
"nätverket kommer att ladda ner en kompatibel XML-fil som manuellt kan laddas "
"upp till ditt Peppol-nätverk. Odoo håller för närvarande på att bli en "
"åtkomstpunkt för ANZ-regionen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:393
msgid "ABA files for batch payments"
msgstr "ABA-filer för batchbetalningar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:395
msgid ""
"An ABA file is a digital format developed by the `Australian Banking "
"Association <https://www.ausbanking.org.au/>`_. It is designed for business "
"customers to facilitate bulk payment processing by uploading a single file "
"from their business management software."
msgstr ""
"En ABA-fil är ett digitalt format som utvecklats av `Australian Banking "
"Association <https://www.ausbanking.org.au/>`_. Det är utformat för "
"företagskunder för att underlätta massbetalningsbehandling genom att ladda "
"upp en enda fil från sin företagsledningsprogramvara."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:399
msgid ""
"The main advantage of using ABA files is to improve payment and matching "
"efficiency. This is achieved by consolidating numerous payments into one "
"file for batch processing, which can be submitted to all Australian banks."
msgstr ""
"Den största fördelen med att använda ABA-filer är att betalnings- och "
"matchningseffektiviteten förbättras. Detta uppnås genom att många "
"betalningar konsolideras i en fil för batchbehandling, som kan lämnas till "
"alla australiensiska banker."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:409
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and "
"enable :guilabel:`Batch Payments`."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar` och "
"aktivera :guilabel:`Batchbetalningar`."

