#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:467
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:193
msgid "Electronic documents"
msgstr "Elektroniska dokument"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:474
msgid ""
"A *series* number is linked to a sequence number range for electronic "
"invoices. To configure the series number on a sales journal, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals` and set it in "
"the :guilabel:`Series` field. If more than one series is needed, a new sales "
"journal must be created, and a new series number must be assigned for each "
"series."
msgstr ""
"Ett *serie*nummer är länkat till ett nummerserieintervall för elektroniska "
"fakturor. För att konfigurera serienumret på en försäljningsjournal, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Journaler` och ange det "
"i fältet :guilabel:`Serie`. Om fler än en serie behövs måste en ny "
"försäljningsjournal skapas och ett nytt serienummer måste tilldelas för "
"varje serie."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:479
msgid ""
"Enable the :guilabel:`Use Documents?` option as the :guilabel:`Series` field "
"will only be displayed if the :guilabel:`Use Documents?` option is selected "
"on the journal."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera alternativet :guilabel:`Använda dokument?` eftersom "
"fältet :guilabel:`Serie` endast visas om alternativet :guilabel:`Använda "
"dokument?` är valt på journalen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:482
msgid ""
"When issuing electronic and non-electronic invoices, the :guilabel:`Type` "
"field selects the document type used when creating the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Vid utfärdande av elektroniska och icke-elektroniska fakturor väljer "
"fältet :guilabel:`Typ` den dokumenttyp som används när fakturan skapas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:486
msgid ""
"When creating the journal, ensure the :guilabel:`Dedicated Credit Note "
"Sequence` field in the :guilabel:`Accounting Information` section is "
"unchecked, as in Brazil, sequences between invoices, credit notes, and debit "
"notes are shared per series number, which means per journal."
msgstr ""
"När journalen skapas, se till att fältet :guilabel:`Dedikerad "
"kreditfakturanummerserie` i sektionen :guilabel:`Bokföringsinformation` är "
"avmarkerat, eftersom nummerserier i Brasilien mellan fakturor, "
"kreditfakturor och debetnotor delas per serienummer, vilket betyder per "
"journal."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:495
msgid ""
"To process an electronic invoice for goods (NF-e) or services (NFS-e), the "
"invoice must be confirmed and taxes must be computed by Avalara. The "
"following fields must be filled out:"
msgstr ""
"För att behandla en elektronisk faktura för varor (NF-e) eller tjänster (NFS-"
"e) måste fakturan bekräftas och skatter måste beräknas av Avalara. Följande "
"fält måste fyllas i:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:498
msgid ":guilabel:`Customer`, with all customer information"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Kund`, med all kundinformation"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:499
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:627
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Method: Brazil`: Specify the expected payment method."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Betalningsmetod: Brasilien`: Ange förväntad betalningsmetod."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:500
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Document Type`: Select :guilabel:`(55) Electronic Invoice (NF-e)` "
"or :guilabel:`(SE) Electronic Service Invoice (NFS-e)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dokumenttyp`: Välj :guilabel:`(55) Elektronisk faktura (NF-e)` "
"eller :guilabel:`(SE) Elektronisk tjänstefaktura (NFS-e)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:503
msgid ":guilabel:`Other Info` tab:"
msgstr "Fliken :guilabel:`Övrig information`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:505
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fiscal Position` set as :guilabel:`Automatic Tax Mapping (Avalara "
"Brazil)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Skatteregion` inställd som :guilabel:`Automatisk skattemappning "
"(Avalara Brasilien)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:507
msgid ""
"Some optional fields depend on the nature of the transaction. These fields "
"in the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab are not required, so in most cases, "
"leaving them blank will not result in errors from the government when the "
"invoice is submitted:"
msgstr ""
"Vissa valfria fält beror på transaktionens karaktär. Dessa fält i "
"fliken :guilabel:`Övrig information` är inte obligatoriska, så i de flesta "
"fall kommer det inte att resultera i fel från myndigheterna när fakturan "
"skickas in om de lämnas tomma:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:511
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Freight Model` determines how the goods are planned to be "
"transported - domestic."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fraktmodell` bestämmer hur varorna planeras att transporteras - "
"inrikes."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:512
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Transporter Brazil` determines who is doing the transportation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Transportör Brasilien` bestämmer vem som utför transporten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:514
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`Send`. In the pop-up window, click :guilabel:`Process "
"e-invoice` and any other options, such as :guilabel:`Download` "
"or :guilabel:`Email`. Finally, click :guilabel:`Send` to process the invoice "
"with the government."
msgstr ""
"Klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Skicka`. I popup-fönstret, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Behandla e-faktura` och andra alternativ, "
"såsom :guilabel:`Ladda ner` eller :guilabel:`E-post`. Slutligen, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Skicka` för att behandla fakturan hos myndigheten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:519
msgid ""
"All fields available on the invoice used to issue an electronic invoice are "
"also available on the sales order, if needed. When creating the first "
"invoice, the :guilabel:`Document Number` field is displayed and allocated as "
"the first number to be used sequentially for subsequent invoices."
msgstr ""
"Alla fält som finns tillgängliga på fakturan som används för att utfärda en "
"elektronisk faktura finns också tillgängliga på försäljningsordern om det "
"behövs. När den första fakturan skapas visas "
"fältet :guilabel:`Dokumentnummer` och tilldelas som det första numret som "
"ska användas sekventiellt för efterföljande fakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:526
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:591
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:437
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:417
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:511
msgid "Credit notes"
msgstr "Kreditnotor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:528
msgid ""
"If a sales return needs to be registered, a :ref:`credit note can be created "
"in Odoo <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>` and sent to the "
"government for validation."
msgstr ""
"Om en försäljningsretur behöver registreras kan en :ref:`kreditfaktura "
"skapas i Odoo <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-note>` och skickas till "
"regeringen för validering."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:532
msgid ""
"Credit notes are only available for electronic invoices for goods (NF-e)."
msgstr ""
"Kreditfakturor är endast tillgängliga för elektroniska fakturor för varor "
"(NF-e)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:537
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:648
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:463
msgid "Debit notes"
msgstr "Debetnotor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:539
msgid ""
"If additional information needs to be included or values that were not "
"accurately provided in the original invoice need to be corrected, "
"a :ref:`debit note can be issued <accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-note>`."
msgstr ""
"Om ytterligare information behöver inkluderas eller värden som inte angavs "
"korrekt i den ursprungliga fakturan behöver korrigeras kan "
"en :ref:`ändringsfaktura utfärdas <accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-"
"note>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:544
msgid ""
"Debit notes are only available for electronic invoices for goods (NF-e)."
msgstr ""
"Debetnotor är endast tillgängliga för elektroniska fakturor för varor (NF-e)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:545
msgid ""
"Only the products included in the original invoice can be included in the "
"debit note. While changes can be made to the product's unit price or "
"quantity, products **cannot** be added to the debit note. The purpose of "
"this document is only to declare the amount to be added to the original "
"invoice for the same or fewer products."
msgstr ""
"Endast produkter som ingick i den ursprungliga fakturan kan inkluderas i "
"ändringsfakturan. Även om ändringar kan göras av produktens pris per enhet "
"eller kvantitet kan produkter **inte** läggas till i ändringsfakturan. "
"Syftet med detta dokument är endast att deklarera det belopp som ska läggas "
"till den ursprungliga fakturan för samma eller färre produkter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:553
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:368
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/vietnam.rst:221
msgid "Invoice cancellation"
msgstr "Annullering av faktura"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:555
msgid ""
"It is possible to cancel an electronic invoice that the government validated."
msgstr ""
"Det är möjligt att avbryta en elektronisk faktura som regeringen validerat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:558
msgid ""
"Check whether the electronic invoice is still within the cancellation "
"deadline, which may vary according to each state's legislation."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera om den elektroniska fakturan fortfarande är inom tidsfristen för "
"annullering, vilken kan variera enligt varje stats lagstiftning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:566
msgid ""
"To cancel an e-invoice for goods (NF-e) in Odoo, click :guilabel:`Request "
"Cancel` and add a cancellation :guilabel:`Reason` on the pop-up that "
"appears. To send this cancellation reason to the customer via email, enable "
"the :guilabel:`E-mail` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"För att avbryta en e-faktura för varor (NF-e) i Odoo, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Begär annullering` och lägg till en "
"annullerings:guilabel:`orsak` i popup-fönstret som visas. För att skicka "
"denna annulleringsorsak till kunden via e-post, aktivera "
"kryssrutan :guilabel:`E-post`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:571
msgid ""
"This is an electronic cancellation, which means that Odoo will send a "
"request to the government to cancel the NF-e. It will then consume one |IAP| "
"credit, as an |API| call occurs."
msgstr ""
"Detta är en elektronisk annullering, vilket innebär att Odoo kommer att "
"skicka en förfrågan till regeringen för att annullera NF-e. Det kommer då "
"att förbruka en |IAP|-kredit, eftersom ett |API|-anrop sker."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:579
msgid ""
"To cancel an e-invoice for services (NFS-e) in Odoo, "
"click :guilabel:`Request Cancel`. There is no electronic cancellation "
"process in this case, as not every city has this service available. The user "
"needs to cancel this NFS-e on the city portal manually. Once that step is "
"completed, they can request the cancellation in Odoo, which will cancel the "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"För att avbryta en e-faktura för tjänster (NFS-e) i Odoo, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Begär annullering`. Det finns ingen elektronisk "
"annulleringsprocess i detta fall, eftersom inte varje stad har denna tjänst "
"tillgänglig. Användaren behöver annullera denna NFS-e på stadens portal "
"manuellt. När det steget är slutfört kan de begära annullering i Odoo, "
"vilket kommer att annullera fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:587
msgid "Correction letter"
msgstr "Rättelsebrev"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:589
msgid ""
"A correction letter can be created and linked to an electronic invoice for "
"goods (NF-e) that the government validated."
msgstr ""
"Ett korrigeringsbrev kan skapas och kopplas till en elektronisk faktura för "
"varor (NF-e) som regeringen validerat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:592
msgid ""
"To do so in Odoo, click :guilabel:`Correction Letter` and add a "
"correction :guilabel:`Reason` to the pop-up. To send the correction reason "
"to a customer via email, enable the :guilabel:`E-mail` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"För att göra detta i Odoo, klicka på :guilabel:`Korrigeringsbrev` och lägg "
"till en korrigerings:guilabel:`orsak` i popup-fönstret. För att skicka "
"korrigeringsorsaken till en kund via e-post, aktivera "
"kryssrutan :guilabel:`E-post`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:597
msgid ""
"Correction letters are only available for electronic invoices for goods (NF-"
"e)."
msgstr ""
"Rättelsebrev är endast tillgängliga för elektroniska fakturor för varor (NF-"
"e)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:602
msgid "Invoice number range invalidation"
msgstr "Ogiltigförklaring av fakturanummerintervall"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:604
msgid ""
"A range of sequences that are assigned to sales journals can be invalidated "
"by the government if they are not currently used **and** will not be used in "
"the future. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Journals`, open the journal, click the :icon:`fa-cog` (gear) icon, and "
"select :guilabel:`Invalidate Number Range (BR)`. On "
"the :guilabel:`Invalidate Number Range (BR)` wizard, add "
"the :guilabel:`Initial Number` and :guilabel:`End Number` of the range that "
"should be cancelled, and enter an invalidation :guilabel:`Reason`."
msgstr ""
"Ett intervall av sekvenser som är tilldelade till försäljningsjournaler kan "
"ogiltigförklaras av regeringen om de för närvarande inte används **och** "
"inte kommer att användas i framtiden. För att göra detta, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Journaler`, öppna "
"journalen, klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-cog` och "
"välj :guilabel:`Ogiltigförklara nummerintervall (BR)`. I "
"guiden :guilabel:`Ogiltigförklara nummerintervall (BR)`, lägg "
"till :guilabel:`Startnummer` och :guilabel:`Slutnummer` för det intervall "
"som ska annulleras och ange en ogiltigförklarings:guilabel:`orsak`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:613
msgid ""
"Invoice number range invalidation is only available for electronic invoices "
"for goods (NF-e)."
msgstr ""
"Ogiltigförklaring av fakturanummerintervall är endast tillgängligt för "
"elektroniska fakturor för varor (NF-e)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:614
msgid ""
"The journal's chatter records the log of the cancelled numbers, along with "
"the XML file."
msgstr ""
"Journalens händelseflöde registrerar loggen över de annullerade numren, "
"tillsammans med XML-filen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:621
msgid ""
"When receiving an invoice from a supplier, encode the bill in Odoo by adding "
"all the commercial information and the same Brazilian-specific information "
"recorded on the :ref:`customer invoices <localizations/brazil/electronic-"
"documents>`."
msgstr ""
"När du tar emot en faktura från en leverantör, registrera fakturan i Odoo "
"genom att lägga till all handelsinformation och samma brasiliansk-specifika "
"information som registrerats på :ref:`kundfakturorna <localizations/brazil/"
"electronic-documents>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:625
msgid "These Brazilian-specific fields are:"
msgstr "Dessa brasiliansk-specifika fält är:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:628
msgid ":guilabel:`Document Type`: used by the vendor"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Dokumenttyp`: används av leverantören"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:629
msgid ":guilabel:`Document Number`: the invoice number from the supplier"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Dokumentnummer`: fakturanumret från leverantören"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:630
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Freight Model`: **NF-e specific** how goods are planned to be "
"transported - domestic"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fraktmodell`: **NF-e specifik** hur varor planeras att "
"transporteras - inrikes"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:631
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Transporter Brazil`: **NF-e specific** who is doing the "
"transportation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Transportör Brasilien`: **NF-e specifik** vem som utför "
"transporten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:636
msgid "Point of sale NFC-e"
msgstr "Kassa NFC-e"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:638
msgid ""
"The NFC-e is a legal document that supports selling goods or merchandise to "
"the final customer. Like the :ref:`NF-e <localizations/brazil/e-invoice-"
"goods-nf-e>`, the electronic customer invoice is also issued in XML file "
"format and has an auxiliary document (DANFC-e) known as the *NFC-e Summary*. "
"This electronic document can be issued through **Odoo Point of Sale**."
msgstr ""
"NFC-e är ett juridiskt dokument som stöder försäljning av varor eller "
"handelsvaror till slutkunden. Liksom :ref:`NF-e <localizations/brazil/e-"
"invoice-goods-nf-e>` utfärdas den elektroniska kundfakturan också i XML-"
"filformat och har ett hjälpdokument (DANFC-e) känt som *NFC-e-"
"sammanfattning*. Detta elektroniska dokument kan utfärdas genom **Odoo "
"Kassasystem**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:643
msgid ""
"Its legal validity is guaranteed by the digital signature and by each "
"Brazilian state's SEFAZ (Secretaria da Fazenda)."
msgstr ""
"Dess juridiska giltighet garanteras av den digitala underskriften och av "
"varje brasiliansk stats SEFAZ (Secretaria da Fazenda)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:647
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Avalara integration <localizations/brazil/avatax-account>` "
"operates on a credit-based system. Each operation that involves "
"communication with Avalara consumes one credit. The following operations "
"within the **Point of Sale** (POS) application are subject to credit "
"consumption:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Avalara-integrationen <localizations/brazil/avatax-account>` fungerar "
"på ett kreditbaserat system. Varje process som involverar betalningsreferens "
"med Avalara förbrukar en kreditpoäng. Följande processer inom applikationen "
"**Kassasystem** (POS) är föremål för kreditförbrukning:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:652
msgid "Tax calculation at the time of sale"
msgstr "Skatteberäkning vid tidpunkten för försäljningen"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:653
msgid "Electronic invoice issuance (NFC-e)"
msgstr "Utfärdande av elektronisk faktura (NFC-e)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:656
msgid ""
"Each step is billed separately. For example, calculating taxes and issuing "
"an invoice for the same POS transaction consumes two credits."
msgstr ""
"Varje steg faktureras separat. Till exempel förbrukar beräkning av skatter "
"och utfärdande av en faktura för samma kassatransaktion två kreditpoäng."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:660
