#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:704
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings` and make "
"sure that the relevant Point of Sale is :ref:`selected at the top of the "
"screen <pos/use/settings>`. Then, scroll to the :guilabel:`Accounting` "
"section and configure the :guilabel:`Brazilian EDI` fields:"
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Kassa --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar` och se "
"till att relevant kassa är :ref:`vald längst upp på skärmen <pos/use/"
"settings>`. Scrolla sedan ner till sektionen :guilabel:`Bokföring` och "
"konfigurera fälten under :guilabel:`Brasiliansk EDI`:"

