msgstr ":guilabel:`Stad` och :guilabel:`Stat` där fakturan utfärdas"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:739
msgid ":guilabel:`CPF/CNPJ`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`CPF/CNPJ`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:741
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Validate`. The NFC-e appears, highlighting the customer's "
"CPF on the print."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Validera`. NFC-e visas och markerar kundens CPF på "
"utskriften."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:742
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Print` or :guilabel:`Send via e-mail` to deliver the "
"invoice to the customer."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Skriv ut` eller :guilabel:`Skicka via e-post` för att "
"leverera fakturan till kunden."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:747
msgid "NFC-e ticket print"
msgstr "NFC-e ärendekvitto"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:749
msgid ""
"After :ref:`generating and validating the NFC-e <localizations/brazil/"
"generate-nfc-e>`, click :guilabel:`Print` to deliver the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Efter att ha :ref:`skapat och validerat NFC-e <localizations/brazil/generate-"
"nfc-e>`, klicka på :guilabel:`Skriv ut` för att leverera fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:753
msgid ""
"The Odoo NFC-e feature is compatible with any thermal printer and does not "
"require an :doc:`Odoo IoT Box <../../general/iot>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo NFC-e-funktionen är kompatibel med alla termiska skrivare och kräver "
"inte en :doc:`Odoo IoT-box <../../general/iot>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:759
