msgstr "Återutfärda en PoS-beställning med ett NFC-e-fel"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:761
msgid "If the NFC-e returns an error, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Om NFC-e returnerar ett fel, följ dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:763
msgid "Correct the error."
msgstr "Korrigera felet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:764
msgid ""
"Re-issue the NFC-e by clicking the :icon:`fa-bars` :guilabel:`(menu)` icon "
"and selecting :guilabel:`Orders`."
msgstr ""
"Återutfärda NFC-e genom att klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-"
"bars` :guilabel:`(meny)` och välja :guilabel:`Beställningar`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:766
msgid ""
"Filter the list to show only :guilabel:`Paid` orders and "
"click :guilabel:`Details`. The error is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Filtrera listan för att endast visa :guilabel:`Betalda` beställningar och "
"klicka på :guilabel:`Detaljer`. Felet visas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:768
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Send NFC-e`."
msgstr "Klicka på :guilabel:`Skicka NFC-e`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:771
msgid ""
"If the error has been corrected and the POS register is closed, Odoo logs "
"the tax adjustment in the chatter of the related journal entry. The journal "
"entry for the order indicates that the taxes were incorrectly calculated. In "
"this case, reprocessing the NFC-e is required."
msgstr ""
"Om felet har korrigerats och kassasystemregistret är stängt, loggar Odoo "
"skattejusteringen i händelseflödet för den relaterade verifikationen. "
"Verifikationen för beställningen indikerar att skatterna beräknades "
"felaktigt. I detta fall krävs ombearbetning av NFC-e."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:None
msgid "Point of sale order view form."
msgstr "Formulärvy för kassaorder."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:781
msgid "NFC-e refunds & cancellations"
msgstr "NFC-e återbetalningar och annulleringar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:783
msgid ""
":ref:`Refunds can be processed directly in Odoo <pos/use/refund>`, but "
"*cancellations* must be performed through the official government portal."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Återbetalningar kan behandlas direkt i Odoo <pos/use/refund>`, men "
"*annulleringar* måste utföras genom den officiella regeringsportalen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:786
msgid ""
"When the process is finalized, the approved return NF-e is created, meaning "
"the **previous NFC-e is canceled**."
msgstr ""
"När processen är slutförd skapas den godkända retur-NF-e, vilket innebär att "
"**den tidigare NFC-e annulleras**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:None
msgid "Return of Goods NF-e Approved."
msgstr "Retur av varor NF-e godkänd."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:793
msgid ""
"SEFAZ only allows cancellation of an NFC-e **within 30 minutes** of its "
"issuance on the SEFAZ website. After this period, a manual refund must be "
"processed, along with the issuance of a *Return of Goods NF-e*."
msgstr ""
"SEFAZ tillåter endast annullering av en NFC-e **inom 30 minuter** efter dess "
"utfärdande på SEFAZ-webbplatsen. Efter denna period måste en manuell "
"återbetalning behandlas, tillsammans med utfärdandet av en *Retur av varor "
"NF-e*."

