msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate Key`: click :guilabel:`Upload your file` and select "
"the `.pfx` file."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Certificate Key`: klicka på :guilabel:`Upload your file` och välj "
"filen `.pfx`."

