"and it needs to be displayed in the invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Handelsnamn`: Om företaget använder ett specifikt handelsnamn och "
"det behöver visas på fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:111
msgid ""
"The data configured in the :guilabel:`Fiscal Information` section is printed "
"in the valid fiscal PDF reports."
msgstr ""
"Data som konfigurerats i sektionen :guilabel:`Skatteinformation` skrivs ut i "
"de giltiga skattemässiga PDF-rapporterna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:117
msgid "Electronic invoicing credentials and |DIAN| environment"
msgstr "Uppgifter för digital fakturering och |DIAN|miljö"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:119
msgid ""
"To configure the user credentials to be used to connect with the |DIAN|'s "
"web service and the |DIAN| environment, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`Colombian Electronic Invoicing` section. Then, follow these "
"steps:"
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera användaruppgifterna som ska användas för att ansluta "
"till |DIAN|:s webbtjänst och |DIAN|miljön, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring "
"--> Konfiguration --> Inställningar` och rulla ner till "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Colombiansk digital fakturering`. Följ sedan dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:123
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`DIAN: Free Service` as the :guilabel:`Electronic Invoicing "
"Provider`."
msgstr ""
"Välj :guilabel:`DIAN: Free Service` som :guilabel:`Leverantör för digital "
"fakturering`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:124
msgid ""
"Configure the :guilabel:`Operation Modes` for the respective types of "
"documents (*electronic invoices* or *support documents*) to be generated "
"from Odoo. Click :guilabel:`Add a line`, then fill in the fields:"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera :guilabel:`Processlägen` för respektive typer av dokument "
"(*digitala fakturor* eller *stöddokument*) som ska genereras från Odoo. "
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Lägg till en rad` och fyll sedan i fälten:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:128
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Software Mode`: the type of document to be generated with the "
"operation mode."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mjukvaruläge`: den typ av dokument som ska genereras med "
"processläget."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:129
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Software ID`: the ID generated by |DIAN| for the specific "
"operation mode."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mjukvaru-ID`: det ID som genererats av |DIAN| för det specifika "
"processläget."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:130
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Software PIN`: the PIN selected in the operation mode "
"configuration in the |DIAN| portal."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Mjukvaru-PIN`: den PIN som valts i konfigurationen av "
"processläget i |DIAN|portalen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Testing ID`: the testing ID generated by |DIAN| and obtained "
"after testing the operation mode."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Test-ID`: det test-ID som genererats av |DIAN| och erhållits "
"efter testning av processläget."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:135
msgid ""
"Configure the available :guilabel:`Certificates` to sign the electronic "
"documents. Click :guilabel:`Add a line`, then fill in the fields:"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera tillgängliga :guilabel:`Certifikat` för att signera de digitala "
"dokumenten. Klicka på :guilabel:`Lägg till en rad` och fyll sedan i fälten:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:138
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: the name of the certificate."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Namn`: certifikatets namn."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate`: upload the certificate file in PEM format. In "
"the :guilabel:`Private Key` field that appears on the screen, select an "
"existing private key or create a new one. To do so, enter a key name and "
"select :guilabel:`Create and edit`. Then, in the :guilabel:`Create Private "
"Key` wizard, upload a valid :guilabel:`Key file` and click :guilabel:`Save & "
"Close`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Certifikat`: ladda upp certifikatfilen i PEM-format. I "
"fältet :guilabel:`Privat nyckel` som visas på skärmen, välj en befintlig "
"privat nyckel eller skapa en ny. För att göra detta, ange ett nyckelnamn och "
"välj :guilabel:`Skapa och redigera`. I guiden :guilabel:`Skapa privat "
"nyckel`, ladda sedan upp en giltig :guilabel:`Nyckelfil` och klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Spara & stäng`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:0
msgid "Colombian electronic invoicing credentials configured."
msgstr "Konfigurerade uppgifter för colombiansk digital fakturering."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:147
msgid ""
"Configure the |DIAN| environment; the |DIAN| electronic invoicing module "
"offers four different |DIAN| environments to connect with:"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera |DIAN|-miljön; modulen för |DIAN| digital fakturering erbjuder "
"fyra olika |DIAN|-miljöer att ansluta till:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:150
msgid ""
"**DIAN demo mode**: This environment allows to test electronic invoicing "
"workflows using a demo digital certificate. Files are created and accepted "
"automatically and are not sent to any |DIAN| environment. Every internal "
"validation can be tested. To activate it, tick the :guilabel:`DIAN Demo "
"Mode` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"**DIAN demoläge**: Denna miljö gör det möjligt att testa arbetsflöden för "
"digital fakturering med hjälp av ett democertifikat. Filer skapas och "
"godkänns automatiskt och skickas inte till någon |DIAN|-miljö. Varje intern "
"validering kan testas. För att aktivera det, markera "
"kryssrutan :guilabel:`DIAN demoläge`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:156
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`DIAN Demo Mode` checkbox is hidden from view when "
"the :guilabel:`Test environment` checkbox is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Kryssrutan :guilabel:`DIAN demoläge` är dold när "
"kryssrutan :guilabel:`Testmiljö` är aktiverad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:159
msgid ""
"**Certification environment**: This environment is useful to pass the |DIAN| "
"certification process and obtain the *Enabled* status to invoice from Odoo. "
"To activate it, enable both the :guilabel:`Test environment` and "
"the :guilabel:`Activate the certification process` checkboxes."
msgstr ""
"**Certifieringsmiljö**: Denna miljö är användbar för att klara |DIAN|-"
"certifieringsprocessen och erhålla statusen *Aktiverad* för att fakturera "
"från Odoo. För att aktivera den, aktivera både "
"kryssrutorna :guilabel:`Testmiljö` och :guilabel:`Aktivera "
"certifieringsprocessen`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:162
msgid ""
"**Testing environment**: This environment allows reproducing electronic "
"invoicing flows and validations in the |DIAN| testing portal. To activate "
"it, enable only the :guilabel:`Test Environment` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"**Testmiljö**: Denna miljö gör det möjligt att återskapa arbetsflöden och "
"valideringar för digital fakturering i |DIAN|-testportalen. För att aktivera "
"den, aktivera endast kryssrutan :guilabel:`Testmiljö`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:165
msgid ""
"**Production environment**: This environment allows generating valid "
"electronic documents. To activate it, disable both the :guilabel:`Test "
"environment` and the :guilabel:`Activate the certification process` "
"checkboxes."
msgstr ""
"**Produktionsmiljö**: Denna miljö gör det möjligt att generera giltiga "
"digitala dokument. För att aktivera den, avaktivera både "
"kryssrutorna :guilabel:`Testmiljö` och :guilabel:`Aktivera "
"certifieringsprocessen`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:170
msgid ""
"Do not activate :guilabel:`DIAN Demo Mode` on a production database. This "
"mode is intended for use in test environments only."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera inte :guilabel:`DIAN demoläge` på en produktionsdatabas. Detta läge "
"är endast avsett för användning i testmiljöer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:174
msgid "In a multi-company database, each company can have its own certificate."
msgstr ""
"I en databas med flera företag kan varje företag ha sitt eget certifikat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:177
msgid ""
"For electronic invoicing configurations using the Carvajal solution, review "
"the following video: `Configuración de Facturación Electrónica - "
"Localización de Colombia <https://www.youtube.com/watch?"
"v=bzweMwTEbfY&list=PL1-aSABtP6ABxZshems3snMjx7bj_7ZsZ&index=3>`_."
msgstr ""
"För konfigurationer av digital fakturering med Carvajal-lösningen, granska "
"följande video: `Configuración de Facturación Electrónica - Localización de "
"Colombia <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bzweMwTEbfY&list=PL1-"
"aSABtP6ABxZshems3snMjx7bj_7ZsZ&index=3>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:184
msgid "Automatic DIAN Enablement"
msgstr "Automatisk DIAN-aktivering"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:186
msgid ""
"Odoo automates the |DIAN| enablement process to become an electronic "
"invoicer using the `DIAN Own Software <https://micrositios.dian.gov.co/"
"sistema-de-facturacion-electronica/como-puedes-facturar-electronicamente/>`_ "
"solution, sending the required number of valid customer invoices, credit "
"notes, and debit notes to the DIAN certification environment."
msgstr ""
"Odoo automatiserar |DIAN|-aktiveringsprocessen för att bli en elektronisk "
"fakturerare med hjälp av lösningen `DIAN egen mjukvara <https://"
"micrositios.dian.gov.co/sistema-de-facturacion-electronica/como-puedes-"
"facturar-electronicamente/>`_ genom att skicka erforderligt antal giltiga "
"kundfakturor, kreditfakturor och debetfakturor till DIANs certifieringsmiljö."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:191
msgid ""
"To start this process, complete the :ref:`main configuration steps for "
"electronic invoicing <localization/colombia/einvoice-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"För att starta denna process, slutför :ref:`huvudkonfigurationsstegen för "
"digital fakturering <localization/colombia/einvoice-configuration>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:195
msgid ""
"Always run the enablement process in a **test database** to serve as the "
"environment for continued electronic invoicing testing before going to "
"production."
msgstr ""
"Kör alltid aktiveringsprocessen i en **testdatabas** som ska fungera som "
"miljö för fortsatt testning av digital fakturering innan du går till "
"produktion."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:198
msgid ""
"To begin the process, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Settings`, scroll to the :guilabel:`Colombian Electronic Invoicing` section, "
"and complete the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"För att påbörja processen, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> "
"Konfiguration --> Inställningar`, skrolla till "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Colombiansk digital fakturering` och slutför följande "
"steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:201
msgid "Enable the :guilabel:`Test Environment` checkbox."
msgstr "Aktivera kryssrutan :guilabel:`Testmiljö`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:202
msgid "Enable the :guilabel:`Activate Certification Process` checkbox."
msgstr "Aktivera kryssrutan :guilabel:`Aktivera certifieringsprocess`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:203
msgid ""
"Enter the number of documents requested by the |DIAN| for each type of "
"document"
msgstr "Ange antalet dokument som begärts av |DIAN| för varje typ av dokument"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:204
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Begin Certification Process`, then :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Påbörja certifieringsprocess`, sedan :guilabel:`Spara`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:207
msgid ""
"The exact number of documents required by the |DIAN| is shown in the portal "
"when you register the operation mode."
msgstr ""
"Det exakta antalet dokument som krävs av |DIAN| visas i portalen när du "
"registrerar operationsläget."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:210
msgid ""
"The necessary journals, products, and required documents are automatically "
"generated and submitted to the |DIAN|'s certification environment."
msgstr ""
"De nödvändiga journalerna, produkterna och erforderliga dokumenten genereras "
"automatiskt och skickas till |DIAN|:s certifieringsmiljö."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:213
msgid ""
"When the process is complete, click :guilabel:`Open` to review the generated "
"documents and check each document's validation status under "
"its :guilabel:`DIAN` tab."
msgstr ""
"När processen är klar, klicka på :guilabel:`Öppna` för att granska de "
"genererade dokumenten och kontrollera varje dokuments valideringsstatus "
"under fliken :guilabel:`DIAN`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:217
msgid ""
"Confirm that the company status has changed to :guilabel:`Enabled` in the |"
"DIAN| portal before proceeding to production:"
msgstr ""
"Bekräfta att företagets status har ändrats till :guilabel:`Aktiverad` i |"
"DIAN|-portalen innan du fortsätter till produktion:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:220
msgid ""
"If the status is :guilabel:`Enabled`, the process has been completed "
"successfully."
msgstr ""
"Om statusen är :guilabel:`Aktiverad` har processen slutförts framgångsrikt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:221
msgid ""
"If the company is not :guilabel:`Enabled`, repeat the process until it is "
"successfully enabled."
msgstr ""
"Om företaget inte är :guilabel:`Aktiverat`, upprepa processen tills det är "
"framgångsrikt aktiverat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:224
msgid ""
"Watch this `video <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_0j9kqL9yOU>`_ for a "
"demonstration of the process."
msgstr ""
"Se denna `video <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_0j9kqL9yOU>`_ för en "
"demonstration av processen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:228
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/guatemala.rst:176
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:210
msgid "Master data"
msgstr "Masterdata"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:235
msgid ""
"Configure the following fields on the :doc:`contact form <../../essentials/"
"contacts>`:"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera följande fält på :doc:`kontaktformuläret <../../essentials/"
"contacts>`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:237
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Identification Number` (VAT): Select the identification number "
"type and enter the identification number. If the identification number type "
"is :guilabel:`NIT`, the identification number must include the verification "
"digit at the end, prefixed by a hyphen (`-`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Identifikationsnummer` (moms): Välj typ av identifikationsnummer "
"och ange identifikationsnumret. Om identifikationsnummertypen "
"är :guilabel:`NIT`, måste identifikationsnumret innehålla "
"verifieringssiffran i slutet, med ett bindestreck (`-`) som prefix."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:240
msgid ""
":ref:`Fiscal Information fields <localization/colombia/configuration/"
"company>` in the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Fält för skatteinformation <localization/colombia/configuration/"
"company>` i fliken :guilabel:`Försäljning & inköp`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:248
msgid ""
"Access the product's form via :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> "
"Products` and ensure that either the :guilabel:`UNSPSC Category` field "
"(found in the :guilabel:`Accounting tab`) or the :guilabel:`Internal "
"Reference` field (in the :guilabel:`General Information` tab) is configured."
msgstr ""
"Öppna produktens formulär via :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Kunder --> "
"Produkter` och säkerställ att antingen fältet :guilabel:`UNSPSC-kategori` "
"(finns i fliken :guilabel:`Bokföring`) eller fältet :guilabel:`Intern "
"referens` (i fliken :guilabel:`Allmän information`) är konfigurerat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:257
msgid ""
"To create or modify taxes, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxes`, and select the related tax."
msgstr ""
"För att skapa eller ändra skatter, gå till :menuselection:`Redovisning --> "
"Konfiguration --> Skatter`, och välj den relaterade skatten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:260
msgid ""
"If sales transactions include products with taxes, configure "
"the :guilabel:`Value Type` field in the :guilabel:`Advanced Options` tab. "
"Retention tax types (:guilabel:`ICA`, :guilabel:`IVA`, :guilabel:`Fuente`) "
"are also included. This configuration is used to display taxes correctly on "
"the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Om försäljningstransaktioner inkluderar produkter med skatter, konfigurera "
"fältet :guilabel:`Värdetyp` i fliken :guilabel:`Avancerade optioner`. Typer "
"av innehållningsskatt (:guilabel:`ICA`, :guilabel:`IVA`, :guilabel:`Fuente`) "
"ingår också. Denna konfiguration används för att visa skatter korrekt på "
"fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:None
msgid "Specific tax configurations per DIAN regulations."
msgstr "Specifika skattekonfigurationer enligt DIAN-regler."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:271
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/uruguay.rst:275
msgid "Sales journals"
msgstr "Försäljningsjournaler"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:273
msgid ""
"Once the |DIAN| has assigned the official sequence and prefix for the "
"electronic invoice resolution, the sales journals related to the invoices "
"**must** be updated in Odoo. To do so, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals` and select an "
"existing sales journal or create a new one with the :guilabel:`Create` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"När |DIAN| har tilldelat den officiella nummerserien och prefixet för den "
"digitala fakturaresolutionen, **måste** försäljningsjournalerna relaterade "
"till fakturorna uppdateras i Odoo. För att göra detta, navigera "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Journaler` och välj en "
"befintlig försäljningsjournal eller skapa en ny med "
"knappen :guilabel:`Skapa`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:278
msgid ""
"On the sales journal form, enter the :guilabel:`Journal Name` "
"and :guilabel:`Type`, then set a unique :guilabel:`Short Code` in "
"the :guilabel:`Journals Entries` tab. Then, configure the following data in "
"the :guilabel:`Advanced Settings` tab:"
msgstr ""
"På försäljningsjournalformuläret, ange :guilabel:`Journalnamn` "
"och :guilabel:`Typ`, ange sedan en unik :guilabel:`Kort kod` i "
"fliken :guilabel:`Journalposter`. Konfigurera sedan följande data i "
"fliken :guilabel:`Avancerade inställningar`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:282
msgid ":guilabel:`Electronic invoicing`: enable UBL 2.1 (Colombia)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Digital fakturering`: aktivera UBL 2.1 (Colombia)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:283
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invoicing Resolution`: resolution number issued by |DIAN| to the "
"company via their test set."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Fakturabeslut`: beslutsnummer emitterat av |DIAN| till företaget "
"via deras testpaket."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:285
msgid ":guilabel:`Resolution Date`: initial effective date of the resolution."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Beslutsdatum`: initial effektiv datum för beslutet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:286
msgid ":guilabel:`Resolution End Date`: end date of the resolution's validity."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Beslutets slutdatum`: slutdatum för beslutets giltighet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:287
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Range of Numbering (minimum)`: first authorized invoice number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nummreringsintervall (minimum)`: första auktoriserade "
"fakturanummer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:288
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Range of Numbering (maximum)`: last authorized invoice number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Nummreringsintervall (maximum)`: sista auktoriserade "
"fakturanummer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:289
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Technical Key`: control key received from the |DIAN| portal test "
"set or from their web service in case of the production environment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Teknisk nyckel`: kontrollnyckel mottagen från |DIAN|-portalens "
"testpaket eller från deras webbtjänst vid produktionsmiljö."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:292
msgid ""
"When the database is configured for the :ref:`production environment "
"<localization/colombia/einvoice-configuration>`, instead of configuring "
"these fields manually, click the :guilabel:`Reload DIAN configuration` "
"button to obtain the |DIAN| resolution information from the |DIAN| web "
"service."
msgstr ""
"När databasen är konfigurerad för :ref:`produktionsmiljön <localization/"
"colombia/einvoice-configuration>`, istället för att konfigurera dessa fält "
"manuellt, klicka på knappen :guilabel:`Ladda om DIAN-konfiguration` för att "
"erhålla |DIAN|-beslutsinformationen från |DIAN|-webbtjänsten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:None
msgid "Reload DIAN configuration button in sale journals."
msgstr "Knappen Ladda om DIAN-konfiguration i försäljningsjournaler."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:301
msgid ""
"The short code and resolution of the journal **must** match the ones "
"received in the |DIAN| portal test set or from the MUISCA portal."
msgstr ""
"Den korta koden och beslut för journalen **måste** matcha de som mottagits i "
"|DIAN|-portalens testpaket eller från MUISCA-portalen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:303
msgid ""
"The :ref:`invoice sequence and prefix <localization/colombia/invoice-"
"creation>` **must** be correctly configured when the first invoice is "
"created. Odoo automatically assigns a prefix and sequence to the following "
"invoices."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Fakturanummerserien och prefixet <localization/colombia/invoice-"
"creation>` **måste** vara korrekt konfigurerade när den första fakturan "
