#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:120
msgid ""
"If products have any :doc:`withholding taxes <../accounting/taxes/"
"retention>`, they must be configured on the product form. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Products`. On "
"the :guilabel:`General Information` tab, specify both :guilabel:`Purchase "
"Taxes` and :guilabel:`Profit Withhold`."
msgstr ""
"Om produkter har någon :doc:`källskatt <../accounting/taxes/retention>` "
"måste de konfigureras på produktformuläret. För att göra detta, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Leverantörer --> Produkter`. På "
"fliken :guilabel:`Allmän information` anger du "
"både :guilabel:`Inköpsskatter` och :guilabel:`Vinstinnehållning`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:130
msgid ""
"To manage taxes, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --"
"> Taxes`. Depending on the tax type, the following options may be required "
"for additional configuration:"
msgstr ""
"För att hantera skatter, navigera till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> "
"Konfiguration --> Skatter`. Beroende på skattetyp kan följande alternativ "
"krävas för ytterligare konfiguration:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:133
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Name`: Follows a specific format depending on the tax type:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Skattenamn`: Följer ett specifikt format beroende på skattetyp:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:0
msgid "**For IVA (Value-Added Tax)**:"
msgstr "**För IVA (mervärdesskatt)**:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:0
msgid ""
"`IVA [percent] (104, [form code] [tax support code] [tax support short "
"name])`"
msgstr ""
"`IVA [procent] (104, [formulärkod] [skattetabellkod] [skattetabellkortnamn])`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:0
msgid "Example: `IVA 12% (104, RUC [tax support code] IVA)`"
msgstr "Exempel: `IVA 12% (104, RUC [skattetabellkod] IVA)`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:0
msgid "**For Income Tax Withholding codes**:"
msgstr "**För koder för källskatt på inkomst**:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:0
msgid "`Code ATS [percent of withhold] [withhold name]`"
msgstr "`Kod ATS [procent av innehållning] [innehållningsnamn]`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:0
msgid "Example: `Code ATS 10% Retención a la Fuente`"
msgstr "Exempel: `Kod ATS 10% Retención a la Fuente`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:142
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Support`: Configure only for the IVA tax. This option is used "
"to register purchase withholdings."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Skattetabeller`: Konfigurera endast för IVA-skatt. Detta "
"alternativ används för att registrera inköpsinnehållningar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:144
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Code ATS`: Configure only for income tax withholding codes, as it "
"is necessary to register a withholding."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kod ATS`: Konfigurera endast för koder för källskatt på inkomst, "
"eftersom det krävs för att registrera en innehållning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:147
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Definition` tab:"
msgstr "På fliken :guilabel:`Definition`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Grids`: Configure the code of a 104 form if it is an IVA tax, "
"and the code of a 103 form if it is an income tax withholding code."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Skattetabeller`: Konfigurera koden för ett 104-formulär om det är "
"en IVA-skatt, och koden för ett 103-formulär om det är en kod för källskatt "
"på inkomst."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:153
msgid ":doc:`Configuring taxes <../accounting/taxes>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Konfigurera skatter <../accounting/taxes>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:160
msgid ""
"To access or configure document types, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Document Types`. Each document type can have a unique "
"sequence per journal where it is assigned. As part of the localization, the "
"document type includes the country where the document is applicable; also, "
"the data is created automatically when the localization module is installed. "
"The information required for the document types is included by default and "
"doesn't need to be changed."
msgstr ""
"För att öppna eller konfigurera dokumenttyper, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Dokumenttyper`. Varje "
"dokumenttyp kan ha en unik nummerserie per journal där den är tilldelad. Som "
"en del av lokaliseringen inkluderar dokumenttypen det land där dokumentet är "
"tillämpligt; dessutom skapas data automatiskt när lokaliseringsmodulen "
"installeras. Den information som krävs för dokumenttyperna inkluderas som "
"standard och behöver inte ändras."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:169
msgid "Company and contact"
msgstr "Företag och kontakt"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:172
msgid ""
":doc:`Configure a company or individual contact <../../essentials/contacts>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Konfigurera ett företag eller en individuell kontakt <../../essentials/"
"contacts>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:174
msgid ""
"The following fields should be completed for localization purposes on the "
"contact form:"
msgstr ""
"Följande fält bör fyllas i för lokaliseringsändamål på kontaktformuläret:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:176
msgid ":guilabel:`Name`: Enter the company or individual's name."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Namn`: Ange företagets eller individens namn."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:177
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Address`: The :guilabel:`Street` sub-field is required to confirm "
"electronic invoices."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Adress`: Underfältet :guilabel:`Gata` krävs för att bekräfta "
"elektroniska fakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:178
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Identification Number`: For a company, enter the :guilabel:`Ruc`. "
"For individuals, enter the :guilabel:`Cédula` or :guilabel:`Passport` number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Identifikationsnummer`: För ett företag, ange :guilabel:`Ruc`. "
"För individer, ange :guilabel:`Cédula`- eller :guilabel:`Passport`-nummer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:180
msgid ":guilabel:`SRI Taxpayer Type`: Select the contact's SRI taxpayer type."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`SRI-skattebetalartyp`: Välj kontaktens SRI-skattebetalartyp."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:181
msgid ":guilabel:`Phone`: Enter the company or individual's phone number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Telefon`: Ange företagets eller individens telefonnummer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:182
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Email`: Enter the company or individual's email. This email is "
"used to send electronic documents, such as invoices."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`E-post`: Ange företagets eller individens e-postadress. Denna e-"
"post används för att skicka elektroniska dokument, såsom fakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:186
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`SRI Taxpayer Type` indicated on the contact form determines "
"which :ref:`VAT and profit withholding <localizations/ecuador/vat-"
"withholding>` taxes apply when using this contact on a vendor bill."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`SRI-skattebetalaretypen` som anges i kontaktformuläret avgör "
"vilka :ref:`moms- och vinstskatteavdrag <localizations/ecuador/vat-"
"withholding>` som gäller när denna kontakt används på en leverantörsfaktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:195
msgid ""
"To upload information for electronic documents, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`Ecuadorian Localization` section."
msgstr ""
"För att ladda upp information för elektroniska dokument, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar` och "
"rulla ned till sektionen :guilabel:`Ecuadoriansk lokalisering`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:198
msgid ""
"Configure the following information, starting with the :guilabel:`Electronic "
"Invoicing` section:"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera följande information, börja med sektionen :guilabel:`Digital "
"fakturering`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:200
msgid ":guilabel:`Company legal name`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Företagets juridiska namn`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:201
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Regime`: Select whether the company is in the :guilabel:`Regular "
"Regime (without additional messages in the RIDE)` or is qualified as in "
"the :guilabel:`RIMPE Regime`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Regim`: Välj om företaget tillhör :guilabel:`Ordinarie regim "
"(utan ytterligare meddelanden i RIDE)` eller är kvalificerat som "
"tillhörande :guilabel:`RIMPE-regimen`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:203
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Special Taxpayer Number`: If the company is qualified as a "
"special taxpayer, complete this field with the company's corresponding tax "
"contributor number."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Speciellt skattebetalarnummer`: Om företaget är kvalificerat som "
"en speciell skattebetalare, fyll i detta fält med företagets motsvarande "
"skattebidragsnummer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:205
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Forced to Keep Accounting Books`: Enable this option if needed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tvingad att föra bokföringsböcker`: Aktivera detta alternativ om "
"det behövs."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:207
msgid ":guilabel:`Withholding` section:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Skatteavdrag`-sektion:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:209
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Consumables`: Enter the code of the default withholding tax used "
"when purchasing goods."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Förbrukningsvaror`: Ange koden för den standardskatteavdrag som "
"används vid inköp av varor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:210
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Services`: Enter the code of the default withholding tax used "
"when purchasing services."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tjänster`: Ange koden för den standardskatteavdrag som används "
"vid inköp av tjänster."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:211
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Credit Card`: Enter the code of the default withholding tax used "
"when purchasing with credit cards."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kreditkort`: Ange koden för den standardskatteavdrag som används "
"vid inköp med kreditkort."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withhold Agent Number`: Enter the company's withholding agent "
"resolution number, if applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Skatteavdragsagentnummer`: Ange företagets "
"skatteavdragsagentbeslutsnummer, om tillämpligt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:216
msgid ":guilabel:`SRI Connection` section:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`SRI-anslutning`-sektion:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:218
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate file for SRI`: Select the company's :guilabel:`SRI "
"certificate`. Click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`SRI Certificates` to "
"upload one, if necessary."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Certifikatfil för SRI`: Välj företagets :guilabel:`SRI-"
"certifikat`. Klicka på :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`SRI-certifikat` för "
"att ladda upp ett, om det behövs."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:220
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Use production servers`: Enable this option if electronic "
"documents are used in the production environment; leave it disabled if the "
"testing environment is used instead."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Använd produktionsservrar`: Aktivera detta alternativ om "
"elektroniska dokument används i produktionsmiljön; lämna det avaktiverat om "
"testmiljön används istället."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:223
msgid ":guilabel:`Withholding accounts` section:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Skatteavdragskonton`-sektion:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:225
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Tax Base Account`: Enter the company's sales tax base "
"account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Konto för momsbas för försäljning`: Ange företagets momsbaskonto "
"för försäljning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:226
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Tax Base Account`: Enter the company's sales tax "
"purchase account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Konto för momsbas för inköp`: Ange företagets momsbaskonto för "
"inköp."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:229
msgid "When using the testing environment, EDI data is sent to test servers."
msgstr "När testmiljön används skickas EDI-data till testservrar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:232
msgid ""
"The values entered in the :guilabel:`Consumables` and :guilabel:`Services` "
"withholding fields are used as default values for domestic **only when** no "
"withholdings are set up on the *SRI Taxpayer Type*."
msgstr ""
"Värdena som anges i fälten för skatteavdrag "
"för :guilabel:`Förbrukningsvaror` och :guilabel:`Tjänster` används som "
"standardvärden för inrikes **endast när** inga skatteavdrag är konfigurerade "
"för *SRI-skattebetalaretypen*."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:235
msgid ""
"The entered :guilabel:`Credit Card` withholding value is always applied when "
"a credit or debit card SRI payment method is used."
msgstr ""
"Det angivna skatteavdragsvärdet för :guilabel:`Kreditkort` tillämpas alltid "
"när en kredit- eller bankkorts SRI-betalningsmetod används."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:241
msgid "VAT withholding"
msgstr "Innehållande av moms"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:244
msgid ""
"This configuration applies only if the SRI recognizes the company as a "
"withholding agent. If not, skip this step."
msgstr ""
"Denna konfiguration gäller endast om SRI erkänner företaget som "
"skällskatteavdragare. Om inte, hoppa över detta steg."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:247
msgid ""
"To configure a VAT withholding, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxpayer Type SRI`. Then, configure the :guilabel:`Name` "
"of the taxpayer type, the :guilabel:`Goods VAT Withholding`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Services VAT Withholding`."
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera ett momsinnehåll, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring ‑> "
"Konfiguration ‑> Taxpayer Type SRI`. Konfigurera sedan :guilabel:`Namn` på "
"skattebetalaretypen, :guilabel:`Goods VAT Withholding` "
"och :guilabel:`Services VAT Withholding`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:252
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Taxpayer Type` is :guilabel:`Rimpe`, configure "
"the :guilabel:`Profit Withhold` percentage."
msgstr ""
"Om :guilabel:`Taxpayer Type` är :guilabel:`Rimpe`, konfigurera procentsatsen "
"för :guilabel:`Profit Withhold`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:258
msgid "Printer points"
msgstr "Skrivarpunkter"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:260
msgid ""
"*Printer points* need to be configured for each type of electronic document "
"used, such as customer invoices, credit notes, and debit notes."
msgstr ""
"*Utskriftspunkter* behöver konfigureras för varje typ av elektroniskt "
"dokument som används, såsom kundfakturor, kreditfakturor och "
"ändringsfakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:263
msgid ""
"To configure printer points, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Journals`. For each electronic document, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, and enter the following information on the journal "
"form:"
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera utskriftspunkter, navigera "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring ‑> Konfiguration ‑> Journaler`. För varje "
"elektroniskt dokument, klicka på :guilabel:`Ny` och ange följande "
"information på journalformuläret:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:267
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal Name`: Enter in this format: `[Emission Entity]-[Emission "
"Point] [Document Type]`, e.g., `001-001 Sales Documents`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Journalnamn`: Ange i detta format: `[Utgivningsenhet]-"
"[Utgivningspunkt] [Dokumenttyp]`, t.ex. `001-001 Försäljningsdokument`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:269
msgid ":guilabel:`Type`: Refers to the journal type; select :guilabel:`Sales`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Typ`: Avser journaltypen; välj :guilabel:`Försäljning`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:271
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:563
msgid "Once the :guilabel:`Type` is selected, complete the following fields:"
msgstr "När :guilabel:`Typ` har valts, fyll i följande fält:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:273
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:566
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Use Documents?`: Enable this option if legal invoicing (invoices, "
"debit/credit notes) is used, as this is the standard configuration. If not, "
"select the option to record accounting entries unrelated to legal invoicing "
"documents, such as receipts, tax payments, or journal entries."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Använd dokument?`: Aktivera detta alternativ om juridisk "
"fakturering (fakturor, ändrings-/kreditfakturor) används, eftersom detta är "
"standardkonfigurationen. Om inte, välj alternativet att registrera "
"verifikationer som inte är relaterade till juridiska faktureringsdokument, "
"såsom inleveranser, skattebetalningar eller verifikationer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:277
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:316
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:570
msgid ":guilabel:`Emission Entity`: Enter the facility number."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Utgivningsenhet`: Ange anläggningsnummer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:278
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:317
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:571
msgid ":guilabel:`Emission Point`: Enter the printer point."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Utgivningspunkt`: Ange utskriftspunkten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:279
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:318
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:572
msgid ":guilabel:`Emission address`: Enter the address of the facility."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Utgivningsadress`: Ange anläggningens adress."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:281
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:320
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Journal Entries` tab, under the :guilabel:`Accounting "
"information` section, fill in the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"I fliken :guilabel:`Verifikationer`, under "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Bokföringsinformation`, fyll i följande fält:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:284
msgid ":guilabel:`Default Income Account`: Enter the default income account."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Standardinkomstkonto`: Ange standardinkomstkontot."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:285
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dedicated Credit Note Sequence`: Enable this option if *credit "
"notes* should be generated from this printer point (i.e., the journal)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dedicated Credit Note Sequence`: Aktivera detta alternativ om "
"*kreditfakturor* ska genereras från denna utskriftspunkt (dvs. journalen)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:287
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Dedicated Debit Note Sequence`: Enable this option if *debit "
"notes* should be generated from this printer point (i.e., the journal)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Dedicated Debit Note Sequence`: Aktivera detta alternativ om "
