"validerats. :ref:`Kreditfakturor <accounting/credit_notes/issue-credit-"
"note>` kan endast registreras från en validerad (bokförd) faktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:457
msgid ""
"Keep the :guilabel:`Document Type` on :guilabel:`(04) Credit Note` in "
"the :guilabel:`Credit note` window."
msgstr ""
"Behåll :guilabel:`Dokumenttyp` på :guilabel:`(04) Kreditfaktura` i "
