#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:263
msgid "B2B and B2C invoicing"
msgstr "B2B- och B2C-fakturering"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:265
msgid ""
"France's `electronic invoicing reform <https://www.impots.gouv.fr/"
"professionnel/je-passe-la-facturation-electronique>`_ *(reforme de la "
"facturation électronique)* impacts all VAT-registered French companies, and "
"is being rolled out in two phases:"
msgstr ""
"Frankrikes `elektroniska faktureringsreform <https://www.impots.gouv.fr/"
"professionnel/je-passe-la-facturation-electronique>`_ *(réforme de la "
"facturation électronique)* påverkar alla momsregistrerade franska företag "
"och rullas ut i två faser:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:270
msgid "From **September 1, 2026**:"
msgstr "Från den **1 september 2026**:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:272
msgid ""
"every company must be able to receive domestic B2B e-invoices via "
"*plateformes agréées* (approved platforms) :ref:`(e-invoicing) "
"<localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-einvoicing>`"
msgstr ""
"varje företag måste kunna ta emot inhemska B2B-e-fakturor via *plateformes "
"agréées* (godkända plattformar) :ref:`(elektronisk fakturering) "
"<localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-einvoicing>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:274
msgid ""
"large enterprises (GE) and mid-sized enterprises (ETI) must send domestic "
"B2B e-invoices :ref:`(e-invoicing) <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-"
"elec-einvoicing>` and must submit data to the tax authorities about certain "
"operations, such as B2C and cross-border B2B operations :ref:`(e-reporting) "
"<localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-reporting>`"
msgstr ""
"stora företag (GE) och medelstora företag (ETI) måste skicka inhemska B2B-e-"
"fakturor :ref:`(elektronisk fakturering) <localizations/france/e-invoicing-"
"fac-elec-einvoicing>` och måste lämna data till skattemyndigheterna om vissa "
"operationer, såsom B2C- och gränsöverskridande B2B-operationer :ref:`(e-"
"rapportering) <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-reporting>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:279
msgid ""
"From **September 1, 2027**, every company, including small and medium-sized "
"enterprises (PME) and micro-enterprises are subject to the same :ref:`e-"
"invoicing <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-einvoicing>` "
"and :ref:`e-reporting <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-reporting>` "
"requirements."
msgstr ""
"Från den **1 september 2027** omfattas varje företag, inklusive små och "
"medelstora företag (PME) och mikroföretag, av samma krav "
"på :ref:`elektronisk fakturering <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-"
"einvoicing>` och :ref:`e-rapportering <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-"
"elec-reporting>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:284
msgid ""
"Odoo is officially certified as a *plateforme agréée* (approved platform) on "
"the e-invoicing network. It supports the receipt of documents in various "
"formats (Facture-X, UBL, and CII) and the sending of documents exclusively "
"in UBL format."
msgstr ""
"Odoo är officiellt certifierat som en *plateforme agréée* (godkänd "
"plattform) i det elektroniska faktureringsnätverket. Det stöder mottagande "
"av dokument i olika format (Facture-X, UBL och CII) och sändning av dokument "
"uteslutande i UBL-format."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:289
msgid "VAT-exempt transactions under Articles 261-261E are excluded."
msgstr "Momsbefriade transaktioner enligt artiklarna 261-261E är undantagna."

