#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:703
msgid "Implementation details"
msgstr "Detaljer om implementeringen"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:705
msgid ""
"The following accounting entities are imported from the FEC files: "
"**Accounts, Journals, Partners**, and **Moves**. The module automatically "
"determines the encoding, line terminator, and separator used in the file. "
"Next, a check is performed to ensure that each line has the correct number "
"of fields matching the header. If the check is successful, the entire file "
"is read, stored in memory, and scanned. Accounting entities are then "
"imported one type at a time in the following order."
msgstr ""
"Följande bokföringsenheter importeras från FEC-filerna: **Konton, Journaler, "
"Partner** och **Verifikationer**. Modulen avgör automatiskt kodning, "
"radavslutare och avskiljare som används i filen. Därefter utförs en kontroll "
"för att säkerställa att varje rad har rätt antal fält som matchar "
"sidhuvudet. Om kontrollen lyckas läses hela filen, lagras i minnet och "
"skannas. Bokföringsenheterna importeras sedan en typ i taget i följande "
"ordning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:714
msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "Konton"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:716
msgid ""
"Each accounting entry is associated with an account identified by "
"the :guilabel:`CompteNum` field."
msgstr ""
"Varje verifikation är kopplad till ett konto som identifieras av "
"fältet :guilabel:`CompteNum`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:721
msgid "Code matching"
msgstr "Matchning av kod"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:723
msgid ""
"If an account with the same code already exists, the existing one is used "
"rather than creating a new one. In Odoo, account numbers follow the default "
"digit length of the fiscal localization. Since the FEC module is tied to the "
"French localization, the default account length is 6 digits. This means that "
"trailing zeros in account codes are removed, and the comparison between the "
"account codes in the FEC file and those already in Odoo is made based only "
"on the first six digits of the codes."
msgstr ""
"Om ett konto med samma kod redan finns används det befintliga istället för "
"att skapa ett nytt. I Odoo följer kontonummer standardsifferlängden för "
"skattelokalisering. Eftersom FEC-modulen är knuten till den franska "
"lokaliseringen är standardkontolängden 6 siffror. Detta innebär att "
"efterföljande nollor i kontokoder tas bort, och jämförelsen mellan "
"kontokoderna i FEC-filen och de som redan finns i Odoo görs endast baserat "
"på de första sex siffrorna i koderna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:731
msgid ""
"The account code `65800000` in the file is matched with an existing `658000` "
"account in Odoo, and the existing account is used instead of creating a new "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Kontokoden `65800000` i filen matchas med ett befintligt konto `658000` i "
"Odoo, och det befintliga kontot används istället för att skapa ett nytt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:737
msgid "Reconcilable flag"
msgstr "Försonlig flagga"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:739
msgid ""
"An account is technically flagged as *reconcilable* if the first line in "
"which it appears has the :guilabel:`EcritureLet` field filled out, "
"indicating that the accounting entry will be reconciled with another one."
msgstr ""
"Ett konto är tekniskt flaggat som *avstämbart* om den första raden där det "
"förekommer har fältet :guilabel:`EcritureLet` ifyllt, vilket indikerar att "
"verifikationen kommer att stämmas av med en annan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:744
msgid ""
"The field can be left empty on the line, but the entry must still be "
"reconciled with an unrecorded payment. The account is flagged as "
"reconcilable once the import of the move lines requires it."
msgstr ""
"Fältet kan lämnas tomt på raden, men verifikationen måste ändå stämmas av "
"mot en oregistrerad betalning. Kontot flaggas som avstämbart när importen av "
"transportraderna kräver det."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:751
msgid "Account type and templates matching"
msgstr "Kontotyp och mallmatchning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:753
msgid ""
"Since the account **type** is not specified in the FEC format, **new** "
"accounts are created with the default type :guilabel:`Current Assets`. After "
"the import process, they are matched against the installed Chart of Account "
"templates. The *reconcile* flag is also determined this way."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom konto**typen** inte anges i FEC-formatet skapas **nya** konton med "
"standardtypen :guilabel:`Omsättningstillgångar`. Efter importprocessen "
"matchas de mot de installerade kontoplansmallar. Flaggan *avstämning* "
"bestäms också på detta sätt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:757
msgid ""
"The matching is performed by comparing the left-most digits, starting with "
"all digits, followed by 3 digits, and then 2 digits."
msgstr ""
"Matchningen utförs genom att jämföra de vänstra siffrorna, med start på alla "
"siffror, följt av 3 siffror och sedan 2 siffror."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:763
msgid "Full comparison"
msgstr "Fullständig jämförelse"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:763
msgid "3-digits comparison"
msgstr "3-siffrig jämförelse"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:763
msgid "2-digits comparison"
msgstr "2-siffrig jämförelse"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:765
#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/authorize.rst:95
msgid "Template"
msgstr "Mall"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:765
msgid "`400000`"
msgstr "`400000'"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:765
msgid "`400`"
msgstr "`400`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:765
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:767
msgid "`40`"
msgstr "`40`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:767
msgid "`40100000`"
msgstr "`40100000'"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:767
msgid "`401`"
msgstr "`401`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:769
msgid "**Result**"
msgstr "**Resultat**"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:769
msgid "Match **found**"
msgstr "Matchning **hittad**"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:772
msgid ""
"The account type is then flagged as :guilabel:`payable` "
"and :guilabel:`reconcilable` based on the account template."
msgstr ""
"Kontotypen flaggas sedan som :guilabel:`skulder` och :guilabel:`avstämbar` "
"baserat på kontomallen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:780
msgid ""
"Journals are checked against the existing ones in Odoo to avoid duplicates, "
"even when importing multiple FEC files."
msgstr ""
"Journaler kontrolleras mot de befintliga i Odoo för att undvika dubbletter, "
"även vid import av flera FEC-filer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:783
msgid ""
"If a journal with the same code already exists, the existing journal is used "
"instead of creating a new one."
msgstr ""
"Om en journal med samma kod redan finns används den befintliga journalen "
"istället för att skapa en ny."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:786
msgid ""
"New journals have the prefix :guilabel:`FEC-` added to their name. For "
"example, :guilabel:`ACHATS` becomes :guilabel:`FEC-ACHATS`."
msgstr ""
"Nya journaler får prefixet :guilabel:`FEC-` tillagt till sitt namn. Till "
"exempel blir :guilabel:`ACHATS` :guilabel:`FEC-ACHATS`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:790
msgid ""
"Journals are *not* archived, allowing the user to manage them as desired."
msgstr ""
"Journaler arkiveras *inte*, vilket gör det möjligt för användaren att "
"hantera dem efter önskemål."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:795
msgid "Journal type determination"
msgstr "Bestämning av tidskriftstyp"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:797
msgid ""
"The journal type is not specified in the format (similar to the accounts) "
"and is initially created with the default type :guilabel:`general`."
msgstr ""
"Journaltypen anges inte i formatet (liknar kontona) och skapas initialt med "
"standardtypen :guilabel:`allmän`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:800
msgid ""
"At the end of the import process, the journal type is determined based on "
"the following rules regarding related moves and accounts:"
msgstr ""
"I slutet av importprocessen bestäms journaltypen baserat på följande regler "
"angående relaterade transporter och konton:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid ""
":guilabel:`bank`: Moves in these journals always include a line (debit or "
"credit) impacting a liquidity account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`bank`: Transporter i dessa journaler inkluderar alltid en rad "
"(debet eller kredit) som påverkar ett likviditetskonto."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid ""
":guilabel:`cash` / :guilabel:`bank` can be interchanged, so :guilabel:`bank` "
"is assigned when this condition is met."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`kontant` / :guilabel:`bank` kan bytas ut, så :guilabel:`bank` "
"tilldelas när detta villkor är uppfyllt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid ""
":guilabel:`sale`: Moves in these journals mostly have debit lines on "
"receivable accounts and credit lines on tax income accounts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`försäljning`: Transporter i dessa journaler har oftast debetrader "
"på kundfordringskonton och kreditrader på skatteinkomstkonton."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid "Sale refund journal items are debit/credit inverted."
msgstr ""
"Verifikat för återbetalning av försäljning är debet/kredit inverterade."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid ""
":guilabel:`purchase`: Moves in these journals mostly have credit lines on "
"payable accounts and debit lines on expense accounts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`inköp`: Transporter i dessa journaler har oftast kreditrader på "
"skuldkonton och debetrader på utgiftskonton."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid "Purchase refund journal items are debit/credit inverted."
msgstr "Verifikat för återbetalning av inköp är debet/kredit inverterade."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`general`: Used for everything else."
msgstr ":guilabel:`allmän`: Används för allt annat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:816
msgid "A minimum of three moves is required to identify the journal type."
msgstr "Minst tre transporter krävs för att identifiera journaltypen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:817
msgid ""
"A threshold of 70% of the moves must meet the criteria for a journal type to "
"be determined."
msgstr ""
"En tröskel på 70% av transporterna måste uppfylla kriterierna för att en "
"journaltyp ska kunna bestämmas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:820
msgid ""
"Suppose we are analyzing the moves that share a "
"certain :guilabel:`journal_id`."
msgstr ""
"Anta att vi analyserar de transporter som delar en "
"viss :guilabel:`journal_id`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:823
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:853
msgid "Moves"
msgstr "Rörelser"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:823
msgid "Count"
msgstr "Räkna"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:823
msgid "Percentage"
msgstr "Procentuell andel"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:825
msgid "that have a sale account line and no purchase account line"
msgstr "som har en försäljningskonto rad och ingen inköpskonto rad"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:827
msgid "that have a purchase account line and no sale account line"
msgstr "som har en inköpskonto rad och ingen försäljningskonto rad"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:827
msgid "25%"
msgstr "25%"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:829
msgid "that have a liquidity account line"
msgstr "som har en likviditetskontolinje"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:829
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:829
msgid "**75%**"
msgstr "**75%**"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:831
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:216
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:230
msgid "**Total**"
msgstr "**Totalt**"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:831
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:831
msgid "100%"
msgstr "100%"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:834
msgid ""
"The journal :guilabel:`type` would be :guilabel:`bank`, because the bank's "
"move percentage (75%) exceeds the threshold (70%)."
msgstr ""
"Journalens :guilabel:`typ` skulle vara :guilabel:`bank`, eftersom bankens "
"transportprocent (75%) överstiger tröskelvärdet (70%)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:842
msgid ""
"Each contact keeps its :guilabel:`Reference` from the :guilabel:`CompAuxNum` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Varje kontakt behåller sin :guilabel:`referens` från "
"fältet :guilabel:`CompAuxNum`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:845
msgid ""
"These fields are searchable based on previous FEC imports for fiscal/audit "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"Dessa fält är sökbara baserat på tidigare FEC-importer för skatte-/"
"revisionsändamål."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:848
msgid ""
"Similar and potential duplicate contacts can be merged using the Data "
"Cleaning App."
msgstr ""
"Liknande och potentiella dubbletter av kontakter kan sammanfogas med hjälp "
"av appen för datarensning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:855
msgid ""
"Entries are posted and reconciled immediately upon submission, with "
"the :guilabel:`EcritureLet` field used to match the entries."
msgstr ""
"Transaktioner bokförs och avstäms omedelbart vid inlämning, där "
"fältet :guilabel:`EcritureLet` används för att matcha transaktionerna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:858
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`EcritureNum` field represents the name of the moves, but it "
"may sometimes be left empty. In such cases, the :guilabel:`PieceRef` field "
"is used instead."
msgstr ""
"Fältet :guilabel:`EcritureNum` representerar namnet på transporterna, men "
"det kan ibland vara tomt. I sådana fall används fältet :guilabel:`PieceRef` "
"istället."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:864
msgid "Rounding issues"
msgstr "Problem med avrundning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:866
msgid ""
"A rounding tolerance is applied based on currency precision for debit and "
"credit amounts (i.e., 0.01 for EUR). If the difference falls under this "
"tolerance, a new line is added to the move, called :guilabel:`Import "
"rounding difference`, targeting the following accounts:"
msgstr ""
"En avrundningstolerans tillämpas baserat på valutaprecision för debet- och "
"kreditbelopp (dvs. 0,01 för EUR). Om skillnaden understiger denna tolerans "
"läggs en ny rad till i transporten, kallad :guilabel:`Avrundningsdifferens "
"vid import`, som riktar sig mot följande konton:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:870
msgid "`658000` Charges diverses de gestion courante, for added debits"
msgstr ""
"`658000` Charges diverses de gestion courante, för tillkommande debiteringar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:871
msgid "`758000` Produits divers de gestion courante, for added credits"
msgstr "`758000` Produits divers de gestion courante, för extra krediter"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:876
msgid "Missing move name"
msgstr "Saknar flyttnamn"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:878
msgid ""
"If the the :guilabel:`EcritureNum` field is not filled out "
"and :guilabel:`PieceRef` field is not suited to determine the move name (it "
"may be used as an accounting move line reference), it becomes impossible to "
"identify which lines should be grouped into a single move, and effectively "
"preventing the creation of balanced moves."
msgstr ""
"Om fältet :guilabel:`EcritureNum` inte är ifyllt och "
"fältet :guilabel:`PieceRef` inte är lämpligt för att fastställa "
"transportnamnet (det kan användas som en referens för bokföringsrader), blir "
"det omöjligt att identifiera vilka rader som ska grupperas i en enda "
"transport, vilket i praktiken förhindrar skapandet av balanserade "
"transporter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:883
msgid ""
"In such cases, a final attempt is made to group all lines by the same "
"journal and date (:guilabel:`JournalLib`, :guilabel:`EcritureDate`). If this "
"grouping generates balanced moves (sum(credit) - sum(debit) = 0), then each "
"different combination of journal and date creates a new move."
msgstr ""
"I sådana fall görs ett sista försök att gruppera alla rader efter samma "
"journal och datum (:guilabel:`JournalLib`, :guilabel:`EcritureDate`). Om "
"denna gruppering genererar balanserade transporter (summa(kredit) - "
"summa(debet) = 0), skapar varje unik kombination av journal och datum en ny "
"transport."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:889
msgid ""
"`ACH` + `2021/05/01` --> new move on journal `ACH` with name `20210501`."
msgstr ""
"`ACH` + `2021/05/01` --> nytt drag i tidningen `ACH` med namnet `20210501`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:891
msgid ""
"If this attempt fails, an error message is displayed, listing all the move "
"lines that are considered unbalanced."
msgstr ""
"Om detta försök misslyckas visas ett felmeddelande som listar alla de "
"transportrader som anses vara obalanserade."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:897
msgid "Contact information"
msgstr "Kontaktinformation"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:899
msgid ""
"If a line includes contact information, it is copied to the accounting move "
"itself, provided the targeted journal is of type :guilabel:`payable` "
"or :guilabel:`receivable`."
msgstr ""
"Om en rad innehåller kontaktinformation kopieras den till själva "
"bokföringstransporten, förutsatt att den aktuella journalen är av "
"typen :guilabel:`skulder` eller :guilabel:`kundfordran`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:905
msgid "FEC Export"
msgstr "FEC-export"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:907
msgid ""
"To download the FEC, in the **Accounting** app, go "
"to :menuselection:`Reporting --> General Ledger`. Click the :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon and select :guilabel:`FEC`. In "
"the :guilabel:`FEC File Generation` window, fill in the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"För att ladda ner FEC, gå i appen **Bokföring** "
"till :menuselection:`Rapporter --> Huvudbok`. Klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(kugghjul)` och välj :guilabel:`FEC`. I "
"fönstret :guilabel:`FEC-filgenerering`, fyll i följande fält:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:911
msgid ":guilabel:`Start Date`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Startdatum`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:912
msgid ":guilabel:`End Date`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Slutdatum`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:913
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Test File`: Enable this option to test the FEC file generation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Testfil`: Aktivera detta alternativ för att testa genereringen av "
"FEC-filen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:914
msgid ":guilabel:`Exclude lines at 0`: Enable this option if needed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Exkludera rader på 0`: Aktivera detta alternativ vid behov."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:915
msgid ":guilabel:`Excluded Journals`: Select the journal(s) to exclude."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Exkluderade journaler`: Välj den/de journaler som ska exkluderas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:917
msgid "Then, click :guilabel:`Generate`."
msgstr "Klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Skapa`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:920
msgid ""
"`Official Technical Specification (fr) <https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/codes/"
