"på :guilabel:`Skapa e-Waybill` för att fortsätta."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:367
msgid "You can find the JSON-signed file in the attached files in the chatter."
msgstr "Du kan hitta den JSON-signerade filen i de bifogade filerna i chatten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:372
msgid ""
"You can print the invoice PDF report once you have submitted the E-Way bill. "
