msgstr ""
"Se till att modulen **E-Way bill Stock** är :ref:`installerad <general/"
"install>` och att :ref:`E-Way bill-installationen <india/e-waybill-setup>` "
"är komplett."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:403
msgid ""
"To create E-Way bills from :doc:`receipts and deliveries </applications/"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations>` in the "
