#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:357
msgid "Here is a non-exhaustive list:"
msgstr "Här är en icke uttömmande lista:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ":ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`"
msgstr ":ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ""
"As a buyer, you have to pay taxes on what you buy and integrate tax "
"information. :guilabel:`Reverse Charge` taxes."
msgstr ""
"Som köpare måste du betala skatt på det du köper och integrera "
"skatteinformation. :guilabel:`Reverse Charge` skatter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ":ref:`localizations/italy/split-payment`"
msgstr ":ref:`localizations/italy/split-payment`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ""
"As a |PA| business buyer, you have to pay taxes and integrate tax "
"information. Be sure that you replace the :guilabel:`0% Sale Taxes` on the "
"vendor bill you received with the correct :guilabel:`Split Payment` taxes."
msgstr ""
"Som |PA| affärsköpare måste du betala skatter och integrera "
"skatteinformation. Se till att du ersätter :guilabel:`0% "
"försäljningsskatter` på den leverantörsfaktura du fick med de "
"korrekta :guilabel:`Delad betalning` skatterna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Self Consumption`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Självkonsumtion`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid ""
"When, as a business owner, you use an asset that you bought for business for "
"personal reasons instead, you have to pay those taxes you originally "
"deducted as a business cost for it."
msgstr ""
"När du som företagare i stället använder en tillgång som du köpt för "
"affärsändamål för personliga ändamål måste du betala den skatt som du "
"ursprungligen drog av som en kostnad för affärsändamål."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:370
msgid ""
"Odoo may detect that your vendor bill can be interpreted as a document of a "
"type that needs tax integration, as detailed in the :ref:`localizations/"
"italy/document-types` section."
msgstr ""
"Odoo kan upptäcka att din leverantörsfaktura kan tolkas som ett dokument av "
"en typ som behöver skatteintegrering, enligt beskrivningen i "
"avsnittet :ref:`localizations/italy/document-types`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:374
msgid ""
"Be sure that you replace the :guilabel:`0% Sale Taxes` on the vendor bill "
"you received with the ones you're supposed to pay to the |AdE|. A button "
"then appears on the top of the single vendor bill form to send them."
msgstr ""
"Se till att du ersätter :guilabel:`0% försäljningsskatter` på den "
"leverantörsfaktura du fick med de som du ska betala till |AdE|. En knapp "
"visas då överst i det enskilda leverantörsfaktura-formuläret för att skicka "
"dem."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:378
msgid ""
"When clicking on the :guilabel:`Send Tax Integration` button, an XML file of "
"the appropriate :guilabel:`Document Type` is generated, attached to the "
"bill, and sent as for invoices."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på knappen :guilabel:`Send Tax Integration` genereras en XML-"
"fil av lämplig :guilabel:`Document Type` som bifogas fakturan och skickas på "
"samma sätt som för fakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid "EDI Send Tax Integration button"
msgstr "Knapp för integration av skatt vid EDI-överföring"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:389
msgid ""
"The |SdI| requires businesses to send customer invoices and other documents "
"through the :abbr:`EDI (Electronic Data Interchange)`."
msgstr ""
"|SdI| kräver att företag skickar kundfakturor och andra dokument "
"genom :abbr:`EDI (Electronic Data Interchange)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:392
msgid ""
"The following :guilabel:`Document Type` codes all technically identify "
"different business use cases."
msgstr ""
"Följande :guilabel:`Document Type`-koder identifierar alla tekniskt sett "
"olika användningsområden för verksamheten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:397
msgid "TD01 - invoices"
msgstr "TD01 - fakturor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:399
msgid ""
"This represents the standard **domestic** scenario for all invoices "
"exchanged through the |SdI|. Any invoice that doesn't fall into one of the "
"specific special cases is categorized as a regular invoice, identified by "
"the :guilabel:`Document Type` `TD01`."
msgstr ""
"Detta representerar det vanliga **inhemska** scenariot för alla fakturor som "
"utbyts genom |SdI|. Varje faktura som inte faller under något av de "
"specifika specialfallen kategoriseras som en vanlig faktura, identifierad "
"av :guilabel:`dokumenttyp` `TD01`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:406
msgid "TD02 - down payments"
msgstr "TD02 - förskottsbetalningar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:408
msgid ""
"**Down payment** invoices are imported/exported with a "
"different :guilabel:`Document Type` code `TDO2` than regular invoices. Upon "
"import of the invoice, a regular vendor bill is created."
msgstr ""
"**Down payment**-fakturor importeras/exporteras med en "
"annan :guilabel:`Document Type`-kod `TDO2` än vanliga fakturor. Vid import "
"av fakturan skapas en vanlig leverantörsfaktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:411
msgid ""
"Odoo exports transactions as `TD02` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo exporterar transaktioner som `TD02` om följande villkor är uppfyllda:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:413
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:553
msgid "It is an invoice."
msgstr "Det är en faktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:414
msgid "All invoice lines are related to down payment sales order lines."
msgstr ""
"Alla fakturarader är relaterade till rader för försäljningsorder med "
"förskottsbetalning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:419
msgid "TD04 - credit notes"
msgstr "TD04 - kreditfakturor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:421
msgid ""
"It is the standard scenario for all **credit notes** issued to **domestic** "
"clients, when we need to formally acknowledge that the seller is reducing or "
"cancelling a previously issued invoice, for example, in case of overbilling, "
"incorrect items, or overpayment. Just like invoices, they must be sent to "
"the |SdI|, their :guilabel:`Document Type` `TD04`"
msgstr ""
"Det är standardscenariot för alla **kreditfakturor** som utfärdas till "
"**inhemska** kunder, när vi behöver formellt bekräfta att säljaren minskar "
"eller annullerar en tidigare utfärdad faktura, till exempel vid "
"överfakturering, felaktiga artiklar eller överbetalning. Precis som fakturor "
"måste de skickas till |SdI|, deras :guilabel:`dokumenttyp` `TD04`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:429
msgid "TD07, TD08, TD09 - simplified invoicing"
msgstr "TD07, TD08, TD09 - förenklad fakturering"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:431
msgid ""
"Simplified invoices (`TD07`), credit notes (`TD08`), and debit notes "
"(`TD09`) can be used to certify domestic transactions under 400 EUR (VAT "
"included). Its status is the same as that of a regular invoice, but with "
"fewer information requirements."
msgstr ""
"Förenklade fakturor (`TD07`), kreditnotor (`TD08`) och debetnotor (`TD09`) "
"kan användas för att attestera inhemska transaktioner under 400 EUR "
"(inklusive moms). Dess status är densamma som för en vanlig faktura, men med "
"färre informationskrav."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:435
msgid "For a simplified invoice to be established, it must include:"
msgstr ""
"För att en förenklad faktura ska kunna upprättas måste den innehålla "
"följande:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:437
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer Invoice` reference: **unique** numbering sequence with "
"**no gaps**."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kundfaktura` referens: **unik** nummerserie **utan luckor**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:438
msgid ":guilabel:`Invoice Date`: issue **date** of the invoice."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fakturadatum`: **datum** för utfärdande av fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:439
msgid ""
":ref:`Company Info <general/companies/company>`: the **seller**'s full "
"credentials (VAT/TIN number, name, full address)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Företagsinformation <general/companies/company>`: **säljarens** "
"fullständiga uppgifter (momsregistreringsnummer/skatteidentifieringsnummer, "
"namn, fullständig adress)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:441
msgid ":guilabel:`VAT`: the **buyer**'s VAT/TIN number (on the partner form)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Moms`: **köparens** momsregistreringsnummer/"
"skatteidentifieringsnummer (på partnerformuläret)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:442
msgid ":guilabel:`Total`: the total **amount** (VAT included) of the invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Total`: det totala **beloppet** (inklusive moms) på fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:444
msgid ""
"In the :abbr:`EDI (Electronic Data Interchange)`, Odoo exports invoices as "
"simplified if:"
msgstr ""
"I :abbr:`EDI (Electronic Data Interchange)` exporterar Odoo fakturor som "
"förenklade if:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:446
msgid "It is a domestic transaction (i.e., the partner is from Italy)."
msgstr "Det är en inhemsk transaktion (dvs. partnern är från Italien)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:447
msgid ""
"Your company's **required fields** (:guilabel:`VAT Number` "
"or :guilabel:`Codice Fiscale`, :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime`, and full "
"**address**) are provided."
msgstr ""
"Ditt företags **obligatoriska fält** (:guilabel:`momsregistreringsnummer` "
"eller :guilabel:`Codice Fiscale`, :guilabel:`skatteregim` och fullständig "
"**adress**) är angivna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:449
msgid ""
"The partner's address is not fully specified (i.e., it misses the City or "
"the ZipCode)."
msgstr ""
"Partnerns adress är inte fullständigt angiven (dvs. den saknar stad eller "
"postnummer)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:450
msgid "The total amount of VAT included is **less** than **400 EUR**."
msgstr "Det totala beloppet inklusive moms är **mindre** än **400 EUR**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:453
msgid ""
"The 400 EUR threshold was defined in `the decree of the 10th of May 2019 in "
"the Gazzetta Ufficiale <https://www.gazzettaufficiale.it/eli/id/"
"2019/05/24/19A03271/sg>`_. We advise you to check the current official value."
msgstr ""
"Tröskeln på 400 EUR definierades i \"dekretet av den 10 maj 2019 i Gazzetta "
"Ufficiale <https://www.gazzettaufficiale.it/eli/id/2019/05/24/19A03271/"
"sg>`_. Vi råder dig att kontrollera det aktuella officiella värdet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:460
msgid "TD16 - internal reverse charge"
msgstr "TD16 - inhemsk omvänd skattskyldighet"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:462
msgid ""
"Internal **reverse charge** transactions (see :ref:`localizations/italy/tax-"
"exemption` and :ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`) are exported as "
"`TD16` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"Inhemska transaktioner med **omvänd skattskyldighet** "
"(se :ref:`localizations/italy/tax-exemption` och :ref:`localizations/italy/"
"reverse-charge`) exporteras som `TD16` om följande villkor är uppfyllda:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:466
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:485
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:501
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:522
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:588
msgid "It is a vendor bill."
msgstr "Det är en leverantörsfaktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:467
msgid ""
"It has at least **one tax** on the invoice lines that targets one of "
"these :ref:`tax grids <localizations/italy/grids>`: `VJ6`, `VJ7`, `VJ8`, "
"`VJ12`, `VJ13`, `VJ14`, `VJ15`, `VJ16`, `VJ17`"
msgstr ""
"Den har **åtminstone en moms** på fakturaraderna som riktar sig mot någon av "
"dessa :ref:`skattetabeller <localizations/italy/grids>`: `VJ6`, `VJ7`, "
"`VJ8`, `VJ12`, `VJ13`, `VJ14`, `VJ15`, `VJ16`, `VJ17`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:473
msgid "TD17 - buying services from abroad"
msgstr "TD17 - köp av tjänster från utlandet"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:475
msgid ""
"When buying **services** from **EU** and **non-EU** countries, the foreign "
"*seller* invoices a service with a **VAT-excluded** price, as it is not "
"taxable in Italy. The VAT is paid by the *buyer* in Italy."
msgstr ""
"Vid köp av **tjänster** från **EU**- och **icke-EU**-länder fakturerar den "
"utländska *säljaren* en tjänst med ett pris som är **exklusive moms**, "
"eftersom den inte är skattepliktig i Italien. Momsen betalas av *köparen* i "
"Italien."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:479
msgid ""
"Within the EU: the *buyer* integrates the invoice received with the **VAT "
"information** due in Italy (i.e., **vendor bill tax integration**)."
msgstr ""
"Inom EU: *köparen* kompletterar den mottagna fakturan med den "
"**momsinformation** som ska betalas i Italien (dvs. **integration av moms på "
"leverantörsfaktura**)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:481
msgid ""
"Non-EU: the *buyer* sends themselves an invoice (i.e., **self-billing**)."
msgstr ""
"Icke-EU: *köparen* skickar en faktura till sig själv (dvs. "
"**självfakturering**)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:483
msgid ""
"Odoo exports a transaction as `TD17` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo exporterar en transaktion som `TD17` om följande villkor är uppfyllda:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:486
msgid ""
"It has at least **one tax** on the invoice lines that targets the tax "
"grid :ref:`VJ3 <localizations/italy/grids>`."
msgstr ""
"Den har **åtminstone en moms** på fakturaraderna som riktar sig mot "
"skattetabellen :ref:`VJ3 <localizations/italy/grids>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:488
msgid ""
"All invoice lines either have :guilabel:`Services` as **products**, or a tax "
"with the :guilabel:`Services` as **tax scope**."
msgstr ""
"Alla fakturarader har antingen :guilabel:`Tjänster` som **produkter** eller "
"en skatt med :guilabel:`Tjänster` som **skatteomfattning**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:494
msgid "TD18 - buying goods from EU"
msgstr "TD18 - köp av varor från EU"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:496
msgid ""
"Invoices issued within the EU follow a **standard format**, therefore only "
"an integration of the existing invoice is required."
msgstr ""
"Fakturor som utfärdas inom EU följer ett **standardformat**, och därför "
"krävs endast en integration av den befintliga fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:499
msgid ""
"Odoo exports a transaction as `TD18` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo exporterar en transaktion som `TD18` om följande villkor är uppfyllda:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:502
msgid "The **partner** is from an **EU** country."
msgstr "**Partnern** är från ett **EU**-land."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:503
msgid ""
"It has at least one tax on the invoice lines that targets the tax "
"grid :ref:`VJ9 <localizations/italy/grids>`."
msgstr ""
"Den har minst en skatt på fakturaraderna som riktar sig mot "
"skattetabellen :ref:`VJ9 <localizations/italy/grids>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:505
msgid ""
"All invoice lines either have :guilabel:`Consumable` as **products**, or a "
"tax with :guilabel:`Goods` as **tax scope**."
msgstr ""
"Alla fakturarader har antingen :guilabel:`Consumable` som **produkter**, "
"eller en skatt med :guilabel:`Goods` som **skatteomfattning**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:511
msgid "TD19 - buying goods from VAT deposit"
msgstr "TD19 - köp av varor från momsdepå"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:513
msgid ""
"Buying **goods** from a **foreign** vendor, but the **goods** are already in "
"**Italy** in a **VAT deposit**."
msgstr ""
"Köper **varor** från en **utländsk** säljare, men **varorna** befinner sig "
"redan i **Italien** i en **VAT-deposition**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:516
msgid ""
"From the EU: the *buyer* integrates the invoice received with the **VAT "
"information** due in Italy (i.e., **vendor bill tax integration**)."
msgstr ""
"Från EU: *köparen* integrerar mottagen faktura med den **momsinformation** "
"som ska betalas i Italien (dvs. **integration av leverantörsfakturaskatt**)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:518
msgid ""
"Non-EU: the *buyer* sends an invoice to *themselves* (i.e., **self-"
"billing**)."
msgstr ""
"Icke-EU: *köparen* skickar en faktura till *sig själv* (d.v.s. "
"**självfakturering**)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:520
msgid ""
"Odoo exports a transaction as a `TD19` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo exporterar en transaktion som en `TD19` om följande villkor är "
"uppfyllda:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:523
msgid ""
"It has at least one tax on the invoice lines that targets the tax "
"grid :ref:`VJ3 <localizations/italy/grids>`."
msgstr ""
"Den har minst en skatt på fakturaraderna som riktar sig mot "
"skattetabellen :ref:`VJ3 <localizations/italy/grids>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:525
msgid ""
"All invoice lines either have :guilabel:`Consumables` as products, or a tax "
"with :guilabel:`Goods` as **tax scope**."
msgstr ""
"Alla fakturarader har antingen :guilabel:`Consumables` som produkter eller "
"en skatt med :guilabel:`Goods` som **tax scope**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:531
msgid "TD24 - deferred invoices"
msgstr "TD24 - uppskjutna fakturor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:533
msgid ""
"The **deferred invoice** is an invoice that is **issued at a later time** "
"than the sale of goods or the provision of services. A **deferred invoice** "
"has to be issued at the latest within the **15th day** of the month "
"following the delivery covered by the document."
msgstr ""
"En **fördröjd faktura** är en faktura som **utställs vid en senare "
"tidpunkt** än försäljningen av varor eller tillhandahållandet av tjänster. "
"En **fördröjd faktura** måste utfärdas senast den **15:e dagen** i den månad "
"som följer på den leverans som omfattas av dokumentet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:537
msgid ""
"It usually is a **summary invoice** containing a list of multiple sales of "
"goods or services carried out in the month. The business is allowed to "
"**group** the sales into **one invoice**, generally issued at the **end of "
"the month** for accounting purposes. Deferred invoices are default for "
"**wholesalers** having recurrent clients."
msgstr ""
"Det är vanligtvis en **sammanfattningsfaktura** som innehåller en lista över "
"flera försäljningar av varor eller tjänster som genomförts under månaden. "
"Företaget får **gruppera** försäljningarna i **en faktura**, som vanligtvis "
"utfärdas i **slutet av månaden** för bokföringsändamål. Uppskjutna fakturor "
"är standard för **grossister** som har återkommande kunder."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:542
msgid ""
"If the goods are transported by a **carrier**, every delivery has an "
"associated **Documento di Transporto (DDT)**, or **Transport Document**. The "
"deferred invoice **must** indicate the details of all the **DDTs** "
"information for better tracing."
msgstr ""
"Om varorna transporteras av en **transportör** har varje leverans ett "
"tillhörande **Documento di Transporto (DDT)**, eller **Transportdokument**. "
"Den fördröjda fakturan **måste** innehålla uppgifter om alla **DDT** för "
"bättre spårning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:547
msgid ""
"E-invoicing of deferred invoices requires the "
"`l10n_it_stock_ddt` :ref:`module <localizations/italy/modules>`. In this "
"case, a dedicated :guilabel:`Document Type` `TD24` is used in the e-invoice."
msgstr ""
"Elektronisk fakturering av uppskjutna fakturor kräver :ref:`modulen "
"<localizations/italy/modules>` `l10n_it_stock_ddt`. I detta fall används en "
"dedikerad :guilabel:`dokumenttyp` `TD24` i e-fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:551
msgid ""
"Odoo exports transactions as `TD24` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo exporterar transaktioner som `TD24` om följande villkor är uppfyllda:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:554
msgid ""
"It is associated with deliveries whose **DDTs** have a **different** date "
"than the issue date of the invoice."
msgstr ""
"Den är kopplad till leveranser vars **DDT** har ett **annat** datum än "
"fakturans utställningsdatum."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:560
msgid "TD28 - San Marino"
msgstr "TD28 - San Marino"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:567
msgid ""
"San Marino and Italy have special agreements on e-invoicing operations. As "
"such, **invoices** follow the regular **reverse charge** rules. You can use "
"the proper :guilabel:`Document Type` depending on the invoice type: `TD01`, "
"`TD04`, `TD05`, `TD24`, `TD25`. Additional requirements are not enforced by "
"Odoo. However, the user is requested by the **State** to:"
msgstr ""
"San Marino och Italien har särskilda avtal om e-fakturering. Som sådana "
"följer **fakturor** de vanliga **reglerna för omvänd debitering**. Du kan "
"använda rätt :guilabel:`Document Type` beroende på fakturatyp: `TD01`, "
"`TD04`, `TD05`, `TD24`, `TD25`. Ytterligare krav verkställs inte av Odoo. "
"Användaren uppmanas dock av **State** att:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:572
msgid "Select a tax with the :guilabel:`Tax Exemption Kind` set to `N3.3`."
msgstr "Välj en skatt med :guilabel:`momsbefrielsetyp` inställd på `N3.3`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:573
msgid "Use the generic |SdI| :guilabel:`Destination Code` `2R4GTO8`."
msgstr "Använd den generiska |SdI| :guilabel:`destinations­koden` `2R4GTO8`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:575
msgid ""
"The invoice is then routed by a dedicated office in San Marino to the "
"correct business."
msgstr ""
"Fakturan vidarebefordras sedan av ett särskilt kontor i San Marino till rätt "
"företag."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:582
msgid ""
"When a **paper bill** is received from San Marino, any Italian company "
"**must** submit that invoice to the |AdE| by indicating the e-"
"invoice's :guilabel:`Document Type` field with the special value `TD28`."
msgstr ""
"När en **pappersfaktura** tas emot från San Marino **måste** alla italienska "
"företag skicka in den fakturan till |AdE| genom att ange e-"
"fakturans :guilabel:`dokumenttyp` med det speciella värdet `TD28`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:586
msgid ""
"Odoo exports a transaction as `TD28` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo exporterar en transaktion som `TD28` om följande villkor är uppfyllda:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:589
msgid ""
"It has at least one tax on the invoice lines that targets the tax "
"grids :ref:`VJ <localizations/italy/grids>`."
msgstr ""
"Den har minst en skatt på fakturaraderna som riktar sig mot "
"skattetabellerna :ref:`VJ <localizations/italy/grids>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:591
msgid "The **country** of the partner is **San Marino**."
msgstr "Partnerns **land** är **San Marino**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:596
msgid "Public administration businesses (B2G)"
msgstr "Offentliga förvaltningsföretag (B2G)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:598
msgid ""
"|PA| businesses are subjected to more control than private businesses as "
"they handle public money coming from taxpayers. The :abbr:`EDI (Electronic "
"Data Interchange)` process adds some steps to the :ref:`regular one "
"<localizations/italy/e-invoicing-process>`, as |PA| businesses can "
"**accept** or **refuse** invoices."
msgstr ""
"|PA|-företag är föremål för mer kontroll än privata företag eftersom de "
"hanterar offentliga pengar som kommer från skattebetalare. :abbr:`EDI-"
"processen (Electronic Data Interchange)` lägger till några steg till "
"den :ref:`vanliga <localizations/italy/e-invoicing-process>`, eftersom |PA|-"
"företag kan **acceptera** eller **avvisa** fakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:604
msgid ""
"|PA| businesses have a 6-digit long :guilabel:`Destination Code`, also "
"called :abbr:`CUU (Codice Univoco Ufficio)`, that is **mandatory**, **PEC** "
"address cannot be used in this case."
msgstr ""
"|PA|-företag har en 6-siffrig :guilabel:`destinationskod`, även "
"kallad :abbr:`CUU (Codice Univoco Ufficio)`, som är **obligatorisk**; "
"**PEC**-adress kan inte användas i detta fall."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:608
msgid ""
"`Complete list of businesses that belong to the Public Administration along "
"with their Destination Code <https://www.agenziaentrate.gov.it/portale/web/"
"guest/aree-tematiche/fatturazione-elettronica>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Komplett lista över företag som tillhör den offentliga förvaltningen "
"tillsammans med deras destinationskod <https://www.agenziaentrate.gov.it/"
"portale/web/guest/aree-tematiche/fatturazione-elettronica>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:614
msgid "CIG, CUP, DatiOrdineAcquisto"
msgstr "CIG, CUP, inköpsorderdata"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:616
msgid ""
"To ensure the effective traceability of payments by public administrations, "
"electronic invoices issued to public administrations must contain:"
msgstr ""
"För att säkerställa en effektiv spårbarhet av betalningar från offentliga "
"förvaltningar måste elektroniska fakturor som utfärdas till offentliga "
"förvaltningar innehålla följande:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:619
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CIG (Codice Identificativo Gara)`, except in cases of exclusion "
"from traceability obligations provided by law n. 136 of August 13, 2010."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`CIG (Codice Identificativo Gara)`, utom i fall av undantag från "
"spårbarhetskrav som föreskrivs i lag nr 136 av den 13 augusti 2010."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:621
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)`, in case of invoices related to "
"public works."
msgstr ""
"Den :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)`, när det gäller fakturor "
"relaterade till offentliga arbeten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:623
msgid ""
"If the XML file requires it, the |AdE| can *only* proceed payments of "
"electronic invoices when the XML file contains a :abbr:`CIG (Codice "
"Identificativo Gara)` and :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)`."
msgstr ""
"Om XML-filen kräver det kan |AdE| *endast* behandla betalningar av "
"elektroniska fakturor när XML-filen innehåller en :abbr:`CIG (Codice "
"Identificativo Gara)` och :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:628
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)` and the :abbr:`CIG (Codice "
"Identificativo Gara)` must be included in one of the `DatiOrdineAcquisto`, "
"`DatiContratto`, `DatiConvenzione`, `DateRicezione`, or "
"`DatiFattureCollegate` XML tags."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)` och :abbr:`CIG (Codice Identificativo "
"Gara)` måste ingå i någon av XML-taggarna `PurchaseOrderData`, "
"`ContractData`, `ConventionData`, `ReceiptDate` eller `InvoiceData`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:632
msgid ""
"These correspond to the elements named :guilabel:`CodiceCUP` "
"and :guilabel:`CodiceCIG` of the electronic invoice XML file, whose table "
"can be found on the government `website <http://www.fatturapa.gov.it/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Dessa motsvarar elementen med namnen :guilabel:`CodiceCUP` "
"och :guilabel:`CodiceCIG` i XML-filen för elektroniska fakturor, vars tabell "
"finns på regeringens webbplats <http://www.fatturapa.gov.it/>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:639
msgid "Split payment"
msgstr "Delad betalning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:641
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Split Payment` mechanism behaves much "
"like :ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`."
msgstr ""
"Mekanismen :guilabel:`delad betalning` fungerar ungefär "
"som :ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:644
msgid ""
"When an Italian company bills a |PA| business - for example, cleaning "
"services for a public building - the |PA| business self-reports the VAT to "
"the Tax Agency themselves, and the vendor just has to select the appropriate "
"tax with the right :guilabel:`Tax Exemption` for their invoice lines."
msgstr ""
"När ett italienskt företag fakturerar ett |PA|-företag - till exempel "
"städtjänster för en offentlig byggnad - självrapporterar |PA|-företaget "
"momsen till skattemyndigheten själva, och leverantören behöver bara välja "
"lämplig skatt med rätt :guilabel:`momsbefrielse` för sina fakturarader."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:649
msgid ""
"The specific :guilabel:`Scissione dei Pagamenti` fiscal position is "
"available to deal with partners belonging to the |PA|."
msgstr ""
"Den specifika skattepositionen :guilabel:`Scissione dei Pagamenti` är "
"tillgänglig för att hantera partners som tillhör |PA|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:660
msgid "Qualified electronic signature"
msgstr "Kvalificerad elektronisk underskrift"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:662
msgid ""
"Invoices and bills intended for the |PA| must include a **qualified "
"electronic signature** when submitted through the |SdI|. This signature is "
"automatically applied in the :abbr:`XAdES (XML Advanced Electronic "
"Signature)` format when the invoice's partner has a 6-digit "
"long :guilabel:`Destination Code` (which indicates a |PA| business)."
msgstr ""
"Fakturor avsedda för |PA| måste innehålla en **kvalificerad elektronisk "
"underskrift** när de skickas via |SdI|. Denna underskrift tillämpas "
"automatiskt i :abbr:`XAdES (XML Advanced Electronic Signature)`-format när "
"fakturans partner har en 6-siffrig :guilabel:`Destination Code` (som "
"indikerar ett |PA|-företag)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:668
msgid ""
"When such an invoice is transmitted to the Tax Agency, the generated `.xml` "
"file is signed on the Odoo servers, returned to the database, and attached "
"to the invoice automatically."
msgstr ""
"När en sådan faktura överförs till skattemyndigheten signeras den genererade "
"`.xml`-filen på Odoo-servrarna, returneras till databasen och bifogas "
"automatiskt till fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:674
msgid "Acceptance or refusal"
msgstr "Godkännande eller avslag"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:676
msgid ""
"After receiving the invoice through the |SdI|, the |PA| business has 15 days "
"to accept the invoice. If it does, then the process ends here. If the |PA| "
"business refuses the invoice, it is still considered valid once it is "
"accepted by the |SdI|. You then have to issue a credit note to compensate "
"and send it to the |SdI|."
msgstr ""
"Efter att ha mottagit fakturan via |SdI| har |PA|-företaget 15 dagar på sig "
"att godkänna fakturan. Om det gör det avslutas processen här. Om |PA|-"
"företaget avslår fakturan anses den fortfarande giltig när den accepteras av "
"|SdI|. Du måste då utfärda en kreditfaktura för att kompensera och skicka "
"den till |SdI|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:684
msgid "Expired terms"
msgstr "Utgångna villkor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:686
msgid ""
"If the |PA| business doesn't reply within 15 days, you need to contact the |"
"PA| business directly, sending them both the invoice and the received "
"deadline notification by email. You can make an arrangement with them and "
"manually set the correct :guilabel:`SdI State` on your invoice."
msgstr ""
"Om |PA|-företaget inte svarar inom 15 dagar måste du kontakta |PA|-företaget "
"direkt och skicka dem både fakturan och den mottagna tidsfristnotifikationen "
"via e-post. Du kan komma överens med dem och manuellt ställa in "
"korrekt :guilabel:`SdI State` på din faktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:693
msgid "Point of sale fiscal printers"
msgstr "Kassasystemets skatteskrivare"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:696
msgid ""
"Fiscal printers are distinct from :doc:`ePOS printers </applications/sales/"
"point_of_sale/hardware_network/receipt_printers>`. The IP address for a "
"fiscal printer should not be entered in the ePOS IP address settings."
msgstr ""
"Fiskala skrivare skiljer sig från :doc:`ePOS-skrivare </applications/sales/"
"point_of_sale/hardware_network/receipt_printers>`. IP-adressen för en fiskal "
"skrivare ska inte anges i inställningarna för ePOS IP-adress."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:700
msgid ""
"Fiscal regulations mandate using certified RT devices, such as RT printers "
"or RT servers, to ensure compliant sales receipts and secure communication "
"with the Tax Authority. These devices automatically transmit fiscal data "
"daily. RT printers, designed for individual POS terminals, handle "
"transactions, print receipts, and report to the authorities, ensuring data "
"integrity and compliance."
msgstr ""
"Skattereglerna kräver användning av certifierade RT-enheter, såsom RT-"
"skrivare eller RT-servrar, för att säkerställa kompatibla "
"försäljningskvitton och säker kommunikation med skattemyndigheten. Dessa "
"enheter överför automatiskt skattedata dagligen. RT-skrivare, utformade för "
"enskilda kassaterminaler, hanterar transaktioner, skriver ut kvitton och "
"rapporterar till myndigheterna, vilket säkerställer dataintegritet och "
"efterlevnad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:708
msgid "Simulation mode"
msgstr "Simuleringsläge"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:711
msgid ""
"Since the simulation mode sends data to the authorities, it should only be "
"enabled at the very start of the printer's configuration process. Once the "
"printer is switched to the production mode, it cannot be reverted to the "
"simulation mode."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom simuleringsläget skickar data till myndigheterna bör det endast "
"aktiveras i början av skrivarens konfigurationsprocess. När skrivaren växlas "
"till produktionsläget kan den inte återställas till simuleringsläget."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:715
msgid ""
"To test the fiscal printer setup with Odoo, configure the fiscal printer in "
"the simulation mode as follows:"
msgstr ""
"För att testa konfigurationen av skatteskrivaren med Odoo, konfigurera "
"skatteskrivaren i simuleringsläget enligt följande:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:718
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:749
msgid ""
"Make sure the fiscal printer is set to its default state: printer on, start-"
"up cycle complete, and no transaction in progress."
msgstr ""
"Se till att skatteskrivaren är inställd i sitt standardtillstånd: skrivaren "
"på, startcykeln slutförd och ingen transaktion pågår."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:720
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:751
msgid "Type `3333`."
msgstr "Skriv `3333`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:721
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:752
msgid ""
"Press :guilabel:`Chiave`. The screen displays :guilabel:`Scelta Funzione`."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på :guilabel:`Chiave`. Skärmen visar :guilabel:`Scelta Funzione`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:722
msgid "Type `14`. The screen displays :guilabel:`Apprendimento`."
msgstr "Skriv `14`. Skärmen visar :guilabel:`Apprendimento`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:723
msgid "Type `62`. The screen displays :guilabel:`Simulazione`."
msgstr "Skriv `62`. Skärmen visar :guilabel:`Simulazione`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:724
msgid "To turn the :guilabel:`no` into a :guilabel:`si`, press :guilabel:`X`."
msgstr ""
"För att ändra :guilabel:`no` till :guilabel:`si`, tryck på :guilabel:`X`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:725
msgid "To confirm, press :guilabel:`Contante`."
msgstr "För att bekräfta, tryck på :guilabel:`Contante`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:726
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:757
msgid "Press :guilabel:`Chiave`."
msgstr "Tryck på :guilabel:`Chiave`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:728
msgid "To configure the printer for production, repeat the steps above."
msgstr "För att konfigurera skrivaren för produktion, upprepa stegen ovan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:731
msgid ""
"To test the printer configuration, the physical device must first be "
"obtained and registered with the relevant authorities."
msgstr ""
"För att testa skrivarkonfigurationen måste den fysiska enheten först "
"erhållas och registreras hos relevanta myndigheter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:737
msgid "Setting up the printer to work with Odoo"
msgstr "Konfigurera skrivaren att fungera med Odoo"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:739
msgid ""
"Fiscal printers are meant to work only in the local network. This means the "
"printer and the device running :doc:`Odoo Point of Sale </applications/sales/"
"point_of_sale>` must be connected to the same network."
msgstr ""
"Fiskala skrivare är avsedda att fungera endast i det lokala nätverket. Detta "
"innebär att skrivaren och enheten som kör :doc:`Odoo Kassa </applications/"
"sales/point_of_sale>` måste vara anslutna till samma nätverk."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:743
msgid ""
"Fiscal printers are typically configured to use HTTP by default. To ensure "
"compatibility with Odoo, the settings must be updated to enable HTTPS "
"support on the printer. This can be done using either the EpsonFPWizard "
"configuration software or the keyboard connected to the printer."
msgstr ""
"Fiskala skrivare är vanligtvis konfigurerade att använda HTTP som standard. "
"För att säkerställa kompatibilitet med Odoo måste inställningarna uppdateras "
"för att aktivera HTTPS-stöd på skrivaren. Detta kan göras med antingen "
"konfigurationsprogramvaran EpsonFPWizard eller tangentbordet som är anslutet "
"till skrivaren."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:747
msgid "To set up the fiscal printer using the keyboard, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"För att installera den fiskala skrivaren med tangentbordet, följ dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:753
msgid "Type `34`. The screen displays :guilabel:`Web Server`."
msgstr "Skriv `34`. Skärmen visar :guilabel:`Web Server`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:754
msgid ""
"Press :guilabel:`Contante` 3 times until the screen displays :guilabel:`Web "
"Server: SSL`."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på :guilabel:`Contante` 3 gånger tills skärmen visar :guilabel:`Web "
"Server: SSL`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:755
msgid "To turn the value `0` into a `1`, press :guilabel:`X`."
msgstr "För att ändra värdet `0` till `1`, tryck på :guilabel:`X`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:756
msgid "To confirm, press :guilabel:`Contante` 3 times."
msgstr "För att bekräfta, tryck på :guilabel:`Contante` 3 gånger."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:759
msgid ""
"Then, log in to the printer with the device that runs :doc:`Odoo Point of "
"Sale </applications/sales/point_of_sale>` so it recognizes the printer's "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"Logga sedan in på skrivaren med enheten som kör :doc:`Odoo Kassa </"
"applications/sales/point_of_sale>` så att den känner igen skrivarens "
"certifikat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:762
msgid "To approve and install the printer's certificate, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"För att godkänna och installera skrivarens certifikat, följ dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:764
msgid ""
"Access the printer by opening a web browser and entering `https://<ip-of-"
"your-printer>` in the address bar. A :guilabel:`Warning: Potential Security "
"Risk Ahead` security message appears."
msgstr ""
"Få åtkomst till skrivaren genom att öppna en webbläsare och ange `https://"
"<ip-of-your-printer>` i adressfältet. Ett "
"säkerhetsmeddelande :guilabel:`Varning: Potentiell säkerhetsrisk` visas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:766
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Advanced` to show the certificate approval options."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Avancerat` för att visa alternativen för godkännande av "
