#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:777
msgid "Ri.Ba. (Ricevuta Bancaria)"
msgstr "Ri.Ba. (Ricevuta Bancaria)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:779
msgid ""
"|Ri.Ba.| is a payment method widely used in Italy where vendors request "
"payments through their bank, which forwards the request to the customer's "
"own bank and takes responsibility for the collection. This enables payment "
"automation and reduces risks for the vendor."
msgstr ""
"|Ri.Ba.| är en betalningsmetod som används i stor utsträckning i Italien där "
"leverantörer begär betalningar genom sin bank, som vidarebefordrar begäran "
"till kundens egen bank och tar ansvar för inkasseringen. Detta möjliggör "
"automatisering av betalningar och minskar riskerna för leverantören."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:783
msgid ""
"The vendor generally uploads a fixed-format text file with the list of "
"payments to the bank's web portal."
msgstr ""
"Leverantören laddar vanligtvis upp en textfil med fast format som innehåller "
"listan över betalningar till bankens webbportal."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:787
msgid ""
"|Ri.Ba.| are exclusively for **domestic payments** in Italy. For recurring "
"international payments, please use `SEPA Direct Debt (SDD) <../accounting/"
"payments/batch_sdd>`_"
msgstr ""
"|Ri.Ba.| är exklusivt för **inhemska betalningar** i Italien. För "
"återkommande internationella betalningar, använd `SEPA-direktdebitering "
"(SDD) <../accounting/payments/batch_sdd>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:795
msgid ""
"Check that the `l10n_it_riba` module is :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera att modulen `l10n_it_riba` är :ref:`installerad <general/"
"install>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:796
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Companies` and "
"select the company that will use |Ri.Ba.|."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Companies` och "
"välj det företag som ska använda |Ri.Ba.|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:798
msgid "Fill out the required :guilabel:`SIA Code`."
msgstr "Fyll i den obligatoriska :guilabel:`SIA-koden`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:0
msgid "The company's SIA code"
msgstr "Företagets SIA-kod"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:804
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`SIA Code` identifies businesses within the Italian banking "
"network and is used to receive money through specific payment methods. It "
"consists of one letter and four digits (e.g., T1234) and can usually be "
"found on the bank's portal or obtained by contacting the bank."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`SIA-koden` identifierar företag inom det italienska banknätverket "
"och används för att ta emot pengar genom specifika betalningsmetoder. Den "
"består av en bokstav och fyra siffror (t.ex. T1234) och finns vanligtvis på "
"bankens portal eller kan erhållas genom att kontakta banken."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:809
msgid "Ensure the Company's bank account has an Italian IBAN."
msgstr "Säkerställ att företagets bankkonto har ett italienskt IBAN."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:812
msgid "How to configure :doc:`Bank Accounts <../accounting/bank>`"
msgstr "Hur man konfigurerar :doc:`bankkonton <../accounting/bank>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:817
msgid "Accept Ri.Ba. for your invoices"
msgstr "Acceptera Ri.Ba. för dina fakturor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:819
msgid ""
"Payments of type |Ri.Ba.| can be registered from the :guilabel:`Invoices` "
"(:menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`)."
msgstr ""
"Betalningar av typen |Ri.Ba.| kan registreras från :guilabel:`Invoices` "
"(:menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:823
msgid ""
"Make sure that your invoice involves a Partner that has a bank account with "
"an Italian IBAN."
msgstr ""
"Se till att din faktura involverar en partner som har ett bankkonto med en "
"italiensk IBAN."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:825
msgid "Then, all Payments must be grouped in a **Batch Payment**."
msgstr "Då måste alla betalningar grupperas i en **batchbetalning**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:828
msgid ":doc:`Batch Payments <../accounting/payments>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Batchbetalningar <../accounting/payments>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:829
msgid ":doc:`Create a Batch Payment <../accounting/payments/batch>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Skapa en batchbetalning <../accounting/payments/batch>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:831
msgid ""
"Once you press the :guilabel:`Validate` button for the Batch Payment, the |"
"Ri.Ba.| file is generated and attached to the Batch Payment, so you can "
"download it and upload it through your bank's web portal."
msgstr ""
"När du trycker på knappen :guilabel:`Validate` för batchbetalningen "
"genereras |Ri.Ba.|-filen och bifogas till batchbetalningen, så att du kan "
"ladda ner den och ladda upp den via din banks webbportal."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:None
msgid "The Ri.Ba. file attached"
msgstr "Den bifogade Ri.Ba.-filen"

