#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:188
msgid ":doc:`../../general/companies`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../allmänt/företag`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:190
msgid ""
"If you have :ref:`multiple companies <accounting/multi-company>`, you can "
"centralize and manage them all on a single Odoo database. The KRA identifies "
"and differentiates the **parent** company from its **subsidiaries** by using "
"IDs. Furthermore, subsidiaries are classified as :ref:`branches <general/"
"companies/branches>` of the parent company."
msgstr ""
"Om du har :ref:`flera företag <accounting/multi-company>` kan du "
"centralisera och hantera dem alla i en enda Odoo-databas. KRA identifierar "
"och särskiljer **moderbolaget** från dess **dotterbolag** genom att använda "
"ID:n. Vidare klassificeras dotterbolagen som :ref:`filialer <general/"
"companies/branches>` till moderbolaget."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:195
msgid ""
"To configure the company's ID, open the **Settings** app, "
"click :guilabel:`Update Info` in the :guilabel:`Companies` section, and "
"search for the :guilabel:`eTIMS Branch Code` field. The **parent company** "
"has a branch ID equal to `00` in a multi-company environment. Companies that "
"are *not* the parent company have a branch ID other than `00` and are "
"assigned an ID by the KRA."
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera företagets ID, öppna appen **Inställningar**, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Uppgradera information` i sektionen :guilabel:`Företag` och "
"sök efter fältet :guilabel:`eTIMS Branch Code`. **Moderbolaget** har ett "
"filial-ID lika med `00` i en fleraföretagsmiljö. Företag som *inte* är "
"moderbolag har ett filial-ID annat än `00` och tilldelas ett ID av KRA."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:200
msgid ""
"To fetch the **branch ID** from the KRA for your non-parent companies, "
"ensure the parent company has a Kenyan :guilabel:`Tax ID` and the OSCU "
"device has been :ref:`initialized <kenya/initialization>`. Then, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Branches` tab and click :guilabel:`Populate from KRA`."
msgstr ""
"För att hämta **filial-ID:t** från KRA för dina icke-moderbolag, se till att "
"moderbolaget har ett kenyanskt :guilabel:`Skattenummer` och att OSCU-enheten "
"har :ref:`initierats <kenya/initialization>`. Gå sedan till "
"fliken :guilabel:`Filialer` och klicka på :guilabel:`Fyll i från KRA`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:205
msgid "The KRA considers each **place of supply** as a separate branch (ID)."
msgstr "KRA betraktar varje **leveransställe** som en separat bransch (ID)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:206
msgid ""
"The **OSCU** device must be :ref:`initialized independently <kenya/"
"initialization>` for each branch."
msgstr ""
"Enheten **OSCU** måste :ref:`initialiseras oberoende av <kenya/"
"initialization>` för varje gren."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:210
msgid "Contact branch ID"
msgstr "ID för kontaktfilial"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:212
msgid ""
"To attribute a branch ID to a contact, access the contact form, go to "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, and enter the branch code in "
"the :guilabel:`eTIMS Branch Code` field."
msgstr ""
"För att tilldela ett filial-ID till en kontakt öppnar du kontaktformuläret, "
"går till fliken :guilabel:`Accounting` och anger filialkoden i "
"fältet :guilabel:`eTIMS Branch Code`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:216
msgid "By default, contacts' branch IDs are set to `OO`."
msgstr "Som standard är kontaktpersonernas filial-ID inställt på `OO`."

