msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Partner Ledger`."
msgstr "Gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Rapportering --> Partnerkonto`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:110
msgid ""
"In the :icon:`fa-calendar` (:guilabel:`Period`) selector, choose the "
