#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:115
msgid ""
"Copy the total :guilabel:`Balance` for those partners for the given period."
msgstr ""
"Kopiera det totala :guilabel:`Saldo` för dessa partner för den angivna "
