#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:350
msgid "MyInvois status"
msgstr "MyInvois-status"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:352
msgid ""
"The current MyInvois status of an invoice or bill is shown in "
"the :guilabel:`MyInvois State` field within the :guilabel:`MyInvois` tab."
msgstr ""
"Den aktuella MyInvois-statusen för en faktura eller leverantörsfaktura visas "
"i fältet :guilabel:`MyInvois-status` på fliken :guilabel:`MyInvois`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:355
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Validation in Progress`: the validation is being processed by "
"MyInvois. A blue :guilabel:`Processing` banner is also displayed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Validering pågår`: valideringen behandlas av MyInvois. En "
"blå :guilabel:`Behandlas` banner visas också."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:357
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Valid`: it is validated by MyInvois. The :guilabel:`Submission "
"UID`, :guilabel:`MyInvois` and :guilabel:`Validation Time` are automatically "
"updated with information from MyInvois."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Giltig`: den är validerad av MyInvois. :guilabel:`Inlämnings-"
"id`, :guilabel:`MyInvois` och :guilabel:`Valideringstid` uppdateras "
"automatiskt med information från MyInvois."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:362
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically checks and updates the status every hour. To update it "
"manually at any time, click :guilabel:`Update MyInvois Status`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo kontrollerar och uppdaterar automatiskt statusen varje timme. För att "
"uppdatera den manuellt när som helst, klicka på :guilabel:`Uppdatera "
"MyInvois-status`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:370
msgid ""
"Sent invoices can be canceled within 72 hours from :guilabel:`Validation "
"time`. In this case, open the invoice and click :guilabel:`Request Cancel`. "
"In the :guilabel:`Cancel document` window, include the "
"cancellation :guilabel:`Reason`, then click :guilabel:`Update Invoice`. "
"The :guilabel:`MyInvois State` is updated to :guilabel:`cancelled`."
msgstr ""
"Skickade fakturor kan annulleras inom 72 timmar "
"från :guilabel:`Valideringstid`. Öppna i så fall fakturan och klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Begär annullering`. I fönstret :guilabel:`Annullera dokument`, "
"ange :guilabel:`Orsak` för annulleringen och klicka sedan "
"på :guilabel:`Uppdatera faktura`. :guilabel:`MyInvois-stat` uppdateras "
"till :guilabel:`annullerad`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:376
msgid "Send credit notes to MyInvois"
msgstr "Skicka kreditfakturor till MyInvois"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:378
msgid ""
"Before sending a credit note, the original invoice must be successfully "
"submitted to MyInvois. Otherwise, the credit note's :guilabel:`MyInvois "
"State` is updated to :guilabel:`Invalid`."
msgstr ""
"Innan en kreditfaktura skickas måste den ursprungliga fakturan ha skickats "
"till MyInvois. Annars uppdateras kreditfakturans :guilabel:`MyInvois-stat` "
"till :guilabel:`Ogiltig`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:381
msgid ""
"While Odoo uses a single :guilabel:`credit note` document, MyInvois "
"categorizes these into two types: :guilabel:`credit note` "
"and :guilabel:`refund note`, depending on how they are reconciled."
msgstr ""
"Medan Odoo använder ett enda :guilabel:`kreditfaktura`-dokument, "
"kategoriserar MyInvois dessa i två typer: :guilabel:`kreditfaktura` "
"och :guilabel:`återbetalningsfaktura`, beroende på hur de avstäms."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:384
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MyInvois Credit Note`: This is created when an Odoo credit note "
"is reconciled with the original invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MyInvois kreditfaktura`: Denna skapas när en Odoo-kreditfaktura "
"avstäms mot den ursprungliga fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:386
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MyInvois Refund Note`: This is created when an Odoo credit note "
"is reconciled with a full payment instead of the original invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MyInvois återbetalningsfaktura`: Denna skapas när en Odoo-"
"kreditfaktura avstäms mot en fullständig betalning istället för den "
"ursprungliga fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:390
msgid ""
"If a credit note is reconciled with only a partial payment before being "
"sent, it is still categorized as a :guilabel:`credit note` in MyInvois."
msgstr ""
"Om en kreditfaktura avstäms mot endast en delbetalning innan den skickas, "
"kategoriseras den fortfarande som en :guilabel:`kreditfaktura` i MyInvois."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:396
msgid ""
"To issue both a credit note and a refund note for the same original invoice:"
msgstr ""
"För att utfärda både en kreditfaktura och en återbetalningsfaktura för samma "
"ursprungliga faktura:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:395
msgid "Create two separate credit notes in Odoo from the original invoice."
msgstr ""
"Skapa två separata kreditfakturor i Odoo från den ursprungliga fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:396
msgid ""
"For a MyInvois :guilabel:`Refund Note`: Register a payment before sending it."
msgstr ""
"För en MyInvois :guilabel:`återbetalningsfaktura`: Registrera en betalning "
"innan den skickas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:397
msgid ""
"For a MyInvois :guilabel:`Credit Note`: Do not register a payment before "
"sending it."
msgstr ""
"För en MyInvois :guilabel:`kreditfaktura`: Registrera inte en betalning "
"innan den skickas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:400
msgid ""
"The same logic applies to credit notes created from bills: if reconciled "
"with a full payment, the credit note becomes a :guilabel:`Self-billed Refund "
"Note`; otherwise, it becomes a :guilabel:`Self-billed Credit Note`."
msgstr ""
"Samma logik gäller för kreditfakturor som skapas från fakturor: om den "
"avstäms mot en fullständig betalning blir kreditfakturan "
"en :guilabel:`egenskapad återbetalningsfaktura`; annars blir den "
"en :guilabel:`egenskapad kreditfaktura`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:405
msgid "Send debit notes to MyInvois"
msgstr "Skicka ändringsfakturor till MyInvois"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:407
msgid ""
":ref:`Issue a debit note from an existing bill or invoice <accounting/"
"credit_notes/issue-debit-note>` and click :guilabel:`Send To MyInvois`. In "
"MyInvois, it appears then as a :guilabel:`Debit Note` if issued from an "
"invoice or a :guilabel:`Self-billed Debit Note` from a vendor bill."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Utfärda en ändringsfaktura från en befintlig faktura eller faktura "
"<accounting/credit_notes/issue-debit-note>` och klicka på :guilabel:`Skicka "
"till MyInvois`. I MyInvois visas den sedan som "
"en :guilabel:`ändringsfaktura` om den utfärdats från en faktura eller "
"en :guilabel:`egenskapad ändringsfaktura` från en leverantörsfaktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:414
msgid "POS workflow"
msgstr "Arbetsflöde för kassasystem"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:416
msgid ""
"Two workflows are available to issue e-invoices in :doc:`Point of Sale "
"<../../sales/point_of_sale>`:"
msgstr ""
"Två arbetsflöden är tillgängliga för att utfärda e-fakturor i :doc:`kassa "
"<../../sales/point_of_sale>`:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:418
msgid ""
":ref:`Individual e-invoice <malaysia/myinvois/pos_workflow/submit>`: Issue "
"an e-invoice immediately for a specific order using the customer's details."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Individuell e-faktura <malaysia/myinvois/pos_workflow/submit>`: "
"Utfärda en e-faktura omedelbart för en specifik beställning med kundens "
"uppgifter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:420
msgid ""
":ref:`Consolidated e-invoice <malaysia/myinvois/pos_workflow/consolidated>`: "
"Create orders as usual, then aggregate them periodically into a single "
"consolidated e-invoice."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Konsoliderad e-faktura <malaysia/myinvois/pos_workflow/consolidated>`: "
"Skapa beställningar som vanligt och aggregera dem sedan periodiskt till en "
"enda konsoliderad e-faktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:426
msgid "Individual e-invoice"
msgstr "Individuell e-faktura"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:428
msgid ""
"To issue an individual e-invoice and send it to MyInvois, :doc:`create an "
"invoice </applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/pos_invoices>`, and ensure "
"the selected customer has a valid :abbr:`TIN (tax identification number)` or "
"**Identification Number**."
msgstr ""
"För att utfärda en individuell e-faktura och skicka den till "
"MyInvois, :doc:`skapa en faktura </applications/sales/point_of_sale/use/"
"pos_invoices>` och se till att den valda kunden har ett "
"giltigt :abbr:`skatteidentifikationsnummer (TIN)` eller "
"**identifikationsnummer**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:433
msgid ""
"If the QR code does not appear on the invoice, the MyInvois validation is "
"still in progress. Odoo automatically retrieves the status in the "
"background. Simply reopen the invoice later to retrieve the validated "
"version with the QR code."
msgstr ""
"Om QR-koden inte visas på fakturan pågår MyInvois-valideringen fortfarande. "
"Odoo hämtar automatiskt statusen i bakgrunden. Öppna helt enkelt fakturan "
"igen senare för att hämta den validerade versionen med QR-koden."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:440
msgid "Consolidated e-invoice"
msgstr "Konsoliderad e-faktura"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:442
msgid ""
"Orders that are not e-invoiced individually can be aggregated into a "
"consolidated e-invoice."
msgstr ""
"Beställningar som inte e-faktureras individuellt kan samlas i en "
"konsoliderad e-faktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:444
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Consolidated "
"Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Kassa --> Beställningar --> Konsoliderad faktura`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:445
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Consolidate Orders` and set the :guilabel:`Date From` "
"and :guilabel:`Date To`."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Konsolidera beställningar` och ställ "
"in :guilabel:`Datum från` och :guilabel:`Datum till`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:446
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Submit to MyInvois`."
msgstr "Klicka på :guilabel:`Skicka in till MyInvois`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:448
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically fetches all eligible POS orders within that timeframe "
"that have not been individually :ref:`invoiced <malaysia/myinvois/"
"pos_workflow/submit>` nor :ref:`refunded <malaysia/myinvois/pos_workflow/"
"refund>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo hämtar automatiskt alla kvalificerade kassabeställningar inom den "
"tidsramen som varken har blivit individuellt :ref:`fakturerade <malaysia/"
"myinvois/pos_workflow/submit>` eller :ref:`återbetalade <malaysia/myinvois/"
"pos_workflow/refund>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:453
msgid ""
"Orders belonging to an :ref:`open POS register <pos/use/open-register>` are "
"not included in the consolidation. :ref:`Close the register <pos/use/"
"register-close>` to include them."
msgstr ""
"Beställningar som tillhör ett :ref:`öppet kassaregister <pos/use/open-"
"register>` ingår inte i konsolideringen. :ref:`Stäng registret <pos/use/"
"register-close>` för att inkludera dem."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:456
msgid ""
"To submit the consolidation, click :guilabel:`Submit to MyInvois` on the "
"form view. For multiple records, click :guilabel:`Consolidated Invoices` to "
"go back to the list view, and select the relevant consolidated invoices. "
"Then, click :guilabel:`Submit to MyInvois`. Consolidated e-invoices are "
"issued to the pre-configured :guilabel:`General Public` contact."
msgstr ""
"För att skicka in konsolideringen, klicka på :guilabel:`Skicka in till "
"MyInvois` i formulärvyn. För flera handlingar, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Konsoliderade fakturor` för att gå tillbaka till listvyn och "
"välj relevanta konsoliderade fakturor. Klicka sedan på :guilabel:`Skicka in "
"till MyInvois`. Konsoliderade e-fakturor emitteras till den "
"förkonfigurerade :guilabel:`Allmänna kontakten`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:464
#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:407
msgid "Refunds"
msgstr "Återbetalning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:466
msgid "To refund a customer, :ref:`process a return <pos/use/refund>`."
msgstr "För att återbetala en kund, :ref:`behandla en retur <pos/use/refund>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:468
msgid ""
"Refunds for orders e-invoiced individually or via consolidation must be "
"issued as e-invoices (Refund Notes). To do so, click :guilabel:`Invoice` "
"before processing the refund."
msgstr ""
"Återbetalningar för beställningar som e-fakturerats individuellt eller via "
"konsolidering måste utfärdas som e-fakturor (kreditfakturor). För att göra "
"detta, klicka på :guilabel:`Faktura` innan du behandlar återbetalningen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:472
msgid "Access invoices via QR code"
msgstr "Få åtkomst till fakturor via QR-kod"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:474
msgid ""
"When a document is successfully submitted to MyInvois, a QR code is added to "
"its PDF version. Scanning this code links directly to the validated document "
"in MyInvois."
msgstr ""
"När ett dokument har skickats till MyInvois läggs en QR-kod till i dess PDF-"
"version. Genom att skanna denna kod länkas direkt till det validerade "
"dokumentet i MyInvois."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:477
msgid "To download the PDF from an invoice or bill:"
msgstr "För att ladda ner PDF:en från en faktura eller faktura:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:479
msgid "Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon"
msgstr "Klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(kugghjul)`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:480
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Download`"
msgstr "Välj :guilabel:`Ladda ner`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:481
msgid "Choose either :guilabel:`PDF` or :guilabel:`PDF without Payment`"
msgstr "Välj antingen :guilabel:`PDF` eller :guilabel:`PDF utan betalning`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:None
msgid "MyInvois QR code"
msgstr "MyInvois QR-kod"

