#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:106
msgid ""
"The Odoo Mexican localization modules allow for the signing of electronic "
"invoices, according to the specifications of the |SAT| for `version 4.0 of "
"the CFDI <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/ tramitesyservicios/Paginas/documentos/"
"Anexo_20_Guia_de_llenado_CFDI.pdf>`_, a legal requirement, as of January 1, "
"2022. These modules also add relevant accounting reports including the |"
"DIOT|, enable foreign trade, and enable the creation of delivery guides."
msgstr ""
"Odoo:s mexikanska lokaliseringsmoduler möjliggör signering av elektroniska "
"fakturor, enligt specifikationerna från |SAT| för `version 4.0 av CFDI "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/ tramitesyservicios/Paginas/documentos/"
"Anexo_20_Guia_de_llenado_CFDI.pdf>`_, ett lagkrav sedan 1 januari 2022. "
"Dessa moduler lägger också till relevanta bokföringsrapporter inklusive |"
"DIOT|, aktiverar utrikeshandel och möjliggör skapandet av leveransguider."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:113
msgid ""
"In order to electronically sign any documents in Odoo, the Sign application "
"must be installed."
msgstr ""
"För att elektroniskt signera dokument i Odoo måste applikationen "
"Underskrifter vara installerad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:119
msgid ""
":doc:`Mexican Payroll signing and configurations <../../hr/payroll/"
"payroll_localizations/mexico>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Mexikansk signering och konfigurationer för löner <../../hr/payroll/"
"payroll_localizations/mexico>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:125
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Krav och önskemål"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:127
msgid ""
"It is necessary to meet the following requirements before configuring the "
"Mexican localization modules in Odoo:"
msgstr ""
"Det är nödvändigt att uppfylla följande krav innan du konfigurerar de "
"mexikanska lokaliseringsmodulerna i Odoo:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:130
msgid "Be registered in the |SAT| with a valid |RFC|."
msgstr "Vara registrerad i |SAT| med ett giltigt |RFC|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:131
msgid ""
"Have a `Certificado de Sello Digital / Digital Seal Certificate <https://"
"www.gob.mx/sat/acciones-y-programas/certificado-de-sello-digital>`_ (CSD)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:133
msgid ""
"Choose a |PAC|. Currently, Odoo works with the following |PAC|\\s: `Solución "
"Factible <https://solucionfactible.com/contenido/productos/timbrado/"
"general#dos>`_, `Quadrum <https://cfdiquadrum.com.mx/odoo/>`_, and `SW "
"Sapien - Smarter Web <https://info.sw.com.mx/sw-smarter-odoo>`_."
msgstr ""
"Välj en |PAC|. För närvarande fungerar Odoo med följande |PAC|\\s: `Solución "
"Factible <https://solucionfactible.com/contenido/productos/timbrado/"
"general#dos>`_, `Quadrum <https://cfdiquadrum.com.mx/odoo/>`_ och `SW Sapien "
"- Smarter Web <https://info.sw.com.mx/sw-smarter-odoo>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:143
msgid ""
"After installing the correct modules, the next step is to verify that the "
"company is configured with the correct data. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Companies`, and select "
"the company to configure."
msgstr ""
"Efter att ha installerat rätt moduler är nästa steg att verifiera att "
"företaget är konfigurerat med korrekt data. Gå "
"till :menuselection:`Inställningar --> Användare & Företag --> Företag` och "
"välj företaget som ska konfigureras."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:147
msgid ""
"Enter the full :guilabel:`Address` in the resulting form, "
"including: :guilabel:`ZIP` code, :guilabel:`State`, :guilabel:`Country`, and "
"|RFC| (:guilabel:`Tax ID` number)."
msgstr ""
"Ange den fullständiga :guilabel:`Adressen` i formuläret, "
"inklusive: :guilabel:`Postnummer`, :guilabel:`Stat`, :guilabel:`Land` och |"
"RFC| (:guilabel:`Skattenummer`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:150
msgid ""
"According to the requirements of the |CFDI| 4.0, the name of the main "
"company contact **must** match the business name registered in the |SAT|, "
"without the legal entity abbreviation. This is the same for "
"the :guilabel:`ZIP` code."
msgstr ""
"Enligt kraven för |CFDI| 4.0 **måste** namnet på huvudkontakten för "
"företaget matcha företagsnamnet som är registrerat i |SAT|, utan förkortning "
"för juridisk form. Detsamma gäller för :guilabel:`Postnumret`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:155
msgid ""
"From a legal point of view, Mexican companies **must** use the local "
"currency (MXN). To use another currency, let MXN be the default currency and "
"use a :doc:`pricelist <../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Ur juridisk synvinkel **måste** mexikanska företag använda den lokala "
"valutan (MXN). För att använda en annan valuta, låt MXN vara standardvalutan "
"och använd en :doc:`prislista <../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/"
"pricing>` istället."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:159
msgid ""
"Next, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Settings`, and scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`MX Electronic invoicing` section. Under :guilabel:`Service "
"Tax Administration (SAT)`, select the :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime` that applies "
"to the company from the drop-down list, and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"Gå sedan till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Inställningar` och scrolla till "
"sektionen :guilabel:`MX Elektronisk fakturering`. Under :guilabel:`Service "
"Tax Administration (SAT)`, välj den :guilabel:`Skattemyndighetsregim` som "
"gäller för företaget från rullgardinsmenyn och klicka på :guilabel:`Spara`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:164
msgid ""
"To test the Mexican localization, make sure the following fields are filled "
"in:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:166
msgid ":guilabel:`Company form`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:168
msgid ":guilabel:`Company Name`: enter `INNOVACION VALOR Y DESARROLLO SA SA`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:169
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Address`: fill in all fields with a real address in Mexico, and "
"`58000` as :guilabel:`Zip`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:171
msgid ":guilabel:`RFC`: enter `IVD920810GU2`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:173
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`MX Electronic invoicing` section. In "
"the :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime` field, select :guilabel:`General de Ley "
"Personas Morales`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:180
msgid ""
"When using branches, invoicing information is taken from the main company "
"except for the zip code. Unless the |RFC| is set on the branch, then Odoo "
"uses the branch information instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:183
msgid ""
"Branches enable users to establish multiple brands within the same parent "
"company. Additionally, when different fiscal regimes are required for "
"invoicing purposes, it is necessary to create a branch for each regime. By "
"default, the regime is inherited from the parent company. However, if the "
"regime is explicitly set on the branch, Odoo adopts the regime applicable to "
"that branch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:194
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the **Contacts** application to access "
"contact records."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Installera <general/install>` applikationen **Kontakter** för att "
"komma åt kontakthandlingar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:196
msgid ""
"To create a contact that can be invoiced, go to "
"the :menuselection:`Contacts` app and click :guilabel:`New`. Then, enter the "
"contact name, full :guilabel:`Address` including the :guilabel:`ZIP` "
"code, :guilabel:`State`, :guilabel:`Country`, and |RFC| (:guilabel:`Tax ID`)."
msgstr ""
"För att skapa en kontakt som kan faktureras, gå till "
"appen :menuselection:`Kontakter` och klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa`. Ange sedan "
"kontaktnamnet, fullständig :guilabel:`Adress` "
"inklusive :guilabel:`Postnummer`, :guilabel:`Stat`, :guilabel:`Land` och |"
"RFC| (:guilabel:`Skattenummer`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:201
msgid ""
"As with the company itself, all contacts must have their correct business "
"name registered in the |SAT|. The :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime` must also be "
"added in the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab."
msgstr ""
"Precis som för företaget självt måste alla kontakter ha sitt korrekta "
"företagsnamn registrerat hos |SAT|. :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime` måste också "
"läggas till i fliken :guilabel:`Försäljning & Inköp`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:205
msgid ""
"Having a |RFC| (:guilabel:`Tax ID`) set but no :guilabel:`Country` "
"configured may result in incorrect invoices."
msgstr ""
"Att ha ett |RFC| (:guilabel:`Skattenummer`) inställt men "
"ingen :guilabel:`Land` konfigurerad kan resultera i felaktiga fakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:213
msgid ""
"In order to properly sign invoices, set the :ref:`Factor Type <l10n/mx/"
"factor-type>` and :ref:`Tax Object <l10n/mx/tax-object>` fields on sales "
"taxes."
msgstr ""
"För att korrekt signera fakturor, ställ in fälten :ref:`Factor Type <l10n/mx/"
"factor-type>` och :ref:`Tax Object <l10n/mx/tax-object>` på "
"försäljningsmomsar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:217
msgid ""
"RESICO ISR withholdings and some |IEPS| taxes are created automatically, but "
"the feature is not active by default. To enable it, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"RESICO ISR-innehållningar och vissa |IEPS|-skatter skapas automatiskt, men "
"funktionen är inte aktiv som standard. För att aktivera den, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Skatter`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:223
msgid "Factor type"
msgstr "Typ av faktor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:225
msgid ""
"Both the **Factor Type** and **SAT Tax Type** fields are pre-loaded in the "
"default taxes."
msgstr ""
"Både fälten **Factor Type** och **SAT Tax Type** är förladdade i "
"standardskatterna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:227
msgid ""
"For new taxes, set these fields in :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxes` and click :guilabel:`New`. Set the :guilabel:`Tax "
"Type` to :guilabel:`Sales`. In the :guilabel:`Advanced Options` tab, "
"fill :guilabel:`SAT Tax Type` and :guilabel:`Factor Type` fields."
msgstr ""
"För nya skatter, ställ in dessa fält i :menuselection:`Bokföring --> "
"Konfiguration --> Skatter` och klicka på :guilabel:`Ny`. Ställ "
"in :guilabel:`Skattetyp` till :guilabel:`Försäljning`. I "
"fliken :guilabel:`Avancerade alternativ`, fyll i fälten :guilabel:`SAT Tax "
"Type` och :guilabel:`Factor Type`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:231
msgid ""
"Odoo supports four groups of :guilabel:`SAT Tax "
"Types`: :guilabel:`IVA`, :guilabel:`ISR`, :guilabel:`IEPS`, "
"and :guilabel:`Local Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo stöder fyra grupper av :guilabel:`SAT Tax "
"Types`: :guilabel:`IVA`, :guilabel:`ISR`, :guilabel:`IEPS` "
"och :guilabel:`Lokala skatter`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:234
msgid ""
"If the factor type is :guilabel:`Quota`, standard calculation methods cannot "
"be used. Instead, set the tax calculation computation to :guilabel:`Custom "
"Formula`."
msgstr ""
"Om faktortypen är :guilabel:`Quota` kan standardberäkningsmetoder inte "
"användas. Ställ istället in skatteberäkningen till :guilabel:`Anpassad "
"formel`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:238
msgid ""
"result = quantity * 6.455\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"result = quantity * 6.455\n"
"\n"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:241
msgid "*quantity* = the number of items in the transaction"
msgstr "*quantity* = antalet artiklar i transaktionen"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:242
msgid "*6.455* = the quota value (a fixed amount per unit)"
msgstr "*6.455* = kvotavärdet (ett fast belopp per enhet)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:243
msgid "Only per-unit quotas are supported, not quotas based on other factors"
msgstr "Endast kvoter per enhet stöds, inte kvoter baserade på andra faktorer"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:246
msgid ""
"Mexico manages two different kinds of 0% VAT to accommodate two scenarios:"
msgstr ""
"Mexiko hanterar två olika typer av 0% moms för att tillgodose två scenarier:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:248
msgid "For *0% VAT*, set the :guilabel:`Factor Type` to :guilabel:`Tasa`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:249
msgid ""
"For *VAT Exempt*, set the :guilabel:`Factor Type` to :guilabel:`Exento`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:252
msgid ""
"Local taxes are generated in a separate node in the XML file, these do not "
"get validated by the |PAC|."
msgstr ""
"Lokala skatter genereras i en separat nod i XML-filen, dessa valideras inte "
"av |PAC|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:256
msgid ""
"Quotas and custom formulas require the :guilabel:`Define Taxes as Python "
"Code` module. See :doc:`Taxes <../accounting/taxes>`."
msgstr ""
"Kvoter och anpassade formler kräver modulen :guilabel:`Define Taxes as "
"Python Code`. Se :doc:`Skatter <../accounting/taxes>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:262
msgid "Tax object"
msgstr "Skatteobjekt"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:264
msgid ""
"One requirement of the CFDI 4.0 is that the resulting XML file handles the "
"breakdown of taxes of the operation in accordance with the regulation. There "
"are eight different possible values that are added in the XML file:"
msgstr ""
"Ett krav för CFDI 4.0 är att den resulterande XML-filen hanterar "
"nedbrytningen av skatter för processen i enlighet med regelverket. Det finns "
"åtta olika möjliga värden som läggs till i XML-filen:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:268
msgid ""
"`01`: No tax Object: This value is added automatically if the invoice line "
"doesn't contain any taxes."
msgstr ""
"`01`: No tax Object: Detta värde läggs till automatiskt om fakturaraden inte "
"innehåller några skatter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:270
msgid ""
"`02`: Tax Object: This is the default configuration of any invoice line that "
"contains taxes."
msgstr ""
"`02`: Tax Object: Detta är standardkonfigurationen för alla fakturarader som "
"innehåller skatter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:271
msgid ""
"`03`: Tax Object and doesn't require breakdown: This can only be added "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"`03`: Tax Object and doesn't require breakdown: Detta kan endast läggas till "
"manuellt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:272
msgid "`04`: Tax Object and doesn't have tax: This can only be added manually."
msgstr ""
"`04`: Skatteobjekt och har ingen skatt: Detta kan endast läggas till "
"manuellt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:273
msgid "`05`: Tax Object, VAT for PODEBI: This can only be added manually."
msgstr ""
"`05`: Momsobjekt, moms för PODEBI: Denna kan endast läggas till manuellt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:274
msgid ""
"`06`: VAT Object, No VAT forwarded: This object is selected when there is an "
"ISR withholding and no VAT tax."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:276
msgid ""
"`07`: No VAT forwarded, |IEPS| breakdown: This object is selected when there "
"is an ISR withholding, |IEPS| tax and no VAT tax."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:278
msgid ""
"`08`: No VAT forwarded, |IEPS| breakdown: This object can only be added "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"`08`: Ingen moms vidarebefordrad, |IEPS|-nedbrytning: Detta objekt kan "
"endast läggas till manuellt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:281
msgid "Using either 01, 03, 04, or 05 removes the tax node from the XML file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:284
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`IEPS breakdown` status affects the behavior of the tax "
"objects due to the missing |IEPS| when the breakdown does not happen."
msgstr ""
"Statusen :guilabel:`IEPS-nedbrytning` påverkar beteendet för momsobjekt på "
"grund av att |IEPS| saknas när nedbrytningen inte sker."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:290
msgid "Local taxes"
msgstr "Lokala skatter"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:292
msgid ""
"Local taxes (e.g., *ISH*, *Cedullar*) require a separate XML node and may "
"not follow standard tax logic."
msgstr ""
"Lokala skatter (t.ex. *ISH*, *Cedullar*) kräver en separat XML-nod och "
"kanske inte följer standardskattlogik."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:295
msgid ""
"When configuring a local tax, its name appears in the local tax complement. "
"The rate is treated as a withholding if negative, or carried forward if "
"positive."
msgstr ""
"Vid konfigurering av en lokal skatt visas dess namn i den lokala "
"skattetillägget. Anropet behandlas som en innehållning om det är negativt, "
"eller förs vidare om det är positivt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:301
msgid "IEPS breakdown"
msgstr "IEPS-nedbrytning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:303
msgid ""
"By default Odoo hides the |IEPS| in the invoices so that the subtotal on "
"which the VAT is calculated includes the amount of |IEPS|, this is to ensure "
"that Fiscal Regimes that do not require it, do not receive it."
msgstr ""
"Som standard döljer Odoo |IEPS| i fakturorna så att delsumman som momsen "
"beräknas på inkluderar beloppet för |IEPS|, detta för att säkerställa att "
"skatteregimer som inte kräver det inte får det."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:307
msgid ""
"It is possible to make the |IEPS| visible in the XML by selecting "
"the :guilabel:`IEPS Breakdown` checkbox inside each contact on "
"the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab."
msgstr ""
"Det är möjligt att göra |IEPS| synlig i XML:en genom att markera "
"kryssrutan :guilabel:`IEPS-nedbrytning` i varje kontakt på "
"fliken :guilabel:`Försäljning och inköp`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:311
msgid ""
"When using either :ref:`eCommerce invoicing <l10n/mx/ecommerce>` or "
"the :ref:`Self invoicing portal <l10n/mx/pos/portal>`, the customer has the "
"option to decide whether or not to have the |IEPS| breakdown."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:318
msgid "Other tax configurations"
msgstr "Andra skattekonfigurationer"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:320
msgid ""
"The Mexican Localization uses :doc:`cash basis taxes <../../finance/"
"accounting/taxes/cash_basis>`. When registering a payment, Odoo carries out "
"the movement of taxes from the *Cash Basis Transition Account* to the "
"account set in the :guilabel:`Definition` tab of the tax record set on the "
"invoice or bill line. For such movement, a tax base account is used: "
"(:guilabel:`899.01.99 Base Imponible de Impuestos en Base a Flujo de "
"Efectivo`) in the journal entry when reclassifying taxes. **Do not delete "
"this account**."
msgstr ""
"Den mexikanska lokaliseringen använder :doc:`kontantmetodens skatter <../../"
"finance/accounting/taxes/cash_basis>`. När en betalning registreras utför "
"Odoo flytten av skatter från *kontantmetodens övergångskonto* till kontot "
"som angetts på fliken :guilabel:`Definition` i skatteposten som satts på "
"faktura- eller fakturaraden. För denna flytt används ett skattebasnekonto: "
"(:guilabel:`899.01.99 Base Imponible de Impuestos en Base a Flujo de "
"Efectivo`) i verifikationen vid omklassificering av skatter. **Radera inte "
"detta konto**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:330
msgid "Withholdings"
msgstr "Innehållningar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:332
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo includes withholdings with special distributions to "
"allocate VAT."
msgstr ""
"Som standard inkluderar Odoo innehållningar med särskilda fördelningar för "
"att tilldela moms."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:334
msgid ""
"When registering an invoice, add the withholding and its corresponding VAT. "
"Both must be included on the vendor bill to ensure correct accounting. "
"Using :doc:`fiscal positions <../accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>` is "
"recommended so the cash-basis entry properly splits the distribution."
msgstr ""
"När du registrerar en faktura, lägg till innehållningen och dess motsvarande "
"moms. Båda måste inkluderas på leverantörsfakturan för att säkerställa "
"korrekt bokföring. Användning av :doc:`skatteområden <../accounting/taxes/"
"fiscal_positions>` rekommenderas så att kontantmetodens inlägg korrekt delar "
"upp fördelningen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:340
msgid ""
"For a lease vendor bill of `10000 MXN`, the `10.67%` lease withholding "
"corresponds to a `16% VAT 2/3 H`. Both taxes must be applied together to "
"reflect the correct accounting."
msgstr ""
"För en leverantörsfaktura för hyra på `10000 MXN` motsvarar innehållningen "
"för hyra på `10,67%` en `16% moms 2/3 H`. Båda skatterna måste tillämpas "
"tillsammans för att återspegla korrekt bokföring."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Cash Basis entry with VAT split between paid and due."
msgstr "Kontantmetodens inlägg med moms uppdelad mellan betald och förfallen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:347
msgid ""
"Withholdings |CFDI| is not currently supported. Consult with an accountant "
"about the proper distribution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:353
msgid ""
"To configure products, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> "
"Products`. Open an existing product or click :guilabel:`New`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, set the :guilabel:`UNSPSC Product Category`. "
"Products and categories can be set manually, or through :doc:`a bulk import "
"<../../essentials/export_import_data>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:359
msgid ""
"All products need to have a |SAT| code associated with them in order to "
"prevent validation errors."
msgstr ""
"Alla produkter måste ha en |SAT|-kod associerad med sig för att undvika "
"valideringsfel."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:370
msgid "PAC credentials"
msgstr "PAC-legitimation"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:372
msgid ""
"After processing the `Private Key (CSD) <https://sat.gob.mx/portal/public/"
"tramites/certificado-de-sello-digital>`_ with the |SAT|, register directly "
"with a :ref:`PAC <l10n/mx/requirements>` before creating any invoices in "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:376
msgid ""
"Once an account has been created with any of these providers, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and navigate "
"to the :guilabel:`MX Electronic invoicing` section. Under "
"the :guilabel:`Authorized Certification Provider (PAC)` section, enter the "
"name of your |PAC| with the corresponding credentials (:guilabel:`PAC "
"username` and :guilabel:`PAC password`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Configuring PAC credentials from the Accounting settings."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera PAC-autentiseringsuppgifter från inställningarna för redovisning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:385
msgid ""
"To test the electronic invoicing without credentials, activate "
"the :guilabel:`MX PAC test environment` checkbox, and "
"select :guilabel:`Solucion Factible` as the :guilabel:`PAC`. It is not "
"required to add a username or password for a test environment."
msgstr ""
"För att testa den digitala faktureringen utan uppgifter, aktivera "
"kryssrutan :guilabel:`MX PAC-testmiljö` och välj :guilabel:`Solucion "
"Factible` som :guilabel:`PAC`. Det är inte obligatoriskt att lägga till ett "
"användarnamn eller lösenord för en testmiljö."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:392
msgid ".cer and .key certificates"
msgstr ".cer- och .key-certifikat"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:394
msgid ""
"The `digital certificates of the company <https://www.gob.mx/tramites/ficha/"
"certificado-de-sello-digital/SAT139>`_ must be uploaded within "
"the :guilabel:`Certificates` section. To do so, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Settings --> General Settings --> Certificates and Keys`."
msgstr ""
"`Företagets digitala certifikat <https://www.gob.mx/tramites/ficha/"
"certificado-de-sello-digital/SAT139>`_ måste laddas upp i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Certifiering`. För att göra detta, navigera "
"till :menuselection:`Inställningar --> Allmänna inställningar --> Certifikat "
"och nycklar`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:399
msgid ""
"Under :guilabel:`Manage your certificates`, click the :icon:`fa-right-"
"arrow` :guilabel:`Keys` link to access the :guilabel:`Keys` list view. "
"Click :guilabel:`Create`, upload the digital :guilabel:`Key file` "
"(:file:`.key` file), add a :guilabel:`Name` to the key, and enter "
"the :guilabel:`Private key password`."
msgstr ""
"Under :guilabel:`Hantera dina certifikat`, klicka på länken :icon:`fa-right-"
"arrow` :guilabel:`Nycklar` för att komma åt listvyn :guilabel:`Nycklar`. "
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa`, ladda upp den digitala :guilabel:`Nyckelfilen` "
"(:file:`.key`-filen), lägg till ett :guilabel:`Namn` till nyckeln och "
"ange :guilabel:`Privat nyckellösenord`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:404
msgid ""
"From :menuselection:`Settings --> General Settings --> Certificates and "
"Keys`, select :guilabel:`Certificates` to access the :guilabel:`Certificate` "
"list view. Click :guilabel:`Create`, upload the "
"digital :guilabel:`Certificate` (:file:`.cer` file), add a :guilabel:`Name` "
"to the certificate, and select the :guilabel:`Private Key` created on the "
"previous step from the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"Från :menuselection:`Inställningar --> Allmänna inställningar --> Certifikat "
"och nycklar`, välj :guilabel:`Certifiering` för att komma åt "
"listvyn :guilabel:`Certifikat`. Klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa`, ladda upp det "
"digitala :guilabel:`Certifikatet` (:file:`.cer`-filen), lägg till "
"ett :guilabel:`Namn` till certifikatet och välj den :guilabel:`Privata "
"nyckel` som skapades i föregående steg från rullgardinsmenyn."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:411
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Certificate Password` and :guilabel:`Public Key` fields "
"on :guilabel:`Certificate` records are optional."
msgstr ""
"Fälten :guilabel:`Certifikatlösenord` och :guilabel:`Offentlig nyckel` "
"på :guilabel:`Certifikat`-handlingar är valfria."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:415
msgid ""
"To test the electronic invoicing, the following |SAT| test certificates are "
"provided and can be tested with either :guilabel:`Quadrum` "
"or :guilabel:`Solución Factible` as PAC:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:418
msgid ":download:`Certificate <mexico/certificate.cer>`"
msgstr ":download:`Certificate <mexico/certificate.cer>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:419
msgid ":download:`Certificate Key <mexico/certificate.key>`"
msgstr ":download:`Certifikatnyckel <mexico/certificate.key>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:420
msgid "**Password**: ``12345678a``"
msgstr "**Lösenord**: ``12345678a``"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:430
msgid ""
"The invoicing process in Odoo is based on `Annex 20 <http://"
"omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/anexo_20.htm>`_ version 4.0 of "
"electronic invoicing of the |SAT|."
msgstr ""
"Faktureringsprocessen i Odoo baseras på `Annex 20 <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/"
"tramitesyservicios/Paginas/anexo_20.htm>`_ version 4.0 av elektronisk "
"fakturering av |SAT|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:439
msgid ""
"To start invoicing from Odoo, a customer invoice must be created using "
"the :doc:`standard invoicing flow <../accounting/customer_invoices>`."
msgstr ""
"För att börja fakturera från Odoo måste en kundfaktura skapas med hjälp "
"av :doc:`standardflödet för fakturering <../accounting/customer_invoices>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:442
msgid ""
"While the document is in draft mode, changes can be made to it, some fields "
"take values previously set on the sale order or the contact."
msgstr ""
"Medan dokumentet är i utkastläge kan ändringar göras i det, vissa fält tar "
"värden som tidigare ställts in på ordern eller kontakten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:445
msgid "The fields that need to be reviewed are:"
msgstr "Fälten som behöver granskas är:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:447
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1689
msgid ":guilabel:`CFDI to public`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:448
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1690
msgid ":guilabel:`Usage`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:449
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1688
msgid ":guilabel:`Payment Policy`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:450
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Method`, if :guilabel:`Payment Policy` is not set as |PPD|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:453
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Usage`, :guilabel:`Payment Policy` and :guilabel:`Payment Method` "
"can be previously set on a sale order and/or can be set on the contact for "
"every invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Användning`, :guilabel:`Betalningspolicy` "
"och :guilabel:`Betalningsmetod` kan tidigare ställas in på en order och/"
"eller kan ställas in på kontakten för varje faktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:456
msgid ""
"The payment policy is a selectable field on the invoice and can be manually "
"set to the required policy, however if no policy is selected, Odoo will "
"compute an automatic policy based on the following general rules:"
msgstr ""
"Betalningspolicyn är ett valbart fält på fakturan och kan manuellt ställas "
"in på den obligatoriska policyn, men om ingen policy väljs kommer Odoo att "
"beräkna en automatisk policy baserat på följande allmänna regler:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:460
msgid ""
"The value will be set to |PUE| if the due date in which the payment is "
"expected is within the current month, in case the date is outside the "
"current month, the policy will be set to |PPD| instead."
msgstr ""
"Värdet kommer att ställas in på |PUE| om förfallodatumet då betalningen "
"förväntas är inom den aktuella månaden, om datumet är utanför den aktuella "
"månaden kommer policyn att ställas in på |PPD| istället."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:465
msgid ""
"If the payment policy is not selected and |PPD| policy is expected, either "
"select an invoice :guilabel:`Due Date` on a different month than the current "
"one, or choose :guilabel:`Payment terms` that imply changing the due month "
"(i.e., :guilabel:`30 Days`, or :guilabel:`15 Days`, as long as they fall on "
"the next month)."
msgstr ""
"Om betalningspolicyn inte är vald och |PPD|-policy förväntas, välj antingen "
"ett :guilabel:`Förfallodatum` för fakturan i en annan månad än den aktuella, "
"eller välj :guilabel:`Betalningsvillkor` som innebär att förfallomånaden "
"ändras (dvs. :guilabel:`30 dagar` eller :guilabel:`15 dagar`, så länge de "
"infaller nästa månad)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:470
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Confirm` in the customer invoice, click "
"the :guilabel:`Send` button to process the invoice with the government. Make "
"sure that the :guilabel:`CFDI` checkbox is marked."
msgstr ""
"Efter att ha klickat på :guilabel:`Bekräfta` i kundfakturan, klicka på "
"knappen :guilabel:`Skicka` för att behandla fakturan hos myndigheten. Se "
"till att kryssrutan :guilabel:`CFDI` är markerad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "CFDI Checkbox"
msgstr "CFDI-kryssruta"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:476
msgid ""
"After receiving the signed document back from the government, "
"the :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` field appears on the document, and the XML file "
"appears both in the |CFDI| tab and attached in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"Efter att ha mottagit det signerade dokumentet tillbaka från myndigheten "
"visas fältet :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` på dokumentet, och XML-filen visas "
"både i fliken |CFDI| och bifogad i händelseflödet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:480
msgid ""
"If an email address is configured on the customer contact record, marking "
"the :guilabel:`by Email` and :guilabel:`CFDI` checkboxes sends both the XML "
"and PDF files together."
msgstr ""
"Om en e-postadress är konfigurerad i kundens kontaktpost, skickas både XML- "
"och PDF-filerna tillsammans genom att markera kryssrutorna :guilabel:`via e-"
"post` och :guilabel:`CFDI`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:483
msgid "To download the PDF file locally, click the :guilabel:`Print` button."
msgstr ""
"För att ladda ner PDF-filen lokalt, klicka på knappen :guilabel:`Skriv ut`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:486
msgid ""
"When clicking :guilabel:`Update SAT`, the :guilabel:`SAT status` field on "
"the invoice confirms if the XML file is **Validated** in the |SAT|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:489
msgid ""
"On a testing environment, the message :guilabel:`Not Found` commonly appears."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:492
msgid ""
"Invoices with a :guilabel:`Country` different from Mexico or missing "
"the :guilabel:`Zip` field in the customer form are classified "
"as :guilabel:`CFDI to public` and addressed to a generic customer. "
"The :guilabel:`CFDI to public` checkbox stays active on the invoice form "
"until valid partner information is provided. Once the contact information "
"for a national customer is complete, the checkbox is automatically "
"deactivated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:503
msgid ""
"In the Mexican localization, :doc:`cash rounding <../../finance/accounting/"
"customer_invoices/cash_rounding>` is supported using the :guilabel:`Add a "
"rounding line` method. This adds a rounding line that changes the paid "
"amount, but does not change the amount in the |CFDI|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:513
msgid ""
"While an invoice is a document type \"I\" (Ingreso), a credit note is a "
"document type \"E\" (Egreso)."
msgstr ""
"En faktura är en dokumenttyp \"I\" (Ingreso), medan en kreditfaktura är en "
"dokumenttyp \"E\" (Egreso)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:515
msgid ""
"An addition to the :doc:`standard flow for credit notes <../accounting/"
"customer_invoices/credit_notes>` is that, as a requirement of the |SAT|, "
"there has to be a relation between a credit note and an invoice through the "
"fiscal folio."
msgstr ""
"Ett tillägg till :doc:`standardflödet för kreditfakturor <../accounting/"
"customer_invoices/credit_notes>` är att, som ett krav från |SAT|, måste det "
"finnas en relation mellan en kreditfaktura och en faktura genom den "
"skattemässiga folion."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:519
msgid ""
"Because of this requirement, the field :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` adds this "
"relation with a `01|`, followed by the fiscal folio of the "
"original :abbr:`UUID (universally unique identifier)`."
msgstr ""
"På grund av detta krav lägger fältet :guilabel:`CFDI-ursprung` till denna "
"relation med en `01|`, följt av den skattemässiga folion för det "
"ursprungliga :abbr:`unikt användar-ID (universally unique identifier)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:522
msgid ""
"When creating credit notes, make sure the line description clearly indicates "
"its purpose and specifies which entry applies to a bonus, discount, or "
"refund."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:526
msgid ""
"For the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field to be automatically added, use "
"the :guilabel:`Add Credit Note` button from the invoice, instead of creating "
"it manually."
msgstr ""
"För att fältet :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` ska läggas till automatiskt, använd "
"knappen :guilabel:`Add Credit Note` från fakturan, istället för att skapa "
"det manuellt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:529
msgid ""
"Generally credit notes reverse the main sales account defined in the "
"journal, but it is also possible to globally assign an account to all credit "
"notes. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` and set the :guilabel:`Credit notes` account under "
"the :guilabel:`Default Accounts` section."
msgstr ""
"I allmänhet återkallar kreditfakturor det huvudsakliga försäljningskontot "
"som definierats i journalen, men det är också möjligt att globalt tilldela "
"ett konto till alla kreditfakturor. För att göra detta, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar` och ange "
"kontot för :guilabel:`Kreditfakturor` under "
"avsnittet :guilabel:`Standardkonton`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:535
msgid ""
"On the default configuration, the credit notes account is set "
"as :guilabel:`402.01.01 Returns, discounts or bonuses over sales and/or "
"services at the general rate`."
msgstr ""
"I standardkonfigurationen är kreditfakturornas konto inställt "
"som :guilabel:`402.01.01 Returer, rabatter eller bonusar på försäljning och/"
"eller tjänster till den allmänna taxan`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:539
msgid "The :guilabel:`Payment Policy` can be manually forced before stamping."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:546
msgid ""
"Vendor bills must have a fiscal folio for reports and payments to work "
"correctly. If the vendor bill was created by the Purchase app or added "
"manually, add the XML file of the invoice to the chatter **as a log note**. "
"This updates the fiscal folio accordingly. The bill **must be in draft "
"state** for the update to happen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:552
msgid ""
"When clicking :guilabel:`Update SAT`, the :guilabel:`SAT status` field on "
"the invoice will confirm if the XML file is **Validated** by the |SAT|, this "
"is also true for vendor bills."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på :guilabel:`Uppdatera SAT`, kommer fältet :guilabel:`SAT-"
"status` på fakturan att bekräfta om XML-filen är **Validerad** av |SAT|, "
"detta gäller även för leverantörsfakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:556
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/vendor_bills`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/vendor_bills`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:563
msgid ""
"The module :guilabel:`EDI for Mexico (Advanced Features)` "
"(`l10n_mx_edi_extended`) must be installed on the database to complete "
"the :guilabel:`Address Issued` field on the sales journal. This ensures that "
"all invoices from that sales journal, as well as :ref:`global invoices <l10n/"
"mx/global-invoice>`, use the correct ZIP code when generating the CFDI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:568
msgid ""
"To invoice within a company under different time zones with the same user, "
"create a system parameter to ensure the correct time zone is applied when "
"invoicing, as the user's time zone is used by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:572
msgid ""
"To do so, enable :doc:`developer mode <../../general/developer_mode>` and go "
"to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> System Parameters`. "
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a new parameter with the key "
"`l10n_mx_edi_tz_XX` where `XX` is the ID of the journal, and set the desired "
"time zone as the value, for example, “America/Tijuana”."
msgstr ""
"För att göra detta, aktivera :doc:`utvecklarläge <../../general/"
"developer_mode>` och gå till :menuselection:`Inställningar --> Tekniskt --> "
"Systemparametrar`. Klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa` för att skapa en ny parameter "
"med nyckeln `l10n_mx_edi_tz_XX` där `XX` är journalens ID, och ange önskad "
"tidszon som värde, till exempel \"America/Tijuana\"."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:585
msgid "Payment policy"
msgstr "Betalningspolicy"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:587
msgid ""
"One addition of the Mexican localization is the :guilabel:`Payment Policy` "
"field. `According to the SAT documentation <https://www.sat.gob.mx/consultas/"
"92764/comprobante-de-recepcion-de-pagos>`_, there are two types of payments:"
msgstr ""
"Ett tillägg i den mexikanska lokaliseringen är "
"fältet :guilabel:`Betalningspolicy`. `Enligt SAT-dokumentationen <https://"
"www.sat.gob.mx/consultas/92764/comprobante-de-recepcion-de-pagos>`_ finns "
"det två typer av betalningar:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:591
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PUE` (Pago en una Sola Exhibición/Payment in a Single Exhibition)"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`PUE` (Pago en una Sola Exhibición/Betalning i en enda omgång)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:592
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PPD` (Pago en Parcialidades o Diferido/Payment in Installments or "
"Deferred)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:595
msgid ""
"Payment complements are only generated if the policy of the invoice is set "
"to |PPD|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Example of an invoice with the PUE requirements."
msgstr "Exempel på en faktura med PUE-krav."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:600
msgid ""
"If the invoice has a due date outside the current month, it will default to |"
"PPD|."
msgstr ""
"Om fakturan har ett förfallodatum utanför den aktuella månaden, blir det som "
"standard |PPD|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Example of an invoice with the PPD requirements."
msgstr "Exempel på en faktura med PPD-krav."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:608
msgid "Payment flow"
msgstr "Betalningsflöde"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:610
msgid ""
"In both cases, the payment process in Odoo :doc:`is the same <../accounting/"
"payments>`, the main difference being payments related to |PPD| invoices, by "
"law, need to be sent to the government as a document type \"P\" (Pago)."
msgstr ""
"I båda fallen :doc:`är betalningsprocessen i Odoo densamma <../accounting/"
"payments>`, den huvudsakliga skillnaden är att betalningar relaterade till |"
"PPD|-fakturor enligt lag måste skickas till myndigheten som dokumenttyp "
"\"P\" (Pago)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:614
msgid ""
"If a payment is related to a |PUE| invoice, it can be registered through the "
"payment popup, and be associated with the corresponding invoice. To do so, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`, and "
"select an invoice. Then, click the :guilabel:`Pay` button to open the "
"payment popup, set the :guilabel:`Payment Way` and any other fields, and "
"click :guilabel:`Create Payment`."
msgstr ""
"Om en betalning är relaterad till en |PUE|-faktura kan den registreras genom "
"betalningspopupen och associeras med motsvarande faktura. För att göra "
"detta, navigera till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Kunder --> Fakturor` och "
"välj en faktura. Klicka sedan på knappen :guilabel:`Betala` för att öppna "
"betalningspopupen, ställ in :guilabel:`Betalningssätt` och eventuella andra "
"fält, och klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa betalning`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:621
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/payments`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/payments`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:622
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/bank/reconciliation`"
msgstr ":doc:`../redovisning/bank/avstämning`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:624
msgid ""
"While this process is the same for PPD invoices, the addition of creating "
"an :doc:`electronic document <../accounting/customer_invoices/"
"electronic_invoicing>` means some additional requirements are needed to "
"correctly send the document to the |SAT|."
msgstr ""
"Även om denna process är densamma för PPD-fakturor innebär tillägget att "
"skapa ett :doc:`elektroniskt dokument <../accounting/customer_invoices/"
"electronic_invoicing>` att vissa ytterligare krav behövs för att korrekt "
"skicka dokumentet till |SAT|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:628
msgid ""
"From a legal perspective, PPD invoices **must** include the "
"specific :guilabel:`Payment Way` that the payment was received. Because of "
"this, the :guilabel:`Payment Way` field **cannot** be set as :guilabel:`To "
"Define`, thus the field will become invisible when selecting it."
msgstr ""
"Ur ett juridiskt perspektiv **måste** PPD-fakturor inkludera det "
"specifika :guilabel:`Betalningssätt` som betalningen mottogs med. På grund "
"av detta **kan inte** fältet :guilabel:`Betalningssätt` ställas in "
"som :guilabel:`Att definiera`, därför blir fältet osynligt när det väljs."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:633
msgid ""
"If a bank account number is required, add it in the :guilabel:`Accounting` "
"tab of a customer's contact record."
msgstr ""
"Om ett bankkontonummer krävs, lägg till det i fliken :guilabel:`Bokföring` i "
"en kunds kontaktpost."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:635
msgid ""
"The exact configurations are in the `Anexo 20 of the SAT <http://"
"omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/anexo_20.htm>`_. Usually, "
"the :guilabel:`Bank Account` needs to be 10 or 18 digits for transfers, 16 "
"for credit or debit cards."
msgstr ""
"De exakta konfigurationerna finns i `Anexo 20 of the SAT <http://"
"omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/anexo_20.htm>`_. Vanligtvis "
"behöver :guilabel:``Bank Account`` vara 10 eller 18 siffror för "
"överföringar, 16 för kredit- eller betalkort."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:640
msgid ""
"If a fully-reconciled payment is related to an invoice with "
"a :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio`, the :guilabel:`Update Payments` appears. Click "
"the :guilabel:`Update Payments` button to send the **payment complement** "
"XML file to the government automatically and display it in the |CFDI| tab in "
"both the invoice and the payment."
msgstr ""
"Om en helt avstämd betalning är relaterad till en faktura med "
"en :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio`, visas :guilabel:`Uppdatera betalningar`. Klicka "
"på knappen :guilabel:`Uppdatera betalningar` för att automatiskt skicka XML-"
"filen för **betalningstillägget** till myndigheten och visa den i fliken |"
"CFDI| i både fakturan och betalningen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:645
msgid ""
"Similar to an invoice or credit note, the PDF and XML can be sent to the "
"final customer. To do so, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon "
"to open the actions drop-down menu and select :guilabel:`Send receipt by "
"email` from the payment view."
msgstr ""
"Precis som en faktura eller kreditfaktura kan PDF-filen och XML-filen "
"skickas till slutkunden. För att göra detta, klicka på :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`(kugghjul)`-ikonen för att öppna åtgärdsmenyn och "
"välj :guilabel:`Skicka inleverans via e-post` från betalningsvyn."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:649
msgid ""
"To download the payment PDF from the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab on the invoice, "
"regardless of whether the payment was created with or without "
"reconciliation, click :guilabel:`Print`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Example of the print button on the CFDI tab."
msgstr "Exempel på utskriftsknappen på fliken CFDI."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:658
msgid "Payment cancellations"
msgstr "Annullering av betalning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:660
msgid ""
"To cancel :ref:`payment complements <l10n/mx/payment-flow>`, go to "
"the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab of the related invoice and click :guilabel:`Cancel` "
"on the line of the payment complement."
msgstr ""
"Pro zrušení :ref:`doplňků plateb <l10n/mx/payment-flow>` přejděte na "
"kartu :guilabel:`CFDI` příslušné faktury a klikněte na :guilabel:`Avbryt` na "
"řádku doplňku platby."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:663
msgid ""
"Like with invoices, go to the payment and click :guilabel:`Update SAT` to "
"change the :guilabel:`SAT Status` and :guilabel:`Status` "
"to :guilabel:`Cancelled`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:667
msgid ""
"When substituting a payment complement, unreconcile the current payment. "
"Then, to link the new payment to the original document, add `04|` followed "
"by the fiscal folio in the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field. If the new payment "
"is signed after the substituted document is linked, the older payment is "
"cancelled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:677
msgid ""
"Factoring is a financial transaction in which a business sells its accounts "
"receivable (outstanding invoices) to a specialized financial institution, "
"known as a *factor*, to gain immediate liquidity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:680
msgid "To record a payment for financial factoring, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:682
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`Default Accounts` section and ensure "
"a :guilabel:`Factoring account`  is selected in the :guilabel:`Factoring "
"account` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:685
msgid ""
"From the Accounting Dashboard, click :guilabel:`Bank` on its corresponding "
"Kanban card to manually :ref:`add a transaction line <accounting/"
"transactions/register>` and record the factoring payment. Complete the "
"following fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:689
msgid ":guilabel:`Label`: Enter a brief description of the transaction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:690
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Partner`: Select the financial institution (factor) that will "
"purchase the debt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:691
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amount`: Enter the actual amount to be received by the factor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:694
msgid ""
"The currency of the factoring payment **must** match the bank journal's "
"currency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:696
msgid ""
"In the newly created transaction line, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-"
"v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon and select :guilabel:`Reconcile`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:698
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Search: Journal Items to Match` window, remove "
"the :guilabel:`Partner` filter, select the related invoices to be paid by "
"the factor, and click :guilabel:`Select`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:702
msgid "Do not select the tax lines related to the invoices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:704
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Distribute Payment` window, fill in the following fields "
"to distribute the payment on the selected invoices:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:707
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amount`: Enter the amount that will actually be received from the "
"factor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:708
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Compensation`: Enter the compensation that was paid to the factor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:711
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Amount` and :guilabel:`Compensation` amounts are provided by "
"the factor and are stated on the factoring receipt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:713
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Amount` and :guilabel:`Compensation` amounts equal "
"the :guilabel:`Due` amount. If it exceeds the :guilabel:`Due` amount, the "
"line is highlighted in red."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:716
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`To distribute` field should balance the :guilabel:`Amount` to "
"the transaction amount entered, ensuring it equals zero."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:721
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Bank Matching` view, the factoring payment is then "
"reconciled with the relevant invoices, and the factoring commission is "
"allocated to the :guilabel:`Factoring` account set up."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:724
msgid ""
"To generate the XML file, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> "
"Invoices`, access one of the paid invoices, and click :guilabel:`Update "
"Payments`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:728
msgid ""
"The factoring company can retain a portion of the invoice amount, referred "
"to as aforo, until the end customer completes payment. The retained balance "
"is then released to the vendor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:730
msgid ""
"For multi-currency factoring, use the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` "
"(:guilabel:`adjust settings`) button in the :guilabel:`Distribute Payment` "
"window and add the :guilabel:`Due (Company)` column to display the due "
"amount in the company's currency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:738
msgid "Invoice cancellations"
msgstr "Annullering av fakturor"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:740
msgid ""
"It is possible to cancel the EDI documents sent to the |SAT|. According to "
"the `Reforma Fiscal 2022 <https://www.sat.gob.mx/consultas/91447/nuevo-"
"esquema-de-cancelacion>`_, since January 1st, 2022, there are two "
"requirements for this:"
msgstr ""
"Det är möjligt att avbryta EDI-dokument som skickas till |SAT|. Enligt "
"`Reforma Fiscal 2022 <https://www.sat.gob.mx/consultas/91447/nuevo-esquema-"
"de-cancelacion>`_, sedan den 1 januari 2022, finns det två krav för detta:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:744
msgid "All cancellation requests require a *cancellation reason*."
msgstr "Alla annulleringsförfrågningar kräver en *annulleringsorsak*."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:745
msgid ""
"After 24 hours from the invoice creation, the client must be asked to "
"approve the cancellation. If there is no response within 72 hours, the "
"cancellation is processed automatically."
msgstr ""
"Efter 24 timmar från fakturans skapande måste kunden tillfrågas om att "
"godkänna annulleringen. Om inget svar kommer inom 72 timmar behandlas "
"annulleringen automatiskt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:748
msgid ""
"Invoice cancellations are updated automatically in Odoo, but the update can "
"take some time. To check the cancellation status, click :guilabel:`Update "
"SAT`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:751
msgid "Invoice cancellations can be made for one of the following reasons:"
msgstr "Fakturaannulleringar kan göras av någon av följande anledningar:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:753
msgid "01 - Invoice issued with errors (with related document)"
msgstr "01 - Faktura emitterad med fel (med relaterat dokument)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:754
msgid "02 - Invoice issued with errors (no replacement)"
msgstr "02 - Faktura emitterad med fel (ingen ersättning)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:755
msgid "03 - The operation was not carried out"
msgstr "03 - Processen utfördes inte"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:756
msgid "04 - Nominative operation related to the global invoice"
msgstr "04 - Nominativ process relaterad till den globala fakturan"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:758
msgid ""
"To initiate a cancellation, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --"
"> Invoices`, select the posted invoice to cancel, and "
"click :guilabel:`Request Cancel`. Then, refer to the :ref:`l10n/mx/01-"
"invoice-cancellation` or :ref:`l10n/mx/02-03-04-invoice-cancellation` "
"sections, depending on the cancellation reason."
msgstr ""
"För att inleda en annullering, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Kunder "
"--> Fakturor`, välj den bokförda fakturan att annullera och klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Begär annullering`. Referera sedan till avsnitten :ref:`l10n/"
"mx/01-invoice-cancellation` eller :ref:`l10n/mx/02-03-04-invoice-"
"cancellation`, beroende på annulleringsorsaken."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:764
msgid ""
"Alternatively, request a cancellation from the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Cancel` on the line item."
msgstr ""
"Alternativt kan du begära en annullering från fliken :guilabel:`CFDI` genom "
"att klicka på :guilabel:`Avbryt` på radobjektet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:768
msgid ""
"If a cancellation is requested on a locked period, the CFDI will be "
"cancelled but not the accounting entry."
msgstr ""
"Om en annullering begärs under en låst period kommer CFDI:n att annulleras "
"men inte verifikationen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:770
msgid ""
"If the client rejects the cancellation, the invoice cancellation line item "
"is removed from the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab."
msgstr ""
"Om kunden avvisar annulleringen tas fakturaannulleringens radobjekt bort "
"från fliken :guilabel:`CFDI`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:776
msgid "Cancellation reason 01"
msgstr "Annulleringsorsak 01"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:778
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Request CFDI Cancellation` pop-up window, "
"select :guilabel:`01 - Invoice issued with errors (with related document)` "
"from the :guilabel:`Reason` field and click :guilabel:`Create Replacement "
"Invoice` to create a new draft invoice. This new draft invoice replaces the "
"previous invoice, along with the related |CFDI|."
msgstr ""
"I popup-fönstret :guilabel:`Begär CFDI-annullering`, välj :guilabel:`01 - "
"Faktura emitterad med fel (med relaterat dokument)` från "
"fältet :guilabel:`Orsak` och klicka på :guilabel:`Skapa ersättningsfaktura` "
"för att skapa ett nytt fakturautkast. Detta nya fakturautkast ersätter den "
"tidigare fakturan tillsammans med tillhörande |CFDI|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:782
msgid ":guilabel:`Confirm` the draft and :guilabel:`Send` the invoice."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Bekräfta` utkastet och :guilabel:`skicka` fakturan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:783
msgid ""
"The substituted invoice automatically cancels the original invoice once the "
"new one is signed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:785
msgid ""
"The invoice cancellation is then generated with a reason line item in "
"the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab."
msgstr ""
"Zrušení faktury je poté vygenerováno s položkou důvodu na "
"kartě :guilabel:`CFDI`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Canceled invoice line item in the CFDI tab."
msgstr "Položka zrušené faktury na kartě CFDI."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:791
msgid ""
"When using the :guilabel:`01 - Invoice issued with errors (with related "
"document)` cancellation reason, the `04|` prefix appears in "
"the :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` field. This is an internal prefix used by Odoo "
"to complete the cancellation and **does not** mean that the cancellation "
"reason was :guilabel:`04 - Nominative operation related to the global "
"invoice`."
msgstr ""
"Při použití důvodu zrušení :guilabel:`01 - Faktura emitovaná s chybami (s "
"příslušným dokladem)` se v poli :guilabel:`Fiskální folio` objeví prefix `04|"
"`. Jedná se o interní prefix používaný systémem Odoo k dokončení zrušení a "
"**neznamená**, že důvodem zrušení byl :guilabel:`04 - Nominativní proces "
"související s globální fakturou`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:799
msgid "Cancellation reasons 02, 03, and 04"
msgstr "Důvody zrušení 02, 03 a 04"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:801
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Request CFDI Cancellation` pop-up window, select the "
"desired cancellation :guilabel:`Reason` and :guilabel:`Confirm` the "
"cancellation."
msgstr ""
"V dialogovém okně :guilabel:`Žádost o zrušení CFDI` vyberte "
"požadovaný :guilabel:`Důvod` zrušení a :guilabel:`Bekräfta` zrušení."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:804
msgid ""
"Upon doing so, the invoice cancellation is generated with a reason line item "
"in the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab."
msgstr ""
"Po provedení tohoto kroku je vygenerováno zrušení faktury s položkou důvodu "
"na kartě :guilabel:`CFDI`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:808
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`SAT Status` goes back to **Validated** it could be due to "
"one of these three reasons:"
msgstr ""
"Pokud se :guilabel:`SAT-status` vrátí zpět na **Validerad**, může to být "
"způsobeno jedním z těchto tří důvodů:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:811
msgid ""
"The invoice is labeled as *No Cancelable* in the `SAT Website <https://"
"www.sat.gob.mx/home>`_. due to the fact that it has a valid related "
"document: Either another invoice linked with the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` "
"field or a Payment Complement. If so, cancel any other related document "
"first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:815
msgid ""
"The cancellation request is still being processed by the |SAT|. If so, wait "
"a few minutes and try again."
msgstr ""
"Žádost o zrušení je stále zpracovávána systémem |SAT|. Pokud ano, počkejte "
"několik minut a zkuste to znovu."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:817
msgid ""
"The final customer needs to reject or accept the cancellation request in "
"their `Buzón Tributario <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/BuzonTributario/Paginas/"
"servicios_disponibles.html>`_. This can take up to 72 hours. If the "
"cancellation request is rejected, repeat the process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:822
msgid ""
"`Tool to validate Mexican Electronic Documents (CFDI) status <https://"
"verificacfdi.facturaelectronica.sat.gob.mx/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Nástroj pro ověření stavu mexických elektronických dokumentů (CFDI) "
"<https://verificacfdi.facturaelectronica.sat.gob.mx/>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:825
msgid ""
"For the cancellation reasons **02**, **03** and **04**, "
"the :guilabel:`Create Replacement Invoice` button is replaced by "
"a :guilabel:`Confirm` button that requests the cancellation immediately."
msgstr ""
"U důvodů zrušení **02**, **03** a **04** je tlačítko :guilabel:`Vytvořit "
"náhradní fakturu` nahrazeno tlačítkem :guilabel:`Bekräfta`, které okamžitě "
"vyžádá zrušení."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:828
msgid ""
"Both the current :guilabel:`State` and :guilabel:`Cancellation Reason` can "
"be found in the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab."
msgstr ""
"Aktuální :guilabel:`Stat` i :guilabel:`Důvod zrušení` lze nalézt na "
"kartě :guilabel:`CFDI`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Old invoice with CFDI Origin."
msgstr "Stará faktura s CFDI Origin."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:837
msgid "Cancellation acknowledgement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:839
msgid ""
"To print a cancellation |PAC| response after cancelling a |CFDI|, "
"click :guilabel:`Print` on the corresponding cancellation line in "
"the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab of the invoice form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:842
msgid ""
"To include the current :guilabel:`SAT status` in the PDF, "
"click :guilabel:`Update SAT` in the invoice form. Note that when a payment "
"is reviewed, the invoice status is updated accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Cancellation acknowledgement example."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:849
msgid ""
"A cancellation acknowledgement confirms that the cancellation was requested "
"successfully, but it is *not* definitive proof that the CFDI has been fully "
"cancelled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:855
msgid "Invoicing special use cases"
msgstr "Särskilda användningsfall för fakturering"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:860
msgid "CFDI relations"
msgstr "Vztahy CFDI"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:862
msgid ""
"To relate the current document to previously signed CFDIs, fill in "
"the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field on the invoice and specify the relation "
"using one of the seven available values:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:865
msgid "01: Nota de crédito"
msgstr "01: Nota de crédito"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:866
msgid "02: Nota de débito de los documentos relacionados"
msgstr "02: Debetnota för relaterade dokument"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:867
msgid "03: Devolución de mercancía sobre facturas o traslados previos"
msgstr "03: Returvaror från tidigare fakturor eller överföringar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:868
msgid "04: Sustitución de los CFDI previos"
msgstr "04: Ersättning av tidigare CFDI"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:869
msgid "05: Traslados de mercancias facturados previamente"
msgstr "05: Varuleveranser som fakturerats tidigare"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:870
msgid "06: Factura generada por los traslados previos"
msgstr "06: Faktura genererad från tidigare överföringar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:871
msgid "07: CFDI por aplicación de anticipo"
msgstr "07: CFDI för tillämpning av förskottsbetalning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:874
msgid ""
"The format is: Origin Type|UUID1, UUID2, ...., UUIDn where more than one "
"Origin Type can be added."
msgstr ""
"Formatet är: Ursprungstyp|UUID1, UUID2, ...., UUIDn där mer än en "
"ursprungstyp kan läggas till."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:878
msgid "Here is an example with two relations:"
msgstr "Här är ett exempel med två relationer:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:885
msgid "The first section has relation type **04** with **1 UUID**"
msgstr "Den första sektionen har relationstyp **04** med **1 UUID**"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:886
msgid "The second section has relation type **07** with **2 UUIDs**"
msgstr "Den andra sektionen har relationstyp **07** med **2 UUID:er**"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:888
msgid "Additionally any combination is also visible on the signed PDF."
msgstr "Dessutom visas även alla kombinationer i den signerade PDF:en."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Example of the PDF with 3 relations."
msgstr "Exempel på PDF med 3 relationer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:898
msgid ""
"The main :guilabel:`Currency` in Mexico is MXN. While this is mandatory for "
"all Mexican companies, it is possible to send and receive invoices (and "
"payments) in different currencies. To enable the use of :doc:`multicurrency "
"<../accounting/get_started/multi_currency>`, navigate to "
"the :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Currencies`, and "
"set :guilabel:`[MX] Bank of Mexico` as the :guilabel:`Service` in "
"the :guilabel:`Automatic Currency Rates` section. Then, set "
"the :guilabel:`Interval` field to the desired frequency to update the "
"exchange rates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:905
msgid ""
"This way, the XML file of the document will have the correct exchange rate, "
"and the total amount, in both the foreign currency and in MXN."
msgstr ""
"På så sätt kommer XML-filen för dokumentet att ha rätt växelkurs och det "
"totala beloppet, både i den utländska valutan och i MXN."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:908
msgid ""
"It is highly recommended to use separate :doc:`bank accounts for each "
"currency <../accounting/bank/foreign_currency>`."
msgstr ""
"Det rekommenderas starkt att använda separata :doc:`bankkonton för varje "
"valuta <../accounting/bank/foreign_currency>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:912
msgid ""
"The only currencies that automatically update their exchange rate daily are: "
"USD, EUR, GBP, JPY and CNY."
msgstr ""
"De enda valutor som automatiskt uppdaterar sin växelkurs dagligen är: USD, "
"EUR, GBP, JPY och CNY."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:920
msgid ""
"By law, electronic documents sent to the government cannot have negative "
"lines, as this can trigger errors. Therefore, when using :doc:`Gift Cards "
"<../../sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards>` or :doc:`Loyalty "
"Programs <../../sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount>`, the "
"subsequent negative lines will be translated in the XML as if they were "
"regular :doc:`Discounts <../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing/>`."
msgstr ""
"Enligt lag kan elektroniska dokument som skickas till myndigheter inte ha "
"negativa rader, då detta kan utlösa fel. När du använder :doc:`Presentkort "
"<../../sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards>` "
"eller :doc:`Lojalitetsprogram <../../sales/sales/products_prices/"
"loyalty_discount>` kommer därför de efterföljande negativa raderna att "
"översättas i XML:en som om de vore vanliga :doc:`Rabatter <../../sales/sales/"
"products_prices/prices/pricing/>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:927
msgid ""
"In order to set this up, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales --> Products --> "
"Products` and create a product `Discounts`, make sure that it has a "
"valid :guilabel:`Tax` (usually :guilabel:`IVA` at `16%`)."
msgstr ""
"För att ställa in detta, navigera till :menuselection:`Försäljning --> "
"Produkter --> Produkter` och skapa en produkt `Rabatter`, se till att den "
"har en giltig :guilabel:`Skatt` (vanligtvis :guilabel:`IVA` på `16%`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:931
msgid ""
"After this, create and sign the invoice via |CFDI|, and add the `Discounts` "
"product at the bottom. In the XML, Odoo will distribute the discount between "
"the lines evenly, while any math differences will be added in a rounding "
"product."
msgstr ""
"Skapa och signera sedan fakturan via |CFDI|, och lägg till produkten "
"`Rabatter` längst ner. I XML:en kommer Odoo att fördela rabatten jämnt "
"mellan raderna, medan eventuella matematiska skillnader kommer att läggas "
"till i en avrundningsprodukt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:936
msgid ""
"A `Discount` and `UNSPSC Product Category` for each product variant related "
"to :guilabel:`Gift Cards` or :guilabel:`Loyalty Programs` have to be created."
msgstr ""
"En `Rabatt` och `UNSPSC produktkategori` för varje produktvariant relaterad "
"till :guilabel:`Presentkort` eller :guilabel:`Lojalitetsprogram` måste "
"skapas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:942
msgid "Down payments"
msgstr "Handpenning"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:944
msgid ""
"A common practice in Mexico is the usage of :doc:`down payments <../../sales/"
"sales/invoicing/down_payment>`. They are primarily used when a payment is "
"received for a good or service whose product, price, or both have not been "
"fully determined."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:948
msgid ""
"The |SAT| allows two different ways to handle this process: both of them "
"involve linking all invoices to each other with the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"|SAT| tillåter två olika sätt att hantera denna process: båda innebär att "
"alla fakturor länkas till varandra med fältet :guilabel:`CFDI-ursprung`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:952
msgid "For this process, the :doc:`Sales <../../sales>` app must be installed."
msgstr ""
"För denna process måste appen :doc:`Försäljning <../../sales>` vara "
"installerad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:955
msgid ""
"`The official documentation for registration of down payments in Mexico "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/documentos/"
"GuiaAnexo311221.pdf>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:961
msgid ""
"First, navigate to :menuselection:`Sales --> Products --> Products` to "
"create a product `Anticipo` and configure it. The :guilabel:`Product Type` "
"must be :guilabel:`Service`, and use the :guilabel:`UNSPSC "
"Category` :guilabel:`84111506 Servicios de facturación`."
msgstr ""
"Navigera först till :menuselection:`Försäljning --> Produkt --> Produkt` för "
"att skapa en produkt `Anticipo` och konfigurera den. :guilabel:`Produkttyp` "
"måste vara :guilabel:`Tjänst`, och använd :guilabel:`UNSPSC-"
"kategori` :guilabel:`84111506 Servicios de facturación`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:965
msgid ""
"Then, go to :menuselection:`Sales --> Settings --> Invoicing --> Down "
"Payments`, and add the *Anticipo* product as the default."
msgstr ""
"Gå sedan till :menuselection:` `Sales --> Inställningar --> Fakturering --> "
"Förskottsbetalningar` och lägg till produkten *Anticipo* som standard."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:971
msgid "Method A"
msgstr "Metod A"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:973
msgid ""
"This method consists of creating a down payment invoice, creating an invoice "
"for the total amount, and finally, creating a credit note for the total of "
"the down payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:976
msgid ""
"First, create a sales order with the total amount, and create a down payment "
"from it (either using a percentage or fixed amount). Then, sign the document "
"via CFDI, and register the payment."
msgstr ""
"Skapa först en försäljningsorder med totalbeloppet och skapa en delbetalning "
"från den (antingen med procentandel eller fast belopp). Underteckna sedan "
"dokumentet via CFDI och registrera betalningen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:979
msgid ""
"When the time comes for the customer to get the final invoice, create it "
"again from the same sales order. In the :guilabel:`Create Invoice` popup, "
"select :guilabel:`Regular Invoice`. Make sure to delete the line that "
"contains the product *Anticipo*."
msgstr ""
"När det är dags för kunden att få slutfakturan, skapa den igen från samma "
"försäljningsorder. I popup-fönstret :guilabel:`Skapa faktura`, "
"välj :guilabel:`Vanlig faktura`. Se till att radera raden som innehåller "
"produkten *Anticipo*."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:984
msgid ""
"When using down payments with the Mexican localization, make sure that "
"the :guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` of the products are :guilabel:`Ordered "
"quantities`. Otherwise a customer credit note will be created."
msgstr ""
"När du använder delbetalningar med den mexikanska lokaliseringen, se till "
"att :guilabel:`Faktureringspolicy` för produkterna är :guilabel:`Beställda "
"mängder`. Annars kommer en kreditfaktura att skapas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:988
msgid ""
"Then, copy the :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` from the down payment invoice, and "
"paste it into the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field of the final invoice. Add "
"the prefix `07|` before the value and sign the document via |CFDI|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:992
msgid ""
"Finally, create a credit note for the first invoice. Copy "
"the :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` from the final invoice, and paste it in "
"the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` of the credit note, adding the prefix `07|`. "
"Then, sign the document via |CFDI|."
msgstr ""
"Slutligen, skapa en kreditfaktura för den första fakturan. "
"Kopiera :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` från slutfakturan och klistra in den "
"i :guilabel:`CFDI-ursprung` på kreditfakturan, lägg till prefixet `07|`. "
"Underteckna sedan dokumentet via |CFDI|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:996
msgid ""
"With this, all electronic documents are linked to each other. The final step "
"is to fully pay the new invoice. At the bottom of the new invoice, the "
"credit note appears in the :guilabel:`Outstanding credits`; add it as "
"payment. Finally, register the remaining amount with the :guilabel:`Pay` "
"popup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1001
msgid ""
"In the sales order, all three documents should appear as \"In Payment\"."
msgstr ""
"I försäljningsordern bör alla tre dokumenten visas som \"Under betalning\"."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1004
msgid "Method B"
msgstr "Metod B"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1006
msgid ""
"Another, simpler way to fulfill |SAT| requirements involves creating only "
"the down payment invoice, and a second invoice for the remnant. This method "
"involves the fact that negative lines are treated as discounts."
msgstr ""
"Ett annat, enklare sätt att uppfylla |SAT|-kraven innebär att endast skapa "
"delbetalningsfakturan och en andra faktura för resten. Denna metod bygger på "
"att negativa rader behandlas som rabatter."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1010
msgid ""
"For this, follow the same process as :ref:`Method A <l10n-mx/down-payment-"
"method-a>`, up until the creation of the final invoice. Do not delete the "
"line that contains the *Anticipo* and instead rename the other "
"products :guilabel:`Description` to include the text `CFDI por remanente de "
"un anticipo`. Add the :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` of the down payment invoice "
"in the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field of the final invoice, adding the prefix "
"`07|`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1016
msgid "Finally, sign the final invoice via |CFDI|."
msgstr "Underteckna slutligen slutfakturan via |CFDI|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1021
msgid "Addendas and complements"
msgstr "Addendas och komplement"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1023
msgid ""
"An addenda is a code addition to an invoice XML file that provides extra "
"information beyond legal requirements. It is added after the invoice has "
"been signed. A complement is a fiscal addition that reports specific fiscal "
"operations and is added before the invoice is signed. Only a limited number "
"of complements are available, and some are already included in Odoo. See the "
"`SAT complement documentation <https://www.sat.gob.mx/portal/public/tramites/"
"complementos-de-factura>`_ for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1030
msgid ""
"Addendas and complements can be included in the XML. To add one, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Addendas & Complementos "
"(MX)` and click :guilabel:`New` to enter the code to be injected. Additional "
"fields beyond standard Odoo may be required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1036
msgid ""
"This section might require technical knowledge and may risk adding technical "
"debt; it is recommended to ask your account manager for the best technical "
"advice."
msgstr ""
"Detta avsnitt kan kräva teknisk kompetens och kan riskera att lägga till "
"teknisk skuld; det rekommenderas att fråga din kundansvarig för bästa "
"tekniska råd."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1039
msgid ""
"Once the desired nodes are created, they can be selected on each contact to "
"make them appear on every invoice addressed to that contact. By default, all "
"the selected nodes will be added automatically on every invoice."
msgstr ""
"När de önskade noderna är skapade kan de väljas på varje kontakt för att få "
"dem att visas på varje faktura som riktas till den kontakten. Som standard "
"läggs alla valda noder automatiskt till på varje faktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1043
msgid ""
"It is also possible to just select the nodes as needed on every invoice by "
"selecting the :guilabel:`Other info` tab and then selecting the desired "
"nodes from :guilabel:`Addendas & Complementos`"
msgstr ""
"Det är också möjligt att bara välja noderna efter behov på varje faktura "
"genom att välja fliken :guilabel:`Övrig info` och sedan välja önskade noder "
"från :guilabel:`Addendas & Complementos`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1048
msgid "It is possible to add more than one per contact or per invoice."
msgstr ""
"Det är möjligt att lägga till fler än en per kontakt eller per faktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1053
msgid "XML reader"
msgstr "XML-läsare"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1055
msgid ""
"On certain occasions, such as when creating invoices in another software or "
"in the |SAT| directly, it is possible to upload invoices to Odoo. The XML "
"Reader can retrieve the data from an XML file. To do this, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices` and, in the list "
"view, click :guilabel:`Upload` to select any number of XML files. Draft "
"invoices are automatically created. This can also work by dragging files "
"from a local storage and dropping them in the view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1061
msgid ""
"The draft invoices will retrieve the :guilabel:`Customer information` (if it "
"doesn't exist, new ones will be created), the :guilabel:`Product Lines` "
"(only if products with the same name already exist) and will calculate all "
"taxes and additional fields exclusive to the Mexican Localization. The "
"import information will appear in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"Utkastet till fakturor kommer att hämta :guilabel:`kundinformationen` (om "
"den inte finns kommer nya att skapas), :guilabel:`produktserierna` (endast "
"om produkter med samma namn redan finns) och kommer att beräkna alla skatter "
"och ytterligare fält exklusiva för den mexikanska lokaliseringen. "
"Importinformationen kommer att visas i händelseflödet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1067
msgid ""
"Depending on where the invoice was created, XML files could have different "
"values from the total calculated in Odoo. **Always** double-check any "
"document uploaded this way."
msgstr ""
"Beroende på var fakturan skapades kan XML-filer ha olika värden från det "
"totala beräknade i Odoo. Dubbelkolla **alltid** alla dokument som laddas upp "
"på detta sätt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1070
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer Invoices` created this way can create **payment "
"complements** and can be canceled at any time. If the :guilabel:`Print` "
"option is used, the PDF document includes all the corresponding information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1074
msgid "This can be done for :guilabel:`Vendor Bills` too."
msgstr "Detta kan göras för :guilabel:`leverantörsfakturor` också."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1077
msgid ""
"To retrieve the :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio`, drag and drop XML files as a log "
"note in the chatter for previously created draft invoices."
msgstr ""
"För att hämta :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio`, dra och släpp XML-filer som en "
"logganteckning i händelseflödet för tidigare skapade utkast till fakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1083
msgid "CFDI to public"
msgstr "CFDI till allmänheten"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1085
msgid ""
"The Mexican government requires that any goods or services that are sold "
"must be backed up by an invoice. If the customer does not require an invoice "
"or has no |RFC|, a *CFDI to Public* has to be created also known as a "
"\"nominative\" invoice."
msgstr ""
"Den mexikanska regeringen kräver att alla varor eller tjänster som säljs "
"måste backas upp av en faktura. Om kunden inte kräver en faktura eller inte "
"har något |RFC|, måste en *CFDI to Public* skapas, även känd som en "
"\"nominativ\" faktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1089
msgid "A contact must be created and it must have a particular name."
msgstr "En kontakt måste skapas och den måste ha ett specifikt namn."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1091
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`CFDI to Public` checkbox in either a sales order or an "
"invoice is checked, the final XML will override the data in the invoice "
"contact and will add the following characteristics:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1094
msgid ""
"|RFC|: **XAXX010101000** if it is a national customer or **XEXX010101000** "
"if it is a foreign customer"
msgstr ""
"|RFC|: **XAXX010101000** om det är en nationell kund eller **XEXX010101000** "
"om det är en utländsk kund"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1096
msgid ":guilabel:`ZIP` code: The same code of the company"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Postnummer`: Samma kod som företaget"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1097
msgid ":guilabel:`Usage`: S01 - Without Fiscal Effects"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Användning`: S01 - Utan skattemässiga effekter"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "CFDI to Public Checkbox"
msgstr "Kryssruta för CFDI to Public"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1102
msgid ""
"If the final customer doesn't share any details, create a "
"generic :guilabel:`Customer`. The name cannot be `PUBLICO EN GENERAL` or an "
"error will be triggered (it can be, for example, `CLIENTE FINAL`)."
msgstr ""
"Om slutkunden inte delar några detaljer, skapa en generisk :guilabel:`kund`. "
"Namnet kan inte vara `PUBLICO EN GENERAL` eller så kommer ett fel att "
"utlösas (det kan till exempel vara `CLIENTE FINAL`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1107
msgid ""
"By default, sending the invoice is not allowed if the partner does not have "
"either the *Country* or *ZIP code* set. However, this is not required if "
"the :guilabel:`CFDI to public` checkbox is active."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1112
msgid ""
"`Regla 2.7.1.21 Expedición de comprobantes en operaciones con el público en "
"general <https://www.sat.gob.mx/articulo/90959/regla-2.7.1.21>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Regla 2.7.1.21 Expedición de comprobantes en operaciones con el público en "
"general <https://www.sat.gob.mx/articulo/90959/regla-2.7.1.21>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1118
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1617
msgid "Global invoice"
msgstr "Global faktura"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1120
msgid ""
"If by the end of a certain period of time (that can vary from daily to "
"bimonthly, depending on the company's legal needs and preferences) and the "
"customer still has sales that weren't marked as regular invoices or "
"individual *CFDI to Public* invoices, the |SAT| allows for the creation of a "
"single invoice that can contain all operations, known as a *global invoice*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1126
msgid ""
"For this process, the :doc:`Sales <../../sales/sales>` app must be installed."
msgstr ""
"För denna process måste appen :doc:`Försäljning <../../sales/sales>` vara "
"installerad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1129
msgid ""
"`Guía de llenado del CFDI global <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/"
"tramitesyservicios/Paginas/documentos/GuiallenadoCFDIglobal311221.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Guía de llenado del CFDI global <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/"
"tramitesyservicios/Paginas/documentos/GuiallenadoCFDIglobal311221.pdf>`_"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1135
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Global Invoice Serie` is specific to each branch or company "
"and is used to define the sequence of global invoices. To configure it, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, and navigate "
"to the :guilabel:`MX Electronic invoicing` section. The :guilabel:`Global "
"Invoice Serie` field can be found within the :guilabel:`Service Tax "
"Administration (SAT)` section."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Global Invoice Serie` är specifik för varje filial eller företag "
"och används för att definiera nummerserien för globala fakturor. För att "
"konfigurera den, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> "
"Inställningar`, och navigera till avsnittet :guilabel:`MX Electronic "
"invoicing`. Fältet :guilabel:`Global Invoice Serie` finns i "
"avsnittet :guilabel:`Service Tax Administration (SAT)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Accounting setting with an MX company."
msgstr "Bokföringsinställning med ett MX-företag."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1144
msgid "The default sequence for every company/branch is `GINV/`"
msgstr "Standardnummerserien för varje företag/filial är `GINV/`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1147
msgid "Sales flow"
msgstr "Försäljningsflöde"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1149
msgid ""
"First, create a dedicated journal in :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Journals` to maintain a separate sequence that is used for "
"global invoices, which function as orders when they are created."
msgstr ""
"Skapa först en dedikerad journal i :menuselection:`Bokföring --> "
"Konfiguration --> Journaler` för att bibehålla en separat nummerserie som "
"används för globala fakturor, vilka fungerar som ordrar när de skapas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1153
msgid ""
"Then, make sure that all the sales orders that need to be signed have the "
"following configurations:"
msgstr ""
"Se sedan till att alla försäljningsorder som behöver signeras har följande "
"konfigurationer:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1155
msgid ":guilabel:`CFDI to Public` checkbox enabled"
msgstr ":guilabel:`CFDI till offentlig` kryssruta aktiverad"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1156
msgid ":guilabel:`Invoice Status` marked as :guilabel:`To Invoice`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fakturastatus` markerad som :guilabel:`Att fakturera`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1158
msgid ""
"After this, go to :menuselection:`Sales --> To Invoice --> Orders to "
"Invoice`, select all relevant sales orders and press :guilabel:`Create "
"Invoices`. Make sure to disable the :guilabel:`Consolidated Billing` "
"checkbox and click :guilabel:`Create Draft Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"Gå sedan till :menuselection:`Försäljning --> Att fakturera --> Order att "
"fakturera`, välj alla relevanta försäljningsorder och tryck "
"på :guilabel:`Skapa fakturor`. Se till att avaktivera "
"kryssrutan :guilabel:`Konsoliderad fakturering` och klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Skapa fakturautkast`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1162
msgid ""
"In the list of draft invoices displayed, select all, click :icon:`fa-"
"gear` :guilabel:`Actions`, and select :guilabel:`Confirm entries`. Then, "
"select all posted invoices again and return to the :icon:`fa-"
"gear` :guilabel:`Actions` drop-down menu to select :guilabel:`Create Global "
"Invoice`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1166
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create Global Invoice` window, select "
"the :guilabel:`Periodicity` recommended by an accountant and use "
"the :guilabel:`Date` field to specify the period to be invoiced. Then, "
"click :guilabel:`Create`. Verify all invoices are signed under the same XML "
"file and share the same :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1172
msgid ""
"The selected :guilabel:`Date` is used only to extract the *month* and *year* "
"for the XML. For bimonthly periodicity, the month determines the period "
"declared as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1175
msgid "Months 1-12: Standard month number (January = 1, February = 2, etc.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1176
msgid "January - February -> 13"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1177
msgid "March - April -> 14"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1178
msgid "May - June -> 15"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1179
msgid "July - August -> 16"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1180
msgid "September - October -> 17"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1181
msgid "November - December -> 18"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1183
msgid ""
"Global invoices created this way won't include a **PDF** attachment, as "
"their information is already in Odoo and isn't meant to be seen by customers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1187
msgid ""
"Selecting the date 01/12/2026 with monthly periodicity declares month 12 and "
"year 2026."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1188
msgid ""
"Selecting the date 01/12/2026 with bimonthly periodicity declares month 18 "
"and year 2026."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1189
msgid ""
"Selecting the date 01/12/2026 with daily periodicity declares month 12 and "
"year 2026."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1192
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Show` in the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab to display a list with "
"all related invoices."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Visa` under fliken :guilabel:`CFDI` för att visa en "
"lista med alla relaterade fakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1193
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Cancel` in the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab to cancel the global "
"invoice in both the |SAT| and Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Avbryt` under fliken :guilabel:`CFDI` för att avbryta "
"den globala fakturan i både |SAT| och Odoo."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1199
msgid "Electronic accounting reports"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1201
msgid ""
"For Mexico, `Electronic Accounting <https://www.sat.gob.mx/aplicacion/42150/"
"envia-tu-contabilidad-electronica>`_ refers to the obligation to keep "
"accounting records and entries through electronic means, and to enter "
"accounting information on a monthly basis, through the |SAT| website."
msgstr ""
"För Mexiko avser \"Elektronisk bokföring <https://www.sat.gob.mx/aplicacion/"
"42150/envia-tu-contabilidad-electronica>`_\" skyldigheten att föra bokföring "
"och verifikat på elektronisk väg och att månadsvis föra in "
"bokföringsinformation via webbplatsen |SAT|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1206
msgid "It consists of three main XML files:"
msgstr "Den består av tre XML-huvudfiler:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1208
msgid "The updated list of the chart of accounts that is currently in use"
msgstr "Den uppdaterade listan över kontoplanen som för närvarande används"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1209
msgid ""
"A monthly trial balance, plus a closing entry report, also known as: *Trial "
"Balance Month 13*"
msgstr ""
"En månatlig råbalans, plus en rapport över utgående saldo, även känd som: "
"*Råbalans månad 13*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1210
msgid ""
"An export of the journal entries in the general ledger (optional except in "
"the case of a compulsory audit)"
msgstr ""
"En export av verifikationerna i huvudboken (valfritt förutom vid "
"obligatorisk revision)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1213
msgid ""
"The resulting XML files follow the requirements of the `Anexo Técnico de "
"Contabilidad Electrónica 1.3 <https://www.gob.mx/cms/uploads/attachment/file/"
"151135/Anexo24_05012015.pdf>`_."
msgstr ""
"De resulterande XML-filerna följer kraven i `Anexo Técnico de Contabilidad "
"Electrónica 1.3 <https://www.gob.mx/cms/uploads/attachment/file/151135/"
"Anexo24_05012015.pdf>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1216
msgid ""
"In addition to this, it is possible to generate the `DIOT <https://"
"www.sat.gob.mx/declaracion/74295/presenta-tu-declaracion-informativa-de-"
"operaciones-con- terceros-(diot)->`_: a report of vendors' journal entries "
"that involve IVA taxes that can be exported in a TXT file."
msgstr ""
"Utöver detta är det möjligt att skapa `DIOT <https://www.sat.gob.mx/"
"declaracion/74295/presenta-tu-declaracion-informativa-de-operaciones-con- "
"terceros-(diot)->`_: en rapport över leverantörers verifikationer som "
"involverar IVA-skatter och som kan exporteras i en TXT-fil."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1222
msgid "To use these reports, the following modules must be installed:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1224
msgid ":guilabel:`Odoo Mexican Localization Reports` (`l10n_mx_reports`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1225
msgid ":guilabel:`Mexico - Month 13 Trial Balance` (`l10n_mx_reports_closing`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1226
msgid ":guilabel:`Odoo Mexican XML Polizas Export` (`l10n_mx_xml_polizas`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1228
msgid ""
"The *chart of accounts* and the *Trial Balance Month 13* reports can be "
"found in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Trial Balance`. The "
"*DIOT* report can be found in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> "
"Tax Report`."
msgstr ""
"Rapporterna *kontoplan* och *Råbalans månad 13* finns "
"under :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Rapporter --> Råbalans`. Rapporten "
"*DIOT* finns under :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Rapporter --> "
"Skatterapport`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1233
msgid ""
"The specific characteristics and obligations of the reports required to be "
"sent might change depending on the fiscal regime. Always contact an "
"accountant before sending any documents to the government."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1242
msgid ""
"The :doc:`chart of accounts <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` "
"in Mexico follows a specific pattern based on the |SAT| documentation "
"`Código agrupador de cuentas <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/fichas_tematicas/"
"buzon_tributario/Documents/codigo_agrupador.pdf>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1246
msgid ""
"It is possible to create any account, as long as it respects |SAT|'s "
"encoding group: the pattern is `NNN.XX.YY`, `NNN.XX.YYY` or `NNN.XX.YYY.ZZ`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1250
msgid "Some examples are `102.01.99`, `401.01.001` or `401.01.001.16`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1252
msgid ""
"When a new account is created in :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Chart of Accounts`, the structure is validated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1255
msgid ""
"Once all accounts are created, make sure the correct :guilabel:`Tags` are "
"added as these mark the nature of the account."
msgstr ""
"När alla konton är skapade, se till att rätt :guilabel:`Taggar` läggs till "
"eftersom dessa markerar kontots karaktär."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1258
msgid ""
"Due to the account hierarchy on parent accounts, set the "
"appropriate :guilabel:`Parent Account` on each account to create a hierarchy "
"for reports. Accounts without a parent are level 1 accounts; accounts below "
"them are level 2, and so on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1263
msgid ""
"Active accounts must be longer than five digits, or they trigger errors in "
"the report. By default, Odoo marks accounts in yellow if the numbering could "
"cause issues later on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1265
msgid ""
"If an account is shorter than five characters, mark it as inactive so "
"validations do not apply to it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1267
msgid ""
"Accounts shorter than three characters are not reported in XML reports. This "
"is useful to classify accounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1269
msgid ""
"As a good practice, only keep last-level accounts active and keep all parent "
"accounts inactive. This prevents accounting errors, while parent accounts "
"still appear in reports."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1272
msgid ""
"Once everything is set up, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --"
"> Trial Balance`, and click the :guilabel:`COA SAT (XML)` button to generate "
"an XML file containing all of the accounts. This XML file is ready to upload "
"to the |SAT| website."
msgstr ""
"När allt är installerat, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Rapporter --> "
"Råbalans`, och klicka på knappen :guilabel:`COA SAT (XML)` för att skapa en "
"XML-fil som innehåller alla konton. Denna XML-fil är klar att laddas upp "
"till |SAT|-hemsidan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1281
msgid ""
"The trial balance reports the initial balance, credits, and total balances "
"of the accounts, provided that their :ref:`numbering <l10n_mx/chart-of-"
"accounts>` is correct."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1284
msgid ""
"To generate an XML file of the trial balance, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Trial Balance` and select "
"the date. Click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(gear)` icon and "
"select :guilabel:`SAT (XML)`. Then, select the appropriate :guilabel:`Submit "
"Type` from the :guilabel:`Export SAT` window, depending on whether the trial "
"balance is :guilabel:`Normal` or :guilabel:`Supplementary`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Trial balance report."
msgstr "Trialbalansrapport."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1296
msgid "Month 13"
msgstr "Månad 13"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1298
msgid ""
"An additional report is the *Month 13*: a closing balance sheet that shows "
"any adjustments or movements made in the accounting to close the year."
msgstr ""
"En ytterligare rapport är *Månad 13*: en avslutande balansräkning som visar "
"eventuella korrigeringar eller rörelser som gjorts i bokföringen för att "
"avsluta året."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1301
msgid ""
"To generate this XML document, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Accounting --> Journal Entries`, and create a new document. Here, add all "
"amounts to modify, and balance the debit and/or credit of each one."
msgstr ""
"För att skapa detta XML-dokument, navigera till :menuselection:`Bokföring --"
"> Bokföring --> Verifikationer`, och skapa ett nytt dokument. Här lägger du "
"till alla belopp att modifiera och balanserar debet och/eller kredit för var "
"och en."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1305
msgid ""
"After this is done, go to the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab and check "
"the :guilabel:`Month 13 Closing` field. If needed, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Trial Balance` and select "
"the date :guilabel:`Month 13`, where it is possible to see the total amount "
"of the year, plus all the additions of the journal entry. To generate the "
"XML file, click the :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(action menu)`, then "
"select :guilabel:`SAT (XML)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1316
msgid ""
"By law, all transactions in Mexico must be recorded digitally. Since Odoo "
"automatically creates all the underlying journal entries of all invoices and "
"payments, simply exporting the general ledger complies with |SAT|'s audits "
"and/or tax refunds."
msgstr ""
"Enligt lag måste alla transaktioner i Mexiko registreras digitalt. Eftersom "
"Odoo automatiskt skapar alla underliggande verifikationer för alla fakturor "
"och betalningar, uppfyller export av huvudboken |SAT|:s revisioner och/eller "
"momsåterbetalningar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1321
msgid ""
"The report can be filtered by period or by journal, depending on the need."
msgstr "Rapporten kan filtreras efter period eller journal, beroende på behov."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1323
msgid ""
"To create the XML, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> "
"General Ledger`, click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(action menu)`, then "
"click :guilabel:`XML (Polizas)`. Then, select among four :guilabel:`Export` "
"types:"
msgstr ""
"För att skapa XML:en, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Rapporter --> "
"Huvudbok`, klicka på :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(åtgärdsmeny)`, klicka sedan "
"på :guilabel:`XML (Polizas)`. Välj sedan bland fyra :guilabel:`Export`-typer:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1327
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax audit`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Skatterevision`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1328
msgid ":guilabel:`Audit certification`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Revisionsintyg`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1329
msgid ":guilabel:`Return of goods`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Retur av varor`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1330
msgid ":guilabel:`Compensation`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Kompensation`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1332
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Tax audit` or :guilabel:`Audit certification`, add "
"the :guilabel:`Order Number` provided by the |SAT|. For :guilabel:`Return of "
"goods` or :guilabel:`Compensation`, add the :guilabel:`Process Number`, also "
"provided by the |SAT|."
msgstr ""
"För :guilabel:`Momsrevision` eller :guilabel:`Revisionscertifiering`, lägg "
"till :guilabel:`Ordernummer` som tillhandahålls av |SAT|. "
"För :guilabel:`Återlämnande av varor` eller :guilabel:`Kompensation`, lägg "
"till :guilabel:`Processnummer`, som också tillhandahålls av |SAT|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1337
msgid ""
"To see this report without sending it, use `ABC6987654/99` for "
"the :guilabel:`Order Number` or `AB123451234512` for the :guilabel:`Process "
"Number`."
msgstr ""
"För att se denna rapport utan att skicka den, använd `ABC6987654/99` "
"för :guilabel:`Ordernummer` eller `AB123451234512` "
"för :guilabel:`Processnummer`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1343
msgid "DIOT report"
msgstr "DIOT-rapport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1345
msgid ""
"The DIOT (Declaración Informativa de Operaciones con Terceros / *Informative "
"Declaration of Operations with Third Parties*) is an additional obligation "
"with the |SAT|, where the current status of creditable and non-creditable "
"payments, withholdings, import taxes, and refunds of VAT from the vendor "
"bills are provided to the |SAT|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1350
msgid ""
"Unlike other reports, the |DIOT| is uploaded to a website provided by the |"
"SAT| that contains the A-29 form. In Odoo, it is possible to download the "
"records of all transactions as a TXT file with 54 columns. This file can be "
"uploaded to the form, reducing the data that is manually added."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1354
msgid ""
"The transactions file contains the total amount of the payments registered "
"in vendor bills, broken down into the corresponding types of IVA. "
"The :guilabel:`VAT`, :guilabel:`Country` and :guilabel:`Type of operation` "
"fields are mandatory for all vendors."
msgstr ""
"Transaktionsfilen innehåller det totala beloppet för de betalningar som "
"registrerats i leverantörsfakturor, uppdelat i motsvarande typer av IVA. "
"Fälten :guilabel:`Moms`, :guilabel:`Land` och :guilabel:`Typ av process` är "
"obligatoriska för alla leverantörer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1358
msgid ""
"To download the |DIOT| report as a TXT file, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reports --> Tax Return`. Select the "
"desired month, click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(action menu)`, and "
"select :guilabel:`DIOT (TXT)`."
msgstr ""
"För att ladda ner |DIOT|-rapporten som en TXT-fil, gå "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Rapporter --> Deklaration`. Välj önskad "
"månad, klicka på :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`(åtgärdsmeny)`, och "
"välj :guilabel:`DIOT (TXT)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1362
msgid ""
"In case new taxes are created in the database, there are two types of tags. "
"Tags containing **tax** must go into the tax distribution, and the ones with "
"the base name go on the base of the tax. All lines of a VAT tax **must** "
"contain at least one tax grid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "DIOT (TXT) download button."
msgstr "DIOT (TXT) nedladdningsknapp."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1370
msgid ""
"It is required to fill in the :guilabel:`Type of Operation` field in "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab of each vendor to prevent validation errors. "
"Make sure that foreign customers have their :guilabel:`Country` set."
msgstr ""
"Det krävs att fylla i fältet :guilabel:`Process` i "
"fliken :guilabel:`Bokföring` för varje leverantör för att förhindra "
"valideringsfel. Se till att utländska kunder har sitt :guilabel:`Land` "
"inställt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "DIOT information on a vendor contact."
msgstr "DIOT-information om en leverantörskontakt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1377
msgid ""
"Selecting :guilabel:`87 - Global Operations` will cause the final TXT file "
"to merge all vendors that are part of the global operations under one "
"generic VAT: *XAXX010101000*."
msgstr ""
"Att välja :guilabel:`87 - Globala processer` kommer att göra att den "
"slutliga TXT-filen sammanfogar alla leverantörer som är en del av de globala "
"processerna under ett generiskt momsnummer: *XAXX010101000*."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1383
msgid "Accounting reports"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1385
msgid ""
"Two Mexican-specific reports are the :ref:`Balance Sheet <l10n/mx/balance-"
"sheet>` and the :ref:`Profit and Loss <l10n/mx/profit-loss>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1393
msgid ""
"The report is based on NIF B-6 and is divided into assets, liabilities, and "
"equity, which reflect the current financial state of the company."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1401
msgid ""
"The report is based on NIF B-3 and is divided into income, operating "
"expenses, comprehensive financial results (RIF), and taxes, which help "
"identify the net profit or financial position of a company."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1408
msgid "External trade"
msgstr "Extern handel"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1410
msgid ""
"The external trade is a complement to a regular invoice that adds certain "
"values in both the XML and PDF, to invoices with a foreign customer "
"according to `SAT regulations <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/"
"Paginas/complemento_comercio_exterior.htm>`_, such as:"
msgstr ""
"Externhandeln är ett komplement till en vanlig faktura som lägger till vissa "
"värden i både XML och PDF, till fakturor med en utländsk kund enligt `SAT "
"regelverk <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/"
"complemento_comercio_exterior.htm>`_, t.ex:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1414
msgid "The specific address of the receiver and the sender"
msgstr "Mottagarens och avsändarens specifika adress"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1415
msgid ""
"The addition of a :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` that identifies the type of "
"product"
msgstr ""
"Tillägg av en :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` som identifierar typen av produkt"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1416
msgid ""
"The correct :doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/incoterms` (International "
"Commercial Terms)"
msgstr ""
"De korrekta :doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/incoterms` "
"(internationella handelsvillkoren)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1417
msgid ""
"And more, such as the *certificate of origin* and *special units of measure*"
msgstr "Och mer, såsom *ursprungsintyg* och *speciella måttenheter*"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1419
msgid ""
"This allows the correct identification of exporters and importers, in "
"addition to expanding the description of the merchandise sold."
msgstr ""
"Detta gör det möjligt att korrekt identifiera exportörer och importörer och "
"dessutom utöka beskrivningen av de varor som säljs."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1422
msgid ""
"Since January 1, 2018, external trade is a requirement for taxpayers who "
"carry export operations of type A1. While the current CFDI is 4.0, the "
"external trade is currently on version 2.0."
msgstr ""
"Sedan den 1 januari 2018 är utrikeshandel ett krav för skattebetalare som "
"utför exportprocesser av typ A1. Medan nuvarande CFDI är 4.0, är "
"utrikeshandeln för närvarande på version 2.0."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1426
msgid ""
"In order to use this feature, the :guilabel:`EDI for Mexico (Advanced "
"Features)` `l10n_mx_edi_extended` module must be installed."
msgstr ""
"För att använda denna funktion måste modulen :guilabel:`EDI för Mexiko "
"(Avancerade funktioner)` `l10n_mx_edi_extended` installeras."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1430
msgid ""
"Before installing, make sure your business needs to use this feature. "
"Consult an accountant first, if needed, before installing any modules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1433
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`CFDI to public` checkbox must be ticked when creating foreign "
"invoices."
msgstr ""
"Kryssrutan :guilabel:`CFDI till offentlig` måste vara ikryssad när utländska "
"fakturor skapas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1441
msgid ""
"To configure your company contact for external trade, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers`, remove the "
"default :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` filter, and select "
"your :guilabel:`Company` name. While the CFDI 4.0 requirements require "
"adding a valid :guilabel:`ZIP` code in the company contact record, the "
"external trade complement adds the requirement that the :guilabel:`City` and "
"the :guilabel:`State` must also be valid. All three fields must coincide "
"with the `Official SAT Catalog for Carta Porte <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/"
"tramitesyservicios/Paginas/catalogos_emision_cfdi_complemento_ce.htm>`_, or "
"it will produce an error."
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera din företagskontakt för utrikeshandel, navigera "
"till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Kunder --> Kunder`, ta bort "
"standardfiltret :guilabel:`Kundfakturor` och välj ditt :guilabel:`Företag`-"
"namn. Medan CFDI 4.0-kraven kräver att en giltig :guilabel:`Postnummer` "
"läggs till i företagskontaktposten, lägger utrikeshandelstillskottet till "
"kravet att :guilabel:`Stad` och :guilabel:`Stat` också måste vara giltiga. "
"Alla tre fälten måste överensstämma med den `officiella SAT-katalogen för "
"Carta Porte <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/"
"catalogos_emision_cfdi_complemento_ce.htm>`_, annars kommer det att ge ett "
"fel."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1451
msgid ""
"Add the :guilabel:`City` and :guilabel:`State` in the company's *contact "
"record*, not in the company record itself."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till :guilabel:`Stad` och :guilabel:`Stat` i företagets *kontaktpost*, "
"inte i själva företagsposten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1454
msgid ""
"On the contact record, the optional fields :guilabel:`Locality` "
"and :guilabel:`Colony Code` can also be filled. These two fields also have "
"to coincide with the data in the |SAT|."
msgstr ""
"I kontaktposten kan de valfria fälten :guilabel:`Lokalitet` "
"och :guilabel:`Koloni-kod` också fyllas i. Dessa två fält måste också "
"överensstämma med data i |SAT|."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1457
msgid ""
"To configure the contact data for a foreign receiving client, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers`, and select the "
"foreign client's contact. The contact must have the following fields "
"completed to avoid errors:"
msgstr ""
"För att konfigurera kontaktuppgifterna för en utländsk mottagande kund, "
"navigera till :menyselection:``Accounting --> Customers --> Customers`` och "
"välj den utländska kundens kontakt. Kontakten måste ha följande fält ifyllda "
"för att undvika fel:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1461
msgid ""
"The entire company :guilabel:`Address`, including a valid :guilabel:`ZIP` "
"code and the foreign :guilabel:`Country`."
msgstr ""
"Hela företagets :guilabel:`Address`, inklusive en giltig :guilabel:`ZIP`-kod "
"och det utländska :guilabel:`Country`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1463
msgid ""
"The foreign :guilabel:`RFC` (tax identification number), in the correct "
"format (for example: Colombia `123456789-1`)"
msgstr ""
"Det utländska :guilabel:`RFC` (skatteregistreringsnummer), i korrekt format "
"(till exempel: Colombia `123456789-1`)"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1465
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab, to activate the :guilabel:`Needs "
"external trade?` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"I fliken :guilabel:`Försäljning & Inköp`, för att aktivera "
"kryssrutan :guilabel:`Kräver utrikeshandel?`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1469
msgid ""
"In the resulting XML and PDF files, the :guilabel:`VAT` is automatically "
"replaced by the generic VAT for abroad transactions: `XEXX010101000`."
msgstr ""
"I de resulterande XML- och PDF-filerna ersätts :guilabel:`VAT` automatiskt "
"med den generiska momsen för transaktioner i utlandet: `XEXX010101000`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1475
msgid ""
"All products involved with external trade have four additional fields that "
"are required, two of which are exclusive to external trade."
msgstr ""
"Alla produkter som är involverade i utrikeshandel har fyra ytterligare fält "
"som krävs, varav två är exklusiva för utrikeshandel."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1478
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Reference` of the product must be set in "
"the :guilabel:`General Information` tab."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Referens` för produkten måste ställas in i "
"fliken :guilabel:`Allmän information`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1479
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Weight` of the product in the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab must "
"be more than `0`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vikt` för produkten i fliken :guilabel:`Lager` måste vara mer än "
"`0`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1480
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` of the product must be set in "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab for external trade. Use the `VUCEM tariff "
"fraction classifier <https://www.ventanillaunica.gob.mx/vucem/"
"Clasificador.html>`_ to find the correct value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1483
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`UMT Aduana` in the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab must be set and "
"correspond to the :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` for external trade."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`UMT Aduana` i fliken :guilabel:`Bokföring` måste ställas in och "
"motsvara :guilabel:`Tullfraktion` för utrikeshandel."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Required external trade product fields."
msgstr "Obligatoriska produktfält för extern handel."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1490
msgid ""
"If the UoM code of the :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` is `01`, the "
"correct :guilabel:`UMT Aduana` is `kg`."
msgstr ""
"Om UoM-koden för :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` är `01`, är den "
"korrekta :guilabel:`UMT Aduana` `kg`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1492
msgid ""
"If the UoM code of the :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` is `06`, the "
"correct :guilabel:`UMT Aduana` is `Units`."
msgstr ""
"Om UoM-koden för :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` är `06`, är den "
"korrekta :guilabel:`UMT Aduana` `Units`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1498
msgid ""
"Before creating an invoice, it is important to take into account that "
"external trade invoices require converting product prices into a foreign "
"currency such as USD. Therefore, :doc:`multicurrency <../accounting/"
"get_started/multi_currency>` **must** be enabled with the foreign currency "
"activated in the :guilabel:`Currencies` section. The "
"correct :guilabel:`Service` to run is :guilabel:`[MX] Bank of Mexico`. To "
"convert product prices, create a :doc:`pricelist <../../sales/sales/"
"products_prices/prices/pricing>` in the foreign currency."
msgstr ""
"Innan du skapar en faktura är det viktigt att ta hänsyn till att "
"utrikeshandelsfakturor kräver konvertering av produktpriser till en utländsk "
"valuta såsom USD. Därför **måste** :doc:`multivaluta <../accounting/"
"get_started/multi_currency>` aktiveras med den utländska valutan aktiverad i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Valutor`. Den korrekta :guilabel:`Tjänst` att köra "
"är :guilabel:`[MX] Bank of Mexico`. För att konvertera produktpriser, skapa "
"en :doc:`prislista <../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>` i den "
"utländska valutan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1505
msgid ""
"Then, with the correct exchange rate set up in :menuselection:`Accounting --"
"> Settings --> Currency`, set the :guilabel:`Incoterm` and the "
"optional :guilabel:`Certificate Source` fields in the "
"invoice's :guilabel:`Other Info` tab."
msgstr ""
"Sedan, med rätt växelkurs inställd i :menuselection:`Bokföring --> "
"Inställningar --> Valuta`, ställ in fälten :guilabel:`Incoterm` och det "
"valfria :guilabel:`Certificate Source` i fakturans flik :guilabel:`Other "
"Info`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1510
msgid ""
"While not mandatory, the information will be more complete "
"if :guilabel:`CFDI to public` is also active."
msgstr ""
"Även om det inte är obligatoriskt kommer informationen att vara mer komplett "
"om :guilabel:`CFDI to public` också är aktivt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1513
msgid ""
"Finally, confirm the invoice with the same process as a regular invoice, and "
"click the :guilabel:`Send` button to sign it via CFDI."
msgstr ""
"Slutligen, bekräfta fakturan med samma process som en vanlig faktura och "
"klicka på knappen :guilabel:`Skicka` för att signera den via CFDI."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1519
msgid "Invoicing services"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1521
msgid ""
"Services and merchandise can be invoiced together on the same invoice if the "
"service is set up correctly. To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1524
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Products` and access the "
"relevant service form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1526
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, under the :guilabel:`UNSPSC` section, "
"find the :guilabel:`UMT Aduana` field and click the :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`(right arrow)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1528
msgid ""
"Verify that either the :guilabel:`UNSPSC Category` is selected "
"to :guilabel:`E48 service unit` or the :guilabel:`Customs code` is set as "
"`99`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1531
msgid ""
"Invoicing with either of these codes sets the service price to 0 for customs "
"declarations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1538
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Point of sale <../../sales/point_of_sale>` adaptation of the "
"Mexican Localization enables the creation of invoices that comply with the |"
"SAT| requirements directly from the **POS register**, with the added benefit "
"of creating receipt tickets that allow *self-invoicing* in a special portal "
"and creating global invoices."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Kassa <../../sales/point_of_sale>`-anpassningen av den mexikanska "
"lokaliseringen möjliggör skapandet av fakturor som uppfyller |SAT|-kraven "
"direkt från **kassaregistret**, med den extra fördelen att skapa kvitton som "
"möjliggör *egenskapad fakturering* i en speciell portal och skapandet av "
"globala fakturor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1546
msgid "Point of sale flow"
msgstr "Flöde för kassasystem"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1548
msgid ""
"On top of the standard :ref:`Point of Sale configuration <pos/use/"
"settings>`, the Mexican localization requires each payment method to be "
"configured with a correct :guilabel:`Payment Way` as well as a :guilabel:`Re-"
"invoicing account` to handle the accounting for invoices with the invoicing "
"portal."
msgstr ""
"Utöver den vanliga :ref:`kassasystemskonfigurationen <pos/use/settings>` "
"kräver den mexikanska lokaliseringen att varje betalningsmetod konfigureras "
"med ett korrekt :guilabel:`betalningssätt` samt "
"ett :guilabel:`omfaktureringskonto` för att hantera bokföringen för fakturor "
"med faktureringsportalen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1554
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo creates pre-configured payment methods for cash, credit "
"card, and debit card and assigns the :guilabel:`402.04.01 Re-invoicing` "
"account as default for re-invoicing."
msgstr ""
"Som standard skapar Odoo förkonfigurerade betalningsmetoder för kontant, "
"kreditkort och bankkort och tilldelar kontot :guilabel:`402.04.01 "
"Återfakturering` som standard för återfakturering."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1557
msgid ""
"While selling on the **Point of Sale**, click the :guilabel:`Customer` "
"button to either create or select a customer. Here it is possible to review "
"customer invoicing information (such as the |RFC| or :guilabel:`Fiscal "
"Regime`) and even modify it directly inside the session."
msgstr ""
"När du säljer i **kassasystemet**, klicka på knappen :guilabel:`Kund` för "
"att antingen skapa eller välja en kund. Här är det möjligt att granska "
"kundens faktureringsinformation (såsom |RFC| eller :guilabel:`Fiscal "
"Regime`) och till och med ändra den direkt i sessionen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1561
msgid ""
"After selecting a customer, tick the :icon:`fa-file-text-"
"o` :guilabel:`Invoice` checkbox. This opens a menu to select "
"the :guilabel:`Usage` and to define if it is an invoice to the public. Click "
"confirm, select the payment method, and then click validate to complete the "
"order. The PDF is then downloaded and it is possible to send the invoice via "
"mail to the final customer alongside the receipt."
msgstr ""
"Efter att ha valt en kund, markera kryssrutan :icon:`fa-file-text-"
"o` :guilabel:`Faktura`. Detta öppnar en meny för att välja :guilabel:`Usage` "
"och för att definiera om det är en faktura till allmänheten. Klicka på "
"bekräfta, välj betalningsmetod och klicka sedan på validera för att slutföra "
"beställningen. PDF:en laddas sedan ner och det är möjligt att skicka "
"fakturan via e-post till slutkunden tillsammans med inleveransen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1568
msgid ""
"To create invoices from orders, go to the :guilabel:`Orders` menu, select "
"the order, click :guilabel:`Load Order`, and tick the :icon:`fa-file-text-"
"o` :guilabel:`Invoice` checkbox. This opens the same menu for "
"the :guilabel:`Usage` and :guilabel:`CFDI to Public`."
msgstr ""
"För att skapa fakturor från beställningar, gå till "
"menyn :guilabel:`Beställningar`, välj beställningen, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Load Order` och markera kryssrutan :icon:`fa-file-text-"
"o` :guilabel:`Faktura`. Detta öppnar samma meny för :guilabel:`Usage` "
"och :guilabel:`CFDI to Public`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Invoice Configuration for Point of Sale."
msgstr "Fakturakonfiguration för kassasystem."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1575
msgid ""
"To sign a credit note automatically, tick the :icon:`fa-file-text-"
"o` :guilabel:`Invoice` checkbox when processing a :ref:`refund <pos/use/"
"refund>`."
msgstr ""
"För att signera en kreditfaktura automatiskt, markera kryssrutan :icon:`fa-"
"file-text-o` :guilabel:`Faktura` när du behandlar en :ref:`återbetalning "
"<pos/use/refund>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1579
msgid ""
"Credit notes for returned products will contain the relation "
"type :guilabel:`03 - Devolución de mercancía sobre facturas o traslados "
"previos`."
msgstr ""
"Kreditfakturor för returnerade produkter kommer att innehålla "
"relationstypen :guilabel:`03 - Devolución de mercancía sobre facturas o "
"traslados previos`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1583
msgid ""
"In the Mexican localization, positive and negative lines in a **POS** "
"session cannot be mixed."
msgstr ""
"I den mexikanska lokaliseringen kan positiva och negativa rader i en "
"**kassasystem**-session inte blandas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1585
msgid ""
"If a |SAT| validation error occurs, the customer receives a :doc:`Pro-Forma "
"invoice <../../sales/sales/invoicing/proforma>` instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1591
msgid "Self-invoicing portal"
msgstr "Portal för egenskapad fakturering"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1593
msgid ""
"If the final customer is not sure if they want to have their invoice "
"generated at the exact moment of the sale, it is possible to give them the "
"option of creating a receipt with either a QR code or a URL. To do so, "
"follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Om slutkunden inte är säker på om de vill få sin faktura genererad vid exakt "
"tidpunkten för försäljningen, är det möjligt att ge dem möjligheten att "
"skapa en inleverans med antingen en QR-kod eller en URL. För att göra detta, "
"följ dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1597
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration`."
msgstr "Gå till :menuselection:`Kassa --> Konfiguration`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1598
msgid "Select the :guilabel:`Point of Sale`."
msgstr "Välj :guilabel:`Kassa`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1599
msgid "Scroll to the :guilabel:`Bills & Receipts` section."
msgstr "Scrolla till sektionen :guilabel:`Bills & Receipts`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1600
msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Self-service invoicing`."
msgstr "Aktivera :guilabel:`Self-service invoicing`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1601
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Print` field to :guilabel:`QR code`, :guilabel:`URL`, "
"or :guilabel:`QR code + URL`."
msgstr ""
"Ställ in fältet :guilabel:`Print` till :guilabel:`QR code`, :guilabel:`URL` "
"eller :guilabel:`QR code + URL`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1604
msgid ""
"Customers who scan this QR code or follow the URL access a menu where they "
"can add their fiscal information, including :guilabel: Usage` "
"and :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1607
msgid ""
"On the journal entries of the session, the previously selected **Re-"
"invoicing account** will be used to handle reversals of the sales entries "
"when invoices are requested as well as be used as a sales account for the "
"new invoices."
msgstr ""
"I sessionens verifikationer kommer det tidigare valda "
"**återfaktureringskontot** att användas för att hantera återkallelser av "
"försäljningsposterna när fakturor begärs samt användas som försäljningskonto "
"för de nya fakturorna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1612
msgid ":ref:`refund <pos/use/refund>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1619
msgid ""
"As with regular sales orders, global invoices can also be created from the "
"POS register."
msgstr ""
"Precis som med vanliga försäljningsorder kan globala fakturor också skapas "
"från kassaregistret."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1621
msgid ""
"For this, make sure not to select a customer or the invoice option in the "
"payment menu and go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Orders`. "
"There, select all the orders to invoice, click :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`Actions` and select :guilabel:`Create Global Invoice`."
msgstr ""
"För detta, se till att inte välja en kund eller fakturaalternativet i "
"betalningsmenyn och gå till :menuselection:`Kassa --> Beställningar --> "
"Beställningar`. Där, välj alla beställningar att fakturera, klicka "
"på :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Åtgärder` och välj :guilabel:`Create Global "
"Invoice`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1625
msgid ""
"Like with sales orders, choose the correct :guilabel:`Periodicity` and "
"press :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"Precis som med försäljningsorder välj korrekt :guilabel:`periodicitet` och "
"tryck på :guilabel:`Skapa`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1627
msgid ""
"This attaches an XML file to each of the selected orders. The XML files can "
"be downloaded by going to the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab. If needed, it is "
"possible to cancel the invoice from the same tab."
msgstr ""
"Detta bifogar en XML-fil till var och en av de valda orderna. XML-filerna "
"kan laddas ner genom att gå till fliken :guilabel:`CFDI`. Om det behövs är "
"det möjligt att avbryta fakturan från samma flik."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1630
msgid ""
"If eventually any of the orders that are part of the global invoice need to "
"be addressed to a customer, it is still possible to send an invoice by "
"opening the POS register, clicking the :icon:`fa-bars` :guilabel:`(drop-down "
"menu)`, then click :guilabel:`Orders`. Change the :guilabel:`All active "
"orders` filter to :guilabel:`Paid`, select the order, and click "
"the :icon:`fa-file-text-o` :guilabel:`Invoice` button."
msgstr ""
"Om någon av beställningarna som ingår i den globala fakturan så småningom "
"behöver adresseras till en kund, är det fortfarande möjligt att skicka en "
"faktura genom att öppna kassaregistret, klicka på :icon:`fa-"
"bars` :guilabel:`(rullgardinsmeny)`, klicka sedan "
"på :guilabel:`Beställningar`. Ändra filtret :guilabel:`Alla aktiva "
"beställningar` till :guilabel:`Betald`, välj beställningen och klicka på "
"knappen :icon:`fa-file-text-o` :guilabel:`Faktura`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1637
msgid ""
"Global invoices, just as regular invoices, can only be grouped by physical "
"address. That is determined by the address set on the POS invoice journal, "
"so when attempting to invoice two addresses a warning will come up to warn "
"the user of the error."
msgstr ""
"Globala fakturor kan, precis som vanliga fakturor, endast grupperas efter "
"fysisk adress. Detta bestäms av adressen som är inställd på kassasystemets "
"fakturajournaler, så när man försöker fakturera två adresser kommer en "
"varning att dyka upp för att varna användaren om felet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1642
msgid ""
"For cash rounding, consider the configuration in the :ref:`Cash rounding "
"<l10n/mx/invoices/cash-rounding>` section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1650
msgid ""
"The eCommerce adaptation of the Mexican Localization provides an extra step "
"to create invoices that comply with the |SAT| requirements "
"on :doc:`eCommerce <../../websites/ecommerce>` by retrieving the customer "
"data after the **Checkout** and even allowing for the signature of "
"**automatic invoices** after the payment is processed, as well as sending "
"customers the files via email and granting them access to retrieve their PDF "
"file from their own customer portal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1659
msgid "eCommerce flow"
msgstr "Webbshopsflöde"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1661
msgid ""
"During the regular checkout process, a new :guilabel:`Invoicing Info` step "
"appears, where it is possible to request an invoice or not. "
"If :guilabel:`No` is selected, a **CFDI to Public** is created. "
"If :guilabel:`Yes` is selected, the :guilabel:`RFC`, :guilabel:`Fiscal "
"Regime`, and :guilabel:`Usage` are required in order to get all information "
"in the sales order, where its status will change to :guilabel:`To Invoice`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1667
msgid ""
"Additionally the customer can decide whether or not to request :ref:`IEPS "
"Breakdown <l10n/mx/ieps-breakdown>`."
msgstr ""
"Dessutom kan kunden bestämma om de vill begära :ref:`IEPS-nedbrytning <l10n/"
"mx/ieps-breakdown>` eller inte."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1671
msgid ""
"Make sure to add a :guilabel:`UNSPSC code` to the :ref:`shipping product "
"<ecommerce/checkout/delivery>`."
msgstr ""
"Se till att lägga till en :guilabel:`UNSPSC-kod` till :ref:`fraktprodukten "
"<ecommerce/checkout/delivery>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1674
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Automatic Invoicing` is enabled "
"in :menuselection:`Settings --> Website --> Invoicing`, the electronic "
"document will be signed automatically."
msgstr ""
"Om :guilabel:`automatisk fakturering` är aktiverad "
"i :menuselection:`Inställningar ‑> Hemsida ‑> Fakturering`, kommer det "
"elektroniska dokumentet att signeras automatiskt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1682
msgid ""
"The **Sales** app contains fields that make invoicing easier, while the "
"fields themselves do not change the sales behavior, they are directly copied "
"when creating an invoice."
msgstr ""
"Appen **Försäljning** innehåller fält som gör faktureringen enklare, och "
"även om fälten i sig inte ändrar försäljningsbeteendet, kopieras de direkt "
"när en faktura skapas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1685
msgid "The copied fields are:"
msgstr "De kopierade fälten är:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1687
msgid ":guilabel:`Payment Way`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1692
msgid ""
"Additionally, it is possible to get a preview of the invoice for validation "
"purposes with the customer by installing the :doc:`pro-forma module <../../"
"sales/sales/invoicing/proforma>`. This module adds the mentioned fields to "
"the sale order as well as:"
msgstr ""
"Dessutom är det möjligt att få en förhandsgranskning av fakturan för "
"valideringssynd med kunden genom att installera :doc:`proformafakturamodulen "
"<../../sales/sales/invoicing/proforma>`. Denna modul lägger till de nämnda "
"fälten till försäljningsordern samt:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1696
msgid ":guilabel:`Product code`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1697
msgid ":guilabel:`Unit code`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1698
msgid ":guilabel:`Fiscal regime`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1703
msgid "Subscriptions"
msgstr "Prenumerationer"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1705
msgid ""
"While handling subscriptions, all the sales fields are used to create the "
"recurrent invoices. These are automatically signed and sent via email with "
"the PDF and XML attached with no additional manual actions required."
msgstr ""
"Vid hantering av prenumerationer används alla försäljningsfält för att skapa "
"återkommande fakturor. Dessa signeras automatiskt och skickas via e-post med "
"PDF och XML bifogade utan ytterligare manuella åtgärder."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1710
msgid ""
"All invoices generated by the subscription app will always be automatically "
"signed with no exceptions."
msgstr ""
"Alla fakturor som genereras av prenumerationsappen kommer alltid att "
"signeras automatiskt utan undantag."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1716
msgid "Inventory"
msgstr "Inventering"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1721
msgid "Customs numbers"
msgstr "Tullnummer"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1723
msgid ""
"A *customs declaration* (Pedimento Aduanero) is a fiscal document that "
"certifies that all contributions to the fiscal entity (the |SAT|) have been "
"paid for, including the import/export of goods."
msgstr ""
"En *tulldeklaration* (Pedimento Aduanero) är ett skattedokument som intygar "
"att alla avgifter till skattemyndigheten (|SAT|) har betalats för, inklusive "
"import/export av varor."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1727
msgid ""
"According to the `Annex 20 <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/"
"Paginas/anexo_20.htm>`_ of CFDI 4.0, in documents where the invoiced goods "
"come from a first-hand import operation, the :guilabel:`Customs Number` "
"field needs to be added to all lines of products involved with the "
"operation, as does the date of the document."
msgstr ""
"Enligt `Bilaga 20 <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/"
"anexo_20.htm>`_ i CFDI 4.0, i dokument där de fakturerade varorna kommer "
"från en förstahandsimportoperation, måste fältet :guilabel:`Tullnummer` "
"läggas till på alla rader för produkter som är involverade i operationen, "
"liksom datumet för dokumentet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1733
msgid ""
"To do so, the :guilabel:`Odoo Mexico Localization for Stock/Landing` "
"`l10n_mx_edi_landing` module must be installed, in addition to "
"the :doc:`Inventory <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory>`, :doc:`Purchase "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/purchase>`, and :doc:`Sales <../../sales/sales>` "
"apps."
msgstr ""
"För att göra detta måste modulen :guilabel:`Odoo Mexico Localization for "
"Stock/Landing` `l10n_mx_edi_landing` installeras, utöver apparna :doc:`Lager "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory>`, :doc:`Inköp <../../inventory_and_mrp/"
"purchase>` och :doc:`Försäljning <../../sales/sales>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1738
msgid ""
"Do not confuse this feature with external trade. The customs numbers are "
"directly related to importing goods, while the external trade complement is "
"related to exporting. Consult an accountant first if this feature is needed "
"before doing any modifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1745
msgid ""
"In order to track the correct customs number for a specific invoice, Odoo "
"uses :doc:`landed costs <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"inventory_valuation/landed_costs>`. Go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and in the :guilabel:`Valuation` section, make "
"sure that :guilabel:`Landed Costs` is activated."
msgstr ""
"För att spåra rätt tullnummer för en specifik faktura använder "
"Odoo :doc:`hemtagningskostnader <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"inventory_valuation/landed_costs>`. Gå till :menuselection:`Lager --> "
"Konfiguration --> Inställningar`, och i sektionen :guilabel:`Värdering`, se "
"till att :guilabel:`Hemtagningskostnader` är aktiverat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1751
msgid ""
"It is recommended to add a :guilabel:`Default Journal` to automatically fill "
"the mandatory :guilabel:`Journal` field on landed costs even though landed "
"costs that only add customs numbers without adding :guilabel:`Additional "
"Costs` do not create journal entries."
msgstr ""
"Det rekommenderas att lägga till en :guilabel:`Standardjournal` för att "
"automatiskt fylla i det obligatoriska fältet :guilabel:`Journal` på "
"hemtagningskostnader även om hemtagningskostnader som endast lägger till "
"tullnummer utan att lägga till :guilabel:`Ytterligare kostnader` inte skapar "
"verifikationer."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1755
msgid ""
"Configure the **goods-type** products that hold the customs numbers. To do "
"so, create the products and complete these three requirements:"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurera produkter av **varutyp** som innehåller tullnummer. För att göra "
"detta, skapa produkterna och uppfyll dessa tre krav:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1758
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tracking` **must** be set to either :guilabel:`By Lots` "
"or :guilabel:`By Unique Serial Number` but **not** :guilabel:`By Quantity`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Spårning` **måste** vara inställd på antingen :guilabel:`Efter "
"partier` eller :guilabel:`Efter unikt serienummer`, men "
"**inte** :guilabel:`Efter kvantitet`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1760
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` **must** be set to :guilabel:`Delivered "
"quantities`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Faktureringspolicy` **måste** vara inställd "
"på :guilabel:`Levererade mängder`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1761
msgid ""
":doc:`Valuation by lots/serial numbers <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots>` **must** be enabled."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Värdering per partier/serienummer <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots>` **måste** vara aktiverad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1764
msgid ""
"This makes the :guilabel:`Customs invoicing` field available on "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab. Enable the field to use customs numbers with "
"this product."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1767
msgid ""
"It is important to make sure the product has a :guilabel:`Product Category` "
"and has the following configuration:"
msgstr ""
"Det är viktigt att se till att produkten har en :guilabel:`Produktkategori` "
"och har följande konfiguration:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1770
msgid ":guilabel:`Costing Method`: Either :guilabel:`FIFO` or :guilabel:`AVCO`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Kostnadsberäkningsmetod`: Antingen :guilabel:`FIFO` "
"eller :guilabel:`AVCO`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1771
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Inventory Valuation`: Either :guilabel:`Periodic` "
"or :guilabel:`Perpetual`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Lagervärdering`: Antingen :guilabel:`Periodisk` "
"eller :guilabel:`Kontinuerlig`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1774
msgid ""
"The feature works regardless of whether the :doc:`inventory valuation <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>` is set to "
"either :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` or :guilabel:`Perpetual (at "
"invoicing)`."
msgstr ""
"Funktionen fungerar oavsett om :doc:`lagervärderingen <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>` är inställd på "
"antingen :guilabel:`Periodisk (vid avslut)` eller :guilabel:`Kontinuerlig "
"(vid fakturering)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Storable products general configuration."
msgstr "Lagringsbara produkter allmän konfiguration."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Storable product category configuration."
msgstr "Lagringsbar konfiguration av produktkategorier."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1785
msgid "Purchase and sales flow"
msgstr "Inköps- och försäljningsflöde"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1787
msgid ""
"After configuring the product, follow the standard :doc:`purchase flow "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/purchase>`."
msgstr ""
"Efter att ha konfigurerat produkten, följ det vanliga :doc:`inköpsflödet "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/purchase>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1790
msgid ""
"Create a purchase order from :menuselection:`Purchase --> Orders --> "
"Purchase Order`. Then, confirm the order to display a :guilabel:`Receipt` "
"smart button. Click the :guilabel:`Receipt` smart button "
"and :guilabel:`Validate` the receipt."
msgstr ""
"Skapa en inköpsorder från :menuselection:`Inköp --> Beställningar --> "
"Inköpsorder`. Bekräfta sedan ordern för att visa en smart "
"knapp :guilabel:`Inleverans`. Klicka på den smarta "
"knappen :guilabel:`Inleverans` och :guilabel:`validera` inleveransen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1794
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Operations --> Landed Costs`, and create "
"a new record. In the :guilabel:`Transfer`, add the receipt that was just "
"validated, and add the :guilabel:`Customs number`."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Lager --> Processer --> Hemtagningskostnader` och "
"skapa en ny post. I :guilabel:`Överföra`, lägg till inleveransen som just "
"validerats och lägg till :guilabel:`Tullnummer`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1799
msgid ""
"While it is possible to add costs related to the customs number at this "
"stage of the process, it is highly recommended to create a landed cost from "
"a vendor bill from a customs agent. Learn more about :doc:`Landed Costs here "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/landed_costs>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1805
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Customs number` field is not editable once it is set, and "
"cannot be repeated, however it is possible to fix the number on the lot or "
"serial number later by selecting a different landed cost."
msgstr ""
"Fältet :guilabel:`Tullnummer` är inte redigerbart när det väl är inställt "
"och kan inte upprepas, men det är möjligt att korrigera numret på partiet "
"eller serienumret senare genom att välja en annan hemtagningskostnad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Customs number on a landed costs Inventory record."
msgstr "Tullnummer på en inventeringspost för landade kostnader."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1812
msgid ""
"The customs number assigned to a specific lot or serial number can be found "
"on its record in :menuselection:`Inventory --> Products --> Lots/Serial "
"Numbers`. The :guilabel:`L10N Mx Edi Landed Cost` field can be edited at any "
"time to fix any mistakes that could have occurred when registering the "
"landed cost. Editing the :guilabel:`L10N Mx Edi Landed Cost` field "
"automatically updates the :guilabel:`Customs number` and the name of the lot "
"or serial number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1818
msgid ""
"Next, create a sales order and confirm it. Click the :guilabel:`Delivery` "
"smart button that appears, and carefully review the assigned lots/serial "
"numbers to make sure they are the desired values. After that, "
"click :guilabel:`Validate` on the delivery order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1822
msgid ""
"Finally, :ref:`create an invoice from the sales order <accounting/inv-"
"process/so>` and confirm it. The invoice lines are created according to the "
"distribution of the delivery order. If more than one customs number is "
"selected, Odoo splits the invoice lines by quantity and customs number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Customs number on confirmed sales order product."
msgstr "Tullnummer på bekräftad försäljningsorderprodukt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1834
msgid ""
"A `Carta Porte <https://www.sat.gob.mx/portal/public/tramites/complemento-"
"carta-porte>`_ is a bill of lading: a document that states the type, "
"quantity, and destination of goods being carried."
msgstr ""
"En `Carta Porte <https://www.sat.gob.mx/portal/public/tramites/complemento-"
"carta-porte>`_ är ett konossement: ett dokument som anger typ, kvantitet och "
"destination för varor som transporteras."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1837
msgid ""
"On July 17th, 2024, version 3.1 of this |CFDI| was implemented for all "
"transportation providers, intermediaries, and owners of goods. Odoo is able "
"to generate a document type \"T\" (Traslado), which, unlike other documents, "
"is created in a delivery order instead of an invoice or payment."
msgstr ""
"Den 17 juli 2024 implementerades version 3.1 av denna |CFDI| för alla "
"transportföretag, mellanhand och godsägare. Odoo kan skapa en dokumenttyp "
"\"T\" (Traslado), som till skillnad från andra dokument skapas i en "
"leveransorder istället för en faktura eller betalning."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1841
msgid ""
"Odoo can create XML and PDF files with (or without) ground transport, and "
"can process materials that are treated as *Dangerous Hazards*."
msgstr ""
"Odoo kan skapa XML- och PDF-filer med (eller utan) marktransport, och kan "
"bearbeta material som behandlas som *Dangerous Hazards*."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1844
msgid ""
"To print the PDF, the delivery order must be signed by the government. Then, "
"it can be printed using the :guilabel:`Print Carta Porte` button on the "
"delivery order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1848
msgid ""
"The PDF file contains a QR code to verify the CCP code for the authorities."
msgstr ""
"PDF-filen innehåller en QR-kod för att verifiera CCP-koden för myndigheterna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1850
msgid ""
"To transport goods between warehouses, the logistic route must contain a "
"**Delivery** type of operation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1854
msgid ""
":doc:`Inter-warehouse replenishment <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/replenishment/resupply_warehouses>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Påfyllning mellan lager <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"warehouses_storage/replenishment/resupply_warehouses>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1858
msgid ""
"In order to use this feature, the :guilabel:`Mexico - Electronic Delivery "
"Guide` `l10n_mx_edi_stock` module must be installed."
msgstr ""
"För att använda denna funktion måste modulen :guilabel:`Mexiko - Elektronisk "
"leveransguide` `l10n_mx_edi_stock` vara installerad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1861
msgid ""
"Additionally, it is necessary to have the :doc:`Inventory <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` and :doc:`Sales <../../sales/sales>` apps "
"installed."
msgstr ""
"Dessutom krävs att apparna :doc:`Lager <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` "
"och :doc:`Försäljning <../../sales/sales>` är installerade."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1865
msgid ""
"Odoo does not support Carta Porte type document type \"I\" (Ingreso), air, "
"train or marine transport."
msgstr ""
"Odoo stöder inte Carta Porte dokumenttyp \"I\" (Ingreso), flyg-, tåg- eller "
"sjötransport."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1868
msgid ""
"Consult an accountant first if this feature is needed before doing any "
"modifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1873
msgid ""
"Odoo manages two different types of CFDI type \"T\". Both can be created "
"from either :doc:`incoming shipments or delivery orders <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo hanterar två olika typer av CFDI typ \"T\". Båda kan skapas från "
"antingen :doc:`inkommande försändelser eller leveransorder <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1877
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No Federal Highways` is used when the :guilabel:`Distance to "
"Destination` is `less than 30 km <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/cartaporte/"
"Paginas/documentos/PreguntasFrecuentes_Autotransporte.pdf>`_."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Inga federala motorvägar` används när :guilabel:`Avstånd till "
"destination` är `mindre än 30 km <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/cartaporte/"
"Paginas/documentos/PreguntasFrecuentes_Autotransporte.pdf>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1880
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Federal Transport` is used when the :guilabel:`Distance to "
"Destination` exceeds 30 km."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Federal transport` används när :guilabel:`Avstånd till "
"destination` överstiger 30 km."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1882
msgid ""
"For No Federal Highways, no other configuration is required beyond the "
"standard requirements of regular invoicing (the |RFC| of the customer, the "
"UNSPSC code, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"För Inga federala motorvägar krävs ingen annan konfiguration utöver "
"standardkraven för vanlig fakturering (kundens |RFC|, UNSPSC-koden, osv.)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1885
msgid ""
"For *Federal Transport*, several configurations have to be added to "
"contacts, vehicle setups, and products. Those configurations are then "
"included in the XML and PDF files."
msgstr ""
"För *Federal transport* måste flera konfigurationer läggas till i kontakter, "
"fordonsinställningar och produkter. Dessa konfigurationer inkluderas sedan i "
"XML- och PDF-filerna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1889
msgid "Contacts and vehicles"
msgstr "Kontakter och fordon"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1891
msgid ""
"Like the external trade feature, the :guilabel:`Address` in both the company "
"and the final customer must be complete. The :guilabel:`ZIP` "
"code, :guilabel:`City`, and :guilabel:`State` must coincide with the "
"`Official SAT Catalog for Carta Porte <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/"
"tramitesyservicios/Paginas/catalogos_emision_cfdi_complemento_ce.htm>`_."
msgstr ""
"Precis som funktionen för utrikeshandel måste :guilabel:`Adressen` i både "
"företaget och slutkunden vara "
"komplett. :guilabel:`Postnumret`, :guilabel:`staden` och :guilabel:`staten` "
"måste överensstämma med `den officiella SAT-katalogen för Carta Porte "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/"
"catalogos_emision_cfdi_complemento_ce.htm>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1897
msgid "The :guilabel:`Locality` field is optional for both addresses."
msgstr "Fältet :guilabel:`Ort` är valfritt för båda adresserna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1900
msgid ""
"The origin address used for the delivery guide is set "
"in :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Warehouses`. While this "
"is set as the company address by default, it is possible to change it to a "
"proper warehouse address."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1904
msgid ""
"This feature requires the use of :doc:`Fleet <../../hr/fleet/new_vehicle>` "
"to manage vehicles. The vehicle setup is managed directly on the vehicle, "
"and all the required fields are only visible after checking "
"the :guilabel:`L10N Mx Is Freight Vehicle` field."
msgstr ""
"Denna funktion kräver användning av :doc:`Fordon <../../hr/fleet/"
"new_vehicle>` för att hantera fordon. Fordonsinställningen hanteras direkt "
"på fordonet, och alla obligatoriska fält visas endast efter att "
"fältet :guilabel:`L10N Mx Is Freight Vehicle` har markerats."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1908
msgid ""
"Checking the :guilabel:`L10N Mx Is Freight Vehicle` field displays "
"the :guilabel:`MX Parameters` tab where the mandatory fields are required to "
"create a correct delivery guide. Additionally the vehicle **must** contain "
"a :guilabel:`License Plate`, a :guilabel:`Model Year`, and "
"a :guilabel:`Driver`."
msgstr ""
"Markering av fältet :guilabel:`L10N Mx Is Freight Vehicle` visar "
"fliken :guilabel:`MX-parametrar`, där de obligatoriska fälten krävs för att "
"skapa en korrekt fraktsedel. Dessutom **måste** fordonet innehålla "
"en :guilabel:`Registreringsskylt`, ett :guilabel:`Modellår` och "
"en :guilabel:`Drivrutin`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1913
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Vehicle Plate Number` and :guilabel:`Number Plate` fields "
"must contain between 5 and 7 characters."
msgstr ""
"Fälten :guilabel:`Fordonsregistreringsnummer` och :guilabel:`Nummerskylt` "
"måste innehålla mellan 5 och 7 tecken."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1916
msgid ""
"The main driver of the vehicle is set directly on the :guilabel:`Driver` "
"field, and it is possible to add more vehicle operators in "
"the :guilabel:`Intermediaries` section. The only mandatory fields for driver "
"contacts are the :guilabel:`VAT` and :guilabel:`Operator License`."
msgstr ""
"Fordonets huvudförare anges direkt i fältet :guilabel:`Drivrutin`, och det "
"är möjligt att lägga till fler fordonsoperatörer i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Mellanhänder`. De enda obligatoriska fälten för "
"förarkontakter är :guilabel:`Moms` och :guilabel:`Förarlicens`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Delivery guide vehicle configuration."
msgstr "Konfiguration av fordon för leveransguide."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1924
msgid ""
"If the vehicle is rented or more intermediaries are required, it is possible "
"to add them in the :guilabel:`Intermediaries` field."
msgstr ""
"Om fordonet är hyrt eller fler mellanhänder krävs är det möjligt att lägga "
"till dem i fältet :guilabel:`Mellanhänder`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1930
msgid ""
"Similar to regular invoicing, all products must have a :guilabel:`UNSPSC "
"category`. In addition to this, there are two extra configurations for "
"products involved in delivery guides:"
msgstr ""
"I likhet med vanlig fakturering måste alla produkter ha en :guilabel:`UNSPSC-"
"kategori`. Utöver detta finns det två extra konfigurationer för produkter "
"som är involverade i leveransguider:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1933
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Product Type` must be set as :guilabel:`Storable Product` for "
"stock movements to be created."
msgstr ""
"För att lagerrörelser ska kunna skapas måste :guilabel:`Produkttyp` vara "
"inställd som :guilabel:`Lagringsbar produkt`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1935
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab, the :guilabel:`Weight` field must be more "
"than `0`."
msgstr ""
"I fliken :guilabel:`Lager` måste fältet :guilabel:`Vikt` vara mer än `0`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1938
msgid ""
"Creating a delivery guide of a product with the :guilabel:`Weight` set to "
"`0` will trigger an error. As the :guilabel:`Weight` is immediately stored "
"in the delivery order, it is then necessary to return the products and "
"recreate the delivery order (and delivery guide) with the correct values."
msgstr ""
"Att skapa en leveransguide för en produkt med :guilabel:`Vikt` inställd på "
"`0` kommer att utlösa ett fel. Eftersom :guilabel:`Vikt` omedelbart lagras i "
"leveransordern är det då nödvändigt att returnera produkterna och återskapa "
"leveransordern (och leveransguiden) med korrekta värden."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1944
msgid "Sales and inventory flow"
msgstr "Försäljnings- och lagerflöde"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1946
msgid ""
"To create a delivery guide, first create and confirm a sales order "
"from :menuselection:`Sales --> Sales Order`. Click the :guilabel:`Delivery` "
"smart button that is generated, and :guilabel:`Validate` the transfer."
msgstr ""
"För att skapa en leveransguide, skapa först och bekräfta en "
"försäljningsorder från :menuselection:`Försäljning --> Försäljningsorder`. "
"Klicka på den smarta knappen :guilabel:`Leverans` som skapas "
"och :guilabel:`Validera` överföringen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1950
msgid ""
"After the status is set to :guilabel:`Done`, it is possible to edit the "
"transfer and select the :guilabel:`Transport Type` in "
"the :guilabel:`Additional Info` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1953
msgid ""
"If using the :guilabel:`No Federal Highways` :guilabel:`Transport Type`, "
"save the transfer, and then click :guilabel:`Generate Delivery Guide`. The "
"resulting XML can be found in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder :guilabel:`Inga federala "
"motorvägar` :guilabel:`Transporttyp`, spara överföringen och klicka sedan "
"på :guilabel:`Skapa leveransguide`. Den resulterande XML-filen finns i "
"händelseflödet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1957
msgid ""
"Other than the :guilabel:`UNSPSC` on all products, delivery guides that "
"use :guilabel:`No Federal Highways` do not require any special configuration "
"to be sent to the government, as they are a type \"T\" CFDI with no delivery "
"guide complement."
msgstr ""
"Utöver :guilabel:`UNSPSC` på alla produkter kräver leveransguider som "
"använder :guilabel:`Inga federala motorvägar` ingen speciell konfiguration "
"för att skickas till myndigheten, eftersom de är en typ \"T\" CFDI utan "
"leveransguide-komplement."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1961
msgid ""
"If using the :guilabel:`Federal Transport` :guilabel:`Transport Type`, "
"the :guilabel:`Vehicle Setup` is displayed to be selected. "
"The :guilabel:`Operator` is taken from the vehicle's driver. It can be "
"changed for each delivery. If changed, the :guilabel:`Set As Main Driver` "
"button appears. Click it to replace the driver on the fleet vehicle for "
"traceability purposes. The :guilabel:`Gross vehicle weight` is taken from "
"the :guilabel:`Vehicle setup` configuration where it is possible to add "
"additional :guilabel:`Extra weight` to account for the drivers and luggage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1970
msgid ""
"Odoo calculates the :guilabel:`Gross vehicle weight` with the following "
"formula:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1972
msgid ""
"Gross vehicle weight = Vehicle weight + (Weight + Extra Weight) / 1000\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Bruttovikt för fordon = Fordonsvikt + (Vikt + Extra vikt) / 1000\n"
"\n"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1975
msgid ""
"Every delivery requires a value in :guilabel:`Distance to Destination (KM)` "
"greater than `0`. Finally, enter the :guilabel:`Delivery Date` and "
"click :guilabel:`Generate Delivery Guide`."
msgstr ""
"Varje leverans kräver ett värde i :guilabel:`Avstånd till destination (KM)` "
"större än `0`. Ange slutligen :guilabel:`Leveransdatum` och klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Skapa leveransguide`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1979
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Scheduled Date` is filled and represents the time "
"at which the shipment leaves the warehouse. The :guilabel:`Delivery Date` is "
"the time when the shipment is expected to arrive at its destination. These "
"values are declared in both the XML and PDF."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1984
msgid "Dangerous hazards"
msgstr "Farliga faror"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1986
msgid ""
"Certain values in the :guilabel:`UNSPSC Category` are considered in the "
"`official SAT catalog <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/"
"complemento_carta_porte.htm>`_ as *dangerous hazards*. These categories need "
"additional considerations when creating a delivery guide "
"with :guilabel:`Federal Transport`."
msgstr ""
"Vissa värden i :guilabel:`UNSPSC Category` betraktas i den `officiella SAT-"
"katalogen <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/"
"complemento_carta_porte.htm>`_ som *farliga faror*. Dessa kategorier kräver "
"ytterligare överväganden när man skapar en leveransguide "
"med :guilabel:`Federal Transport`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1991
msgid ""
"First, select the product from :menuselection:`Inventory --> Products --> "
"Products`. Then, in the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, fill "
"the :guilabel:`Hazardous Material Designation Code` and :guilabel:`Hazardous "
"Packaging` fields with the correct code from the |SAT| catalog."
msgstr ""
"Först, välj produkten från :menuselection:`Lager --> Produkter --> "
"Produkter`. Sedan, i fliken :guilabel:`Bokföring`, fyll i "
"fälten :guilabel:`Farligt gods beteckningskod` och :guilabel:`Farlig "
"godsförpackning` med rätt kod från |SAT| katalogen."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:None
msgid "Delivery guide hazardous material product required fields."
msgstr "Leveransguide farligt material produkt obligatoriska fält."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1999
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`UNSPSC Category` may or may not be classified as a dangerous "
"hazard, for example *01010101*. If it is not dangerous, enter `0` in "
"the :guilabel:`Hazardous Material Designation Code` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2003
msgid ""
"In :guilabel:`MX Parameters`, complete the :guilabel:`Environment Insurer` "
"and :guilabel:`Environment Insurance Policy` as well. After this, continue "
"with the regular process to create a delivery guide."
msgstr ""
"I :guilabel:`MX-parametrar`, fyll i :guilabel:`Miljöförsäkringsgivare` "
"och :guilabel:`Miljöförsäkringsbrev` också. Efter detta, fortsätt med den "
"vanliga processen för att skapa en leveransguide."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2008
msgid "Imports and Exports"
msgstr "Import och export"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2010
msgid ""
"If a Carta Porte is for international operations (for exports), some "
"additional fields need to be taken into account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2013
msgid ""
"First, make sure that all relevant :guilabel:`Products` have the following "
"configuration:"
msgstr ""
"Först, se till att alla relevanta :guilabel:`produkter` har följande "
"konfiguration:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2015
msgid ""
":guilabel:`UNSPSC Category` cannot be :guilabel:`01010101 Does not exist in "
"the catalog`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`UNSPSC-kategori` kan inte vara :guilabel:`01010101 Finns inte i "
"katalogen`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2016
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` and :guilabel:`UMT Aduana` must be set, similar "
"to the :ref:`external trade <l10n/mx/external-trade>` flow."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` och :guilabel:`UMT Aduana` måste anges, "
"liknande :ref:`utrikeshandelsflödet <l10n/mx/external-trade>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2018
