msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the following modules to get all the "
"features of the Philippines localization:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Installera <general/install>` följande moduler för att få alla "
"funktioner i Filippinernas lokalisering:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/philippines.rst:19
