#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:124
msgid ""
"Open the **Accounting** app, go to :menuselection:`Customers --> Invoices`, "
"and select a posted invoice."
msgstr ""
"Öppna appen **Bokföring**, gå till :menuselection:`Kunder --> Fakturor` och "
"välj en bokförd faktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:127
msgid ""
"In the pop-up window, check :guilabel:`Send via KSeF (e-Faktura)` and "
"click :guilabel:`Send`."
msgstr ""
"I popup-fönstret, kryssa för :guilabel:`Skicka via KSeF (e-Faktura)` och "
"klicka på :guilabel:`Skicka`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:129
msgid "When an invoice is sent, Odoo automatically:"
msgstr "När en faktura skickas, gör Odoo automatiskt:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:131
msgid "Generates the invoice in the required FA(3) XML format."
msgstr "Genererar fakturan i det obligatoriska FA(3) XML-formatet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:132
msgid "Submits the file to KSeF for validation."
msgstr "Skickar filen till KSeF för validering."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:133
msgid "Saves a copy of the XML file in the invoice's chatter."
msgstr "Sparar en kopia av XML-filen i fakturans händelseflöde."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:135
msgid ""
"You can also manually export the FA(3) XML and check the invoice's "
"processing status:"
msgstr ""
"Du kan också manuellt exportera FA(3) XML och kontrollera fakturans "
"bearbetningsstatus:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:137
msgid "Open a posted invoice."
msgstr "Öppna en bokförd faktura."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:138
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Export FA(3) XML` to download the invoice as an XML file to "
"your browser's download folder."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Exportera FA(3) XML` för att ladda ner fakturan som en "
"XML-fil till din webbläsares nedladdningsmapp."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:140
msgid ""
"To check its processing status, click :guilabel:`Check invoice status` next "
"to the export option."
msgstr ""
"För att kontrollera dess bearbetningsstatus, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Kontrollera fakturastatus` bredvid exportalternativet."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:141
msgid ""
"The live status is displayed on the invoice under the :guilabel:`eInvoice "
"status` field."
msgstr ""
"Direktstatusen visas på fakturan under fältet :guilabel:`E-fakturastatus`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:143
msgid ""
"Once the Polish government officially registers the invoice on the KSeF "
"platform, it assigns an **Official Receipt Certificate (UPO)**. To view it, "
"open the invoice and click :guilabel:`Check invoice UPO`."
msgstr ""
"När den polska regeringen officiellt registrerat fakturan på KSeF-"
"plattformen tilldelas den ett **officiellt mottagningsbevis (UPO)**. För att "
"visa det, öppna fakturan och klicka på :guilabel:`Kontrollera faktura-UPO`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:150
msgid "Automatic bill import"
msgstr "Automatisk fakturaimpport"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:152
msgid ""
"By default, the Polish localization automatically fetches vendor bills from "
"KSeF every three hours. To adjust this frequency or toggle the feature:"
msgstr ""
"Som standard hämtar den polska lokaliseringen automatiskt "
"leverantörsfakturor från KSeF var tredje timme. För att justera denna "
"frekvens eller växla funktionen:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:155
msgid ""
"With :doc:`developer mode <../../general/developer_mode>` activated, open "
"the **Settings** app and go to :menuselection:`Technical --> Scheduled "
"Actions`."
msgstr ""
"Med :doc:`systemutvecklarläget <../../general/developer_mode>` aktiverat, "
"öppna appen **Inställningar** och gå till :menuselection:`Tekniskt --> "
"Schemalagda åtgärder`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:157
msgid ""
"Search for and open :guilabel:`Polish eInvoice: Download vendor bills from "
"KSeF`."
msgstr ""
"Sök efter och öppna :guilabel:`Polsk eInvoice: Ladda ner leverantörsfakturor "
"från KSeF`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/poland.rst:158
msgid "Use the :guilabel:`Execute Every` field to change the frequency."
msgstr "Använd fältet :guilabel:`Verkställ var` för att ändra frekvensen."

