#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:189
msgid "Veri*Factu"
msgstr "Veri*Factu"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:192
msgid ""
"Producers of Veri*Factu billing systems must self-certify their compliance "
"with the regulations. :download:`Download Odoo's \"declaración "
"responsable\"<spain/declaracion_responsable.pdf>`"
msgstr ""
"Producenter av Veri*Factu-faktureringssystem måste egencertifiera sin "
"efterlevnad av regelverket. :download:`Ladda ner Odoos \"declaración "
"responsable\"<spain/declaracion_responsable.pdf>`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:195
msgid ""
"**Veri*Factu** is the Spanish Tax Agency's verifiable invoice issuance "
"system. It is mandatory for most taxpayers in Spain, except for those who "
"use the SII system or are under a regional tax regime (i.e., TicketBai)."
msgstr ""
"**Veri*Factu** är det spanska skatteverkets system för verifierbar "
"fakturautfärdande. Det är obligatoriskt för de flesta skattebetalare i "
"Spanien, förutom de som använder SII-systemet eller omfattas av ett "
"regionalt skattesystem (dvs. TicketBai)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:199
msgid ""
"Odoo allows :ref:`invoices <localizations/spain/veri-factu-invoices>` and "
"Point of Sale :ref:`orders <localizations/spain/veri-factu-orders>` to be "
"automatically sent to the tax authorities."
msgstr ""
"Odoo tillåter att :ref:`fakturor <localizations/spain/veri-factu-invoices>` "
"och kassa-:ref:`beställningar <localizations/spain/veri-factu-orders>` "
"automatiskt skickas till skattemyndigheterna."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:207
msgid "To enable **Veri\\*Factu**, follow these steps:"
msgstr "För att aktivera **Veri\\*Factu**, följ dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:209
msgid ""
"Open the Settings app to make sure your company's :guilabel:`Country` "
"and :guilabel:`Tax ID` are correctly set in the :ref:`Companies <general/"
"companies/company>` section."
msgstr ""
"Öppna appen Inställningar för att säkerställa att ditt "
"företags :guilabel:`Land` och :guilabel:`Skattenummer` är korrekt inställda "
"i sektionen :ref:`Företag <general/companies/company>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:211
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Spain - Veri*Factu` "
"(`l10n_es_edi_verifactu`) module."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Installera <general/install>` modulen :guilabel:`Spanien - Veri*Factu` "
"(`l10n_es_edi_verifactu`)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:213
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"or :menuselection:`Invoicing --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`Veri\\*Factu` section, check the :guilabel:`Enable "
"Veri*Factu` option, and click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Manage "
"certificates` to add a certificate."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar` "
"eller :menuselection:`Fakturering --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar`, "
"rulla ner till sektionen :guilabel:`Veri\\*Factu`, kryssa för "
"alternativet :guilabel:`Aktivera Veri*Factu` och klicka på :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Hantera certifikat` för att lägga till ett certifikat."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:217
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Certificates for Veri\\*Factu` list view, "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"I listvyn :guilabel:`Certifikat för Veri\\*Factu`, klicka på :guilabel:`Ny`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:218
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Upload your file`, then select a certificate file and enter "
"the :guilabel:`Password` needed to open the certificate (if there is one)."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Ladda upp din fil`, välj sedan en certifikatfil och "
"ange :guilabel:`Lösenord` som behövs för att öppna certifikatet (om det "
"finns något)."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:222
msgid "At least one certificate has to be uploaded."
msgstr "Åtminstone ett certifikat måste laddas upp."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:223
msgid ""
"By default, Veri*Factu is in testing mode. The data is sent to test servers "
"and is not considered official. When official data can be sent to the "
"production servers, go to the :guilabel:`Veri\\*Factu` section in "
"the :guilabel:`Settings` and disable :guilabel:`Test Environment`."
msgstr ""
"Som standard är Veri*Factu i testläge. Data skickas till testservrar och "
"anses inte vara officiella. När officiella data kan skickas till "
"produktionsservrar, gå till sektionen :guilabel:`Veri\\*Factu` "
"i :guilabel:`Inställningar` och avaktivera :guilabel:`Testmiljö`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:233
msgid ""
"Once an :doc:`invoice <../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices>` is "
"confirmed, it can be :ref:`sent <accounting/invoice/sending>`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Send` window, the Veri*Factu option is available if "
"Veri*Factu has been enabled."
msgstr ""
"När en :doc:`faktura <../../finance/accounting/customer_invoices>` har "
"bekräftats kan den :ref:`skickas <accounting/invoice/sending>`. I "
"fönstret :guilabel:`Skicka` är alternativet Veri*Factu tillgängligt om "
"Veri*Factu har aktiverats."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:237
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send` to generate a JSON file containing the invoice "
"details. This file is stored as a Veri*Factu document. In "
"the :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` tab, all corresponding documents are listed by "
"their creation date and current status."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Skicka` för att skapa en JSON-fil som innehåller "
"fakturadetaljer. Denna fil lagras som ett Veri*Factu-dokument. I "
"fliken :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` listas alla motsvarande dokument efter deras "
"skapandedatum och aktuell status."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:242
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:267
msgid ""
"To download a JSON file, click on its document in the :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` "
"tab. Then, in the :guilabel:`Open: Veri*Factu Documents` window, click the "
"link in the :guilabel:`JSON` field."
msgstr ""
"För att ladda ner en JSON-fil, klicka på dess dokument i "
"fliken :guilabel:`Veri*Factu`. Sedan, i fönstret :guilabel:`Öppna: "
"Veri*Factu-dokument`, klicka på länken i fältet :guilabel:`JSON`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:246
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:271
msgid ""
"The document should be sent to the :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de "
"Administración Tributaria)` immediately. However, it may be delayed due to "
"mandatory waiting periods between submissions required by the :abbr:`AEAT "
"(Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria)`. In such cases, the document "
"is automatically sent the next time a scheduled action runs."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentet ska skickas till :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de Administración "
"Tributaria)` omedelbart. Det kan dock försenas på grund av obligatoriska "
"väntetider mellan inskickningar som krävs av :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de "
"Administración Tributaria)`. I sådana fall skickas dokumentet automatiskt "
"nästa gång en schemalagd åtgärd körs."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:250
msgid ""
"A Veri\\*Factu **QR code** appears on the invoice PDF. Scan this code to "
"verify that the invoice has been received and recognized by the :abbr:`AEAT "
"(Agencia Estatal de Administración Tributaria)`."
msgstr ""
"En Veri\\*Factu **QR-kod** visas på fakturans PDF. Skanna denna kod för att "
"verifiera att fakturan har mottagits och godkänts av :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia "
"Estatal de Administración Tributaria)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:257
msgid "Point of sale orders"
msgstr "Kassabeställningar"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:259
msgid ""
"Once an order has been :ref:`paid <pos/use/sell>`, a JSON file containing "
"the order details is generated. This file is stored as a Veri*Factu document."
msgstr ""
"När en beställning har :ref:`betalats <pos/use/sell>` genereras en JSON-fil "
"som innehåller beställningsdetaljerna. Denna fil lagras som ett Veri*Factu-"
"dokument."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:262
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Orders`. In "
"the :guilabel:`Orders` list view, select the relevant order. In "
"the :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` tab, all the corresponding documents are listed "
"by their creation date and current status."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Kassa --> Beställningar --> Beställningar`. I "
"listvyn :guilabel:`Beställningar`, välj relevant beställning. Under "
"fliken :guilabel:`Veri*Factu` listas alla motsvarande dokument efter deras "
"skapandedatum och aktuell status."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:276
msgid ""
"If an invoice is generated for an order during the payment process, the "
"Veri*Factu document is :ref:`created and sent for the invoice <localizations/"
"spain/veri-factu-invoices>` instead."
msgstr ""
"Om en faktura genereras för en beställning under betalningsprocessen, skapas "
"och skickas Veri*Factu-dokumentet :ref:`för fakturan istället <localizations/"
"spain/veri-factu-invoices>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:280
msgid ""
"A Veri\\*Factu **QR code** appears on the order receipt, even if an invoice "
"is created for the order. Scan this code to verify that the invoice has been "
"received and recognized by the :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de "
"Administración Tributaria)`"
msgstr ""
"En Veri\\*Factu **QR-kod** visas på beställningskvittot, även om en faktura "
"skapas för beställningen. Skanna denna kod för att verifiera att fakturan "
"har mottagits och godkänts av :abbr:`AEAT (Agencia Estatal de Administración "
"Tributaria)`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:287
msgid "TicketBAI"
msgstr "TicketBAI"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:289
msgid ""
"`Ticket BAI <https://www.gipuzkoa.eus/es/web/ogasuna/ticketbai>`_ or "
"**TBAI** is an e-Invoicing system used by the Basque government and its "
"three provincial councils (Álava, Biscay, and Gipuzkoa). Odoo supports the "
"**TicketBAI (TBAI)** electronic invoicing format for all three regions of "
"the **Basque Country**."
msgstr ""
"`Ticket BAI <https://www.gipuzkoa.eus/es/web/ogasuna/ticketbai>`_ eller "
"**TBAI** är ett system för elektronisk fakturering som används av den "
"baskiska regeringen och dess tre provinsråd (Álava, Biscaya och Gipuzkoa). "
"Odoo stödjer formatet för elektronisk fakturering **TicketBAI (TBAI)** för "
"alla tre regionerna i **Baskien**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:295
msgid "To use TicketBAI, make sure:"
msgstr "För att använda TicketBAI, se till att:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:297
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Country` and :guilabel:`Tax ID` fields on the :doc:`company "
"record <../../general/companies>` are filled in."
msgstr ""
"Fälten :guilabel:`Land` och :guilabel:`Skattenummer` "
"i :doc:`företagshandlingen <../../general/companies>` är ifyllda."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:299
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Spain -TicketBAI` (`l10n_es_edi_TBAI`) module is :ref:`installed "
"<general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"Modulen :guilabel:`Spanien -TicketBAI` (`l10n_es_edi_TBAI`) "
"är :ref:`installerad <general/install>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:301
msgid "To configure TicketBAI, follow these steps:"
msgstr "För att konfigurera TicketBAI, följ dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:303
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll "
"down to the :guilabel:`Spain Localization` section."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> Konfiguration --> Inställningar` och "
"rulla ner till sektionen :guilabel:`Spanien Lokalisering`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:305
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Registro de Libros connection TicketBAI` section, select a "
"region in the :guilabel:`Tax Agency for TBAI` field and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"I sektionen :guilabel:`Registro de Libros connection TicketBAI`, välj en "
"region i fältet :guilabel:`Skattemyndighet för TBAI` och :guilabel:`Spara`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:307
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Manage certificates (TicketBAI)`."
msgstr "Klicka på :guilabel:`Hantera certifikat (TicketBAI)`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:308
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Certificates for EDI TicketBAI invoices on Spain` view, "
"click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"I vyn :guilabel:`Certifikat för EDI TicketBAI-fakturor i Spanien`, klicka "
"på :guilabel:`Ny`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:309
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Upload your file` to upload the certificate, enter "
"the :guilabel:`Certificate Password` provided by the tax agency, and "
"select :guilabel:`TBAI` in the :guilabel:`Certificate scope` field."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på :guilabel:`Ladda upp din fil` för att ladda upp certifikatet, "
"ange :guilabel:`Certifikatlösenord` som tillhandahållits av "
"skattemyndigheten och välj :guilabel:`TBAI` i "
"fältet :guilabel:`Certifikatets tillämpningsområde`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:314
msgid ""
"To test certificates, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Settings` and, in the :guilabel:`Spain Localization` section, "
"enable :guilabel:`TBAI Test Mode`."
msgstr ""
"För att testa certifikat, gå till :menuselection:`Bokföring --> "
"Konfiguration --> Inställningar` och aktivera :guilabel:`TBAI-testläge` i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Spansk lokalisering`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:320
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:362
msgid "Use case"
msgstr "Användningsfall"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:322
#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:364
msgid ""
"Once an invoice is :ref:`created <accounting/invoice/creation>` "
"and :ref:`confirmed <accounting/invoice/confirmation>`, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"När en faktura har :ref:`skapats <accounting/invoice/creation>` "
"och :ref:`bekräftats <accounting/invoice/confirmation>`, följ dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/spain.rst:326
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Print & Send` window, make sure the :guilabel:`TicketBAI` "
"option is enabled and click :guilabel:`Send`"
