msgid "Mandatory compliance information"
msgstr "Obligatorisk efterlevnadsinformation"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:425
msgid ""
"The following rules are mandatory for all users of the Türkiye localization "
"integration. Compliance with these requirements is essential for the legal "
"validity of e-Documents issued through the |GİB| via Nilvera."
msgstr ""
"Följande regler är obligatoriska för alla användare av Turkiet-"
"lokaliseringsintegrationen. Efterlevnad av dessa krav är väsentlig för den "
"juridiska giltigheten av e-Dokument som emitterats via |GİB| via Nilvera."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:430
msgid "Document numbering structure"
msgstr "Dokumentnumreringsstruktur"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:432
msgid ""
"All generated invoices and dispatch documents must follow a specific "
"numbering structure: `three alphanumeric characters` + `document year` + "
"`sequential number`."
msgstr ""
"Alla skapade fakturor och försändelsedokument måste följa en specifik "
"numreringsstruktur: `tre alfanumeriska tecken` + `dokumentår` + "
"`sekvensnummer`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:436
msgid "INV/2025/00001"
msgstr "INV/2025/00001"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:438
msgid ""
"The numbering must be unique, sequential, and continuous. Each document must "
"have a distinct identifier."
msgstr ""
"Numreringen måste vara unik, sekventiell och sammanhängande. Varje dokument "
"måste ha en distinkt identifierare."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:441
msgid ""
"Once a file has been submitted, even if it returns an error, the same "
"sequence number cannot be used; a new document must be created."
msgstr ""
"När en fil har skickats in, även om den returnerar ett fel, kan samma "
"sekvensnummer inte användas; ett nytt dokument måste skapas."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:445
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/sequence`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/sequence`"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:446
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/vendor_bills/sequence`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/vendor_bills/sequence`"

