#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:0
msgid "Banner preview of sequencing of e-Dispatch."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:471
msgid "Sequential number gaps"
msgstr "Luckor i nummerserie"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:473
msgid ""
"If a sequence number is skipped, the previous missing numbers must be issued "
"within 7 days."
msgstr ""
"Om ett sekvensnummer hoppas över måste de föregående saknade numren "
"emitteras inom 7 dagar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:476
msgid ""
"If INV/2025/00002 is issued before INV/2025/00001, INV/2025/00001 must be "
"issued within 7 days."
msgstr ""
"Om INV/2025/00002 emitteras före INV/2025/00001 måste INV/2025/00001 "
"emitteras inom 7 dagar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:478
msgid "No sequence number can remain unissued beyond this period."
msgstr "Inget sekvensnummer kan förbli oemitterat efter denna period."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:481
msgid "Discount rules"
msgstr "Rabattregler"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:483
msgid ""
"Global discounts (discounts shown as a separate invoice line) cannot be "
"issued. All discounts must be applied at the product line level within the "
"invoice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:487
msgid "e-Ledger compliance"
msgstr "e-Ledger-efterlevnad"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:489
msgid ""
"The first issued invoice must represent the opening balance for the "
"accounting period. All subsequent invoices must follow the sequential "
"numbering pattern."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:493
msgid "INV/2025/00001, INV/2025/00002, INV/2025/00003, etc."
msgstr "INV/2025/00001, INV/2025/00002, INV/2025/00003, osv."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:495
msgid ""
"Sequential numbering must be maintained consistently across the e-Ledger to "
"ensure data integrity and compliance."
msgstr ""
"Sekventiell numrering måste upprätthållas konsekvent i e-Ledger för att "
"säkerställa dataintegritet och efterlevnad."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:499
msgid "Nilvera e-Invoice subscriptions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:502
msgid ""
"Turkish e-Invoice law permits only one date range per invoice, at the header "
"level, not per individual line item. Therefore, items with different "
"subscription date ranges cannot be mixed on the same invoice. However, an "
"item with a subscription date range can be mixed with items that that have "
"no date range at all."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:507
msgid ""
"If the invoice is generated from the subscription order in "
"the :doc:`Subscriptions <../../sales/subscriptions>` app, the subscription "
"order's date is used as the invoice's date, at the header level."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:511
msgid "Subscription dates must match across lines."
msgstr ""

