#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:263
msgid "Invoice types"
msgstr "Fakturatyper"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:265
msgid "The type of invoice to be issued depends on the following criteria:"
msgstr "Vilken typ av faktura som ska utfärdas beror på följande kriterier:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:267
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Invoices (B2B)`: A :guilabel:`Tax Invoice`, used for business-"
"to-business transactions, contains all the details required for VAT "
"recovery, including the supplier and customer legal names, "
"addresses, :abbr:`TRN (Tax Registration Number)` numbers (where applicable), "
"itemized VAT amounts, and total amounts. This is the standard document "
"required when a customer intends to reclaim VAT."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Momsfakturor (B2B)`: En :guilabel:`Momsfaktura`, som används för "
"business-to-business-transaktioner, innehåller alla detaljer som krävs för "
"momsåtervinning, inklusive leverantörens och kundens juridiska namn, "
"adresser, :abbr:`TRN (skatteregistreringsnummer)`-nummer (där tillämpligt), "
"specificerade momsbelopp och totalbelopp. Detta är standarddokumentet som "
"krävs när en kund avser att återkräva moms."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:272
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoices (B2C)`: A :guilabel:`Simplified Tax "
"Invoice` is primarily used for business-to-consumer (B2C) transactions, "
"where the customer is not expected to reclaim VAT. It contains reduced "
"customer information (customer :abbr:`TRN (Tax Registration Number)` is not "
"required), focusing instead on supplier details, VAT charged, and the total "
"amount payable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Förenklade momsfakturor (B2C)`: En :guilabel:`Förenklad "
"momsfaktura` används främst för business-to-consumer (B2C)-transaktioner, "
"där kunden inte förväntas återkräva moms. Den innehåller reducerad "
"kundinformation (kundens :abbr:`TRN (skatteregistreringsnummer)` krävs "
"inte), med fokus istället på leverantörsuppgifter, debiterad moms och totalt "
"belopp att betala."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:278
msgid ""
"To create a :guilabel:`Tax Invoice` for a customer, fill in "
"the :guilabel:`TRN` field on the customer contact form. If this field is "
"left empty, a :guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoice` is generated instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:281
msgid ""
"If the customer's :abbr:`TRN (Tax Registration Number)` is not available, "
"and a :guilabel:`Tax Invoice` is required, enter `N/A` in "
"the :guilabel:`TRN` field on the contact form."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:285
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoice` is still a legally valid tax invoice "
"under VAT law."
msgstr ""
"En :guilabel:`Förenklad momsfaktura` är fortfarande en juridiskt giltig "
"momsfaktura enligt momslagen."

