#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:689
msgid ""
"Sign into the Wise account if needed, and see all the pending transactions."
msgstr ""
"Logga in på Wise-kontot om det behövs och se alla väntande transaktioner."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:691
msgid ""
"Review the details and confirm the batch number is the same in Odoo and Wise."
msgstr ""
"Granska detaljerna och bekräfta att batchnumret är detsamma i Odoo och Wise."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:692
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Pay for this batch` or :guilabel:`I've now paid` to pay for "
