#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:5
msgid "Adyen"
msgstr "Adyen"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:7
msgid ""
"`Adyen <https://www.adyen.com/>`_ is a Dutch company that offers several "
"online payment possibilities."
msgstr ""
"`Adyen <https://www.adyen.com/>`_ är ett holländskt företag som erbjuder "
"flera betalningsmöjligheter online."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:11
msgid ""
"Adyen is more focused on enterprise customers and may require a minimum "
"number of transactions and a minimum processed volume."
msgstr ""
"Adyen är mer inriktat på företagskunder och kan kräva ett minsta antal "
"transaktioner och en minsta behandlad volym."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:17
msgid "Adyen configuration"
msgstr "Adyen-konfiguration"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:19
msgid ""
"Create an Adyen account if necessary and log into your `Adyen Customer Area "
"<https://ca-live.adyen.com/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Skapa ett Adyen-konto om det behövs och logga in på ditt `Adyen Customer "
"Area <https://ca-live.adyen.com/>`_."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:23
msgid ""
"Log into your **Test account** to try the integration without charging "
"customers. Switch to your **Live account** once you are ready to accept "
"payments."
msgstr ""
"Logga in på ditt **testkonto** för att prova integrationen utan att debitera "
"kunder. Byt till ditt **livekonto** när du är redo att ta emot betalningar."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:26
msgid ""
"`Contact the Adyen support team <https://docs.adyen.com/platforms/quickstart-"
"guide/support#contact-adyen-support>`_ to enable the **Multiple partial "
"capture** feature."
msgstr ""
"`Kontakta Adyens kundtjänst <https://docs.adyen.com/platforms/quickstart-"
"guide/support#contact-adyen-support>`_ för att aktivera funktionen "
"**Multipel delslutning**."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:28
msgid ""
"In the Adyen Customer Area, go to :menuselection:`Developers --> API "
"credentials` and click the relevant API credential user name in the list or "
"click :icon:`fa-plus-circle` :guilabel:`Create new credential` to create a "
"new one."
msgstr ""
"I Adyen Customer Area, gå till :menuselection:`Developers --> API "
"credentials` och klicka på relevant API-användarnamn i listan eller "
"klicka :icon:`fa-plus-circle` :guilabel:`Create new credential` för att "
"skapa ett nytt."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:31
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Server settings` section, click :guilabel:`Generate API "
"key`, then click the :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`Copy API key`) icon and "
"save the value for the :ref:`payment_providers/adyen/configure_odoo` step."
msgstr ""
"I sektionen :guilabel:`Server settings` klickar du på :guilabel:`Generate "
"API key`, sedan klickar du på ikonen :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`Copy API "
"key`) och sparar värdet för steget :ref:`payment_providers/adyen/"
"configure_odoo`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:34
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Client settings` section, click :guilabel:`Generate client "
"key`, then click the :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`Copy client key`) icon and "
"save the value for the :ref:`payment_providers/adyen/configure_odoo` step."
msgstr ""
"I avsnittet :guilabel:`Client settings`, klicka på :guilabel:`Generate "
"client key`, klicka sedan på ikonen :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`Copy client "
"key`) och spara värdet för steget :ref:`payment_providers/adyen/"
"configure_odoo`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:37
msgid ""
"Enter your Odoo database URL in the :guilabel:`Add allowed origins` field, "
"then click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""
"Ange din Odoo-databas-URL i fältet :guilabel:`Add allowed origins`, klicka "
"sedan på :guilabel:`Add`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:39
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save changes` at the bottom of the page."
msgstr "Klicka på :guilabel:`Save changes` längst ned på sidan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:40
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Developers --> Webhooks` in the left menu and "
"click :icon:`fa-plus-circle` :guilabel:`Create new webhook`."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Developers --> Webhooks` i vänstermenyn och klicka "
"på :icon:`fa-plus-circle` :guilabel:`Create new webhook`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:42
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create new webhook` popup, click :guilabel:`Add` on "
"the :guilabel:`Standard webhook` line."
msgstr ""
"I popup-fönstret :guilabel:`Create new webhook`, klicka på :guilabel:`Add` "
"på raden :guilabel:`Standard webhook`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:44
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Webhook generation` form, in the :guilabel:`Server "
"configuration` section, enter your Odoo database :guilabel:`URL` followed by "
"`/payment/adyen/notification`."
msgstr ""
"På formuläret :guilabel:`Webhook generation`, i sektionen :guilabel:`Server "
"configuration`, anger du din Odoo-databas :guilabel:`URL` följd av `/payment/"
"adyen/notification`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:46
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Security` section, click :guilabel:`Generate` "
"under :guilabel:`HMAC`, then click the :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`Copy HMAC "
"to the clipboard`) icon and save the value for the :ref:`payment_providers/"
"adyen/configure_odoo` step."
msgstr ""
"I sektionen :guilabel:`Security` klickar du på :guilabel:`Generate` "
"under :guilabel:`HMAC`, sedan klickar du på ikonen :icon:`fa-copy` "
"(:guilabel:`Copy HMAC to the clipboard`) och sparar värdet för "
"steget :ref:`payment_providers/adyen/configure_odoo`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:49
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Save configuration` at the bottom of the page."
msgstr "Klicka på :guilabel:`Save configuration` längst ned på sidan."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:50
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Developers --> API URLs`, then copy "
"the :guilabel:`Prefix` and save the value for the :ref:`payment_providers/"
"adyen/configure_odoo` step."
msgstr ""
"Gå till :menuselection:`Developers --> API URLs`, kopiera "
"sedan :guilabel:`Prefix` och spara värdet för steget :ref:`payment_providers/"
"adyen/configure_odoo`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:58
#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:78
msgid ""
":ref:`Navigate to the payment provider Ayden <payment_providers/"
