#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:67
msgid ""
"If you want to :ref:`test Adyen without affecting live transactions "
"<payment_providers/test-mode>`, use your **Test account** credentials, enter "
"`https://checkout-test.adyen.com` in the :guilabel:`API URL Prefix` field, "
"and set the :guilabel:`State` field to :guilabel:`Test Mode`."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill :ref:`testa Adyen utan att påverka verkliga transaktioner "
"<payment_providers/test-mode>`, använd dina uppgifter för **testkonto**, "
"ange `https://checkout-test.adyen.com` i fältet :guilabel:`API URL Prefix` "
"och ställ in fältet :guilabel:`Stat` till :guilabel:`Testläge`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:75
msgid ""
"To enable :ref:`manual capture <payment_providers/manual_capture>` for Adyen "
"payments, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"För att aktivera :ref:`manuell avräkning <payment_providers/manual_capture>` "
"för Adyen-betalningar, följ dessa steg:"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:79
msgid ""
"Go to the :guilabel:`Configuration` tab and enable :guilabel:`Capture Amount "
"Manually`."
msgstr ""
"Gå till fliken :guilabel:`Konfiguration` och aktivera :guilabel:`Capture "
"Amount Manually`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:80
msgid ""
"Log in to your Adyen Customer Area, then go to :menuselection:`Settings` and "
"click :guilabel:`Company` in the :guilabel:`Account management` section."
msgstr ""
"Logga in på ditt Adyen Customer Area, gå sedan "
"till :menuselection:`Inställningar` och klicka på :guilabel:`Företag` i "
"sektionen :guilabel:`Account management`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:82
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`General` section, click the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
"(:guilabel:`Edit property`) icon next to the :guilabel:`Capture Delay` field."
msgstr ""
"I sektionen :guilabel:`Allmän`, klicka på ikonen :icon:`fa-pencil` "
"(:guilabel:`Edit property`) bredvid fältet :guilabel:`Capture Delay`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:84
msgid ""
"In the popup, set the :guilabel:`Capture delay` field to :guilabel:`Manual` "
"and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"I popup-fönstret, ställ in fältet :guilabel:`Capture delay` "
"till :guilabel:`Manual` och klicka på :guilabel:`Spara`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:88
msgid ""
"If the transaction is not captured within 7 days, the customer is entitled "
"to revoke it."
msgstr ""
"Om transaktionen inte avräknas inom 7 dagar har kunden rätt att återkalla "
"den."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:89
msgid ""
"You can :ref:`manually capture <payment_providers/manual_capture>` "
"and :ref:`refund <payment_providers/refunds>` payments directly from your "
"Adyen Customer Area."
msgstr ""
"Du kan :ref:`manuellt avräkna <payment_providers/manual_capture>` "
"och :ref:`återbetala <payment_providers/refunds>` betalningar direkt från "
"ditt Adyen Customer Area."

