"must be a valid IBAN."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Bankkontot` som definierats för :guilabel:`Betalningsjournalen` "
"måste vara ett giltigt IBAN."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:102
msgid "Online payments with |sdd|"
msgstr "Onlinebetalningar med |sdd|"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:105
