msgstr "Buckaroo"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/buckaroo.rst:7
msgid ""
"`Buckaroo <https://www.buckaroo.eu/>`_ is a Dutch-based company that offers "
"several online payment possibilities."
msgstr ""
"`Buckaroo <https://www.buckaroo.eu/>`_ är ett holländskt företag som "
