msgstr "DPO Pay"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:7
msgid ""
"`DPO Pay <https://dpogroup.com/>`_ is a payment provider based in Africa "
"that operates across multiple countries on the continent."
msgstr ""
"`DPO Pay <https://dpogroup.com/>`_ är en betalningsleverantör baserad i "
"Afrika som är verksam i flera länder på kontinenten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:13
msgid "DPO Pay account creation"
msgstr "Skapa DPO Pay-konto"

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:15
msgid ""
"`Fill in the DPO Pay onboarding form <https://dpo-pay-network.odoo.com/"
"form>`_ and upload the required documents."
msgstr ""
"`Fyll i DPO Pay-onboardingformuläret <https://dpo-pay-network.odoo.com/"
"form>`_ och ladda upp de nödvändiga dokumenten."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:17
msgid ""
"Agree to the :guilabel:`Terms and Conditions` and click :guilabel:`Submit`."
msgstr "Godkänn :guilabel:`villkoren` och klicka på :guilabel:`Skicka in`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:18
msgid ""
"DPO Pay creates a test account based on the submitted information and sends "
"you an email containing your login credentials for the `DPO portal <https://"
"portal.dpopay.com>`_ and the :ref:`test credentials <payment_providers/test-"
"mode>` to enter in :ref:`Odoo <payment_providers/dpo/configure_odoo>` if you "
"want to try DPO Pay without affecting live transactions."
msgstr ""
"DPO Pay skapar ett testkonto baserat på den inlämnade informationen och "
"skickar ett e-postmeddelande till dig som innehåller dina "
"inloggningsuppgifter för `DPO-portalen <https://portal.dpopay.com>`_ "
"och :ref:`testuppgifterna <payment_providers/test-mode>` att ange "
"i :ref:`Odoo <payment_providers/dpo/configure_odoo>` om du vill prova DPO "
"Pay utan att påverka verkliga transaktioner."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:23
msgid ""
"Once DPO has verified the information and documents, they will transition "
"your test account to a live account and send another email containing your "
"live credentials to configure in :ref:`Odoo <payment_providers/dpo/"
"configure_odoo>`."
msgstr ""
"När dataskyddsombudet har verifierat informationen och dokumenten kommer de "
"att övergå ditt testkonto till ett livekonto och skicka ett nytt e-"
"postmeddelande med dina uppgifter för att konfigurera i :ref:`Odoo "
"<payment_providers/dpo/configure_odoo>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:32
