"the :ref:`information received from DPO Pay <payment_providers/dpo/"
"configure_dashboard>`."
msgstr ""
"Fyll i fälten :guilabel:`Service ID` och :guilabel:`Company Token` "
"med :ref:`informationen du fått från DPO Pay <payment_providers/dpo/"
"configure_dashboard>`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:35
